{"id": "14929", "revid": "117223", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14929", "title": "Mamadou Diallo (umukinnyi)", "text": "Mamadou Diallo ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Senegal, yavutse ku ya 16 Ugushyingo 1954. Ni umukinnyi wakinnye imikino yo gusimbuka,ubu akaba ari mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru.Yahagariraga igihugu cye kavukire mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1984 yabereye i Los Angeles muri Californiya, arangiza ku mwanya wa 12 ku rutonde rwa nyuma. Mamadou Diallo asimbuka metero zigera15.99. "}
