{"id": "14931", "revid": "12228", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14931", "title": "Aida Diop", "text": "A\u00efda Diop (wavutse ku ya 27 Mata 1970) ni umukinnyi wo kurushanwa ku maguru wo muri Senegal wamenyekanye muri metero 100 na 200.\nMu marushanwa ya Afurika 2000 yabereye muri Algiers yegukanye imidari ya feza muri metero 100 na 200. Yakurikiranye amarushanwa yo muri Afurika 2002 yabereye i Rad\u00e8s afite umudari wa feza muri metero 200. Yatsindiye imidari ya bronze muri Jeux de la Francophonie mu 1997 na 2001.\nYitabiriye amarushanwa y'isi mu 1997, 1999 na 2001 ndetse no mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2000 gusa ntiyageze ku mukino wa nyuma. Yiruka se metero 4 x 400 muri Shampiyona y'isi na Olempike."}
