{"id": "14933", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14933", "title": "Fatou Bintou Kugwa", "text": "Fatou Bintou Fall (yavutse ku ya 23 Kanama 1981) ni umukinnyi w\u2019umukino wo gusiganwa ku maguru ukomoka i Tivaonane muri Senegali, usiganwa cyane muri metero 400. Yagize ibihe byiza bye muri Shampiyona nyafurika 2004, atwara umudari wa zahabu akoresheje amasegonda 50.62."}
{"id": "14934", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14934", "title": "Fall Moussa", "text": "Fall Moussa (wavutse ku ya 28 Kanama 1963) ni umukinnyi wiruka muri Senegali wagiye mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuro wakina muri metero 400 na 800.\nYavukiye i Saint-Louis, muri Senegali. Yitabiriye amarushanwa y'isi ya 1983 muri metro 400, imikino Olempike 1984 yiruka muri metero 800, Shampiyona y'isi 1987 ajya muri metero 800 ndetse n'imikino Olempike yo mu 1988 atageze ku mukino wa nyuma. Yarushanwe kandi muri metero 4 \u00d7 400 mu marushanwa ya Shampiyona y'isi muri 1983, imikino Olempike yo mu 1984 ndetse n'imikino Olempike yo mu 1988, ariko iyi kipe ntiyigeze igera ku mukino wa nyuma.\nMu karere yegukanye imidari ya feza mu marushanwa ya Afurika yo mu 1984 na 1985, umudari wa zahabu muri Jeux de la Francophonie yo mu 1989 ku isi hose yatwaye umudari wa feza muri Summer Universiade muri 1987. \nIgihe cye cyiza cyane ni amasegonda 47.34 muri metero 400 mu 1989 niminota 1: 44.06 muri metero 800 mu mwaka wa 1988. "}
{"id": "14935", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14935", "title": "Moussa Sagna Fall", "text": "Moussa Sagna Fall (yavutse 31 Ukuboza 1959) numusimbuka muremure ukomoka muri Senegali.\nMu karere yegukanye umudari wa bronze muri Shampiyona nyafurika yo mu 1979, atwara umudali wa zahabu muri Shampiyona nyafurika 1982 na 1985. Yitabiriye kandi imikino Olempike yo mu 1980 na Shampiyona y'isi 1983 nubwo atageze ku mukino wa nyuma.\nGusimbuka kwe ku giti cye byari metero 2.26 muri mwaka wa 1982. agira agahigo ko hejuru muriSenegali."}
{"id": "14936", "revid": "122679", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14936", "title": "Ibou Faye", "text": "Ibou Faye (wavutse ku ya 13 Ukuboza 1969 apfa ku ya 26 Gicurasi 2025) ni umukinnyi wa Senegali uri mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru witabiriye amarushanwa yo kwiruka muri metero 400."}
{"id": "14937", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14937", "title": "Amadou Gakou", "text": "Amadou Gakou (wavutse ku ya 25 Werurwe 1940) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru akaba ari mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru. Yitabiriye isiganwa rya metero 400 mu mikino Olempike ya 1964, 1968 na 1972 yegukanye umwanya wa kane mu 1968, ashyiraho agahigo mu gihugu ku masegonda 45.01. Yatsindiye umudari wa feza mu mikino yo muri Afurika yo mu 1965. \nMushiki we ni nyirakuru wa Fatou Bintou Fall wiruka metero 40. "}
{"id": "14938", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14938", "title": "Helmeted guineafowl", "text": "Helmeted guineafowl niyo izwi cyane mu miryango y'inyoni ya guineafowl, Numididae n'umunyamuryango umwe rukumi wa bwoko bwa Numida. ikomoka muri Africa cyane cyane mu majyepfo ya sahara, kandi yamenyekanye cyane nk'ubwoko bwororerwa mu rugo mu burengerazuba bw'uburengerazuba, Amerika y'amajyaruguru,kolombia,brazil,Austrarial n'uburayi.\nHelmeted guineafowl ifite uburebure bwa cm hagati ya 53 na 58cm iyi nyoni ifite umubiri uzengurutse n'umutwe muto. ipima nka 1.3kg(2.9ib) amabara y'umubiri n'umukara, umukara uzengurutswe n'umweru. kimwe n'izindi nyoni, ubu bwoko bufite umutwe utarondoreka, murubu bwoko ukaba wambitswe ibara ry'umuhondo wijimye cyangwa umutuku wijimye. n'uruhu rwambaye umutuku,ubururu,cyangwa umukara. amababa ni magufi kandi azengurutse,umurizo nawo ni mugufi.\nindyo yazo igizwe n'ibiribwa bitandukanye harimo inyamaswa n'ibimera(harimo ibigori,ibirayi,imbuto cyane cyane ibyatsi byo mu buhinzi hamwe n'ibihingwa bitandukanye by'ubuhinzi.) \nibigabo bikunze kwerekana ubukana hagati yabyo,kandi bikagira bikagira uruhare mu mirwano ikaze."}
{"id": "14939", "revid": "10574", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14939", "title": "Mamadou Kass\u00e9 Hann", "text": "Mamadou Kass\u00e9 Hann (yavutse ku ya 10 Ukwakira 1986) niumukinnyi ukina umukino w' inzitizi ukomoka i Pikine muri Senegali [2] Mu mikino Olempike ya 2012, yarushanwe mu kwiruka metero 400 mu bagabo. Yabaye umwe mubarangije iyoShampiyona yisi muri 2013, aba uwa karindwi. Hanne yegukanye umudari inshuro ebyiri muri Shampiyona nyafurika mu gusiganwa.\nYimuriye mu Ubufaransa ku ya 22 Kanama 2014, yemererwa guhagararira igihugu cye cyamureze ku rwego mpuzamahanga kuva muri Kamena 2015. "}
