{"id": "14996", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14996", "title": "Uwiragiye Ambroise", "text": "Ambroise Uwiragiye (yavutse ku ya 31 Ukuboza 1980) ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga ni umunyarwanda wiruka intera ndende, akaba n\u2019inzobere mu gusiganwa muri marato. Yitabiriye isiganwa rya marato ry\u2019abagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi yo muri 2016 aho yarangije ari ku mwanya wa 99 akoresheje iminota 2:25:57. "}
{"id": "14997", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14997", "title": "Crab plover", "text": "ni inyoni ikunda kugaragara mu gishanga gusa iratandukanye \nni inyoni ikomoka mu muryango wa Dromadidae,umuryango \nwayo ni charadriformes, ntusobanutse neza bamwe babonaga\nko ifitanye isano rya bugufi na pranticoles mugihe abandi babonaga\nko yegereye Auks, nimwe mu banyamuryango bonyine ba Dramas.\nkandi irihariye kuko ikunda ahantu hashyuha kuko biyifasha mu gutera amagi."}
{"id": "14998", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14998", "title": "Yankurije Marthe", "text": "--&gt; Marthe Yankurije\nMarthe Yankurije (wavutse 5 Nyakanga 1994) ni umunyarwanda wiruka intera ndende ya marato. Muri 2018, yatsindiye igihugu cye metero 10,000 na Shampiyona ihuza ib'igihugu. Yatsinze kandi isiganwa muri kimwe cya kabiri cya marato muri 2021 Kigali International Peace Marathon, kandi yitabira irushanwa rya metero 5000 mu mikino Olempike yatinze ya 2020.\nUmwuga.\nYankurije akinira ikipe ya APR Imikino ngororamubiri mbere ya 2016, yarushanwe muri Nyamasheke Athletics Club. Yatangiye imikino ngororamubiri afite imyaka 11. Yatangiriye bwa mbere muri marathon ya Kigali 2014, arangiza ari uwa gatanu, nyuma yu mwaka, yitabira amarushanwa ya Afurika ahuza igihugu cya 2014, arangiza ari 35. Yaje ku mwanya wa kane mu gice cya kabiri cya marathon muri Marato mpuzamahanga y\u2019amahoro ya Kigali 2017 maze atsinda 20 kilometres de kigali (12\u00a0mi) bigera muri Bugesera. Yankurije yatsinze muri metero 10,000 mu marushanwa y\u2019igihugu yu Rwanda 2018. Muri uwo mwaka, yatsindiye irushanwa ry\u2019igihugu cy\u2019u Rwanda mu shampiyona y'ibihugu, aza ku mwanya wa gatatu mu marushanwa ya kimwe cya kabiri cya marathon muri Marato mpuzamahanga y\u2019amahoro ya Kigali 2018, na Dar Marathon muri Tanzaniya. \nMuri 2019, yaje ku mwanya wa kabiri mu Kigali International Peace Marathon igice cya kabiri cya marato, maze atsinda 20 kilometres (12\u00a0mi) ibyabaye muri Bugesera na none. Muri uwo mwaka, yitabiriye isiganwa rya metero 10,000 mu mikino nyafurika ya 2019 ; yari umwe mu bakinnyi babiri gusa bo mu Rwanda mu mikino. Muri 2020, yatsindiye igice cya Marathon ya Huye mugihe cyi saha 1:15:15. Yarangije kandi umwanya wa gatatu muri Trier isanzwe 5 kilometres (3.1\u00a0mi) mu isiganwa. \nMuri Gicurasi 2021, yitabiriye amarushanwa yo gusiganwa ku maguru muri Zambiya yaberaga i Lusaka, imikino yo gushaka itike yo kuzitabira imikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi ya 2020. Muri kamena, yatsindiye isiganwa mpuzamahanga rya marato rya Kigali. Kubera iyo mpamvu, yahawe ikarita yo mu Rwanda yo kwitabira imikino Olempike ya 2020. Yarushanwe muri metero 5000 ; yarangije umwanya wa 17 mubushuhe, kandi ntiyatera imbere. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYankurije yavutse muri Nyakanga 1994. Akomoka mu karere ka Nyamasheke, mu Rwanda. Akiri umunyeshuri, yakinnye umupira w'amaguru hamwe na handball. Yavuye mu ishuri akiri muto, mu mwaka wa kane w'amashuri yisumbuye mu 2012. "}
{"id": "14999", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14999", "title": "Uburenganzira bwite kumutungo", "text": "Kuba nyir'ubwite ni leta cyangwa ukuri gutunga amategeko no kugenzura umutungo, ushobora kuba umutungo uwo ariwo wose, ugaragara cyangwa udafatika. Nyirubwite arashobora kubamo uburenganzira bwinshi, twese hamwe twavuga nkumutwe, ushobora gutandukana kandi ufashwe nimpande zitandukanye.\nInzira hamwe nubukanishi bwa nyirubwite biragoye rwose: umuntu arashobora kunguka, kwimura, no gutakaza nyirubwite muburyo butandukanye. Kugirango ubone imitungo umuntu arashobora kuyigura namafaranga, kuyigurisha kubindi bintu, kuyitsindira inshuti, kuyakira nkimpano, kuyungura, kuyisanga, kuyakira nkibyangiritse, kuyinjiza mukora akazi cyangwa gukora serivisi, kuyikora, cyangwa urugo. Umuntu arashobora kwimura cyangwa gutakaza nyir'umutungo awugurisha amafaranga, kuwuhana undi mutungo, kuwutanga nk'impano, kuwusimbuza undi, cyangwa kuwambura nyirubwite binyuze mu nzira zemewe n'amategeko nko kwirukana, kwamburwa, gufatira, cyangwa gufata. Kuba nyirubwite arikwirakwiza kuko nyir'umutungo uwo ariwo wose nawe azagira inyungu zubukungu bwuwo mutungo.\n= Amateka =\nMu binyejana byinshi ndetse no mumico itandukanye, imyumvire yerekeye \"umutungo\" nuburyo ifatwa mumico yagiye itandukana cyane. Kuba nyir'ubwite ni ishingiro ry\u2019ibindi bitekerezo byinshi bigize urufatiro rw\u2019imiryango ya kera n\u2019iki gihe nk\u2019amafaranga, ubucuruzi, ideni, guhomba, ubugizi bwa nabi bw\u2019ubujura, n\u2019umutungo bwite n\u2019umutungo rusange. Kuba nyir'ubwite ni urufunguzo rw'inyubako mu iterambere rya gahunda y\u2019imibereho n\u2019ubukungu. Adam Smith yavuze ko rimwe mu mategeko yera y\u2019ubutabera ari ukurinda ibintu umuntu atunze.\nAmashakiro.\nhttps://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ownership"}
{"id": "15000", "revid": "12228", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15000", "title": "Nkundabera Jean de Dieu", "text": "Nkundabera Jean de Dieu ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga wu Rwanda witabira imikino ngororamubiri. \nNkundabera yari ahagarariye u Rwanda mu mikino Paralempike yo mu 2004 yabereye muri Atenayi, kandi yegukana umudari wa mbere mu gihugu byahataniraga umudali waParalympique cyangwa Olempike mu mikino iyo ari yo yose, atwara umuringa mu isiganwa rya T46 mu bagabo 800, akoresheje amasaha 1: 58.95. Yongeye guhagararira u Rwanda mu mikino Paralympike ya 2008 yabereye i Beijing. \nKugeza mu mwaka wa 2016, Nkundabera yakomeje kuba umudari wonyine w\u2019imikino Olempike cyangwa Paralympique, nubwo u Rwanda rufite abaturage barenga 300.000 bafite ubumuga butandukanye. "}
{"id": "15001", "revid": "10821", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15001", "title": "African wattled lapwing", "text": "African Wattled Lapwing ni inyoni yo mw'itsinda ry'inzererezi cyane \nziboneka mu muryango wa Lapwing nini,no mu muryango wa charadridae\niboneka muri afrika yo munsi yomubutayu bwa sahara hanze y'amashyamba\nni inyoni zigaragara kandi zidashidikanywaho.ni inyoni nini kandi zijimye zifite\nikamba ryirabura, uruhande rwera hamwe ninzara nini zera zo kumano umurizo\nni umweru uvanze n'umukara n'amaguru maremare y'umuhondo.\nafrica wattled lapwing ni bumwe mu masezerano yerekeye kubungabunga\ninyoni zo mumazi zo muri africa na aziya (AEWA) zikurikiza."}
{"id": "15002", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15002", "title": "Muhitira Felicien", "text": "F\u00e9licien Muhitira (wavutse ku ya 4 Ugushyingo 1994) ni umunyarwanda wiruka intera ndende muri marato. Yarushanwaga muri metero 5000 mu marushanwa y'isi yabaye muri 2015 yabereye i Beijing gusa ntiyabashije kuzuza ibisabwa kugirango akine u mukino wa nyuma.\nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nHanze"}
{"id": "15003", "revid": "10821", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15003", "title": "Avocet", "text": "izina Avocet rikomoka mu kiratini recurvus.\nFrancis willughby mu 1678 yavuzeko ari \navosetta y'abatariyani, ubwoko bwa recurvirostra\nbwatangajwe mu 1758 n'umunyamerika w'ibinyabuzima \nCarl linneaus mu gitabo cya 10 yise systeme nature. "}
{"id": "15004", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15004", "title": "Ikipe ya Volleyball y'abagore mu Rwanda", "text": "Ikipe ya Volleyball y'abagore mu Rwanda ihagarariye u Rwanda mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya volley ball y'abagore ndetse n'imikino ya gicuti itandukanye. \nIyi kipe yakinnye amajonjora ya Shampiyona y\u2019Abagore ya Volleyball mu 2001, 2007 na 2021.\nMu mwaka wa 2008, byavuzwe ko iyi kipe yagerageje gushaka umutoza wa Kenya, Paul Bitok ngo ibe umutoza w\u2019igihugu, ariko yanga icyifuzo, maze ajya i Budapest kwiga ibijyanye no gutoza siporo. Nyuma yibyo, Bitok yasubiye mu Rwanda aho yatangiriye imyitozo kuva akiri muto. Hashyizweho ingando mu ntara aho abakinnyi bato bashobora gutezwa imbere. Igihe yavagayo muri 2020, u Rwanda rwagize amakipe yo ku rwego rwisi mu byiciro byose kandi ikipe yigihugu niyo ifite shampiyona nyafurika. \nKuva mu 2021, umutoza mukuru w'iyi kipe yabaye Paulo de Tarso. "}
