{"id": "15010", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15010", "title": "Bigirimana Theophile", "text": "Theophile Bigirimana (yavutse 1 Mutarama 1993) ni umunyarwanda wa bigize umwuga mu kwiruka intera ndende nka marato.\nMuri 2019, yitabiriye isiganwa ry'abagabo bakuru mu marushanwa ya IAAF ya World Cross Country yabereye muri Aarhus, Danimarike. Yarangije ku mwanya wa 47. "}
{"id": "15011", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15011", "title": "Gakuru David", "text": "Gakuru David (wavutse 1997) ni umunyarwanda akaba umukinnyi wabigize umwuga mu kwiruka intera ndende ya Marato.\nMuri 2017, yitabiriye irushanwa ry'abagabo bakuru mu marushanwa ya IAAF World Cross Country 2017 yabereye i Kampala, muri Uganda. Yarangije ku mwanya wa 62. \nMuri 2018, yitabiriye kimwe cya kabiri cya marato y'abagabo mu marushanwa ya IAAF World Half Marathon 2018 yabereye i Valencia, muri Espanye. Yarangije ku mwanya wa 109. "}
