{"id": "15014", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15014", "title": "Sugira James", "text": "Sugira James (wavutse 2 Gashyantare 1997) ni umunyarwanda akaba umukinnyi wabigize umwuga kwiruka intera ndende nka Marato.\nMuri 2014, yitabiriye imikino ya metero 1500 mu bahungu mu mikino Olempike y'urubyiruko yo mu mpeshyi 2014 yabereye i Nanjing mu Bushinwa.\nMuri 2017, yitabiriye irushanwa ry'abagabo bakuru mu marushanwa ya IAAF World Cross Country 2017 yabereye i Kampala, muri Uganda. Yarangije ku mwanya wa 49. \nMuri 2018, yaserukiye u Rwanda mu mikino ya Commonwealth 2018 yabereye muri Gold Coast. Yarushanwe mu bagabo metero 5000 kandi yarangije ku mwanya wa 7. "}
{"id": "15015", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15015", "title": "Tuyishimire Christophe", "text": "Christophe Tuyishimire (wavutse 14 Mutarama 1989) ni umunyarwanda wabigize umwuga wiruka intera ndende muri Marato. Muri 2019, yitabiriye irushanwa ry'abagabo bakuru mu marushanwa ya IAAF ya World Cross Country yabereye muri Aarhus, Danimarike. Yarangije ku mwanya wa 84. \nMuri 2018, yaserukiye anahagararira u Rwanda mu mikino ya Commonwealth 2018 yabereye muri Gold Coast. Yarushanwe mu bagabo metero 5000 kandi yarangije ku mwanya wa 14. "}
{"id": "15016", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15016", "title": "Kinigamazi Patrick", "text": "Patrick Kinigamazi (wavutse ku ya 2 Werurwe 1983) ni umunyarwanda wakinagaa umukino w'iteramakofe wabigize umwuga mu irushanwa kuva 2006 kugeza 2020. Yatwaye igikombe cya Afurika muri 2016 ndetse na WBF super featherweight kuva 2017 kugeza 2020.\nUbuzima.\nKinigamazi yavutse ku ya 2 Werurwe 1983 i Gisenyi, mu Rwanda, yimukira mu Busuwisi afite imyaka cumi n'itanu nyuma ya jenoside yo mu Rwanda. Amaze gutangira siporo yo kurwana afite imyaka cumi nirindwi, yakurikiranye na murumuna we mumukino w'iteramakofe maze yinjira muri Club pugilistique de Carouge. \nMu myaka we wa mbere nkumukinnyi wateramakofe yanarushanwe muri kickbox, yegukana ibikombe bibiri byisi ndetse n\u2019ibihugu bine by\u2019Uburayi. Ku ya 2 Gicurasi 2010, yegukanye igikombe cya WKN cyitiriwe isi yose cyatsinzwe na Gary Hamilton, arangiza imyaka irindwi amaze ari nyampinga. Nyuma Kinigamazi yari umukino wari ikomeye. \nKinigamazi yakinnye na basketball na Bernex Geneve Basket. \numwuga.\nKu ya 29 Kamena 2006, Kinigamazi yatangiye gukina umukino witeramakofe nku wabigize umwuga, atsinda Rocco Cipriano na tekinike yo mu cyiciro cya gatanu i Carouge. Yatsindiye igikombe cye cya mbere mu rugamba rwe rwa karindwi, atsinda Martino Ciano kubera igikombe cyoroheje cy\u2019Ubusuwisi. Nyuma yo gutsinda inshuro 16 kugirango atangire umwuga we yatsinzwe umukino we wa mbere mu 2011 na Guillaume Frenois uzaba shampiyo wi burayi. Umwaka umwe, yatsinzwe bwa kabiri nundi mufaransa, Sebastien Cornu. \nKu ya 18 Ugushyingo 2016, hashize imyaka irenga icyenda nyuma y\u2019irushanwa rye rya nyuma rya shampionat, yatsinze umurwanyi ukomoka mu gihugu cya Congo ukomoka mu gihugu cya Espagne, Clark Telamanou, kubera igikombe cy\u2019umucyo cyoroheje cya Afurika cyatsinzwe binyuze ku cyemezo cya benshi hamwe n'amanota yanditseho 96\u201394, 96\u201394 na 95\u201395. Imirwano ibiri nyuma, ku ya 9 Kamena 2017, Kinigamazi w'imyaka 34 yatsinze Juan Jos\u00e9 Farias ku bwumvikane (117-106, 116-107, 116-107) kugira ngo yegukane igikombe cya WBF super featherweight. Yatsinze ibitego bine byatsinze abasore bahataniraga mbere yuko ahura n\u2019umukinnyi w\u2019umukinnyi w\u2019umukinnyi w\u2019umukinnyi w\u2019umukinnyi w\u2019amajyepfo Bongani Mahlangu i Geneve mu izamu rye rya gatanu, atsinda imikino Olempike yo mu 2004 ku cyemezo cya benshi ku ya 12 Ukuboza 2019. Yahawe kandi umurwanyi w\u2019umwaka wa 2017 muri WBF Awards. "}
{"id": "15018", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15018", "title": "Adonis Filer", "text": "Adonis Jovon Filer (yavutse ku ya 11 Nyakanga 1993) ni umukinnyi wa basketball ukomoka mu Rwanda akagira ubwenegihugu bwa merika ukinira REG BBC ya BAL muri africa. Akinira kandi ikipe yigihugu ya basketball yu Rwanda mumarushanwa mpuzamahanga.\nUbuzima.\nFiler yavukiye muri Chicago, yiga mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Mount Carmel mbere yo kwimukira mu kigo cya Musenyeri Noll i Hammond, muri Leta ya Indiana. Nyuma yaje no kwiga mu ishuri rya Notre Dame i Fitchburg, muri Massachusetts. \nMuri kaminuza.\nFiler yiyemeje gukinara Ingwe za Clemson. Mu gihe yakinaga na rokie, yagereranije amanota 10.0 na 4.0 reba. Nyuma yimyaka ibiri, yavuye muri Clemson yerekeza muri Floride Atlantike. \nUmwuga.\nKu ya 14 Nzeri 2017, Filer yasinyanye amasezerano ya mbere nku mwuga n\u2019ikipe ya Sipiriyani Apollon Limassol. Yarekuwe mbere yo gukina umukino uwo ari wo wose n'ikipe ye.\nFiler yahise asinyana amasezerano yigihembwe cya 2018\u201319, na Beroe wo muri Basketball ya Buligariya (NBL). \nMuri shampiyona ya 2020\u201321, Filer yakinnye na Patriot ya RNBL. Nyuma yigihembwe, amasezerano yararangiye. Ku ya 8 Kamena 2021, Filer yasinyanye na REG BBC. Ku ya 8 Werurwe 2022, yashyizeho agahigo muri BAL ku bafasha benshi mu mukino nyuma yo gutsinda abafasha 14 mu gutsinda AS Sal\u00e9. Muri shampiyona imwe, yagiye yegukana igikombe cya kabiri cya RBL kandi yitiriwe izina rya Team ya mbere All-RBL umwaka wa kabiri yikurikiranya.\nUgushyingo 2022, Filer yakinnye n'ikipe Urunani BBC muri Elite 16 yo mu cyiciro cya 2023 cya BAL. Yagarutse muri REG muri shampiyona nkuru ya 2023. \nIkipe y'igihugu.\nFiler yatoranijwe mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Basketball mu Rwanda mu 2020 maze atangira bwa mbere mu majonjora ya AfroBasket 2021. "}
{"id": "15019", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15019", "title": "Darrius Garrett", "text": "Darrius Garrett (wavutse ku ya 11 Mata 1990) ni umukinnyi wa Basketball wabigize umwuga, akaba umunyamerika n' umunyarwanda, ukinira ikipe ya Iraklis wo muri Shampiyona y\u2019Abagereki. Yakinnye muri basketball yo muri kaminuza ya Richmond.\nMu amashuri.\nGarret yatangiriye mu ishuri ryisumbuye ya McEachern i Powder Springs, muri Jeworujiya aho yize imyaka ibiri ahahurira nu umutoza we Nick Chaykowsky. muri 2007\u201308, afite amanota 16.2, na 11.8 reba, 4.3 blok na 2.0 buri mu mukino. \nUmwuga wa kaminuza.\nNkumunyeshuri wambere muri Richmond mu mwaka wa 2008\u201309, Garrett yakinnye afite amanota 1.3 na reba 1.9 mumikino 12. \nNkumunyeshuri wa kabiri muri 2009\u201310, Garrett yakinnye imikino 35 yose arangiza ari uwa karindwi mu nama ya Atlantike 10 mumikino yose hamwe na 1.7 (60 yose hamwe). Yagereranije kandi amanota 2.3 na 3.4 yagarutse mu minota 14.2 kuri buri mukino. Ku ya 10 Mutarama 2010, mu mukino wahuje Massachusetts, Garrett yashyizeho amateka ya Atlantike 10 na Richmond ku bitego mu mukino umwe hamwe na 14, bihuza ibice bibiri bya kabiri mu mukino wabereye mu mateka ya NCAA Icyiciro cya mbere. \nNkumuto muri 2010\u201311, Garrett yahagaritse amashoti 59 yose, arangiza umwaka wa karindwi kurutonde rwibihe byose bya Richmond hamwe na 124. Mu mikino 37, yagereranije amanota 1.9, reba 4.1 na blok 1,6 mu minota 12.8 kuri buri mukino. \nNkumukuze muri 2011\u201312, Garrett yabaye umukinnyi usanzwe kandi igice kinini cyikipe, ndetse arangiza umwuga we nkumukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi muri Richmond hamwe na 231. Hamwe n'iki cyubahiro, yanashyizwe mu ikipe ya Atlantique 10 All-Defender Team. Mu mikino 32, yagereranije amanota 4.5, 6.5 yagaruye, 1.0 afasha na 3.3 bice mu minota 25.5 kumukino. \nUmwuga wabigize umwuga.\nIrushanwa rya Basketball.\nMu mpeshyi ya 2017, Garrett yakinnye mu irushanwa rya Basketball kuri ESPN kuri Broad Street Brawlers. Yahatanira igihembo cya miliyoni 2 z'amadolari, kandi afasha Brawlers kugera mu cyiciro cya kabiri cy'irushanwa, atsindirwa muri Team Colorado 111\u201395. \nIkipe y'igihugu.\nGarrett yakinnye imikino 3 mu ikipe yigihugu ya basketball yu Rwanda mu majonjora y\u2019igikombe cyisi cya FIBA cya 2019 aho yagerageje amanota 11.7, 9.3 reba na 2.3 afasha kuri buri mukino.\nUbuzima bwite.\nGarrett ni umuhungu wa Darrick Jones na Sharllene Garrett, akaba afite mushiki we, Dayira, na murumuna we, Darrick Jr. "}
{"id": "15020", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15020", "title": "Idrissa Adam", "text": "Idrissa Adam (wavutse 28 Ukuboza 1984) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru wabigize umwuga wo muri Kameruni uhatanira metero 100 na metero 200.\nYasohotse bwa mbere ku rwego mpuzamahanga mu marushanwa nyafurika y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri mu 2003, aho yabaye uwa gatanu muri metero 100. Yatsindiye umudari wa mbere ku mugabane afurika w\u2019umwaka wakurikiyeho, atwara umudari wa bronze mu kwiruka metero 4 \u00d7 100, muri Shampiyona nyafurika yabereye muri 2004 mu ikipe ya rimo Joseph Batangdon. Hari hashize indi myaka ine mbere yuko yegukana undi mudari ukomeye: muri Shampiyona nyafurika ya 2008 we na Batangdon bongeye gutwara umuringa berekeza muri Kameruni. Yaje ku mwanya wa kane muri ibyo birori muri Jeux de la Francophonie 2009. \nYahagarariye Kameruni muri metro 100 na 200 muri Shampiyona nyafurika ya 2010 mu kwiruka ndetse n\u2019imikino ya Commonwealth 2010, ariko ntiyabona ibihe byiza kurenza icyiciro cya mbere. Yigaragaje nk'umukinnyi ku giti cye mu mikino yo muri Afurika muri 2011, aho yayoboye Kameruni amasegonda 10.14 muri metero 100 kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza kandi niyo yatunguye muri metero 200 umudari wa zahabu imbere ya Ben Youssef Meit\u00e9. "}
{"id": "15021", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15021", "title": "Delphine Atangana", "text": "Delphine Bertille Atangana (yavutse ku ya 16 Kanama 1984) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru wabigize umwuga uvuka i Yaound\u00e9 wo muri Kameruni kabuhariwe muri metero 100.\nMu mikino ya Commonwealth 2006 yegukanye umudari wa bronze muri metero 100 arangiriza ari kumwanya wa karindwi muri metero 200. Yitabiriye kandi imikino Olempike yo mu 2004, Shampiyona y'isi ya 2005, Shampiyona y'isi yo mu 2008, Shampiyona y'isi ya 2011, Shampiyona y'isi yo mu 2012 ndetse na Olempike yo mu mpeshyi 2012 atageze ku mukino wa nyuma. Yatsindiye zahabu muri 200\u00a0m mu mikino ya Afro-Aziya.\nIbihe byiza yagize ni amasegonda 11.24, yagezweho mu Kwakira 2003 i Abuja. Afite amasegonda 23.26 muri metero 200, yageze muri Mata 2003 i Bron, n'amasegonda 7.19 muri metero 60, yageze muri Gashyantare 2006 i Aubi\u00e8re. Afite kandi amateka y\u2019igihugu mu kwiruka metero 4 x 400 n'iminota 3: 27.08, yagezeho hamwe na bagenzi be Mireille Nguimgo, Carole Kaboud Mebam na Hortense B\u00e9wouda mu marushanwa y'isi yabereye i Paris mu 2003."}
{"id": "15022", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15022", "title": "Joseph Batangdon", "text": "Joseph Batangdon (wavutse ku ya 29 Nyakanga 1978) ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga akaba yarahoze yiruka muri Kameruni kabuhariwe muri metero 200.\nBatangdon yabaye shampiyo muri Afurika mu 2004, ukwezi mbere y'imikino Olempike yo mu 2004. Yarushanwe mu marushanwa ya metero 200."}
{"id": "15023", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15023", "title": "Serge Bengono", "text": "Serge Bengono (wavutse ku ya 3 Kanama 1977) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga uvuka muri Kameruni wiruka na maguru muri metero 100.\nUmwuga.\nYitabiriye imikino Olempike yo mu 2000 na Shampiyona y'isi mu 2001 na 2003 atageze ku mukino wa nyuma.\nIbihe bye byiza ni amasegonda 10.25 muri metero 100, yagezeho mumikino ya 1999 yabereye muri Johannesburg; n'amasegonda 20.89 muri metero 200, byagezweho muri Mata 2002 i Knoxville. Niwe kandi ufite rekodi yigihugu mu kwiruka metero 4 x 100, yageze muri Shampiyona yisi 1999. Muri relay yanitabiriye amarushanwa yisi ya 1997.\nKuri ubu Serge Bengono ni umutoza wungirije muri kaminuza ya Norfolk."}
{"id": "15024", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15024", "title": "Hortense Bewouda", "text": "Hortense B\u00e9wouda (yavutse 19 Ukwakira 1978) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga wo gusiganwa ku maguru wo muri Kameruni kabuhariwe muri metero 400.\nIbihe byiza yagize ni amasegonda 51.04, yayagize muri kamena 2004 muri Algiers. Kugeza ubu afite Umuhigo wi gihugu mu kwiruka metero 4 x 400 niminota 3: 27.08, yagezeho hamwe na bagenzi be Mireille Nguimgo, Carole Kaboud Mebam na Delphine Atangana muri Kanama 2003 i Paris. "}
{"id": "15025", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15025", "title": "Emmanuel Eseme", "text": "Emmanuel Alobwede Eseme (wavutse 17 Kanama 1993) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga ufite ubwenegihugu bwa merika uvuka muri Kameruni. Yitabiriye metero 200 mu bagabo mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri ya 2019 yabereye i Doha, muri Qatar. gusa ntabwo yujuje ibihe bicyenewe ngo yitabira kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza. \nMuri uwo mwaka kandi, yitabiriye kandi metero 200 z'abagabo ndetse na metero 4 \u00d7 100 z'abagabo mu marushanwa yo kwerekeza mu mikino Nyafurika ya 2019, muri ibyo bihe byombi atatsindiye umudari. \nYahagarariye Kameruni mu mikino Olempike ya 2020 yabereye i Tokiyo, mu Buyapani mu kwiruka metero 200 mu bagabo."}
{"id": "15026", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15026", "title": "Carole Kaboud Mebam", "text": "Carole Madeleine Kaboud Mebam (wavutse ku ya 17 Nzeri 1978) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga ukomoka muri wa Kameruni uzobereye mu kwiruka metero 100 na 400.\nIbyagezweho.\nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nAfite kandi amateka y\u2019igihugu mu kwiruka metero 4 \u00d7 400 n'iminota 3: 27.08, yagezeho hamwe na bagenzi be Mirelle Nguimgo, Delphine Atangana na Hortense B\u00e9wouda muri Kanama 2003 i Paris. "}
{"id": "15027", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15027", "title": "Claudine Komgang", "text": "Claudine Komgang-Fotsing cyangwa Claudine Komgang (wavutse ku ya 21 Mata 1974) ni umukinnyi wa siporo wabigize umwuga uvuka muri Kameruni, akaba yarasezeye mu mikino akaba ari kabuhariwe muri metero 400.\nYatsindiye umudari wa zahabu muri Shampiyona nyafurika 2000. Yitabiriye kandi amarushanwa y'isi yo mu 1999 ndetse na Olempike yo mu 2000 atageze ku mukino wa nyuma.\nIgihe cye cyiza ni amasegonda 50,73, yageze muri Nyakanga 2000 mumujyi wa Mexico."}
{"id": "15028", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15028", "title": "Hugo Mamba-Schlick", "text": "Hugo Lucien Mamba-Schlick (wavutse ku ya 1 Gashyantare 1982) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga akaba ari Umunyamerikakazi wasimbutse inshuro eshatu mu marushanwa ya afurika.\nYabaye uwa gatandatu muri Shampiyona nyafurika yo mu 2006 yegukanye umudari wa feza mu mikino yabereye muri Afurika 2007 kandi yegukana umudari wa feza mu marushanwa ya Afurika yo muri 2008 yaberaga muri Athletisme. Yitabiriye kandi amarushanwa y'isi ya 2007, 2009 na 2011 atageze ku mukino wa nyuma. Mu mwaka wa 2010 yatsindiye umudari wa feza mu mikino ya Commonwealth yabereye i Delhi, mu gusimbuka gushya kwa metero 17.14. Ubu ni inyandiko ya Kameruni."}
{"id": "15029", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15029", "title": "Myriam L\u00e9onie Mani", "text": "Myriam L\u00e9onie Mani (wavutse ku ya 21 Gicurasi 1977) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga uvuka muri Kameruni akaba ari kabuhariwe muri metero 100 na 200. \nMani yari ahagarariye Kameruni mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2008 yarushanwe muri metero 100. Mu bushyuhe bwe bwa mbere yashyize ku mwanya wa gatatu inyuma ya Torri Edwards na Jeanette Kwakye mu gihe cya 11.64 kugirango bazamuke mu cyiciro cya kabiri. Agezeyo, yananiwe kujya muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza kuko igihe cye cya 11,65 cyari inshuro ya gatandatu gusa yubushyuhe, bitera kurandurwa. "}
{"id": "15030", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15030", "title": "Sylvie Mballa \u00c9loundou", "text": "Sylvie Florence Mballa \u00c9loundou (yavutse ku ya 21 Mata 1977) ni - Umukinnyi wabigize umwuga ukora umukino wo gusiganwa ku maguru ukomoka muri Kameruni afite ubwenegihugu bwu bufaransa akaba ari kabuhariwe muri metero 100.\nSylvie Mballa \u00c9loundou ukomoka mu gace ka Yaound\u00e9, umurwa mukuru wa Kameruni, mu ntangiriro yari ahagarariye igihugu yavukiyemo, ariko ahindura ubwenegihugu ku ya 10 Ukwakira 2002 kugira ngo ahatane nk'umwe mu bagize ikipe y'Ubufaransa. Nyuma y'indi mpinduka, ku ya 1 Mata 2005, yongeye kwinjira mu marushanwa munsi y'ibendera rya Kameruni.\nIgihe cye cyiza kuri metero 100 ni amasegonda 11.13, yageze muri Nyakanga 2005 muri Angers, ariko, mu marushanwa ya IAAF yaberaga mu 2006 yabereye i Moscou, yarangije kwiruka metero 60 ku mwanya wa munani."}
{"id": "15031", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15031", "title": "Fran\u00e7oise Mbango Etone", "text": "Fran\u00e7oise Mbango Etone (yavutse ku ya 14 Mata 1976) ni umukinnyi w\u2019imikino ngororamubiri wabigize umwuga ukomoka i Yaound\u00e9 mu gihugu cya Kameruni. Yagiye mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga atandukanye mu Bufaransa kuva mu 2010. Mu gihe yarushanwaga afatanyije na Kameruni, Etone begukanye umudari wa zahabu inshuro 2 mu mikino Olempike yo gusimbuka ushuro eshatu mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2004 yabereye muri Atenayi, mu Bugereki no mu mikino Olempike ya 2008 yabereye i Beijing mu Bushinwa. Yatsindiye imikino Olempike mu gusimbuka gatatu yashyizehoagahigo muri metero 15.39 mu mikino Olempike yabereye i Beijing mu 2008. Muri M 15.39 m mu gusimbuka gatatu harehare mu bagore batatu basimbuka mubihe byose. Abagore 25 gusa ni bo ba simbuka metero 15, Etone yasimbutse hejuru ya metero 15 kuri 7 kugeza kuri 11 yagaragaye ku mukino wa nyuma mu mikino Olempike wenyine.\nEtone kandi yari umuhanga muremure wasimbutse wabaye uwa kabiri muri Shampiyona nyafurika mu 1999. Etone niwe mukinnyi wa mbere w\u2019abakobwa bahagarariye Kameruni wegukanye imidari mu mikino ya Commonwealth, Shampiyona yisi n\u2019imikino Olempike. Yabaye buruse muri gahunda ya Olempike Solidarity kuva mu Gushyingo 2002.\nMu mwaka w'amashuri wa 2005\u201306, yabaga mu mujyi wa New York kuri bourse yo kwiga muri kaminuza ya Mutagatifu Yohani i Queens, muri New York. Bourse yashobotse ku bufatanye n\u2019isosiyete ikora amashanyarazi muri Amerika AES Sonel hamwe na Ambasaderi w\u2019Amerika muri Kameruni, Niels Marquardt. Yahisemo kaminuza ya Mutagatifu Yohani kugira ngo yige (hamwe na murumuna we, Berthe) kubera ko ishuri ryashyigikiraga gahunda z'umuco muri Kameruni."}
{"id": "15032", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15032", "title": "Alfred Moussambani", "text": "Alfred \u00c9mile Moussambani (wavutse ku ya 25 Gashyantare 1974) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru wabigize umwuga ukomoka muri Kameruni akaba ari kabuhariwe muri metero 100. Yahagarariye igihugu cye mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1996 na 2000 nk'umunyamuryango w\u2019ikipe ya metero 4x100. Abandi bagize ikipe muri 1996 bakinanye ni Benjamin Sirimou, Aim\u00e9-Issa Nth\u00e9p\u00e9 na Claude Touk\u00e9n\u00e9-Gu\u00e9bogo. Abagize ikipe bakinanye muri 2000 ni Serge Bengono, II, Joseph Batangdon, na Benjamin Sirimou. \nAfatanije na Serge Mbegomo, Claude Toukene na Joseph Batangdon yegukanye umwanya wa karindwi ku mukino wa nyuma wo kwiruka metero 4 x 100 mu mikino ya Commonwealth 2002 ndetse no mu mikino ya Commonwealth 2006.\nYabaye kandi umwe mu bagize ikipe y'igihugu ye muri Shampiyona y'isi 1997, 2001 na 2003.\nIbyiza bye ni:\nYirutse kandi metero 100 muri 10.33 ariko akoresheje umuyaga +4.1. "}
{"id": "15033", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15033", "title": "Samuel Nchinda-Kaya", "text": "Samuel Nchinda-Kaya (wavutse ku ya 25 Gicurasi 1967) yahoze ari umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru wari wabigize umwuga ukomoka muri Kameruni witabiriye amarushanwa ya metero 100 mu bagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1992. akoresha amasegonda 10.41, byari bihagije kugirango abashe kujya mu cyiciro gikurikira, aho yagize amasegonda 10.58. Ibihe byiza yagize ni amasegonda 10.24, mu mwaka wa 1992. Yirutse kandi muri metero 200, akoresha amasaha 21.50. Mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1988, yarushanwe muri metero 100 na 200, azamuka muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza. "}
{"id": "15034", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15034", "title": "Mireille Nguimgo", "text": "Mireille Nguimgo (wavutse ku ya 7 Ugushyingo 1976) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa kumaguru wabigize umwuga ukomoka muri Kameruni akaba ari kabuhariwe muri metero 400.\nNtabwo yarushanwe kurwego rwo hejuru kuva shampiyona 2004.\nIbyagezweho.\nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nAfite kandi amateka y\u2019igihugu mu kwiruka metero 4 \u00d7 400 n'iminota 3: 27.08, yagezeho hamwe na bagenzi be Carole Kaboud Mebam, Delphine Atangana na Hortense B\u00e9wouda muri Kanama 2003 i Paris. "}
{"id": "15035", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15035", "title": "Georgette Nkoma", "text": "Georgette Nkoma (wavutse ku ya 16 Kamena 1965) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga akaba akomoka muri Kameruni. Muri Shampiyona nyafurika yo mu 1996 yatsindiye imidari ya zahabu muri metero 100 na 200. Yitabiriye kandi amarushanwa y'isi mu 1993, 1995 na 1997, ndetse no muri metero 4 \u00d7 100 mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1996 atageze ku mukino wa nyuma."}
{"id": "15036", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15036", "title": "Jo\u00eblle Mbumi Nkouindjin", "text": "Jo\u00eblle Sandrine Mbumi Nkouindjin (wavutse ku ya 25 Gicurasi 1986) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga ukomoka muri Kameruni ufite umwihariko wo gusimbuka gatatu. Yitabiriye amarushanwa y'isi ya 2015 yabereye i Beijing, gusa ntiyabashije kujya ku mukino wa nyuma. Afite ibihe byiza muri metero 14.16 mu gusimbuka gatatu ari i Yaound\u00e9 muri 2015 na metero 6.35 mu gusimbuka birebire muri Yaound\u00e9 2014."}
{"id": "15037", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15037", "title": "Umunsi w\u2019abagore (Ubuhinde)", "text": "Umunsi mukuru w\u2019abagore mu Buhinde wizihizwa ku ya 13 Gashyantare buri mwaka, ku isabukuru ya Sarojini Naidu wavutse ku ya 13 Gashyantare 1879 i Hyderabad, mu Buhinde. Naidu yari umuyobozi w\u2019ishyaka ryigenga ry\u2019Ubuhinde kandi azwiho ibikorwa by\u2019ubuvanganzo, cyane cyane ku bisigo bye bifite insanganyamatsiko nko gukunda igihugu, gukundana n\u2019indirimbo yise \"Nightingale y' Ubuhinde\" - (\"Bharat Kokila\") ya Mahatma Gandhi, Naidu iteka yaharaniraga kongerera ubushobozi abagore mu Buhinde. "}
{"id": "15038", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15038", "title": "Ikipe ya Cricket y'abagore yu Rwanda", "text": "Ikipe ya Cricket y'abagore yu Rwanda ni ikipe ya Cricket yo mu Rwanda, aho ihagararira igihugu mu marushanwa atandukanye. Ikipe y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019abagore mu mukino wa Cricket yegukana igikombe itsinze ikipe ya Nigeriya mu marushanwa ya Afurika, rikaba ryaritabirwe n\u2019ibihugu 5 aribyo u Rwanda, Nigeriya, Sierra Leone, Gana na Gambiya.\nIkipe y'ubu.\nBimenyimana Marie Diane niwe kapiteni w\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu ya Cricket y'abagore, ni ikipe y'abakinnyi bafite ibikombe mpuzamahanga banditswe muburyo bugaragara bakuye muri nigeriya. Abakinnyi b\u2019ikipe ya cricket y\u2019u Rwanda nibo biganje mu batwaye ibihembo by\u2019abakinnyi beza b\u2019irushanwa aha twavuga:"}
{"id": "15039", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15039", "title": "Issa-Aime Nthepe", "text": "Issa-Aim\u00e9 Nth\u00e9p\u00e9 (wavutse ku ya 26 Kamena 1973) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga ufite ubwenegihugu bwu bufaransa wiruka cyane muri metero 100. Yavukiye i Douala mu gihugu cye cya Kameruni mu 1999.\nMuri Shampiyona yi Burayi 2002 yarangije umwanya wa gatanu muri metero 100 na kane muri metero 4 x 100. Yageze muri kimwe cya kane cya Shampiyona y'isi 2003. Yaje ku mwanya wa karindwi n'ikipe ya relay y'Abafaransa mu gikombe cy'isi cya IAAF 2006.\nIbihe bye byiza ni amasegonda 10.11 muri m 100 n'amasegonda 20.58 muri m 200, byombi yabigezeho mu mpeshyi ya 2002."}
{"id": "15040", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15040", "title": "Suzie Tanefo", "text": "Suzie Tanefo (wavutse ku ya 22 Gicurasi 1969) ni umukinnyi wa siporo wabigize umwuga ukomoka mugihugu cya Kameruni wasezeye ku gukina akaba ari mukiruhuko cy'izabukuru akaba yaari kabuhariwe muri metero 400.\nMu mikino yo muri Afurika yo hagati 1987 yegukanye imidari ya feza muri metero 200 na 400. Yitabiriye kandi amarushanwa y'isi yo mu 1991 na Olempike yo mu 1992 atageze ku mukino wa nyuma. \nIgihe cye cyiza ni amasegonda 52,88, yagezweho muri 1989. "}
{"id": "15041", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15041", "title": "Georgina Toth", "text": "Georgina Toth (wavutse ku ya 10 Werurwe 1982) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga akaba afite umbenegihugu bwa Hongiriya wavutse aru umunya Kameruni, kandi yakiniye iguhugu yavukiyemo cya Kameruni mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2008. \nToth yize muri kaminuza ya Arizona y'Amajyaruguru i flagstaff, muri Arizona, aho yarushanwe mu ikipe y'abagore basiganwa ku maguru, arangiza mu 2009 afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bijyanye n'ubucuruzi-imari n'ubucuruzi. \nKu rwego mpuzamahanga, yaje ku mwanya wa kane mu marushanwa ya Afurika yo ku nshuro ya 16 muri 2008. Toth ifite rekodi yigihugu muri Hongiriya na Kameruni mu guta ibiro hamwe na 19.69\u00a0m (64\u00a0ft 7\u00a0muri), hamwe na rekodi yigihugu ya Kameruni mu guta inyundo hamwe na 67.42\u00a0m."}
{"id": "15042", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15042", "title": "Mahmoud Saber", "text": "Mahmoud Saber ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga ukina umupira w amaguru wumunyamisiri ukinira ikipe ya Pyramide yo mu Misiri yo mu Misiri nka rutahizamu. \nUbuzima.\nMahmoud Saber yavutse ku ya 30 Nyakanga 2001. Yatangiye umwuga we muri Nogoom FC muri 2018 naho muri 2020 yimurirwa muri Pyramids FC. Ari no mu ikipe ya Olempike yo mu Misiri 2023. "}
{"id": "15043", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15043", "title": "Ahmed Daador", "text": "Ahmed Aly Ahmed Daador ni umukinyi w'umupira wamaguru wu munyamisiri ukinira ikipe ya Pyramide yo muri Egiputa yo mu Misiri nkumuzamu. \nUbuzima.\nAhmed Daador yavutse ku ya 10 Mata 1995 mu Misiri. Yatangiye umwuga we muri 2015 hamwe na Misr lel-Maqasah SC. Muri 2017, yinjiye muri Pyramids FC naho muri 2020 yimurirwa muri Al Masry. Muri 2021, yasubijwe muri Pyramids FC. \nIgikombe.\nYari mu ikipe ya kabiri yegukanye igikombe cya EFA League 2018/2019 na 2019/2020 CAF Confederation Cup "}
{"id": "15044", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15044", "title": "Abdallah Magdy", "text": "Abdallah Magdy ni umukinnyi w\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru wabigize umwuga ukomoka muri Egypt, akaba akina hagati mu kibuga (midfielder) aho afasha cyane mu kurinda no gutangiza ibitero; kuri ubu akinira ikipe ya Pyramids FC ikina muri Egyptian Premier League, shampiyona y\u2019icyiciro cya mbere mu Misiri, kandi azwiho gukina afite imbaraga, gutanga imipira myiza no gufasha ikipe ye kugera ku ntsinzi mu mikino yo mu gihugu no ku rwego mpuzamahanga. \nUbuzima.\nAbdallah Magdy yavutse ku ya 22 Gashyantare 1997 mu Misiri. Yakiniye Misr Lel Makkasa kuva 2019 kugeza 2021 ubwo yimurirwaga muri Pyramide. \nIgikombe.\nYari mu ikipe ya kabiri yegukanye igikombe cya shampiyona yo mu Misiri 2022. "}
{"id": "15045", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15045", "title": "Ghanam Mohamed", "text": "Ghanam Mohamed ni ukuminnyi wu mupira wamaguru wu munyamisiri wa bigize umwuga ukinira ikipe ya Future FC yo muri Egiputa ho mu Misiri, muri Future FC ni nkumukinnyi wo hagati. \nUbuzima.\nGhanam Mohamed yavutse ku ya 12 Werurwe 1997 mu Misiri. Yatangiye umwuga we wumupira wamaguru muri Al Ahly. Muri 2017, yimuriwe muri El Gouna. Muri 2018, yimuriwe muri El Entag El- Harby naho mu 2021 yimurirwa muri Future FC. Muri rusange, amaze kwitabira imikino irenga ijana mu marushanwa yose harimo no kugaragara mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu cya Afurika U-23 2019. \nIgikombe.\nYatsindiye Igikombe cya Afurika U-23 2019 ndetse n\u2019igikombe cya EFA 2020/2021 hamwe na Future FC. "}
{"id": "15046", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15046", "title": "Mahmoud Shaaban", "text": "Mahmoud Shaaban ni umukinnyi wu mupira wamaguru wu munyamisiri wabigize umwuga ukinira muri League yo muri Egiputa mu kipe ya Future FC nka myugariro. \nUbuzima.\nMahmoud Shaaban yavutse ku ya 7 Werurwe 1995 mu Misiri. Yatangiye umwuga we wumupira wamaguru Al-Ittihad muri 2015. Muri 2019 yimuriwe muri FC Masr maze muri uwo mwaka, asubizwa muri Al Ittihad. Muri 2021 yaguzwe na Ghazl El Mahalla ubu akaba ari muri Future FC. "}
{"id": "15047", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15047", "title": "Ali Elfil", "text": "Ali Ahmed Mohab Elfil ni umukinnyi wu mupira wamaguru wumunyamisiri ukinira muri cy'iciro cya mbere muri league yo muri Egiputa ho mu Misiri mu i kipe ya Future FC nka myugariro. \nUbuzima.\nAli Elfil yavutse ku ya 13 Ukuboza 1992 mu Misiri. Yatangiye umwuga we wumupira wamaguru muri Telephonat Beni Suef SC. Muri 2015, yimuriwe muri Haras El Hodoud SC. Muri 2018, yaguzwe na Tala'ea El Gaish SC maze mu 2022 yimurirwa muri Future FC. Muri rusange, afite inshuro zirenga ijana n'ibitego bitatu. \nIgikombe.\nYabaye igisonga mu gikombe cya EFA 2019/2020 ndetse nuwatsindiye igikombe cya Super Cup 2020/2021. "}
{"id": "15048", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15048", "title": "Mahmoud Marei", "text": "Mahmoud Marei ni umukinyi wu mupira wa maguru wa bigize umwuga wu munyamisiri ukinira mu cyiciro cya mbere muri League yo muri Egiputa mu ikipe ya Future FC nka myugariro. \nUbuzima.\nMahmoud Marei yavutse ku ya 24 Mata 1998 mu Misiri. Yatangiye umwuga we wumupira wamaguru muri club yurubyiruko ya Wadi Degla SC. Yazamuwe mu ikipe ya mbere muri shampiyona ya 2017/2018 aho yakinnye imyaka, aho yagaragaye inshuro zirenga ijana mbere yo kwerekeza muri Future FC. Yakinnye kandi mu ikipe y\u2019umupira wamaguru y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 20 mu Misiri mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu cya Afurika U-20 2017 aho yakinnye imikino itatu na Mali, Gineya na Zambiya. \nIgikombe.\nMuri 2019, yegukanye igikombe cy\u2019ibihugu CAF U-23 hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Misiri naho muri shampiyona 2021/2022 atwara igikombe cya EFA League hamwe na Future FC. "}
{"id": "15049", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15049", "title": "Bay Kamara", "text": "Bay Kamara ni umukinnyi wu mupira wa maguru ufite ubwenegihugu bw\u2019Ubuholandi ariko ukomoka muri Senegali ukinira ikipe ya Aswan SC yo mu Egiputa ho mu Misiri nku kina ku ruhande. \nUbuzima.\nBay Kamara yavutse ku ya 15 Gashyantare 2001 muri Senegali. Yatangiye umwuga we mu ikipe ya Zeborgia mbere yo kwinjira mu ikipe mpuzamahanga y\u2019Urubyiruko mu Buholandi. Yabanje gukina muri AZ Alkmaar na FC Emmen. Yinjiye mu ikipe ya Misiri yo mu Misiri Aswan SC mu 2022, ubu ari mu nguzanyo na Ismaily SC. "}
{"id": "15050", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15050", "title": "Ibrahim Ayesh", "text": "Ibrahim Ayesh ni umukinnyi wu mupira w'amaguru wu munyamisiri ukinira ikipe ya Ghazl El Mahalla yo mu cyiciro cya mbere mu egiputa ho mu Misiri, akina nku mukinnyi wo hagati. \nUbuzima.\nIbrahim Ayesh yavutse ku ya 16 Ugushyingo 1998 mu Misiri. Yatangiye umwuga we mu kibaya cya Tigris mu 2018. Mu 2022 yimuriwe muri Aswan SC naho mu 2023 yimurirwa muri Ghazl El Mahalla. "}
{"id": "15051", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15051", "title": "Saber El Shimi", "text": "Saber El Shimi ni umukinnyi wu mupira wa maguru akaba umunyamisiri ukinira Aswan SC muri Egiputa nka myugariro. \nUbuzima.\nSaber Ashraf El Shimi yavutse ku ya 30 Mutarama 1993. Yahoze ari capitaine wa Eastern Company SC nyuma yaje gusinyana amasezerano yimyaka ibiri nigice na Aswan SC kubusa. "}
{"id": "15052", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15052", "title": "Mido Mostafa", "text": "Mido Mostafa ni umukinnyi wu mupira wa maguru wu munyamisiri wabigize umwuga ukinira mu cyiciro cya mbere mu Misiri ho muri Egiputa mu i kipe ya Banki nkuru yigihugu ya Misiri nka myugariro akaba yaratizwe muri Aswan SC. "}
{"id": "15053", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15053", "title": "Amr Hossam", "text": "Amr Hossam ni umukinnyi wu mupira wa maguru wu munyamisiri wabigize umwuga ukinira mu cyiciro cya mbere mu Misiri ho muri Egiputa mu i kipe ya Eastern Company nka myugariro ari mu ntizanyo muri Aswan SC \nUbuzima.\nAmr Hossam yavutse ku ya 26 Mutarama 1991 mu Misiri. Yatangiye umwuga we mu 2015 mu ihuriro ry\u2019abapolisi. Muri 2016, yimuriwe muri Petroject, Mbwira FC muri 2018, Isosiyete y'Iburasirazuba mu 2021, ubu akaba ari inguzanyo muri Aswan SC. "}
{"id": "15054", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15054", "title": "Mostafa Abdelrasoul", "text": "Mostafa Abdelrasoul (yavutse 14 Gashyantare 1998) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga wu mupira wamaguru wu munyamisiri ukinira ikipe ya Aswan SC yo muri Egiputa ho mu Misiri muri cyiciro cyambere akina nkumukinnyi wo hagati. "}
{"id": "15055", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15055", "title": "Mahmoud Namjoo", "text": "Mahmoud Namjoo (yavutse, 22 Nzeri 1918 -yapfuye 21 Mutarama 1989) yari umukinnyi uterura ibiremereye ukomoka Irani. Yitabiriye imikino Olempike yo mu 1948, 1952 na 1956 aza ku mwanya wa gatanu, uwa kabiri n'uwa gatatu. Mu marushanwa y'isi yegukanye zahabu eshatu, imwe ya feza n'imidari ibiri ya bronze hagati ya 1949 na 1957, aba uterura ibiremereye wa mbere wa Irani watsinze mu gikombe cy'isi. Namjoo kandi niwe wambere wateruye ibiremereye muri Aziya byatumye ashyiraho agahigo ki si; mugihe cye umwuga we yashyizeho uduhigo tune: kamwe muri clean and jerk muri 1949 na dutatu muri rusange, muri 1948, 1949 na 1951. \nNamjoo yavukiye i Rasht mu 1918 maze mu 1937 yimukira i Tehran, aho yakoraga ahugurwa mu bubaji. Yateruye ibiremereye muri siporo. Usibye guterura ibiremereye yanarushanwe mu kubaka umubiri, kandi yegukana Igihembo cyitiriwe Bwana Universe mu kugabanya ibiro mu 1948, aba uwa gatanu mu 1955. Mu 1956 yamaze amezi abiri akora akazi ko gutoza mu biremereye muri Turukiya. Yakomeje imyitozo mu myaka mirongo ine yakurikiyeho agerageza gutsindira imikino Olempike yo mu 1960. Yapfuye azize kanseri, yandura afite imyaka 70. \nIhuza ryo hanze.\nMahmoud Namjoo at Olympedia"}
{"id": "15057", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15057", "title": "Mohamed Atwa", "text": "Mohamed Atwa (wavutse ku ya 15 Nyakanga 1990) ni umukinnyi w\u2019umupira wa maguru w\u2019umunyamisiri ukinira ikipe ya El Gouna yo mu Misiri mu cyiciro cya mbere mu Misiri nka myugariro, ubu akaba ari mu ntizanyo muri Aswan SC. Yatangiye umwuga we muri 2016 aho yakiniye muri Egiputa Clearing Club maze yinjira muri Alexandrie Union mu 2016. Yimukiye muri Pioneer mu 2018, Pyramide muri 2019, Alexandrie Union na El Gouna muri 2020 na Aswan ku ntizanyo mu 2022. "}
{"id": "15058", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15058", "title": "Raphael Ayagwa", "text": "Raphael Viashima Ayagwa (wavutse ku ya 13 Gashyantare 1998) ni umukinyi wabigize umwuga ukina umupira wa maguru ukina mu cyiciro cya mbere muri Nigeriya ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati wa Aswan.\nUmwuga wa club.\nLobi Stars FC 2016-2017\nRaphael Ayagwa yakinaga muri Plateau United FC i Jos, muri leta ya Plateau, mbere yuko asinyira ikipe ya Lillestr\u00f8m yo muri Noruveje ku ya 15 Kanama 2018. Yavuye muri iyo kipe ku ya 25 Kamena 2019 nyuma yo gusesa amasezerano ye byumvikanyweho. \nKu ya 11 Mutarama 2020, Ayagwa yinjiye mu ikipe ya USL Championat ya FC Tulsa. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nKu ya 19 Kanama 2017, Ayagwa yahamagawe mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Nijeriya maze agaragara muri Nigeria muri Benin "}
{"id": "15059", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15059", "title": "Ahmed Hamoudi", "text": "Ahmed Hamoudi (yavutse wavutse 30 Nyakanga 1990) ni umukinnyi umupira wamaguru wu munyamisiri wabigize umwuga ukina nkumukinnyi wo hagati utera mu ikipe ya Pyramids yo muri Egiputa mu cyiciro cyambere mu Misiri. \nUmwuga wa club.\nSmouha.\nHamoudi yakinnye umupira w'amaguru mu rubyiruko na Smouha Sporting Club maze azamuka mu ikipe yabo ya mbere mu 2010. Muri shampiyona ya mbere yakinnye buri gihe. Nyuma y'imyivumbagatanyo ya Stade ya Port Said ku ya 1 Gashyantare 2012, Shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere cya Misiri yahagaritswe, maze ku ya 10 Werurwe 2012, Ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru mu Misiri ryatangaje icyemezo cyafashe cyo guhagarika shampiyona isigaye. Umikino ya shampiyona yakurikiyeho wongeye gutangira, nyuma y\u2019ubutegetsi bwa Misiri 2013 ku ya 3 Nyakanga 2013, igihe cya Misiri cyahagaritswe kubera impamvu z\u2019umutekano, maze hafatwa icyemezo cyo guhagarika igihe gisigaye cya shampiyona. Igihembwe cyakurikiyeho cyongeye gukinwa byuzuye kandi Hamoudi hamwe na Smouha bari mu ikipe yabaye iya kabiri muri shampiyona.\nBasel.\nKu ya 29 Nyakanga 2014 Basel yatangaje ko basinyanye na Hamoudi ku masezerano y\u2019imyaka ine. Yinjiye mu ikipe ya mbere ya Basel muri shampiyona yabo ya 2014\u201315 iyobowe n'umutoza mukuru Paulo Sousa. Nyuma yo gukina umukino umwe wikizamini, Hamoudi yakinnye bwa mbere ikipe ye nkuru mu mukino w\u2019igikombe cy\u2019Ubusuwisi ku ya 23 Kanama 2014 ubwo Basel yatsinze ibitego 4\u20130 na CS Italien (GE). Yakinnye umukino wa mbere muri shampiyona yo mu gihugu maze atsinda igitego cye cya mbere cya shampiyona mu mukino wabereye i St. Jakob-Park ku ya 23 Nzeri 2014. Nicyo gitego cyanyuma cyumukino umupira wari uturutse kuri mugenzi we wo muri Egiputa Mohamed Elneny, kuko Basel yatsinze 3-1 na Vaduz. \nIgihembwe 2014\u201315 cyagenze neza kuri Basel. Basel yinjiye muri Champions League mu matsinda. Bageze mu cyiciro cya knockout ku ya 9 Ukuboza 2014, ubwo bashoboye kunganya 1-1 i Anfield na Liverpool. Ariko bakuwe mu marushanwa na Porto mu cyiciro cya 16. Mu mpera za shampiyona 2014-15, Basel yegukanye igikombe cya shampiyona kunshuro ya gatandatu yikurikiranya. Mu gikombe cy'Ubusuwisi 2014\u201315 Basel yageze ku mukino wa nyuma. Ariko, kunshuro ya gatatu yikurikiranya barangije ari abiruka.\nZamalek.\nKu cyumweru tariki ya 5 Kanama 2015 Hamoudi yinjiye muri Zamalek ku nguzanyo kugeza shampiyona ya 2015-16 irangiye, yatangiye bwa mbere ku ya 23 Kanama 2015 maze atsinda ibitego bibiri mu mukino yatsinze CS Sfaxien ibitego 3\u20131 mu cyiciro cya gatanu cy\u2019amashyirahamwe ya CAF 2015. Igikombe cyamatsinda. \nAl Ahly.\nKu ya 30 Mutarama 2017, Hamoudi yinjiye muri Al Ahly wo muri Al Batin."}
{"id": "15060", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15060", "title": "Mohamed Hamdy Zaky", "text": "Mohamed Hamdy Zaky uzwi nka Mohamed Hamdy (wavutse ku ya 13 Ukuboza 1991) ni umukinnyi w\u2019umupira wamaguru wabigize umwuga, w\u2019umunyamisiri ukinira mu ikipe ya Ismaily yo mu Misiri muri Shampiyona yi cyiciro cya mbere cya Misiri, nka rutahizamu. \nHamdy yakinnye na Misiri U20 muri 2011 FIFA U-20 Igikombe cyisi. \nHamdy yatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru mu Misiri ku ya 8 Kamena 2015, na Malawi."}
{"id": "15061", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15061", "title": "Malick Evouna", "text": "Malick Evouna (wavutse 28 Ugushyingo 1992) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga mu mupira wa maguru ukomoka muri wa Gabon ukina nka rutahizamu mu i kipe yo muri Egiputa Aswan SC.\nUmwuga.\nNyuma yo gutsinda ibitego cumi na bibiri mu mikino 17 muri shampiyona ya 2012\u201313 muri CF Mounana, Evouna yinjiye mu ikipe ya Maroc Wydad Casablanca atsinda ibitego umunani muri shampiyona ye ya mbere.\nKu ya 11 Nyakanga 2015, hatangajwe ko Evouna yinjiye muri Al Ahly wo mu Misiri. \nKu ya 11 Nyakanga 2016, Evouna yimuriwe muri Tianjin Teda FC yo mu Bushinwa.\nKu ya 26 Ugushyingo 2020, Evouna yimuriwe muri CS Sfaxien wo muri Tuniziya.\nKu ya 4 Nyakanga 2022, Evouna yasubiye mu Misiri asinyira Aswan SC\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nKu ya 9 Ugushyingo 2012, Evouna yatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Gabon na Arabiya Sawudite. Yinjijwe mu ikipe ya Gabon mu gikombe cy\u2019Afurika cya 2015 maze atsinda igitego mu mukino ubanza na Burkina Faso. \nKugeza muri Kamena 2016, Evouna yatsinze ibitego 12 mu ikipe yumupira wamaguru ya Gabon.\n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo urutonde rwa Gabon urutonde rwambere.\""}
