{"id": "15063", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15063", "title": "Mohamed Moussa", "text": "Mohamed Moussa (; wavutse ku ya 16 Kanama 1995) ni umukinnyi wu mupira wa maguru wabigize umwuga ukomoka mu nyamisiri ukina nkumuzamu muri El-Entag El-Harby. Yakiniye ikipe yi gihugu ya Misiri y'abatarengeje imyaka 23, Muri 2015, Moussa yasinyanye amasezerano yi myaka 4 na El-Entag, ava muri Wadi Degla na Al Ahly Fc mbere yuko arangira 2010-2011 \nReba "}
