{"id": "15065", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15065", "title": "Sayed Shabrawy", "text": "Sayed Shabrawy (wavutse ku ya 1 Mata 1993) ni umukinnyi wu mupira wa maguru wabigize umwugu wu munyamisiri usanzwe ukina ku ruhande rw'iburyo mu ikipe ya El-Entag El-Harby. Yakinye mu ikipe yi gihugu ya Misiri mu batarenge imyaka17, imyaka20, na imyaka 23.\nShabrawy yatangiye umwuga we muri Al Ahly mu 2000, azamurwa mu ntera azakinira ikipe ya mbere mu 2014. Nyuma yimukiye muri Al Ittihad Alegizandiriya akina shampiyona imwe, kugeza ubwo yongeye kwimuka muri shampiyona ya 2015\u201316 ku buntu, asinyana amasezerano n\u2019imyaka ibiri na Aswan, aho yakinnye cyane y'umwuga we wabigize umwuga kugeza ubu. Muri 2017, yasinyanye amasezerano yimyaka itatu na El-Entag El-Harby. "}
{"id": "15066", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15066", "title": "Mahmoud Rizk", "text": "Mahmoud Rizk (wavutse 1 Mutarama 1990) ni umukinyi wu mupira wamaguru wabigize umwuga ukomoka mu misiri ukina nkumukinyi wo hagati mu ikipe ya Al Ittihad yo mu Misiri.\nRizk yavuye muri El Mansoura yerekeza muri Al Ahly mu 2015 afite amasezerano yimyaka 5, ariko yagurijwe muri El Entag El Harby umwaka umwe, muri saison ye ya mbere hamwe na El Entag El Harby, yabonye imvune yimbere yimbere ; icyakora iyi kipe yamusinyanye amasezerano ahoraho na Al Ahly shampiyona irangiye. Muri 2017, yongereye amasezerano na El Entag El Harby imyaka 2. Nubwo yongereye amasezerano, yarekuwe niyi kipe mu mpera za shampiyona y\u2019icyiciro cya mbere cya Misiri 2017\u201318, nyuma yaje kwinjira muri Al Ittihad ku buntu. "}
{"id": "15067", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15067", "title": "Ibrahim Hassan", "text": "Ibrahim Hassan Hussein (wavutse 10 Kanama 1966) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga ukomoka mu Misiri wahoze akina umupira wa maguru anyura iburyo. Ibrahim Hassan yahamagawe mu ikipe yi gihugu icyuro 100 yo muri Egiputa. Impanga ye yitwa Hossam nawe yakinnye umupira wa maguru wa bigize umwuga, bakinanye mu makipe yabo. \nUmwuga.\nHassan yavukiye i Cairo, yakinnye ubuhanga imyaka igera kuri makumyabiri, mu mwuga aho yasangiye amakipe na murumuna we Hossam ku bwinshi. Yahagarariye Al Ahly (kabiri), PAOK FC, Neuch\u00e2tel Xamax, Al Ain SCC, Zamalek SC na Al-Masry, ndetse yinjira mu mpanga ye mu mahanga mu mahanga mu Bugereki, Ubusuwisi na Leta zunze ubumwe z'Abarabu.\nHassan yagiye mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru afite imyaka igera kuri 40, akomeza kugira ubuhanga nk'umuyobozi wungirije mu ikipe yahoze yitwa El-Masry, aho murumuna we na we yatangiriye umwuga w'ubutoza mu 2008. Mu mwaka wa 2010, nyuma yigihe gito nk'umuyobozi wungirije hamwe na Zamalek, yabaye umuyobozi wumupira wamaguru.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nHassan yakinnye imikino 125 atsinda Misiri ibitego 12 mumyaka hafi 20, nka Hossam. Yagaragaye mu ikipe y'igihugu mu gikombe cy'isi cya 1990 FIFA, ayifasha kunganya bibiri ndetse no gutsindwa n'Ubwongereza 0\u20131. Murumuna we na we yari intangiriro idashidikanywaho, kuko aba bombi babaye abakinnyi ba mbere baturutse muri Afurika batoranijwe muri Century Club ya FIFA. Hassan akomeje kuba umupira wamaguru wumupira wamaguru wo muri Egiputa wahisemo amakipe yisi ya FIFA (inshuro eshatu) akina muri 1990 na 1999 na Bosiniya na Afrika yepfo."}
{"id": "15068", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15068", "title": "Mabululu", "text": "Agostinho Crist\u00f3v\u00e3o Paci\u00eancia uzwi nka Mabululu, (yavutse ku ya 10 Nzeri 1989) ni umukinnyi mpuza mahanga wa bigize umwuga akaba umukinnyi mpuzamahanga w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Angola ukinira ikipe ya Primeiro de Agosto nka rutahizamu. Yakinnye igikombe cyisi cya FIFA 2014. \nMuri 2018\u201319, yinjiye muri Primeiro de Agosto muri shampiyona yambere ya Angola, Girabola. \n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo urutonde rwa Angola ibitego byambere.\" "}
{"id": "15069", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15069", "title": "Shady Hussein", "text": "Shady Hussien (; wavutse 1 Gicurasi 1993) ni umukinnyi umupira wa maguru wabigize umwuga ukomoka mu Misiri ukina nkumukinnyi ukina imbere muri club ya Al Ahly yo muri Egiputa. \nUmwuga wa club.\nOn 12 September Al Ahly announced the signing of Shady from Ceramica Cleopatra on five years deal."}
{"id": "15070", "revid": "105970", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15070", "title": "Mohamed Abdelmonem", "text": "Mohamed Abdelmonem El-Sayed Mohamed Ahmed (wavutse 1 Gashyantare 1999) ni umukinnyi wu mupira wa maguru wa bigize umwuga ukomoka misiri ukina nkumukinyi wo hagati wa Al Ahly hamwe ni kipe yi gihugu ya Misiri. Abdelmonem yagaragaye mumikino yanyuma 2021 AFCON yakinnye na Senegali."}
{"id": "15071", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15071", "title": "Taher Mohamed", "text": "Taher Mohamed Ahmed Taher Mohamed Mahmoud (wavutse 7 Werurwe 1997) ni umukinnyi wu mupira wa maguru wabigize umwuga ukomoka mu Misiri, ukinira ikipe ya Misiri Al Ahly hamwe ni kipe yi gihugu ya Misiri nkumukinnyi wo kuruhande. \nUmwirondoro.\nTaher yatangiye umwuga we murii Arab Contractors FC afite imyaka umunani, ubwo yinjiraga bwa mbere mu ikipe nkuru ya 96; yatsitse mu gikombe cy'abakinnyi beza muri 2009, 2010, na 2012. Muri 2008, yakiniye ni kipe y'Abarabu Contractors 1996 mu gikombe cya Danone Nations cyabereye i Paris, aho yerekanye ubuhanga bukomeye ; muri iri rushanwa, umuhanzi w'icyamamare muri Tuniziya Al Zubair Baya yatangaje kuri radiyo ya Al Jazeera ko agomba gutorwa nk'umukinnyi mwiza muri shampiyona. Umufaransa Legend Zinedine Zidane yasinyiye T-shirt igihe yaburaga igikombe.\nMu 2013 umutoza mukuru w\u2019Abarabu Contractors FC \"Mountain Wolves\", Mohamed Radwan, yamutoranyirije kujya mu ikipe ya mbere nkumukinnyi ukiri muto w\u2019umupira wamaguru w\u2019Abanyamisiri muri shampiyona yambere ya Misiri. Yakinnye umukino we wa mbere na Al Ahly FC, \"African Club of the Century\", maze ikipe ye iratsinda. Taher yatojwe n'umutoza wo mu Misiri Hassan Shehata.\nMpuzamahanga.\nYatangiye gukinira ikipe y\u2019umupira wamaguru y\u2019igihugu cya Misiri ku ya 16 Ugushyingo 2018 mu majonjora y\u2019igikombe cya Afurika cy\u2019igikombe cy\u2019ibihugu yakinnye na Tuniziya, nk'umusimbura w\u2019iminota 86 asimbuye Amr Warda. Taher yari mu rutonde rwa nyuma rw'ikipe y'imikino Olempike yo mu Misiri yatwaye igikombe cya Afurika giheruka cyabereye i Cairo mu Gushyingo 2019 ikanabasha kujya muri Tokiyo 2020\nMuri Nzeri 2016, US ESPN yatoranije Taher Mohamed mu bakinnyi 10 ba mbere b\u2019umupira wamaguru ku isi bemerewe kuzamuka hamwe n\u2019amakipe yabo mu gikombe cyisi kizabera mu Burusiya 2018."}
{"id": "15072", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15072", "title": "Karim Fouad", "text": "Karim Fouad Abdel Hamid Mahmoud (wavutse 1 Ukwakira 1999) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka mu Misiri akaba akina nka myugariro wa Al Ahly. \nibyo amaze kugeraho.\nAl Ahly"}
{"id": "15073", "revid": "15383", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15073", "title": "Ali Fathy", "text": "Ali Fathy Omar Ali (wavutse 2 Mutarama 1992) ni umukinnyi wu mupira wa maguru wumunya Misiri wabigize umwuga mu ikipe ya Egiputa ya Zamalek SC. Akina mu ikipe yi gihugu yu mupira wa maguru ya Misiri ndetse yanitabiriye imikino Olempike yabaye muri 2012. "}
{"id": "15074", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15074", "title": "Mahmoud Metwalli", "text": "Mahmoud El-Metwalli Mohamed Mansour bakunze ku mwita Mahmoud Metwalli (wavutse 4 Mutarama 1993), ni umukinyi wu mupira wa maguru ukomoka mu Misiri ukinira Al Ahly muri cyiciro cya mbere muri muri Egiputa nku mukinnyi wo hagati. \nIcyubahiro.\nAl Ahly\nMisiri U20"}
{"id": "15075", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15075", "title": "Ramy Rabia", "text": "Ramy Hisham Abdel Aziz Mostafa Rabia wavutse 20 Gicurasi 1993) yari umukinnyi wu mupira wa maguru uvuka mu Misiri ukina mu kibuga rwa gati mu ikipe ya Al Ahly yo mu cyiciro cya mbere cyu mupira mu Egiputa ndetse no mu i kipe yi gihugu y\u2019umupira wa maguru ya Misiri.\nYatangiye umwuga we na Al Ahly, yatangiye gukina umupira w'amaguru nk'uwabigize umwuga afite imyaka cumi nirindwi muri 2010. yafatwaga nk'umwe mu nzira nziza cyane mu mupira w'amaguru wo mu Misiri, yakunze kurambagizwa n'amakipe menshi mbere yo kwinjira mu ikipe ya Sporting CP yo muri Porutugali mu 2014 ku giciro cya \u20ac 750.000. Ariko, nyuma yigihembwe kimwe yakinnye imikino itatu yambere yamakipe, yongeye guhura na Al Ahly.\nRabia yaserukiye Misiri kurwego rwabatarengeje imyaka 20, ayobora ikipe itsinze muri Shampiyona nyafurika U-20 2013. Yatangiye gukinira ikipe nkuru mu Kuboza 2012 ubwo umukino wa gicuti na Qatar.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nRabia yavukiye i Cairo, mu Misiri ku ya 20 Gicurasi 1993. \nAmakipe yakiniye.\nnational team U-20 2013\nAl Ahly\nSporting cp \nsenior team \nIcyubahiro.\nAl Ahly\nMisiri U20"}
{"id": "15076", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15076", "title": "Kahraba ( Umukinnyi )", "text": "Mahmoud Abdel Moneim Abdel Hamid Soliman witwa Mahmoud Kahraba cyangwa Kahraba (wavutse ku ya 13 Mata 1994), ni umukinnyi w\u2019umupira wa maguru wabigize umwuga ukomoka mu Misiri ukinira ikipe ya Al Ahly SC yo mu Misiri ndetse n\u2019ikipe y'igihugu ya Misiri.\nNyuma yo gutangira umwuga nku mukinnyi wuri ukiro muto hamwe na Al Ahly, yatangiye gukina muri shampiyona yicyiciro cya mbere cya Misiri hamwe na ENPPI muri 2011. Yinjiye mu ikipe ya FC Luzern yo mu Busuwisi mu masezerano nki ntizanyo mu gihembwe cya 2013 ariko ava muri iyi kipe muri Werurwe 2014 nyuma y\u2019uko amasezerano ye arangiye na Luzern avugwaho imyitwarire idakwiye. Yagarutse mu Busuwisi muri gihembwe cyakurikiyeho inguzanyo y'amezi atandatu.\nUmwuga wa club.\nUrubyiruko.\nKahraba yatangiye umwuga we na Al Ahly nk'umukinnyi ukiri muto, atsinda ibitego 36 mumikino 20 yakiniye iyi kipe afite imyaka cumi n'itanu nyuma yo kugirana ubufatanye na Tr\u00e9z\u00e9guet. Mu gihe yari muri Al Ahly ni bwo yahawe izina rya Kahraba (\"Amashanyarazi\") n'umutoza w'urubyiruko Badr Ragab kubera imbaraga n'umuvuduko. \nIcyubahiro.\nENPPI\nZamalek\nAl-Ittihad\nAl Ahly\nMisiri U-20"}
{"id": "15078", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15078", "title": "Jordan Chipangama", "text": "Jordan Chipangama (yavutse 12 Ugushyingo 1988) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga mu kwiruka ukomoka muri Zambiya akaba kabuhariwe muri marato. Yitabiriye amarushanwa ya marato y'abagabo mu mikino Olempike ya 2016 aho yarangije ku mwanya wa 93 n'amasaha 2:24:58. Chipangama yize kaminuza muri Amerika. Muri kaminuza, yarushanwe muishuri rya Arizona na kaminuza ya Arizona y'Amajyaruguru. "}
{"id": "15079", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15079", "title": "Chauzje Choosha", "text": "Chauness Chauzje Choosha (wavutse 31 Ukuboza 1992) ni umukinnyi wa siporo wabigize umwuga uvuka muri Zambiya. Yitabiriye amarushanwa mpuzamahanga yo kwiruka mu nzu ya IAAF 2012 aho yashyizeho agahigo mu gihugu cya Zambiya muri metero 60, maze aviramo muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza cya metero 100 muri Shampiyona nyafurika yaberaga mu mikino ngororamubiri. Choosha yabonye itike yo kujya mu mikino Olempike ya 2012 akoresheje ikarita ya wildcardgusa ntiyujuje ibihe bisabwa muri metero 100.\nUbuzima bye.\nChoosha yavutse ku ya 31 Ukuboza 1992 i Monze, muri Zambiya. Yize mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Musuku. \nUmwuga.\nAmarushanwa muri Afurika.\nChoosha yakoze imikino mpuzamahanga yi mikino ngororamubiri muri Shampiyona yisi ya IAAF 2012 muri metero 60, anashyiraho agahigo mu yigihugu cye Zambiya, akoresheje amasegonda 8.19. Ariko, yarangije umunani (nuwa nyuma) mubushyuhe bwe ntiyakomeza muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza. Nyuma yaje kujya muri B\u00e9nin kwitabira amarushanwa ya Afurika 2012 yaberaga muri Athletisme aho yitabiriye metero 100 ndetse akanitabira kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza akoresheje amasegonda 12:72, ariko akurwa mu marushanwa nyuma ya kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza. kuzenguruka. Phiri kandi yitabiriye metero 200 ariko ntabwo yakoze kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza nyuma yo kurangiza bwa nyuma mubushyuhe bwe na 30 muri rusange. \nImikino Olempike.\nChoosha yujuje ibisabwa mu mikino Olempike ya 2012 yabereye i Londres abinyujije ku ikarita yerekana ikarita nyuma yuko umukinnyi wiruka intera ndende Tonny Wamulwa yakomerekeye mu mpanuka yo mu muhanda ibyumweru bitatu mbere yuko imikino itangira. Yitabiriye metero 100 mu bagore mu cyiciro kibanza ku ya 3 Kanama maze ashushanya ubushyuhe bwa mbere, arangiza ari uwa kane mu bakinnyi umunani, akoresheje amasegonda 12:29. Kuva mu 2016, igihe ni cyiza ku giti cye. Yashyize imbere ya Afa Ismail wo muri Maldivies (amasegonda 12.52) na Rima Taha wa Yorodani (amasegonda 12.66) mu bushyuhe buyobowe na Feta Ahamada wo muri Comoros (amasegonda 11.81). Muri rusange, yarangije ku mwanya wa 57 kuri 78 bahanganye, kandi ntiyigeze yinjira mu cyiciro cya mbere kuko igihe cye cyihuta cyatinzeho amasegonda 0.05 ugereranije n\u2019umukinnyi watinze cyane wateye imbere. "}
{"id": "15081", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15081", "title": "Hamdy Fathy", "text": "Hamdy Fathy Abdelhalim Abdelfattah (yavutse 29 Nzeri 1994) ni umukiinyi wu mupira wa maguru wabigize umwuga uvuka mu Misiri ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati mu ikipe ya Al Ahly mu cyiciro cya mbere muri Egiputa ndetse n\u2019ikipe y'igihugu ya Misiri. \nKu ya 14 Ukwakira 2019, Fathy yatangiye gukinira mpuzamahanga maze atsinda igitego kimwe rukumbi yatsinze Botswana igitego 1-0. Hamdy yagaragaye mu mukino wanyuma wa 2021 AFCON na Senegal. \n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo byerekana intego ya Misiri mbere.\" "}
{"id": "15082", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15082", "title": "Edwin Gadayi", "text": "Edwin Kwabla Gadayi (yavutse 14 Gashyantare 2001) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa mu kwiruka muri Gana. Muri Mata 2021, yashyizwe mu itsinda ry'abagabo batanu bitabiriye imikino ngororamubiri ku isi yabereye i Silesia, muri Polonye. Yitabiriye kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza muri metero 200 mu mikino nyafurika yabereye muri Maroc aho yari uwa 4 akoresheje iminota 20.92. Muri Nyakanga 2022, yashyizeho agahigo mu ikipe yi gihugu muri metero 200 muri Shampiyona ya 2023 yabereye i Cape Coast mu gihe cy'amasegonda 20.848. \nImibereho.\nGadayi afite icyicaro mu karere ka Ashanti muri Gana. Ni umunyeshuri wa kaminuza ya Cape Coast. \nIcyubahiro.\nYatsindiye umudari wa bronze muri Shampiyona nyafurika U20. \nYagaragaye kandi nk'uwatsinze mu ishyirahamwe ry\u2019imikino ngororamubiri muri Gana ryaberaga muri Shampiyona yabereye muri Paa Joe muri KNUST. "}
{"id": "15083", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15083", "title": "Mahmoud Naim", "text": "Mahmoud Naim (wavutse ku ya 9 Mata 1994) ni umukinnyi wu umupira w'amaguru wabigize umwuga wo mu Misiri ukinira ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru y'igihugu cya Misiri Aswan SC nka myugariro. Yahoze ari umukinnyi wa sosiyete ya Eastern SC, Ceramica Cleopatra. "}
{"id": "15084", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15084", "title": "Prince Mumba (umukinnyi)", "text": "Moses Mumba Yavukiye i Kitwe mu gihugu cya Zambiya kandi yari umukinnyi wabigize umwuga mu marushanwa yo gusiganwa ku maguru muri metero 800. Yahagarariye Zambiya mu 2004 na Olempike ya 2012. Mumba yitabiriye amarushanwa atatu mu gikombe cy'isi, mu mikino ngororamubiri (IAAF). Mu myaka ya 2005, 2009 na 2011, yaserukiye igihugu cye cya Zambiya mu mikino ibiri ya Afurika. Muri 2007 na 2011, yari umutozawo'abasiganwa ku maguru mu ishuri muri Californiya. Mumba yari afite ibendera rya Zambiya mu birori byo gutangiza no gusoza imikino Olempike ya 2012..\nKu myaka 18 y'amavuko, Mumba yari yitabiriye imikino ya Commonwealth 2002 ndetse no mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 20 mu mikino ngororamubiri. Nyuma yaje kwinjizwa muri kaminuza ya Oral Roberts, aho yari umuntu uhagaze neza. Mumba ni umunyamuryango wa kaminuza ya Oral Roberts Hall of Fame. Nyuma ya kaminuza, yatangiye siporo yabigize umwuga hamwe na Santa Monica Track Club. \nMu mwaka wa 2016 yagaragaye mu bucuruzi bwiswe \"ICYIZERE\" cyo kwiyamamaza kwa Footlocker \"Ubuzima Bwuzuye x Abiruka nyabo\", kuri ubu hategurwa filime ku buzima bwe. Filime izerekanwa izayoborwa na Ashley Avis, ikanakorwa na Cary Granat, Michael Flaherty, na Edward Winters."}
{"id": "15085", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15085", "title": "Kaban Mupopo", "text": "Kabang Mupopo (wavutse ku ya 21 Nzeri 1992) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru wabigize umwuga uvuka muri Zambiya akaba wegukanye umudali wa zahabu muri metero 400 muri Shampiyona nyafurika yo muri 2015.\nUbuzima.\nMupopo yatangiye gukina umupira afite imyaka 11, Yakiniye ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore ya Zambiya; Nka kapiteni, yayoboye Zambiya mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika 2014, aho baviriyemo mu matsinda. \nMupopo yatangiye siporo mu mpeshyi ya 2014, yiruka muri metero 53.44muri metero 400 bwa mbere. Yaserukiye Zambiya mu mikino ya baguva icyongereza 2014 yabereye i Glasgow, aho yakoresheje amasaha 53.09 akaza gusezererwa muri kimwe cya kabiri. Muri, yatsindiye ifeza muri 51.21 mu gikombe cya Afurika cyabereye i Marrakech, yica amateka ya Zambiya; Yatakaje zahabu Folashade Abugan wo muri Nijeriya, wirutse icyarimwe, arangije ifoto. Mupopo yujuje ibisabwa kugira ngo ahagararire Afurika mu marushanwa ya Afurika IAAF 2014, no muri Marrakech, aho yegukanye umwanya wa kane maze azamura igihugu cye agera kuri 50.87. Mupopo yahawe buruse y\u2019amezi 18 na komite olempike ya Zambiya mu 2015, imwemerera kwibanda ku mikino ngororamubiri aho kuba umupira. \nMuri Gicurasi 2015, Mupopo yagaragaye bwa mbere muri IAAF Diamond League i Doha, arangiza ari uwa karindwi muri 51.88. Muri Nyakanga 2015, yirukanye 50.86 muri La Chaux-de-Fonds, atunganya amateka ye ku munsi utarenze ijana ku isegonda. Yatoranijwe mu gikombe cy'isi cya 2015 i Beijing. "}
{"id": "15086", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15086", "title": "Racheal Nachula", "text": "Racheal Nachula (wavutse 14 Mutarama 1986) ni umukinnyi wu mupira wa maguru wabigize umwuga uvuka muri Zambiya wahoze akina siporo ukina nku mukinnyi ukina imbere muri shampiyona ya Espagne mu ikipe ya Zaragoza hamwe ni kipe yi gihugu ya bagore ya Zambiya. \nImikino ngororamubiri.\nAzobereye muri metero 400, Nachula yegukanye umudari wa bronze muri Shampiyona nyafurika ya 2008, mugihe cyiza cyamasegonda 51.39. Yitabiriye imikino ya Commonwealth mu 2006, Shampiyona y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 2006, Shampiyona y\u2019imbere mu 2008, ndetse n\u2019imikino Olempike yo mu 2008 atujuje ibyiciro byanyuma. Yatsindiye umudari wa silver muri 400\u00a0m mu marushanwa y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri muri Afurika yo mu 2009, yandika igihe cya 53.34\u00a0amasegonda. \nAfite kandi amasegonda 23.42 muri metero 200, yagezweho muri Gicurasi 2007 muri Gaborone.\u00a0"}
{"id": "15087", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15087", "title": "Rhoda Njobvu", "text": "Rhoda Njobvu (yavutse 29 Mutarama 1994) ni umukinnyi uvuka muri Zambiya akaba ari kabuhariwe mu gusiganwa ku maguru akaba yarabigize umwuga. \nUmwuga wa siporo.\nNjobvu yungutse ubunararibonye mpuzamahanga bwa mbere mu mikino ya bavuga icyongereza 2014, aho yarushijwe muri metero 400 akoresheje amasegonda 57.47 mu cyiciro cya mbere. Muri 2016, yageze muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza muri Shampiyona nyafurika yabereye i Durban muri 200m. Muri Shampiyona Nyafurika ya 2018 yabereye i Asaba, muri Delta, yongeye kugera muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza, kuri iyi nshuro muri metero 100, yongeyeho, yegukanye umudari wa bronze mu kwiruka metero 4x400, ashyiraho amateka y\u2019igihugu muri gahunda hamwe na 3.38.18s. \nMuri Gicurasi 2021, yitabiriye imikino ngororamubiri ku isi yabereye i Chorz\u00f3w, muri Polonye. We na bagenzi be basibye umukino wa nyuma nyuma yo kwiruka 44.81 s mu cyiciro kibanza muri Gicurasi 2021. \nMu 2021 yashyizeho ibyiza ku giti cye muri metero 100, ku isaha ya 11.12 akaba ari cyo gihe cyambere ku isi, ihuza Tiana Wilson mbere yuko ikubitwa na Nzubechi Grace Nwokocha. Yashimangiye kandi umwanya we mu mikino Olempike ya Tokiyo yatinze 2020. Nyuma yaho gato, yongereye rekodi zirenga 200m agera kuri 22:69 azamura Kabange Mupopo amateka yambere yigihugu kuva muri 2017 hafi igice cyamasegonda, kandi yujuje metero 200 mumikino olempike ya 2020. Njobvu ntabwo yageze muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza mu mikino Olempike haba muri ibyo birori. Njobvu yayoboye imikino yombi mu mikino ya Commonwealth 2022 maze agera muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza mu kwiruka metero 200 aho yaje ku mwanya wa kane mu isiganwa rye yiruka amasegonda 23.72 kandi afite umwanya wa cumi na kane wihuta muri rusange. "}
{"id": "15088", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15088", "title": "Gerald Phiri", "text": "Gerald Phiri (wavutse ku ya 6 Ukwakira 1988) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru uvuka muri Zambiya wirukankaga muri metero 60, metero 100 na metero 200 mu marushanwa atandukanye. Yatangiye siporo yiga mu ma shuri mato, akomeza umwuga muri kaminuza yo muri amerika. Yabaye umukinnyi wa mbere watsizwe i rushanwa inshuro 100\u2013200 mu marushanwa yabereye mu nzu nini ya 12 kandi yegukana igihembo muri amerika yose. ni umukinnyi mpuzamahanga muri Shampiyona yi si ya 2009 yabaye yasoreje muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza muri metero 100. Mu mwaka wa kabiri muri kaminuza yatsindiye umudari wa feza mu birometero 60, yegukana imidari itatu muri 2010.\nNyuma yitabiriye amarushanwa mpuzamahanga yo mu nzu ya IAAF 2012, yitabira imikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi 2012 yabereye i Londres. Yaviriyemo muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza akomeza kurushanwa mu mwaka wa kurikira. Phiri yabuze amahirwe yo gutwara umudari mu marushanwa ya IAAF 2014 yaberaga mu nzu ya metero 60, maze ava mu marushanwa nyafurika yaberaga muri Athletisme nyuma yimyaka ibiri kubera imvune. Ntiyashoboye kujya muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza muri metero 100 mu mikino Olempike ya 2016 nyuma yo kurangiza umwanya wa kane mu bushyuhe bwe.\nUbuzima bwa mbere.\nPhiri yavutse ku ya 6 Ukwakira 1988 mu bitaro bikuru bya Ndola, muri Zambiya. Ni umuhungu wa Huggins na Bestoria Phiri kandi afite barumuna be bavukana. Umuryango we wimukiye muri Afurika y'Epfo mu 1996, ariko nyuma wi mukira mu mujyi wa Mid Wales wa Welshpool nyuma yuko nyina abonye akazi muri icyo gihugu. Phiri yize Abbeydale Grange School i Sheffield ahugura hamwe na City of Sheffield na Dearne Athletic Club iherereye mu majyepfo ya Yorkshire. Yakinnye umupira akiri ku ishuri maze ahabwa umwanya mu ishuri rya Sheffield ku wa gatatu ariko aranga kuko yashakaga kwibanda ku mikino ngororamubiri, anakina Basketball na Badminton. Phiri yahawe impamyabumenyi muri kaminuza ya Texas A&amp;amp;M muri Gicurasi 2012, nyuma yimukira i Orlando, muri Floride. Yahisemo kaminuza kugira uburambe bwo guhindura ubuzima. Phiri mu kiganiro 2012 yavuze ko intego za siporo ari Usain Bolt, Yohan Blake na Tyson Gay. Yahoze ahagarariye Ubwongereza ariko yerekeza muri Zambiya mu 2009, kandi afite ubwenegihugu bubiri bw'ibihugu byombi. \nIshuri, icyiciro rusange nakazi.\nYirukanye umuyaga ufashwa n amasegonda 11,76 namasegonda 11,85 mumikino ya metero 100 mugihe mumwaka wa 7. Byari kuba amateka mashya yigihugu ariko ntibyamenyekanye kubera ko aherutse kugera mubwongereza. Phiri yavumbuwe n\u2019umwarimu we wigisha ibijyanye n\u2019umubiri mu mwaka wakurikiyeho ku munsi w\u2019imikino ngarukamwaka w\u2019ishuri maze amenya ko afite impano muri siporo nyuma yo gutsinda ibirori bye mu marushanwa y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri y\u2019ishuri ry\u2019icyongereza mu 2003. Muri 2005 yanditse amajwi ya gatatu yihuta cyane muri metero 100 mu Bwongereza mu mateka ya siporo y'abatarengeje imyaka 17, ku masegonda 10:51. Phiri yageze muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza metero 100 muri Shampiyona y\u2019Ubwongereza (AAA), maze akora metero 60 mu nzu mu mukino umwe, arangiza ari uwa gatanu muri rusange. Yavuze ko ibisubizo bibi biterwa no kugira ibibazo mu mugongo nubwo imyitozo yo mu itumba. Phiri yabaye Nyampinga w\u2019Amashuri mu Bwongereza 2006, kandi yegukana igihembo cya Harold Whitham kubera kubona ibihembo byiza ku mukinnyi wa Sheffield muri ibyo birori. \nImikino Olempike n'andi marushanwa.\n2014 - kugeza ubu.\nYatoranijwe guhagararira Zambiya mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga yo mu nzu ya IAAF 2014 yabereye muri Polonye. Phiri yatsindiye ubushyuhe muri metero 60 akoresheje amasegonda 6.59 kandi abasha gukomeza muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza. Yaje ku mwanya wa kabiri mu bushyuhe bwa gatatu bwa kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza, ariko ntiyabura kubona umudari arangiza ku mwanya wa gatanu ku mukino wa nyuma hamwe n\u2019igihe cya gatatu n\u2019uwa kane. Phiri yazamutse ku mukino wa nyuma wa metero 100 muri Shampiyona nyafurika ya 2016 yaberaga muri Athletisme ariko aragenda kubera imvune yo mu kibuno yagize muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza muri ibyo birori kandi ntiyabasha kwitabira isiganwa rya metero 4 x 100. Mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2016 yabereye i Rio de Janeiro, yegukanye umwanya wa kane akoresheje amasegonda 10.27 mu bushyuhe bwe bwa metero 100 kandi ntiyitabira kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza. Phiri yari afite ibendera rya Zambiya mu birori byo gusoza. "}
{"id": "15089", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15089", "title": "Sydney Siame", "text": "Sydney Sido Siame (yavutse 7 Ukwakira 1997) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru agakora na siporo uvuka muri Zambiya. Yarushanwe muri metero 200 mu marushanwa y'isi ya 2015 yabereye i Beijing gusa ntiyakomeza mu cyiciro cyisumbuye. yatsindiye umudari wa zahabu mu mikino Olempike y'urubyiruko 2014. \nKwiruka amasegonda 9.88 byanditswe kuri 100\u00a0m i Lusaka muri 2017, ariko igihe cya Siame nticyakuwe kurutonde rwisi hashingiwe ku gihe giteye inkeke. Bibaye ku nshuro ya mbere umunya Zambiya arenga kuri bariyeri y'amasegonda 10 no kuzamura bidasanzwe amasegonda 0.34 ku mukinnyi. \nAmarushanwa.\n1 Ntibemerewe muri kimwe cya kabiri\n2 Ntibemerewe kurangiza\nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nHanze"}
{"id": "15090", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15090", "title": "Tonny Wamulwa", "text": "Anthony Tonny Wamulwa (wavutse ku ya 3 Kanama 1989) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga uvuka muri Zambiya wiruka intera ndende nka mrato akaba kabuhariwe muri metero 5000.\nNkumukinnyi muto warangije icya cumi (muri metero 3000) muri Shampiyona yisi y\u2019urubyiruko mu 2005, icya cumi mu mikino ya Commonwealth 2006, uwa karindwi muri Shampiyona y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 2006 na gatanu muri Shampiyona y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 2008. Mu mwaka wa 2008 yegukanye umudari wa zahabu mu marushanwa yo kwambukiranya imipaka y\u2019akarere ka Afurika yepfo, bivuze ko yari yujuje ibisabwa mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga yo kwambukiranya imipaka yabereye i Edinburgh mu 2008, aho yarangije ari cumi na karindwi mu bakinnyi 109 bari mu isiganwa ry\u2019abato. Yari yarangije icyenda mu 2007.\nYitabiriye kandi amarushanwa y'isi ya 2007 ndetse n'imikino Olempike yo mu 2008 atageze ku mukino wa nyuma."}
{"id": "15091", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15091", "title": "Dennis Banda", "text": "Dennis Banda (wavutse ku ya 10 Ukuboza 1988) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga akaba ari myugariro w'umupira w'amaguru uvuka i Lusaka muri Zambiya mu ikipe ya Green Buffaloes muri Zambiya. Yari afite ibyifuzo byinshi byo gukina muri shampiyona ya 2010/11 i Burayi cyangwa muri Amerika yepfo aho umukozi wa FIFA Marcelo Houseman yakoraga kumasezerano. Yakiniye ikipe nkuru inshuro 29 haba mu gikombe cyisi ndetse no mu gikombe cy\u2019Afurika.\nDennis ntaho ahuriye na perezida wa Zambiya Rupiah Banda.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYakiniye ikipe y'igihugu ya Zambiya anakinira igihugu cye mu gikombe cy'isi cya FIFA U-20 2007 cyabereye muri Kanada. "}
{"id": "15092", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15092", "title": "Emmanuel Banahene", "text": "Emmanuel Banahene Osei (wavutse ku ya 16 Kanama 1988) ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga ukina umupira wa maguru muri Gana. Banahene yakina cyane nka rutahizamu, uwo kuruhande cyangwa umukinnyi wo hagati mu kibuga.\nUmwuga.\nBanahene yatangiye umwuga we mu ikipe ya Gana Stay Cool FC Nyuma yimukira mu bihugu mpuzamahanga, aho yari mu ikipe yatsindiye ku nshuro ya 3 irushanwa rya Mylik Classic U-19, ryakinnye hagati ya 27 na 29 Ugushyingo 2005 muri Dansoman Park, Accra, Gana.\u00a0 Kamena 2006, Umutima w'Intare FC yamusinyanye amasezerano y'imyaka 3. Yaje kugurwa n\u2019uruhande rwa Isiraheli Hapoel Petach Tikva mu mpeshyi ya 2008. Ariko, yabonye amahirwe make yo gukina mu gice cya mbere cya shampiyona ya 2008/2009, nyuma aza kugurizwa mu cyiciro cyo hasi Ramata Shalon. Inguzanyo ye irangiye, mu Kwakira 2009, yasubiye muri Gana gusinyana amasezerano mashya yumwaka umwe na Heart of Lions FC, atangira ku nshuro ya kabiri muri iyi kipe. Mu mwaka wa 2010, Banahene yongeye kugurishwa, noneho kuri Berekum Chelsea, hanyuma umwaka ukurikira, mu ikipe ya Orduspor yo muri Turukiya. Muri 2012, yagurijwe mu ikipe ya TFF ya mbere ya Giresunspor. Mu mpeshyi ya 2012, yasinyanye na Kar\u015f\u0131yaka amasezerano y\u2019umwaka umwe. Ku ya 24 Ukuboza 2012, yahagaritse amasezerano yagiranye na Orduspor. Muri Mutarama 2015 yasinyiye Ismaily SC mumasezerano yimyaka ibiri nigice.\nKu ya 26 Kamena 2022, Banahene yinjiye mu ikipe ya Al-Zulfi yo muri Arabiya Sawudite. Ku ya 5 Mutarama 2023, Banahene yarekuwe. "}
{"id": "15093", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15093", "title": "Kare Becker", "text": "K\u00e5re Becker (wavutse 27 Mutarama 1978) ni umukinnyi yahoze akina umupira wa maguru muba bigize umwuga wakinnye imbere ukomoka muri Zambiya. \nUmwuga.\nBecker yavukiye muri Zambiya na se wa Malawi na nyina wa Zimbabwe, yimukiye mu Buholandi afite imyaka 5 nyuma yo kuba muri Irilande y'Amajyaruguru na Noruveje. \nMu 2000, Becker yagurijwe Heracles Almelo mu cyiciro cya kabiri cy'Ubuholandi. Igihembwe cya 2000\u201301 kirangiye, abajijwe icyo yashakaga kubona mu mishyikirano mishya, yasabye umwanya wo gutekereza. Nyuma y'iminsi ibiri, ariko, ikinyamakuru cyaho cyatangaje ko kuvugurura amasezerano \"byahagaritswe kubera umushahara ukabije\". \nMuri 2001, Becker yasinyiye urundi ruhande rwa kabiri, PEC Zwolle. Ariko, muri iki gihembwe, umuyobozi Paul Krabbe\u00a0[nl] yasimbuwe na Peter Boeve, wamufashe nabi ndetse anamuha ikindi cyumba cyo gufungiramo. Kubera iyo mpamvu, yavuye mu mpera za 2001\u201302.\nMu 2004\u201305, Becker yasinyiye Eintracht Nordhorn mu cyiciro cya kane cy\u2019Ubudage, ariko ntiyakinnye neza kuko \"yasuzuguye cyane umupira w\u2019Ubudage\". "}
{"id": "15094", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15094", "title": "Shadreck Biemba", "text": "Mzansi Shadrack Biemba (4 Mutarama 1965 - 8 Gicurasi 2010) yari umukinnyi wu mupira wa maguru wari warabigize umwuga wavukaga muri Zambiya.\nUmwuga.\nGukina umwuga.\nBiemba wakinnye nk'umuzamu, yakinnye umupira w'amaguru muri Afurika y'Epfo muri AmaZulu, mbere yakiniye Bloemfontein Celtic.\nBiemba kandi yari ahagarariye uruhande rwigihugu cya Zambiya, agaragara inshuro 12 hagati ya 1990 na 1994.\nUmwuga wo gutoza.\nNyuma Biemba abaye umutoza wizamu hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Afurika yepfo Moroka Swallows, ukora muri uwo mwanya hagati ya 2006 na 2010. \nUrupfu.\nBiemba yapfuye azize kanseri ku ya 8 Gicurasi 2010 afite imyaka 45. "}
{"id": "15095", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15095", "title": "Charles Bwale", "text": "Charles Bwale (wavutse ku ya 29 Nyakanga 1976) ni umutoza w\u2019umupira wamaguru wabigize umwuga akomoka muri Zambiya akaba yarahoze atoza ikipe ya Konkola Blades. yari umukinnyi ukona inyuma nka myugariro, akaba yarakinnye imikino icyenda mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Zambiya kuva 2000 kugeza 2003. Yakinnya ikipe ya Zambiya mu marushanwa y\u2019igikombe cya Afurika 2002. Bwale yagizwe umutoza wa Konkola Blades mu mpera za 2020. "}
{"id": "15096", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15096", "title": "Chanda Bwalya", "text": "Chanda Bwalya ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga wu mupira wa maguru ukomoka muri Zambiya. Yahoze akinira muri Terengganu FA muri Maleziya. Yahoze kandi akinira ikipe yu mupira wa maguru yi gihugu ya Zambiya. \u00a0"}
{"id": "15097", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15097", "title": "Johnson Bwalya", "text": "Johnson Bwalya (wavutse ku ya 3 Ukuboza 1967) ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga ukomoka muri Zambiya wahoze akina umupira wa maguru akaba yarakinaga mubi mbere. Umwuga we wose wo gukina yawumaze mu Busuwisi mu gihe yari ahagarariye, ikipe y'igihugu ya Zambiya ku rwego mpuzamahanga. Hamwe na Zambiya, yitabiriye imikino Olempike yo mu 1988. \nBwalya yavukiye Mufulira, yiga mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Kantanshi maze atangira umwuga we mu ikipe yavukiyemo ya Butondo Western Tigers. Mu 1986, yinjiye muri Mufulira Wanderers, yegukana umupira w'amaguru w'umwaka muri shampiyona ye ya mbere muri iyi kipe. Shampiyona irangiye, yasinyiye ikipe yo mu Busuwisi FC Friborg.\nNyuma yaje gukinira FC Sion, FC Bulle, SC Kriens, FC Luzern, na SR Del\u00e9mont.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nBwalya yatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Zambiya muri Mata 1987 mu majonjora yo gukina imikino ya Afurika yose yakinnye na Malawi i Lusaka kandi yari mu ikipe ya Zambiya yujuje amajonjora mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1988 yabereye i Seoul. Yatsinze igitego muri Zambiya yatsinze Ubutaliyani 4\u20130 mu nzira yo kuba ikipe ya mbere ya Afurika yageze muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza. Nyuma yo kunyura hejuru ya myugariro, Bwalya yakubise ishoti kuri metero zigera kuri 35 zinyeganyega kandi zirohama munsi yumupaka. Mu mukino wahuje Ubudage bw\u2019iburengerazuba Zambiya yatsinzwe 4\u20130, yarakomeretse. Ntiyigeze agaragara muri Zambiya mu myaka ine yakurikiye.\nAmaze gukira, Bwalya yagaruye imiterere maze asubira ku mwanya we mu ikipe y'igihugu kandi yagombaga gufatanya n'ikipe mu mukino wa Senegali gusa amenya ko indege yari itwaye iyi kipe yaguye mu nyanja mu mpanuka ya Gabon. Igihe ikipe nshya yari iteraniye ni Bwalya na Kalusha Bwalya bayoboye iyi kipe, bombi batsinze igitego mu mukino wahuje Maroc na Bwalya babona igitego batsinze bafite metero 25 barasa 2-1."}
{"id": "15098", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15098", "title": "Larry Bwalya", "text": "Larry Bwalya (wavutse 29 Gicurasi 1995) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga ukina umupira wa maguru ukomoka muri Zambiya ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati wa Simba muri Tanzaniya ni kipe yu mupira wa maguru yi gihugu ya Zambiya. \nBwalya yasinyanye na Simba SC ku ya 15 Kanama 2020 ku masezerano y'imyaka itatu. Umukinnyi wo hagati rwagaragaye mu mikino ibiri mu marushanwa ya CAF Champions League ya 2020\u201321, atangira imikino na FC Platinum ku ya 6 Mutarama 2021, no mu mukino wo mu matsinda yatangije na AS Vita Club."}
{"id": "15100", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15100", "title": "Taonga Bwembya", "text": "Taonga Bwembya (yavutse ku ya 11 Kamena 1995) ni umukinnyi wu mupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga ukomoka muri Zambiya ukina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati mu ikipe ya mashyamba ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Zambiya.\nGukina umupira.\nUmwuga mu ikipe.\nBwembya yagize uruhare runini mu kuyobora ikipe ye ku mwanya wa kabiri mu cyiciro cya mbere cya Zambiya mu 2014, agera ku ntego muri cyiciro cya mbere nyuma y\u2019imyaka icyenda ihagaze. ayobora iyi kipe ye ku mwanya wa gatanu ushimishije muri shampiyona ye ya mbere nka capitaine. Mbere yigihembwe cya 2016, yabaye myugariro wifunzwa, yanga ibyifuzo byamakipe menshi akomeye. Muri uwo mwaka, Inzererezi zabonye abayobozi bane batandukanye bayobora itsinda, kandi birinda cyane kumanuka. Bwembya yavuze ko gukina kwabo ari impinduka zikunze gukorwa ku ntebe ya tekiniki. \nAmaze kuyobora kapiteni Wanderers imyaka ibiri, yinjiye muri Zanaco mbere yigihembwe cya 2017. Amarushanwa ye ya mbere mu ikipe yaje muri Gashyantare, mu cyiciro cya mbere cyo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cya Shampiyona cya CAF 2017. Bwembya yagizwe umukinnyi w\u2019umukino w\u2019abafana mu mukino wa Zanaco watsinze igitego cya mbere cyatsinzwe na nyampinga w\u2019u Rwanda APR FC. Mu mukino wa kabiri, yatsinze igitego cyonyine mu gutsinda Zanaco 1-0 kugirango abone umwanya wabo mu cyiciro gikurikira. Ibi kandi byabaye intego ye yambere hamwe niyi kipe. Batsinze club yo muri Tanzaniya Young Africans nyuma yibyo kugirango babashe kujya mu matsinda. Ku munsi wanyuma wumukino wamatsinda, Zanaco ikeneye amanota imwe kugirango itere imbere, Bwembya yirukanwe mugihe bakinnye na Wydad Casablanca. Nyuma yiminota icumi, Wydad yatsinze igitego, bituma atera imbere kuko Zanaco yarangije umwanya wa gatatu maze ikurwaho kubitandukaniro. Yagizwe kapiteni w'ikipe mbere ya shampiyona ya 2019. \nImibare mpuzamahanga.\nBwembya, wakuriye i Mufulira, yashyigikiye Mufulira Wanderers FC gukura. "}
{"id": "15101", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15101", "title": "Emmanuel Chabula", "text": "Emmanuel Chabula (wavutse ku ya 10 Mutarama 1998) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Zambiya ukina nk'umukinnyi ukina imbere mu ikipe ya Lusaka Dynamos hamwe ni kipe y'igihugu ya Zambiya. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nChabula yerekeje ku rwego mpuzamahanga mpuzamahanga ku ya 2 Kamena 2019 atsinda penaliti 4-2 (2-2 nyuma yo gutegekwa) yatsinze Malawi, atsinda igitego cye cya mbere mpuzamahanga mpuzamahanga ku munota wa 89 wuwo mukino. \n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo urutonde rwa Zambiya ibitego byambere.\" \nIcyubahiro.\nMpuzamahanga.\nZambiya"}
{"id": "15102", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15102", "title": "Miguel Chaiwa", "text": "Miguel Changa Chaiwa (wavutse ku ya 7 Mata 2004) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga ukomoka muri Zambiya ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati mu kibuga, ukinira ikipe ya Young Boys yo mu Busuwisi ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Zambiya.\nUmwuga.\nIbicuruzwa byurubyiruko bya Shamuel Academy, Chaiwa yinjiye muri club ya Zambiya Atletico Lusaka ku nguzanyo mu 2022. Yimukiye mu ikipe y\u2019abasuwisi Young Boys ku ya 14 Kamena 2022, asinya amasezerano yimyaka 4. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nChaiwa ni urubyiruko mpuzamahanga muri Zambiya, akaba yaraserukiye Zambiya U17 muri 2019 na 2020. Yatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu nkuru ya Zambiya mu mukino wa gicuti yatsinzwe na Iraki ku ya 20 Werurwe 2022. \nUbuzima bwite.\nSe wa Chaiwa, Changa na we yari umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru wabigize umwuga muri Zambiya. "}
{"id": "15103", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15103", "title": "Linos Chalwe", "text": "Linos Chalwe (wavutse 17 Nzeri 1980) ni rutahizamu wu mupira wa maguru wabigize umwuga akaba akomoka muri Zambiya.\nYabaye mu ikipe ya Zambiya 2006 y\u2019igikombe cy\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika, yaje ku mwanya wa gatatu mu itsinda C mu cyiciro cya mbere cy\u2019amarushanwa, bityo ananirwa kubona amajonjora yo kujya muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza."}
{"id": "15104", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15104", "title": "Sashi Chalwe", "text": "Sashi Triehimus Chalwe (wavutse ku ya 16 Gashyantare 1983) ni umukinnyi wahoze ari umukinnyi w' umupira w'amaguru mu gihugu cya Zambiya. \n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo urutonde rwa Zambiya ibitego byambere.\" "}
{"id": "15105", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15105", "title": "James Chamanga", "text": "James Chamanga (wavutse 2 Gashyantare 1980) ni umukinnyi w'umupira wa maguru wa bigize umwuga wo muri Zambiya ukina nka rutahizamu mu ikipe ya Red Arrows.\nUmwuga wa club.\nIgitego cya Chamanga kuri Bafana Bafana cya muhesheje kwi mukira mu mahanga mu gihe Bush Bucks ikipe ye y'umupira w'amaguru muri Afurika y'Epfo icyo gihe ya musinyishije muri 2005. Nyuma yuko Bush Bucks asezerewe mu 2006 yasinyanye na Supersport United aho ari we watsinze ibitego byinshi muri iyi kipe muri shampiyona ya 2006\u201307.\nKu ya 9 Ukuboza 2007, Chamanga yatsinze ibitego bitanu yatsinze Swallows mu mukino wa shampiyona 6-2. Harimo hat-trick hagati yiminota 20 na 24.\nMuri Mata 2008, Chamanga yimukiye mu ikipe ya Dalian Shide yo mu Bushinwa Super League, nyuma yo gutsinda ibitego 14 muri Premier League ya ABSA muri Moroka Swallows muri shampiyona ishize. \nKu ya 6 Gicurasi 2012, Chamanga yagaragaye muri shampiyona ya 100 muri Dalian mu mukino yatsinze ibitego 4-1 iwayo na Tianjin Teda. Yatsinze hat-trick muri uyu mukino.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nChamanga yagaragaye bwa mbere ku rwego mpuzamahanga ku ya 26 Gashyantare 2005 na Botswana nyuma y'amezi atanu atsinda igitego cye cya mbere mpuzamahanga mu mukino wa kimwe cya kabiri cy'igikombe cya COSAFA na Afurika y'Epfo.\nYabaye mu ikipe ya Zambiya 2006 y\u2019igikombe cy\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika yegukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu itsinda C mu cyiciro cya mbere cy\u2019amarushanwa, bityo ananirwa kubona amajonjora yo kujya muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza. Yatsinze igitego cya Zambiya na Sudani (Igikombe cy\u2019Afurika 2008) mu gutsinda Chipolopolo ibitego 3-0. Chamanga kandi yatsinze igitego cya mbere cya Zambiya mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Afurika 2006 na Tuniziya.\nIcyubahiro.\nZambiya"}
{"id": "15106", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15106", "title": "Beston Chambeshi", "text": "Beston Chambeshi (wavutse 4 Mata 1960) ni umutoza wu mupira wa maguru ukomoka muri Zambiya kandi yahoze ari umukinnyi wabigize umwuga.\nGukina umwuga.\nChambeshi yakinnye umupira wamaguru wa Nkana. \nYahagarariye Zambiya mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1988. \nUmwuga wo gutoza.\nYatoje ikipe ya Zambiya Power Dynamos kuva 2012 kugeza 2013. Yabaye umuyobozi w'ikipe y'abatarengeje imyaka 20 ya Zambiya muri 2017, anabayobora mu gikombe cy'isi cya FIFA U-20 2017. Yahujije uruhare rwe n\u2019uruhande rwamakipe Nkana, kandi yatsindiye igihembo cyumutoza wumwaka wa FAZ 2017. \nMuri Gicurasi 2018, nyuma yo kwegura kwa Wedson Nyirenda, yagizwe umuyobozi w'agateganyo w'ikipe nkuru ya Zambiya. Yasimbuwe n'umuyobozi w'Ububiligi Sven Vandenbroeck muri Nyakanga 2018. \nMuri Nyakanga 2021, Chambeshi yagizwe umuyobozi wa Zambiya, asimbuye Milutin Sredojevi\u0107. "}
{"id": "15107", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15107", "title": "Daniel Nathaniel", "text": "Daniel Nathaniel (wavutse ku ya 14 Nyakanga 1992) ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga ukina umukino wamaboko wa volleyball wo muri Nigeriya ukina muri Sunshine Spikers ya Akure ndetse n\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu ya Nijeriya ya bagabo. \nUbuzima.\nYahawe impamyabumenyi ya muri electoronike, ukina nk'umukinnyi wa Nijeriya Sunshine Spikers volley ball Team, Akure, muri Leta ya Ondo. Daniel akina kandi mu ikipe ya Men volleyball A mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Nigeriya y'abagabo. \nIbyagezweho.\nNi kapiteni w'ikipe y'igihugu ya Nigeriya Mens ya Volleyball. Daniel Nathaniel yari mu ikipe yatsindiye Shampiyona y\u2019igihugu ya mbere ya Volleyball i Bauchi muri 2019. \nYabaye kandi mu ikipe yegukanye igikombe cya 2022 cy\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019akarere ka Kwara muri Leta ya Kwara itsinze New Waves yo muri Leta ya Ogun muri iri rushanwa. Kimwe mubyo yagezeho ni ukuyobora ikipe ya nigeriya ya mens ya volley ball mu mikino nyafurika yo muri 2019 muri Maroc. "}
{"id": "15108", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15108", "title": "Ebenezer Andrews", "text": "Ebenezer Andrews (wavutse 21 Gicurasi 2000) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa badimitoni wo muri Gana. Muri Mata 2019, yari mu ikipe ya Gana yegukanye umudari w' umuringa muri Shampiyona muma kipe yose avanze yabereye i Port Harcourt, muri Nijeriya. \nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\nAndereya akomoka muri Winneba mu karere ko hagati muri Gana. Numunyeshuri wa kaminuza yuburezi, Winneba. \nUmwuga.\nAndereya yitabiriye amarushanwa ya Badminton ya Afurika Yose muri 2013 (U-19) yabereye muri Alijeriya. \nYitabiriye kandi imikino ya 10 yose yo muri Afurika muri kaminuza ya Kenyatta i Nairobi, muri Kenya. \nIbyagezweho.\nAndereya na couple ye Eyram Migbodzi batsinze bagenzi babo bo muri Cote d'Ivoire Doulo Lou Annick na Ousmane Ovedroogo kuri 21-12, 21\u201313 kugirango batsinde mu bagabo babiri. \nMu mikino ya Commonwealth 2018 yabereye muri Ositaraliya, Andrews na Daniel Doe bombi begukanye zahabu mu bitego 2-1 kuri bitatu byatsinzwe na Emmanuel Botwe na Abraham Ayittey ku mukino wanyuma wa kabiri. \nImpaka.\nMuri Werurwe 2022, Andereya n'abandi bakinnyi ba Badminton bahagaritswe n\u2019ishyirahamwe rya Badminton muri Gana kandi bemeza ko ari abakinnyi batemerewe. "}
{"id": "15109", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15109", "title": "Salum Abubakar", "text": "Salum Abubakar (yavutse 26 Kanama 1992) ni umukinnyi numupira wamaguru wa bigize umwuga wa Tanzaniya ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati. akina mu ikipe ya Young Africas Fc.\n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo urutonde rwa Tanzaniya ibitego byambere.\" "}
{"id": "15110", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15110", "title": "Salimu Khamis Aiyee", "text": "Salimu Khamis Aiyee (wavutse 5 Gicurasi 1996) ni umukinnyi wu mupira wa maguru wabigize umwuga ukina nka rutahizamu wu mupira wa maguru muri Tanzaniya ukinira mu ikipe ya KMC. "}
{"id": "15111", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15111", "title": "Nurdin Bakari", "text": "Nurdin Bakari (wavutse ku ya 6 Nyakanga 1988) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga w\u2019umupira wa maguru muri Tanzaniya wakiniye ikipe yu mupira wa maguru yi gihugu wa Tanzaniya. Yabaye umwe mu bakinnyi mu gikombe cya CECAFA muri 2004, 2005, 2008, 2009, 2010 na 2011. \n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo urutonde rwa Tanzaniya ibitego byambere.\" "}
