{"id": "15116", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15116", "title": "Dickson Daudi", "text": "Dickson Daudi (yavutse ku ya 10 Mata 1986) ni umukinnyi w'umupira wa maguru wabigize umwuga, akaba akina nka myugariro wu mupira wa maguru wa Tanzaniya ukinira ikipe ya Mtibwa sugar. "}
{"id": "15117", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15117", "title": "Upe Atosu", "text": "Upe Atosu (wavutse ku ya 21 Mata 1993) ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga ukina umukino wa basketball wo muri Nigeriya muri basketball y'abagore mu ikipe ya Butler Bulldogs ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Nigeriya. \nYitabiriye Afrobasket y'abagore 2017. "}
{"id": "15118", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15118", "title": "Mary Durojaye", "text": "Mary Adeola Temitope Asake Durojaye, cyangwa se Mary Durojaye, (wavutse ku ya 14 Nyakanga 1990) yyavukiye i Londere, mu Bwongereza, ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga akaba umukinnyi w\u2019umukino wa basketball ufite ubwenegihugu bw\u2019umwongereza ariko ukomoka mu gihugu cya Nigeriya."}
{"id": "15119", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15119", "title": "Hamdya Abass", "text": "Hamdya Abass (yavutse 1 Kanama 1982) ni umukinnyi umupira wa maguru mu bagore bo muri Gana ukina nka myugariro. Ni umwe mu bagize ikipe yi gihugu y'u mupira wa maguru muri Gana. Yabaye mu ikipe yari mu gikombe cyisi cy\u2019a bagore cya FIFA 2007. Ku rwego rwa club akinira ikipe ya Ghatel Ladies muri Gana. "}
{"id": "15120", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15120", "title": "Qudus Akanni", "text": "Qudus Olamilekan Akanni (wavutse ku ya 2 Ugushyingo 2000) ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga wu mupira wa maguru wa bigize umwuga ukomoka muri Nigeriya ukinira Remo Stars FC, muri Shampiyona yu mupira wa maguru ya bigize umwuga. \nUmwuga mu ikipe.\nBello yatangiye umwuga we muri Remo Stars FC mu 2022. Yari mu ikipe ya Nigeriya yahamagawe umukino wa gicuti wa Super Eagles yo muri Nigeriya na Costa Rica i San Jose. \nQudus kandi yari mu itsinda rya Remo Stars ryatangiye amateka yaryo mu marushanwa ya CAF mu 2022. "}
{"id": "15121", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15121", "title": "Ezekiyeli Edidiong", "text": "Edidiong Ezekiyeli Enobong (yavutse 8 Kanama 2001) ni umukinnyi wu mupira wa maguru mpuzamahanga wa bigize umwuga ukomoka muri Nigeriya ukinira ikipe ya Remo Stars FC. \nUmwuga muri ikipe.\nEzekiyeli yavukiye Akwa Ibom, ubuzima bwe bwa mbere yakoranye na Ibom Youths FC na Dakkada FC\nBitewe n'ubushobozi bwe bwinshi, yoherejwe ku nguzanyo muri Dakkada FC nyuma asubira muri Ibom Youth FC nyuma yo kuguriza.\nYasinywe na Remo Stars FC mu 2022 nyuma yo gutsinda ibitego 10 afashijwe na Dakkada FC \nYatsinze umukino we wa mbere muri Remo Stars na Djeffa FC yo muri Repubulika ya Benin. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYatangiye gukinira mpuzamahanga muri Nijeriya mu mukino wa gicuti na Costa Rica mu 2022. "}
{"id": "15122", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15122", "title": "Ibom Youths FC", "text": "Ibom Youths FC ni ikipe yu mupira wa maguru ya bigize umwuga ibarizwa i Ikot Ekpene, muri Leta ya Akwa Ibom, mugihugu cya Nijeriya. \nIyi kipe irushanwa muri Shampiyona yigihugu ya Nigeria. \nAmateka.\nIyi kipe yashinzwe mu 2016 na guverinoma ya Akwa Ibom muri nigeriya. \nStade.\nIkibuga cyu mujyi wa Ikot Ekpene kibamo ikipe ya Ibom Youths FC. \nIkipe y'ubu.\nKugeza muri Gashyantare 2022, iyi kipe yashyize ahagaragara bamwe mu bakinnyi bashya bazagaragara mbere ya shampiyona 2021/2022. Muri byo harimo; "}
{"id": "15123", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15123", "title": "Vivian Yusuf", "text": "Vivian Aminu Yusuf (wavutse 8 Kanama 1983) ni umukinnyi wajido wo muri Nigeriya, wa kinnye icyiciro cya kabiri cya baremereye. Yatsindiye imidari ibiri ya feza mu mikino ya beraga muri Afurika 2007 mu gihugu cya Alijeriya, no mu marushanwa ya Afurika yo muri Afurika yo mu 2008 yabereye i Agadir, muri Maroc, bombi batsinzwe na Houda Miled wo muri Tuniziya ku mukino wa nyuma. \nYusuf yaserukiye Nijeriya mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2008 mu mikino ya Olempike ya XXIX yabereye i Beijing mu Bushinwa, aho yarushanijwe mu cyiciro cy\u2019abagore baremereye (78)\u00a0kg). Yakiriye neza mu cyiciro cya kabiri kibanza, mbere yo gutsindwa n\u2019umudage Heide Wollert, washoboye gutsinda ippon yikora mu masegonda mirongo itatu n'arindwi. "}
{"id": "15124", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15124", "title": "Abdelhak Achik", "text": "Abdelhak Achik (wavutse ku ya 11 Werurwe 1959) yahoze ari umukinnyi wabigize umwuga w'iteramakofe wakiniragamuri Maroc, wegukanye umudari wa bronze mu guterura biremereye mu cyiciro cya bagabo bari munsi yibiro 57 mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1988 yabereye i Seoul.\nmu mikino Olempike.\nHano hepfo hari inyandiko ya Abdelhak Achik, umukinnyi w'iteramakofe ufite ibiro biremereye muri Maroc witabiriye imikino Olempike ya Seoul mu 1988:"}
{"id": "15125", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15125", "title": "Ezzaki Badou", "text": "Ezzaki Badou uzwi ku izina rya Zaki (wavutse 2 Mata 1959) ni umutoza wu mupira wa maguru wabigize umwuga muri Maroc ndetse akaba yarahoze ari umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga wa kinnye ari nku muzamu. Ezzaki Badou ubu ayobora CS Chebba.\nGukina umwuga.\nZaki yavukiye muri Sidi Kacem, Zaki yari ahagarariye AS Sal\u00e9, Wydad AC, RCD Mallorca na Fath Union Sport mu myaka 17 yamaze akora umwuga. Hamwe na Mallorca, yasinyiye mu 1986 nyuma yo kwitwa umupira wamaguru w\u2019Ubufaransa nkumukinnyi w\u2019umupira wamaguru w\u2019umwaka muri Afurika, yatsindiye kuzamuka muri La Liga mu 1989 ubwo yatwaraga igikombe cya Ricardo Zamora.\u00a0\nZaki yakiniye ikipe y'igihugu ya Maroc mu gikombe cy'isi cya 1986 ndetse n\u2019igikombe cy\u2019ibihugu bine bya Afurika. Mu marushanwa yahoze, yabereye muri Mexico, yafashije igihugu cye mu cyiciro cya 16 ; byongeye kandi, uwahawe imipira 76 yuzuye yitabiriye imikino Olempike yo mu 1984. \nMu 2006, Zaki yatoranijwe n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira wamaguru nyafurika nkumwe mu bakinnyi 200 b\u2019umupira wamaguru muri Afurika mu myaka 50 ishize. \nUmwuga wo gutoza.\nZaki yagiye mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru mu 1993 afite imyaka 34, ahita aba umuyobozi. Mu 2002, nyuma yo gutoza amakipe menshi, harimo n'ahahoze ari FUS na WAC, yagizwe umuyobozi wa Maroc, ava ku mwanya we nyuma y\u2019imyaka itatu agaruka muri Gicurasi 2014. Yagiye ku bwumvikane muri Gashyantare 2016. \nZaki yaje gusubira mu mirimo ya club, akomeza kuyobora impande nyinshi. \nIcyubahiro.\nUmukinnyi.\nWydad Casablanca\nRCD Mallorca\nUmuyobozi.\nWydad Casablanca\nCR Belouizdad\nMaroc"}
{"id": "15126", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15126", "title": "Mustapha El Biyaz", "text": "Mustapha El-Biyaz nanone yitwa El-Biaz (yavutse ku ya 12 Gashyantare 1960) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru wabigize umwuga ukina nka myugariro avuka i Taza muri Maroc.\nUmwuga.\nEl Biyaz yakinnye umupira wamaguru muri KAC Marrakech muri Botola. Yagize kandi \"amarozi\" muri make na FC Penafiel muri Liga ya Porutugali muri shampiyona ya 1987\u201388. \nEl Biyaz yakiniye ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru muri Maroc mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1984 no mu mukino wa nyuma w'igikombe cy'isi cya 1986. \nMu 2006, yatoranijwe na CAF nk'umwe mu bakinnyi 200 b'umupira w'amaguru muri Afurika beza mu myaka 50 ishize. "}
{"id": "15127", "revid": "11200", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15127", "title": "Noureddine Bouyahyaoui", "text": "Noureddine Bouyahiaoui (yavutse 7 Mutarama 1955) ni umugabo wahoze ari umukinnyi wu mupira wa maguru wakina nka myugariro wu mupira wa maguru muri wa Maroc yakiniye ikipe yigihugu ya Maroc mu gikombe cyisi cyo muri 1986. Yakiniye nanone KAC Kenitra."}
{"id": "15128", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15128", "title": "Mustapha Fadli", "text": "Mustapha Fadli ni umukinnyi muteramakofe wari warbigize umwugaukomoka muri Maroke. Akaba yiritabiriye imikino yoroheje y'abagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1984. "}
{"id": "15129", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15129", "title": "Mustafa El Haddaoui", "text": "Mustafa El Haddaoui, nanone azwi nka Mustapha El-Hadaoui mu cyarabu (yavutse 28 Nyakanga 1961) ni umukinnyi wu mupira wa maguru wa bigize uvuka i Casablanca muri Maroke.\nYakoze umwuga we wu mupira wa maguru mu Bufaransa aho yari mu ikipe ya Maroc mu gikombe cyisi cyo muri 1986 na 1994. Yarushanwe kandi muri Maroc mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1984. \n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo byerekana intego ya Maroc mbere.\" "}
{"id": "15130", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15130", "title": "Labid Khalifa", "text": "Labid Khalifa (wavutse 1955) ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga mu mupira wamaguru, akaba akina nka myugariro wu mupira wa maguru wa Maroc. Akaba yarakiniye Maroc mu gikombe cyisi cya FIFA 1986. Yakiniye kandi KAC Kenitra."}
{"id": "15131", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15131", "title": "Abdelmajid Lamriss", "text": "Abdelmajid Lamriss (wavutse 12 Gashyantare 1959) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga wakinanga myugariro wu mupira wa maguru wa Maroc wakiniye ikipe yigihugu cya Maroc mu gikombe cyisi cya 1986. Yakinnye kandi ikipe ya basirikare ya FAR Rabat."}
{"id": "15132", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15132", "title": "Lahcen Ouadani", "text": "Lahcen Ouadani (wavutse 14 Nyakanga 1959) ni umukinnyi wu mupira wa maguru wabigize umwuga akaba yarakinaga ari nka myugariro wu mupira wa maguru wa Maroc wakiniye Maroc mu gikombe cyisi cya 1986. Yakinnye kandi ikipe ya gisirikare ya FAR Rabat."}
{"id": "15133", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15133", "title": "Aziz Bouderbala", "text": "Abdelaziz El Idrissi Bouderbala (wavutse ku ya 26 Ukuboza 1960) yahoze ari umukinyi wu mupira wa maguru wabigize umwuga muri Maroc. Mu 2006, yatoranijwe na CAF yari mubakinnyi 200 bakina umupira w'a maguru muri Afurika mu myaka 50 ishize. \nUmwuga.\nAziz CHAR yatangiye umwuga we wabigize umwuga i Wydad Casablanca, mbere yo kwimukira muri FC Sion, Matra Racing na Olympique Lyon yo mu Bufaransa nyuma. uwahoze ari umukinnyi yakoraga nk'umuyobozi wa tekinike mu ikipe ye ya mbere Wydad Casablanca. Yakiniye kandi GD Estoril-Praia ukomoka muri Porutugali. Mu 1986, Bouderbala yegukanye umwanya wa kabiri mu gihembo cy'umupira w'amaguru muri Afurika.\nBouderbala yakinnye imikino 57 mu ikipe yumupira wamaguru yigihugu ya Maroc kandi akina imikino yanyuma yigikombe cyisi cya 1986. \nMuri 2015, yabaye ambasaderi w'igikombe cya SATUC, irushanwa rishya ry\u2019abagiraneza ku isi ry\u2019imfubyi U16, impunzi n\u2019abana batishoboye.\nUbuzima bwite.\nAba i Canton, muri Leta ya Michigan, hamwe n'umugore we n'abana bane.\nIcyubahiro.\nWydad\nFc Sion\nMaroc\numuntu ku giti cye"}
{"id": "15135", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15135", "title": "Khalid al-Aruri", "text": "Khalid Mustafa Khalifa al-Aruri uzwi ku izina rya Abu al-Qassam mu cyarabu, yari umukinnyi ukina umukino wo kurwana (umurwanyi) muri kisilamu,na Palesitine hamwe na Yorodani yari umuyoboke wa al-Qaeda, akaba yari umuyobozi w'abashinzwe kurinda idini. \nAmateka.\nKhalid al-Aruri yavutse ku ya 25 Nyakanga 1967, avukira i Ramallah ku nkombe y'Iburengerazuba. Yakuriye mu mujyi wa Zarqa muri Yorodani kandi yari umuturage wa Yorodani. \nIgihe yari i Zarqa yahuye na Abu Musab al-Zarqawi maze mu 1989 aba bagabo bombi bajya muri Afuganisitani, bahaguma kugeza mu 1993. Mu 1991, bivugwa ko yakoreye umuryango mpuzamahanga utabara imbabare wa kisilamu. Kuva ku ya 29 Werurwe 1994 kugeza muri Werurwe 1999, bafungiye hamwe muri Yorodani maze al-Zarqawi ashinga umuryango we wa Bayt al-Imamu. Nyuma yo kurekurwa kwabo, bombi bongeye kujya muri Afuganisitani aho Al-Aruri abaye umuyobozi w'ikigo cya Al-Zarqawi imyitozo ya jihadi hafi ya Herat. \nUmubano hagati y\u2019umuyobozi mukuru wa al-Qa'ida Sayf al-Adl na Khalid al-Aruri watangiye mu 1999 igihe Abu Musab al-Zarqawi yagiraga inama n\u2019ubuyobozi bwa al-Qa'ida i Kandahar mbere yo gufungura imyitozo ye hafi ya Herat. Ku bwa al-Adl, al-Zarqawi \"yakundaga gutemberana na Khalid al-Aruri na Sulayman Darwish Abu-al-Ghadiyah.\" \nNyuma yuko Zarqawi n'abantu be bavuye muri Afuganisitani mu 2001, al-Aruri yari umwe mu bajyanama b'imbere ba Zarqawi bizewe maze aba umwe mu bahuza bakomeye na Ansar al-Islam mu majyaruguru ya Iraki. Al-Aruri yakoraga nk'umuyobozi wa kimwe cya kane cya al-Zarqawi kandi yari ashinzwe imyitozo mu majyaruguru ya Iraki. Abu al-Qassam yitabiriye inama ikomeye n'abantu begereye Mullah Krekar muri Kanama 2003 i Tehran."}
{"id": "15136", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15136", "title": "Abdullahi Tibazi", "text": "Abdellah Tibazi ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga wakina ari umuteramakofe ukomoka muri Maroc. Yarushanijwe mu bagabo boroheje mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1984. "}
{"id": "15137", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15137", "title": "Mohammed Timo", "text": "Mohamed Timoumi (yavutse 15 Mutarama 1960) yahoze ari umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga ukina umupira wamaguru ukomoka muri Maroc. Yahawe igihembo cyu mupira w'a maguru muri Afurika mu mwaka wa 1985, kandi ni we mukinnyi wa nyuma we gukanye iki gihembo ubwo yakinaga umupira wa maguru mu gihugu cya Afurika. Muri 2006, CAF yamutoranyirije kuba umwe mu bakinnyi 200 bakomeye bu mupira wa maguru muri Afurika mu myaka 50 ishize. \nUmwuga / Umwuga.\nUyu mukinnyi yitabiriye igikombe cyisi cya FIFA mu 1986 muri Mexico. Ku rwego rw'amakipe, Mohammed Timoumi yatsindiye CAF Champions League hamwe na FAR Rabat, ikipe ikomeye y'umupira w'amaguru muri Maroc mu gihe cye. Yarushanwe kandi muri Maroc mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1984 \nMohamed Timoumi yakinnye akiri muto muri Union of Touarga, aho yari umukinnyi muto. Aho niho yaboneye indorerezi n'inzobere mu mupira w'amaguru muri Maroc.\nImpano ye yatumye yinjira muri imwe mu makipe akomeye ya Maroc: FAR Rabat, wegukanye igikombe cya CAF mu 1985.\n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo byerekana ibitego byambere bya Maroc, urupapuro rwerekana amanota nyuma ya buri gitego cya Maroc\".\nKubaha.\nNka kure\nMaroc\numuntu umwe"}
{"id": "15138", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15138", "title": "Hassan Akesbi", "text": "Hassan Akesbi (wavutse 5 Ukuboza 1934 apfa ku ya 9 Ugushyingo 2024) yahoze ari umukinnyi wabigize umwuga ukomoka muri Maroke afite ubwenegihugu bwa merika wahoze akina umupira wamaguru wakinaga mu bi mbere mu kibuga. \nUmwuga / Umwuga.\nMu mwaka wa 2006, Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira w'amaguru muri Afurika (CAF) ryatoranije Akesbi nk'umwe mu bakinnyi 200 b'umupira w'amaguru bakomeye bo muri Afurika mu myaka 50 ishize. \nKubaha.\nN\u00eemes\nReims\nFUS de Rabat\nUmuntu"}
{"id": "15139", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15139", "title": "Abdulkrim Merry", "text": "Abdelkrim Merry uzwi ku izina rya Krimau ni umukinnyi wahoze akina umupira wa maguru wari wa rabigize umwuga ukomoka muri Maroke wakinaga ku mwanya wi mbere mu kibuga. \nAkazi k'ikipe.\nKrimau yavukiye i Casablanca, muri Maroc, yamaze ubuzima bwe bwose mu Bufaransa, agera ku mukino wa nyuma w'igikombe cya UEFA 1978 na SC Bastia.\nAkazi mpuzamahanga.\nKrimau yari mu ikipe ya Maroc yo mu 1986 mu gikombe cyisi cya FIFA maze atsinda igitego kimwe yatsinze Portugal ibitego 3-1. Mu mikino 13 mpuzamahanga kuva 1976 kugeza 1989, Krimau yatsinze ibitego bitanu. \nUmwuga wo kwigisha / gutoza.\nMu mpeshyi ya 2012, Krimau yatangiye umwuga wo gutoza hamwe na Olympique Marrakech. \nUmwiherero.\nKrimau agaragara buri cyumweru muri TV Yerekana Kurambura kuri TV ya Arryadia."}
{"id": "15140", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15140", "title": "Hassan Nadar", "text": "Hassan Nader (wavutse 8 Nyakanga 1965) ni umugabo wahoze umukinnyi wabigize umwuga ukomoka muri Maroke afite ubwenegihigu bwa merika wahoze akina umupira wamaguru wakinaga imbere mu kibuga.\nYakoresheje igice kinini cyimyaka 21 yakinnye muri Porutugali - akusanya imikino 219 ya Primeira Liga yose hamwe n'ibitego 94 - cyane cyane hamwe na Farense, aho yarengeje ibitego 100.\nAkazi ka club.\nNader yavukiye i Casablanca, yatangiye umwuga we mu ikipe ya Wydad AC yaho mbere yo kwinjira mu ikipe ya RC Lallor ya La Liga mu 1990\u201391. Igihembwe cya kabiri kirangiye, ikipe ya Balearic Islands yasubiye ku rwego rwa mbere, maze yinjira mu mutoza Lorenzo Serra Ferrer muri manda ye. \nMuri Nyakanga 1992, Nader yerekeje muri SC Farense muri Primeira Liga, aba umukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi muri shampiyona mu 1994\u201395 n'ibitego 21 kandi yagize uruhare runini mu majonjora ya Algarve mu gikombe cya UEFA. Mu myaka umunani, yakinnye mu ikipe hamwe n\u2019umuturage Hajry Redouane.\nNyuma Nader yinjiye muri SL Benfica, ariko agaragara nabi mu bihe bibiri maze yimukira i Farense, aho yari kuguma kugeza mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru mu 2004 afite imyaka 39, mu gihe iyi kipe yimukiye mu cyiciro cya kane Terceira Divis\u00e3o yatsinze 11. shampiyona ibitego mu mwaka wa nyuma.\nAkazi mpuzamahanga.\nUmukinnyi mpuzamahanga wa Maroc inshuro 15, Nader yakinnye mu gikombe cyisi cya FIFA mu 1994, atsinda Ubuholandi mu kunganya mu matsinda 1-2, no mu gikombe cy\u2019Afurika cyo mu 1992. \nUbuzima bwite.\nUmuhungu wa Nader, Mohcine, nawe ni umupira wamaguru na rutahizamu. Yavukiye muri Porutugali, yanakoresheje ubuzima bwe bwose muri iki gihugu. "}
{"id": "15141", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15141", "title": "Hicham Zerouali", "text": "Hicham Zerouali uzwi ku izina nka Zero cyangwa Umupfumu wa Maroke (wavutse 17 Mutarama 1977 - 5 Ukuboza 2004) ni umugabo wahoze ari umukinnyi wu mupira wa maguru ukomoka muri Maroke. \nYakinaga mubi mbere mu kibuga hagati muri Maroke, muri Scotland na United Arab Emirates. Yakinnye imikino 7 muri Maroke ku isi.\nAkazi mu ikipe.\nAberdeen.\nNyuma yo gukinira muri Maroc kavukire ya Yaakoub El Mansouria na Polisi ya USP, Zerouali yasinywe n\u2019umuyobozi wa Aberdeen Ebbe Skovdahl ukomoka muri FUS de Rabat mu Gushyingo 1999 ku mafaranga 450.000, abigiriwemo inama n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru., Keith. Burkinshaw. Yabaye umukinnyi wa mbere muri Scotland wambaye ishati ya '0' mu 2000, yabujijwe muri shampiyona ya 2000 na Premier League ya Scotland n'Ubwongereza.\u00a0\nMuri Mutarama 2000, Zerouali yatsinze igitego cya metero mirongo itatu ku busa mu gikombe cya Scottish Cup cya kane cyatsinzwe na St Mirren kugira ngo yongere yongere. Zerouali yahise atsinda ibitego 2-0 kuri Pittodrie kugirango afashe iyi kipe mu cyiciro gikurikira cyamarushanwa. Aberdeen yageze ku mukino wanyuma w'igikombe cya Scottish 2000 ndetse na FA Cup 2000 hamwe na Zerouali bakina imikino yombi, nubwo batsinzwe na Celtic na Rangers.\nMuri Kanama 2000, Zerouali yavunitse akaguru mu mukino wahuje Motherwell, nyuma aza kubura umwanya mu mikino Olempike yabereye i Sydney, amaherezo amara umwaka adakina. Muri kimwe mu bihe atazibagirana nyuma yo kugaruka, yatsinze Hat-trick na Dundee. \nAl-Nassr mwene FAR Rabat.\nNyuma yuko amasezerano ye muri Aberdeen arangiye, yahise agaruka gukina umupira wamaguru muri United Arab Emirates hamwe na Al-Nassr umwaka umwe, mbere yo gusubira mu gihugu cye cya Maroc mu 2003, asinyira FAR Rabat. aho yatsindiye Coupe du Trone muri uwo mwaka. \nAkazi mpuzamahanga.\nZerouali yakinnye imikino 7 mu ikipe yumupira wamaguru ya Maroc maze atsinda ibitego bitatu. Yakiniye Maroc mu gikombe cya Afurika cy\u2019ibihugu byabereye muri Mali mu 2002 maze atsinda ibitego bibiri yatsinze Burkina Faso ibitego 2-1. Yakinnye kandi muri Shampiyona y\u2019urubyiruko mu 1997. Yari mu ikipe mpuzamahanga ukwezi mbere yuko apfa."}
{"id": "15142", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15142", "title": "Samir Hadji", "text": "Samir Hadji (wavutse 12 Nzeri 1989, avukira i Creutzwald) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga wu mupira wa maguru ukinira ikipe ya Luxembourg club F91 Dudelange nku mukinnyi wi mbere mu kibuga. Yavukiye mu Bufaransa, ahagarariye igihugu cya mavuko cya Maroc ku rwego mu bato.\nUbuzima bwite.\nNi umuhungu w'uwahoze akinira Maroc Mustapha Hadji. Se wabo wa Hadji yahoze ari umukinnyi wa AS Nancy Youssouf Hadji. Se wabo yamusobanuriye ko \"arangiza vuba kandi siporo\". \nUmwuga.\nHadji yatangiye gukina muri club yavukiyemo SR Creutzwald. Muri 2007, yinjiye mu Budage asinyana na 1. FC Saarbr\u00fccken muri Oberliga, igice cya gatanu cyumupira wamaguru wubudage. Nyuma yimyaka ibiri, Hadji yasubiye mu Bufaransa ajya mu ikipe yahoze yitwa AS Nancy. Yamaze imyaka ibiri akinira ikipe y\u2019abakunzi ba Championnat de France, akina imikino 59 ndetse atsinda ibitego 18 mbere yo gusinyana na RC Strasbourg muri Nyakanga 2010. Hadji yatangiye umwuga we ku ya 30 Nyakanga 2010 mu mukino wa Coupe de la Ligue w'iyi kipe na \u00c9vian. Hadji yatangiye umukino akina iminota 120 yuzuye kuko Strasbourg yatsinzwe 5-4 kuri penariti. \nNyuma yo gukinira CS Fola Esch mu gice cy\u2019igihugu cya Luxembourg, Hadji yimukiye muri Excelsior Virton muri 2019.\nAkazi mpuzamahanga.\nHadji yakinnye umukino umwe muri Maroc U23 banganya 0-0 na Niger U23 ku ya 1 Ugushyingo 2011. "}
{"id": "15143", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15143", "title": "Badr El Kaddouri", "text": "Badr El Kaddouri (wavutse ku ya 31 Mutarama 1981) ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga mu mupira wa maguru uri mu kiruhuko cyi zabukuru muri Maroke, uheruka gukinira ikipe ya Dynamo Kyiv yo muri Ukraine. Yari nu munyamahanga wa Maroke. El Kaddouri yakinaga ibumoso yashoboraga no gukina hagati mu kibuga.\nUmwuga.\nWydad Casablanca.\nEl Kaddouri yatangiye umwuga we muri Wydad Casablanca mu 2000. Mu 2001, yafashije iyo kipe gutwara Igikombe cya Maroc. Igihe cyakurikiyeho, yinjiye muri Dynamo Kyiv.\nDynamo Kyiv.\nEl Kaddouri yinjiye muri Dynamo Kyiv mu 2002, kugeza igihe inguzanyo ye yimukiye muri Celtic mu 2011, yari umwe mu bakinnyi bamaze igihe kinini muri iyi kipe. Yatangiye gukina na Dynamo ku ya 17 Kanama 2002 atsinda Volyn Lutsk ibitego 3\u20131. Igihe yari muri iyo kipe, yatsindiye ibikombe bine bya Shampiyona yo muri Ukraine, ibikombe bine bya Ukraine ndetse n\u2019ibikombe bitanu bya Ukraine. Yagaragaye mumikino 123 ya shampiyona mugihe rimwe na rimwe yayoboraga ikipe.\nAbaselite.\nKu ya 31 Kanama 2011, El Kaddouri yasinyiye ikipe ya Celtic yo muri Scottish Premier League ku masezerano y'inguzanyo y'amezi atandatu ahitamo kugura. Niwe muntu wa mbere muri Maroc wakiniye Celtic. Yazanywe nk'igifuniko cya Emilio Izaguirre, wakomeretse igihe kirekire. Ku ya 10 Nzeri 2011, El Kaddouri yakinnye bwa mbere muri Celtic muri 4\u20130 yatsinze Motherwell. Yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere kuri Celtic mu mukino wa Derby Old Firm na Rangers ku ya 18 Nzeri 2011 maze agaragara inshuro 6 mu ikipe ya Ecosse mbere yo gusubira muri Dynamo Kyiv muri Mutarama 2012.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nEl Kaddouri yakinnye igihugu cye cyose hamwe 45 kandi yari asanzwe mu gihugu. Yitabiriye kandi imikino Olempike yo mu 2004 hamwe n'ikipe ya Olempike ya Maroc. \nIcyubahiro.\nClub.\nWydad Casablanca\nDynamo Kyiv"}
{"id": "15144", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15144", "title": "Sofian Benzouien", "text": "Sofian Benzouien (wavutse 11 Kanama 1986) ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga mu mupira wa maguru uri mu kiruhuko cyiza. Yavukiye mu Bubiligi, ariko yari umunya Marke ku rwego mpuzamahanga.\nUbuzima.\nUmukinnyi mpuzamahanga w\u2019urubyiruko rwo muri Maroc mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga y\u2019urubyiruko ya FIFA mu 2005, Benzouien yari yarakinnye mu makipe y\u2019urubyiruko n\u2019abakinnyi ba Anderlecht, Beringen-Heusden-Zolder na Bruxelles. Muri Mutarama 2007, yavuye mu ikipe ya Espagne Racing de Santander B (ikipe yabigenewe ya Racing de Santander) \nMuri Kanama 2007, yinjiye muri Perugiya ya Serie C1. Amaze gukina imikino 4 gusa muri saison ya 2007\u201308, na nil muri saison ya 2008\u201309, yahagaritse amasezerano yagiranye niyi kipe mubwumvikane. \nMuri Mutarama 2009, yinjiye muri Eupen mu cyiciro cya kabiri cy'Ababiligi. Muri Nyakanga 2010, yasinyiye F91 Dudelange mu gice cy\u2019igihugu cya Luxembourg. Yakiniye Dudelange kugeza shampiyona ya 2018-19 irangiye.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nAmahanga U20 yo muri Maroc, Benzouien yahamagaye muri Maroc U23 kumukino wa gicuti, kugirango yitegure irushanwa rya CAF ryabagabo ryabanjirije imikino Olempike. \nUmwuga.\nMu mpeshyi ya 2019, Benzouien yimukiye mu ikipe ya Swift Hesperange yo mu cyiciro cya kabiri cya Luxembourger, aho yatorewe kuba umuyobozi wa siporo ndetse anaboneka muri iyi kipe ikindi gihembwe kimwe nkumukinnyi uhagaze neza. Iyi kipe yatandukanye na Benzouien muri Nzeri 2022. "}
{"id": "15145", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15145", "title": "Salma Khabot", "text": "Salma Khabot (yavutse ku ya 29 Kamena 2001) ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga mu ikipe ya kayaker yo muri Maroc. \nUmwuga / Umwuga.\nYatsindiye umudari wa bronze muri K4 500m hamwe na Laila Bouchir, Chaymaa Guemra na Zina Aboudalal muri Shampiyona nyafurika ya 2019. \namahuza yo hanze.\nTemplate:Portail"}
{"id": "15146", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15146", "title": "Mustafa Ahmed Bakali", "text": "Mustafa Ahmed Bakali uzwi ku izina rya Mustapha Bakkali (wavutse 1924 kugeza ku ya 13 Nyakanga 2005) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga ukina umukino wa chess ukomoka muri Maroke ndetse akaba utegura ibiremereye. Yatsindiye Shampiyona ya mbere ya Chess muri Maroke mu 1965, yabaye perezida wa Federasiyo ya Chess muri Maroke (FRME) kuva 1975 kugeza 1986.\nUbuzima.\nMustafa Bakali akomoka muri T\u00e9touan. Yatsindiye Shampiyona ya mbere ya Chess ya Maroc yabaye kuva ku ya 24 Nyakanga kugeza ku ya 1 Kanama 1965 muri club y\u2019ubumwe mu mujyi yavukiyemo, aho yatsinze 6/7 mu cyiciro cy\u2019abakinnyi umunani. Yatsindiye neza izina rye mu 1966, yegukana igikombe cya gatatu mu 1973 atsinda Ahmed Bennis mu mukino wabereye i Rabat. \nBakali yakiniye Maroc mu mikino Olempike ya Chess inshuro enye: \nBakali yari umunyamuryango washinze ishyirahamwe ry\u2019imyuga rya Royal Maroc mu 1963, kandi yayoboye inama y'ubutegetsi mu buryo butemewe kuva 1965 kugeza 1969. Yabaye perezida wa federasiyo kuva 1975 kugeza 1986. Yabaye kandi umunyamuryango wa Federasiyo ya Chess. \nBakali yapfiriye i T\u00e9touan ku ya 13 Nyakanga 2005 afite imyaka 81, nyuma y'uburwayi bumaze igihe. "}
{"id": "15147", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15147", "title": "Mohamed Tissir", "text": "Mohamed Tissir (wavutse 1976) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga ukina umukino wa chess Maroke.\nUmwuga wa Chess.\nYatsindiye igikombe cya Afurika muri Chess muri 1999, Shampiyona ya Chess ya Maroc mu 1996, 1999 na 2005, kandi ahagarariye igihugu cye mu mikino Olempike itari mike. Yatsindiye kandi umudari wa zahabu mu mikino ya 36 ya Chess Olympique ya Palma de Mallorca (Espagne) mu 2004 ndetse anatsinda imikino y'Abarabu yabereye muri Yorodani mu 1999.\nYakinnye mu gikombe cyisi cya Chess 2000, aho yarangirije hepfo yitsinda D, ndetse na FIDE World Chess Championship 2004, aho yatsinzwe na Alexey Dreev mu cyiciro cya mbere. \nUbu ni umutoza wa chess."}
{"id": "15148", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15148", "title": "Ali Sabbar", "text": "Ali Sebbar ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga ukina umukino wa chess akaba yaragaragaye mu mikino yi si. \nUmukino wa kashe.\nSebbar yegukanye igikombe cya Shampiyona ya Maroc muri 2013, ahagararira igihugu cye mu mikino Olempike myinshi, harimo 2004 na 2014, anakina Shampiyona y'isi ya Chess 2013, yakiriwe na Sergey Karjakin. Yamutsinze mu cyiciro cya mbere. "}
{"id": "15149", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15149", "title": "Hichem Hamdouchi", "text": "Hichem Hamdouchi (yavutse ku ya 8 Ukwakira 1972) ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga uvuka i Tangier muri Maroke afite umwenegihugu byu bufaransa ukina umukino wa chess.\nHamdouchi yegukanye igikombe cya Shampiyona cya chess muri Maroke inshuro cumi n'umwe, kuva mu 1988 afite imyaka 15, ubwo yemererwaga bwa mbere gukina amarushanwa akomeye. Muri uwo mwaka, mu marushanwa ya Casablanca, yamenyekanye kubera impano ye yujuje ibisabwa mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Maroke kwitabira imikino ya Chess muri Olympikee yo mu 1988 yabereye i Tesalonike. Afite imyaka 17 yabashije kujya mu majonjora yo muri Afurika mu gikombe cy\u2019isi cya makipe yabaye aya mbere i Lucerne. yatsinze bidasanzwe kuri Jeroen Piket, John Fedorowicz na Ye Jiangchuan.\nMu 1990 muri Olympique ya 29 ya Chess yabereye i Novi Sad yatsinze 8/11, nyuma yaho aruhuka chess kugirango yige. Afite imyaka 20, mu 1992 yakinnye neza mumarushanwa menshi yuburayi. Muri uwo mwaka yakinnye muri 30 ya Chess Olympiade yitwaye neza 7.5 / 11. Yatsindiye muri Sitges na Ceuta mu 1992, aho yakuye amahame ya nyirakuru wa mbere. Mu 1993 yatangiye kwiga Ubukungu muri kaminuza ya Montpellier. Ukuboza 1993 yatsindiye amarushanwa ya master yabereye i Montpellier hamwe na 7/9, abona amahame ye ya kabiri. Nyuma y'amezi make yahawe izina rya nyirakuru. Icyo gihe yari umwe muri ba nyirakuru batatu bo muri Afurika, abandi babiri ni abakinnyi bo muri Tuniziya Slim Bouaziz na Slim Belkhodja.\nMu 1994 yatsindiye amarushanwa ya Masters yabereye i Casablanca maze mu 1995 aba Nyampinga w\u2019Abarabu Chess i Dubai, igitaramo azagisubiramo mu 2002 na 2004. Mu 1996 yongeye gutsinda amarushanwa akomeye ya grandmaster yabereye i Montpellier, aho yize ubucuruzi ubu. Amaze kurangiza amasomo ye mu 1998, yatuye muri Espagne kandi atsinda amarushanwa muri Dos Hermanas, Bolzano na Djerba.\nYongeye gutsindira i Montpellier mu 2001 maze muri uwo mwaka aba Nyampinga wa Chess muri Afurika imbere ya Watu Kobese wo muri Afurika y'Epfo. Mu 2002 yatsindiye kumugaragaro muri Nice, Belfort na Coria del Rio. Muri Mutarama 2003 yashyizwe ku mwanya wa 75 ku isi afite amanota 2615.\nMuri FIDE World Chess Championship 2004 yabereye i Tripoli yazamutse mu cyiciro cya gatatu, aho yakuweho 0.5-1.5 na Michael Adams waje ku mwanya wa kabiri. Mu 2005 yatsindiye muri Castelldefels, mu 2006 i Salou no muri 2007 muri Saint-Affrique. Mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu by\u2019i Burayi mu Kwakira 2007, yakiniye ikipe ya Basque Gros Xake Taldea.\nMuri 2009 Hamdouchi yimukiye muri Federasiyo ya Chess. Muri 2013 yegukanye igikombe cya Shampiyona y\u2019Ubufaransa kandi yari umwe mu bagize ikipe y\u2019Ubufaransa yegukanye umudari wa feza muri Shampiyona y\u2019amakipe yabaye aya mbere iwayo i Warsaw.\nYashakanye na Nyiricyubahiro Nyiricyubahiro Adina-Maria Hamdouchi. "}
{"id": "15150", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15150", "title": "Abderrahmane Boushita", "text": "Abderrahmane Boushita (yavutse 5 Nzeri 1997) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga mu mukino wa jido ukomoka muri Maroke. Yahagarariye Maroke mu mikino nyafurika ya 2019 yegukana umudari wa feza mu bagabo batarengeje ibiro 66. \nYitabiriye kandi amarushanwa y'ibiro 66 mu bagabo mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Judo ya 2017, mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Judo ya 2018 ndetse no muri Shampiyona y'isi ya Judo ya 2019.\nMu marushanwa ya Afurika 2021 yabereye i Dakar, muri Senegali, yegukanye umudari wa bronze mu bagabo 66 kg. "}
{"id": "15151", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15151", "title": "Zahira El Ghabi", "text": "Zahira El Ghabi ni umugore wu muhanga wu mukinnyi wabigize umwuga mu mukino wa chess,wo muri Maroke FIDE, WFM, 2005. \nUmwuga wa Chess.\nMu ntangiriro ya 2000, yari umwe mu bakinnyi ba chess bakomeye muri Maroc. Mu 2000, Zahira El Ghabi yitabiriye Shampiyona y\u2019abagore ku isi mu mukino wa chess na knockout ndetse no mu cyiciro cya mbere yatsinzwe na Julia Demina. \nZahira El Ghabi yakiniye Maroc mu mikino Olempike y'abagore: \nKuva mu 2006 ntiyakunze kwitabira amarushanwa ya chess."}
{"id": "15152", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15152", "title": "Imamu Bassu", "text": "Imad Bassou (wavutse 4 Nyakanga 1993) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga mu mupira wa maguru ukomoka muri Maroc.\nYitabiriye imikino Olempike yo mu 2016 yabereye i Rio de Janeiro, mu basiganwa 66 kg. \nMurumuna we Issam Bassou nawe ni umucamanza. \nMu 2021, yarushanwe mu bagabo 66 kg mu bagabo 2021 ba Judo World Masters yabereye i Doha, muri Qatar. \nIhuza ryo hanze.\nImad Bassou muri federasiyo mpuzamahanga ya Judo Imad Bassou kuri JudoInside.com Imad Bassou kuri AllJudo.net (mu gifaransa) Imad Bassou mu mikino Olempike.com Imad Bassou muri Olympedia Imad Bassou muri Komite Olempike y'igihugu cya Maroc (mu gifaransa) Imad Bassou kuri Comit\u00e9 National Olympique Marocain (mu gifaransa)"}
{"id": "15153", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15153", "title": "Soumiya Iraoui", "text": "Soumiya Iraoui (yavutse ku ya 19 Werurwe 1996) ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga mu mikino wa Jido ukomoka muri Maroke. yabonye umudari wa feza mu mikino nyafurika yegukana imidari itatu, harimo imidari ibiri ya zahabu, muri Shampiyona nyafurika ya Jido. Yahagarariye Maroke mu mikino Olempike ya 2020 yabereye i Tokiyo, mu Buyapani.\nUmwuga.\nYatsindiye umudari wa zahabu mu marushanwa ye muri Shampiyona Nyafurika ya 2018 yabereye i Tunis, muri Tuniziya. Yitabiriye kandi isiganwa ry\u2019ibirometero 57 mu bagore mu mikino ya Mediterane ya 2018 yabereye i Tarragona, Cataloniya, Espanye.\nMuri 2019, yatsindiye umudari wa feza mu marushanwa y'abagore 52 kg mu marushanwa ya Afurika ya Judo yabereye i Cape Town, muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yatsindiye kandi umudari wa feza mu isiganwa ry\u2019ibiro 52 mu bagore mu mikino nyafurika ya 2019 yabereye i Rabat, muri Maroc. Muri uku kwezi, yitabiriye kandi amarushanwa y'abagore 52 kg mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Judo ya 2019 yabereye i Tokiyo, mu Buyapani. Ukwezi kumwe, yatsindiye umudari umwe wa bronze mu birori bye muri Judo Grand Prix Tashkent ya 2019 yabereye i Tashkent, muri Uzubekisitani. \nYatsindiye kandi umudari wa silver muri iri rushanwa mu marushanwa ya Afurika ya Judo ya 2020 yabereye Antananarivo, Madagasikari. Mu 2021, yarushanwe mu bagore 52 kg mu bagore muri Judo World Masters i Doha, muri Qatar aho yakuweho na R\u00e9ka Pupp wo muri Hongiriya mu mukino we wa mbere. Muri Shampiyona yo muri Afurika 2021 yabereye i Dakar, muri Senegali, yegukanye umudari wa zahabu mu marushanwa ye."}
{"id": "15154", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15154", "title": "Rachid Rguig", "text": "Rachid Rguig (wavutse 1 Nzeri 1980) ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga ukina umukino wa Jido muri Maroke, wakinnye mu cyiciro cya kabiri cyoroheje. Yatsindiye umudari wa feza mu cyiciro cye mu marushanwa ya Afurika ya Jido yo mu 2009 yabereye i Port Louis muri Maurice, nu muringa mu marushanwa ya Afurika ya Jido yo mu 2008 yabereye i Agadir, muri Maroke. \nRguig yari ahagarariye Maroc mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2008 yabereye i Beijing, aho yarushanijwe mu cyiciro cya kabiri cy'abagabo (66)\u00a0kg). Yakiriye neza umukino wa kabiri wibanze, mbere yo gutsindwa, na ippon (point point) hamwe na juji gatame (ukuboko kwinyuma-perpendicular), kwa Benjamin Darbelet w\u2019Ubufaransa. Kubera ko uwo bahanganye yateye imbere mu mukino wanyuma, Rguig yatanze irindi shoti ry'umudari wa bronze yinjira mu cyiciro cya repechage. Kubwamahirwe, yatsinzwe kumukino we wambere numunyakanada Sasha Mehmedovic, watsinze neza waza-ari awasete ippon (point point) hamwe na kata gatame (gufata urutugu), muminota ibiri namasegonda mirongo itatu n'atandatu. "}
{"id": "15155", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15155", "title": "Ikipe ya Hockey y'abagabo ya Maroke", "text": "Ikipe Hockey y'igihugu ya Maroke y'abagabo ni ikipe iyoborwe n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino w\u2019amagare mu bwami bwa Maroke, ni umunyamuryango w\u2019ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga ry\u2019imikino ya ice (IIHF). Iyi ikipe ikinira kuri sitade iherereye mu murwa mukuru Rabat muri Maroke.\nAmateka.\nMuri Kamena 2008, Maroc yitabiriye Igikombe cya mbere cy\u2019Abarabu cyabereye Abu Dhabi, cyanarimo amakipe yaturutse muri Alijeriya, UAE na Koweti. Umukino wa mbere wa Maroc watsinzwe na UAE 9-0 ku ya 16 Kamena 2008. Umunyamerika Yassin Ahrazem yatsinze igitego cya mbere muri Koweti mu gikombe cy\u2019abarabu 2008. Ku ya 22 Gicurasi 2010, IIHF yatangaje ko ubu Maroc ari umunyamuryango. "}
{"id": "15156", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15156", "title": "Ikipe ya basketball y'abagabo ya Maroc", "text": "Ikipe y'igihugu ya basketball ya Marocke ihagararira igihugu cya Maroke mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga basketball. Iyi kipe iyoborwe n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umukino wa Basketball muri Maroke, rizwi nka FRMBB. Iyi kipe yagaragaye igihugu muri FIBA AfroBasket inshuro 20 yegukana umudari wa zahabu mu marushanwa ya 1965 no mu 1968, Marocke iya kabiri.\nShira hamwe.\nRoster na yanzu.\nMuri AfroBasket 2017:\nUrutonde rwa nyuma.\n2013 Ikipe yigihugu ya FIBA Igikombe cyibihugu. AfroBasket 2015: "}
{"id": "15157", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15157", "title": "AMI Basket", "text": "Ishyirahamwe Michlifen Ifrane Basket-ball, rizwi nka AMI Basket, ni ikipe ya basketball ya Maroke ifite icyicaro i Ifrane. Ikipe irushanwa muri Diviziyo, shampiyona y'igihugu yo hejuru. Iyi kipe yashinzwe mu 2014 ikaba ifite ishuri ry'urubyiruko rifite abana barenga 140(ijana na mirongo ine)bafite imyaka 4 kugeza 14. Muri 2016, iyi kipe y'abagabo yegukanye igikombe cya shampiyona y'icyiciro cya gatatu muri Maroke. \nIcyubahiro.\nIgice cya 3 cya Maroc"}
{"id": "15158", "revid": "10331", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15158", "title": "ASE Essaouira", "text": "Amal Sportive d'Essaouira, izwi kandi nka Amal Essaouira cyangwa ASE, ni ikipe ya basketball yo mu gihugu cyo muri Maroke. Iyi kipe ikina muri Natiyonale ya 1, amarushanwa yo mu cyiciro cya mbere muri Maroke. Muri 2014, ASE yitabiriye amarushanwa ikipe ya Arabiya. "}
{"id": "15159", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15159", "title": "Chabab Rif Al Hoceima (basketball)", "text": "Chabab Rif Al Hoceima ni ikipe ya bigize umwuga ikina imikino basketball mu gihigu cya Maroke ifite icyicaro i Al Hoceima. Iyi kipe iri muri ikipe za ya multisports ifite izina rimwe."}
{"id": "15160", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15160", "title": "CMC (basketball)", "text": "Cercle Municipal de Casablanca bakunze kwita CMC ni ikipe yabigize umwuga ikia imikino ya basketball, ni igice cy'ishyirahamwe ryi mikino myinshi, rifite icyicaro mu mujyi wa Casablanca, muri Maroke.\nAmateka.\nCMC yashinzwe mu 1934 ku bushake bwa bamwe mu bayobozi b'umugi, hagati ya Casablanca (Parike y\u2019Abarabu) ikwirakwira ku buso bwa m 8000 m 2, CMC ni imwe mu makipe ya mbere ya siporo muri umujyi.\nMu 1972, CMC yegukanye umwanya wa kabiri mu gikombe cya Maroc (Coupe du Tr\u00f4ne de basket-ball) maze ijya mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu by\u2019i Burayi cya 1972\u201373 aho Mounier Wels (66-) yavanyweho mu cyiciro cya mbere. 99 ku ijana i Casablanca na 58-107 i Wels, Otirishiya). \nIcyubahiro n'ibimaze kugerwaho.\nImbere mu Gihugu.\nIkipe ya Maroc\nIgikombe cya Maroke\nAkarere.\nMaghreb Basketball"}
{"id": "15161", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15161", "title": "AS FAR (basketball)", "text": "AS FAR cyagwa izwi nka (Association Sportive des Forces Arm\u00e9es Royales) cyangwa FAR Rabat, ni ikipe ya bigize umwuga ya basketball ikorera mu murwa mukuru Rabat - Sal\u00e9 muri Maroke. Igice cya shampiyona yi mikino myinshi yi zina rimwe, ikipe ye ya mbere ikina mu shampiyoa yitwa Excellence Division, shampiyona ya mbere yi gihugu. \nIkipe ya basketball yashinzwe mu 1959 itwara igikombe cya shampiyona ya Maroc inshuro eshatu (mu myaka ya 1964, 1969, 1986).\nKubaha.\nAmarushanwa yo mu nzu.\nKugabana indashyikirwa\nIgikombe cy'intebe ya Maroc\nAmarushanwa mpuzamahanga.\nIgikombe cya FIBA Afurika Amakipe"}
{"id": "15162", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15162", "title": "FUS Rabat (basketball)", "text": "FUS Rabat izwi kandi nka FUS cyangwa FUS Rabat ni ikipe ya bigize umwuga ya basketball ifite icyicaro i Rabat muri Maroke. Kuri ubu iyi kipe ikina muri Excellence Division kandi ni igice cya basketball yi kipe yi mikino myinshi. Iyi kipe niyo yatsinze cyane mu mateka ya Maroke, ifite ibikombe 17 byi gihugu. \nImikino yo murugo ikinirwa kuri Salle Abderrahmane Bou\u00e2nane, ishobora kwakira abantu 1.500. \nKubaha.\nKuba indashyikirwa mu kugabana \nIgikombe cy'intebe ya Maroc "}
{"id": "15163", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15163", "title": "Ittihad Tanger (basketball)", "text": "IRT Tanger cyangwa Ittihad Riadhi de Tanger, izwi kandi ku izina rya Ittihad Tanger, (Yashinzwe mu 1983) ni ikipe yabigize umwuga ikina imikino ya basketball ifite icyicaro i Tangier muri Maroke., ni umuryango wi mikino myinshi aho ifite igice cyu mupira wamaguru. Iyi kipe ikina mu cyiciro cya mbere cyi cyiciro cya mbere cya Shampiyona yatwaye ibikombe bitatu, icya nyuma cyari muri 2009. Imikino yo mu rugo ya Ittihad ikinirwa kuri sitade ya Salle Badr."}
{"id": "15164", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15164", "title": "Maghreb de Fes (basketball)", "text": "Maghreb de Fes bakunze kwita Maghreb Association Sportive de F\u00e8s cyangwa MAS Fes, ni ikipe yabigize umwuga ikina imikino ya basketball ya bigize umwuga ifite icyicaro i Fez muri Maroke. Ni ikipe irushanwa mu cyiciro cya I. Imikino yo murugo ikinirwa muri Salle 11 Janvier (11 Mutarama), yubatswe mu 2004 kandi ifite imyanya bicaye abafana 3.000.\nIyi kipe yatsindiye ibikombe bitanu bya shampiyona ya Maroc, ibikombe birindwi bya Maroc ndetse n\u2019igikombe kimwe cya Afurika mu 1998.\nKubaha.\nIgikombe cya FIBA Afurika Amakipe\nKugabana indashyikirwa\nIgikombe cy'intebe ya Maroc"}
{"id": "15165", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15165", "title": "AS Sal\u00e9 (basketball)", "text": "AS Sal\u00e9 uzwi kandi nka Club Sportive Sal\u00e9, ni ikipe ya bigize umwuga ya basketball ikomoka muri Maroke aho muri Sal\u00e9. Iyi kipe irushanwa mu cyiciro cya Basketball ya afuruka ya babigize umwuga yitwa BAL. Abakinnyi bazwi muri iyi kipe barimo abakinnyi bakomeye ba basketball muri Maroc Abderrahim Najah, Zakaria El Masbahi na Soufiane Kourdou.\nSal\u00e9 yatwaye igikombe cya Maroc inshuro 9 nigikombe cya Maroc inshuro 11. Iyi kipe yegukanye igikombe kimwe cyumugabane, FIBA Champion Cup yegukanye muri 2017. Sal\u00e9 kandi yitabiriye imikino ibiri ibanza ya Shampiyona nyafurika ya Basketball (BAL).\nAmateka.\nIgice cya basketball cyikipe yimikino myinshi AS Sal\u00e9 cyashinzwe mu 1928. Iyi kipe yakinnye mu cyiciro cya Excellence Division, icyiciro cya mbere cya Maroc, ariko ntago yegukanye igikombe cya mbere cya shampiyona kugeza mu 2010. \nKu ya 20 Ukuboza 2017, Sal\u00e9 yegukanye igikombe cya Afurika cya FIBA 2017, igikombe cya mbere mpuzamahanga cya Sal\u00e9 ndetse n\u2019icyubahiro cya mbere mu ikipe ya Maroc muri ibyo birori mu myaka hafi 20. Yabikoze atsinda \u00c9toile de Rad\u00e8s muri Rad\u00e8s, atsinda umukino wa nyuma 77\u201369. Umutoza mukuru w'ikipe yatsinze yavuze El Bouzidi. Nyuma yaya marushanwa, Abdelhakim Zouita wo muri Sal\u00e9 yahawe igihembo cy\u2019umukinnyi ufite agaciro muri iri rushanwa mu gihe Abderrahim Najah yabonye umwanya mu bakinnyi batanu.\nAbakinnyi.\nUrutonde rwubu.\nIbikurikira nibikoresho bya AS Sal\u00e9 muri saison ya 2022 BAL."}
{"id": "15166", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15166", "title": "Maroc mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2022", "text": "Marok yitabiriye imikino Olempike yo mu 2022 yabereye i Beijing mu Bushinwa, kuva ku ya 4 kugeza ku ya 20 Gashyantare 2022. \nIkipe ya Maroke irimo gusimbuka abagabo. Yassine Aouich niwe watwaye ibendera ryigihugu mugihe cyo gutangiza. Hagati aho, umukorerabushake ni we wari ufite ibendera ry'igihugu mu muhango wo gusoza. \nAbakinnyi.\nUrutonde rwumubare waba kinnyi bitabira buri siporo / zitandukanye\nUmukino wo gusiganwa ku maguru.\nMu kuba yujuje ibyangombwa byujuje ibisabwa muri Maroc yujuje ibisabwa kugira ngo asimbuke abagabo. "}
{"id": "15167", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15167", "title": "Nijeriya mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2022", "text": "Igihugu cya Nigeriya cyitabiriye imikino Olempike ya bereye mu mujyi wa Beijing mu Bushinwa, kuva ku ya 4 kugeza ku ya 20 Gashyantare 2022. \nIkipe ya Nigeriya igizwe nu mugabo umwe wo gusiganwa ku maguru. Seun Adigun wari uhagarariye igihugu mu 2018 yatwaye ibendera ry'igihugu mu muhango wo gutangiza. Adigun yari mumikino nkumuganga wikipe. Kuri ubu, Samuel Ikpefan niwe utwara ibendera mu birori byo gusoza amarushanwa. \nAbakinnyi.\nUrutonde rwumubare wabanywanyi bitabira imikino kuri buri mukino.\nKwiruka hakurya y'umupaka.\nMu kubahiriza ibipimo fatizo byujuje ibisabwa, Nijeriya yujuje ibyangombwa byo gusiganwa ku magare. Ibi bizerekana igihugu cya mbere mu mikino Olempike. Samuel Ikpefan azahagararira igihugu mumikino. Ikpefan, umukinnyi w\u2019umukino wo gusiganwa ku magare w\u2019Abafaransa, yahisemo guhagararira igihugu cya se yavukiyemo muri shampiyona yisi.\nIkpefan yitabiriye imikino ibiri. Mu irushanwa rye rya mbere, isiganwa ryabagabo, Ikpefan yagize umwanya wa 3: 09.57 kugirango arangize umwanya wa 73 muri 88 bahanganye, ananirwa gukomeza mu cyiciro gikurikira."}
{"id": "15168", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15168", "title": "Nijeriya mu mikino ya bavuga i Cyogereza 2022", "text": "Nijeriya yitabiriye imikino ya huzaga ibihugu bivuga icyongereza muri 2022 yabereye i Birmingham mu Bwongereza kuva ku ya 28 Nyakanga kugeza 8 Kanama 2022. Ni ku nshuro ya 15 Nigeriya ikina mu mikino ya bavuga icyongereza. \nNnamdi Chinecherem na Folashade Oluwafemiayo nibo batwaye ibendera ryi gihugu mugihe cyo gutangiza amarushanwa. \nAbakinnyi.\nUrutonde rwumubare wabakinnyi bitabira imikino kuri buri mukino.\nImyitozo ngororamubiri.\nGukurikirana inzira n'ibikorwa byo mumuhanda\nJido.\nAmakipe abiri ya jido yinjiye guhera ku ya 8 Nyakanga 2022. \nUmukino wa tennis.\nNijeriya yujuje ibyiciro bya ITTF ku rutonde rw'amakipe (guhera ku ya 2 Mutarama 2020). Abakinnyi umunani batoranijwe ku ya 8 Nyakanga 2022. \nKuzamura ibiro.\nKugeza ku ya 16 Werurwe 2022, abaterura ibiro icyenda (abagabo babiri, abagore barindwi) bemerewe guhatana.\nStella Kingsley, Adijat Olarinoye, Rafiatu Folashade Lawal na Joy Ogbonne Eze begukanye zahabu mu marushanwa ya 2021 ya Commonwealth yo guterura ibiremereye yabereye i Tashkent, muri Uzubekisitani. Batanu basigaye bujuje ibisabwa binyuze ku rutonde rwa IWF Commonwealth Ranking Urutonde, rwarangiye ku ya 9 Werurwe 2022.\nUrugamba.\nTemplate:Smalldiv"}
{"id": "15169", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15169", "title": "Shampiyona yigihugu", "text": "Shampiyona yi gihugu nicyo cyagezweho cyane muri siporo cyangwa amarushanwa ayo ari yo yose mu ikipe yi gihugu cyangwa imbere mu gihugu. Umutwe wacyo akenshi ufatwa nki rushanwa, sisitemu yo ku rutonde, ingano, ubushobozi, n'ibindi. Ibi bigena ishyirahamwe ryiza, umuntu umwe (cyangwa ikindi kigo) mu gihugu kimwe no mu bindi bice. Inshuro nyinshi, gukoresha ijambo igikombe cyangwa amarushanwa ni uguhitamo amagambo uzaba uwambere. "}
{"id": "15170", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15170", "title": "Jon Kent (umukinnyi)", "text": "Jon Carter Kent (wavutse ku ya 7 Gicurasi 1979) ni umukinnyi wa ruhago ukomoka muri Afurika yepfo. Yakinnye imikino ibiri umunsi umwe mu 2002. Yasezeye mu mukino wa Cricket mu mwaka wa 2011 nyuma yo gukurwa mu masezerano yi kipe ya Cricket ya Dolphins. "}
{"id": "15171", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15171", "title": "Gemma Acheampong", "text": "Gemma Acheampong (wavutse ku ya 13 Gashyantare 1993) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga uvuka muri Ganaufite ubwenegihugu bwa merika akaba ari kabuhariwe mu gusiganwa ku maguru. Afite agahigo muri Gana mu marushanwa atandukanye mu guhatanira metero 300 mu nzu, yahagarariye Gana mu kwiruka metero 4 \u00d7 100 mu mikino Olempike yabereye i Rio de Janeiro muri 2016. \nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nHanze\nMu nzu"}
{"id": "15172", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15172", "title": "George Acquaah", "text": "George Wilson Acquaah (3 Ukwakira 1925 - 18 Ukuboza 1963) yari umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru wari wara bigize umwuga wa komokaga muri Gana witabiriye imikino Olempike 1952.\nMu 1952, George Acquaah yagaragaye nk'umwe mu bakinnyi barindwi bitabiriye Gold Coast mu mikino Olempike yaberaga mu murwa mukuru wa Finlande Helsinki. Mu bushyuhe bwa karindwi mu kwiruka metero 100 umusore wimyaka 26 yavanyweho akoresheje amasegonda 11.1 kumwanya wa gatanu. Mu bushyuhe bwa kabiri bwa metero 4 \u00d7 100 relay ikipe ya Gold Coast, hamwe na Acquaah nkuwiruka wa kabiri hamwe na Gabriel Laryea, John Owusu na Augustus Lawson, babonye umwanya wamasegonda 42.1 babashyira kumwanya wa kane, byongeye biganisha kuri an kurandura."}
{"id": "15173", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15173", "title": "James Addy", "text": "James Aryee Addy (9 Ukuboza 1939 - 26 Mata 2009) yari umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru wakomokaga muri Gana wi tabiriye imikino y'Olempike yo mu 1960, mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1964, mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1968, no mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1972. "}
{"id": "15174", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15174", "title": "Ebenezer Addy", "text": "Ebenezer Charles O. Addy (wavutse ku ya 5 Ugushyingo 1940) ni umukinyi wa bigize umwuga akaba umuhanga mu by'imibereho y'abantu bo muri Gana akaba yarahoze ari umukinnyi w\u2019imikino ngororamubiri witabiriye imikino Olempike yo mu 1964. Yashakanye na Marian Ewurama Addy, umuhanga mu binyabuzima akaba n\u2019umugore wa mbere wo muri Gana wageze ku ntera y\u2019umwarimu wuzuye w\u2019ubumenyi bw\u2019ibinyabuzima. "}
{"id": "15175", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15175", "title": "Mercy Addy", "text": "Mercy Addy (wavutse 7 Gicurasi 1964) ni umukinnyi wa siporo wo muri Gana kabuhariwe muri metero 400.\nIgihe cye cyiza ni amasegonda 51.0 (igihe cyagenwe), yageze mu Kwakira 1989 i Accra. Ubu ni inyandiko ya Gana. Yari afite amasegonda 52.08 hamwe nigihe cya elegitoroniki."}
{"id": "15176", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15176", "title": "Daniel Adomako", "text": "Daniel Adomako (wavutse 24 Ukuboza 1979) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru wabigize umwuga muri Gana. Yarushanwe mu kwiruka metero 4 \u00d7 400 mu mikino Olempike yabaye mu 2000. "}
{"id": "15177", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15177", "title": "Hannah Afriyie", "text": "Hannah Afriyie (wavutse ku ya 21 Ukuboza 1951) ni umukinnyi wi mikino wa bigize umwuga ukina imikino ngororamubiri wo muri Gana. Yatsindiye imidari ibiri ya zahabu mu kwiruka metero 100 na 200 mu mikino yo muri Afurika yo mu 1978 yabereye muri Algiers.\nAfriyie yageze muri kimwe cya kane kirangiza metero 100 na metero 200 mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1972. \nMu mikino yo muri Afurika y\u2019iburengerazuba 1977 yabereye i Lagos, yegukanye umudari wa silver muri metero 100. "}
{"id": "15178", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15178", "title": "Albert Agyemang", "text": "Albert Agyemang (wavutse ku ya 4 Ukwakira 1977) ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga wo gusiganwa ku maguru ukomoka muri Gana wasezeye ajya mu cyiruhuko cyi zabukuru yari kabuhariwe muri metero 200.\nYitabiriye imikino ibiri ya Olempike, mu 1996 na 2000.\nIgihe cye cyiza ni amasegonda 20.64, yagezweho muri Nyakanga 1999 i Tampere. Kugeza ubu inyandiko yo muri Gana ni iya Emmanuel Tuffour n'amasegonda 20.15. "}
{"id": "15179", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15179", "title": "Michael Ahey", "text": "Michael Kofi Ahey (wavutse ku ya 22 Ugushyingo 1939) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga wakomokaga muri Gana, yirukankaga muri metero ndende nka Marato, yahatanye mu 1964 mu mpeshyi, yongera mu 1968 nabwo mumpeshyi, yongera kugaruka na one mu mpeshyi yo 1972."}
{"id": "15180", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15180", "title": "Eric Akogyiram", "text": "Eric Akogyiram (wavutse ku ya 25 Kamena 1969) ni umukinnyi wa siporo wari warabigize uwmuga wakomokaga muri Gana wasezeye ari mu cyiruhuko cyi zabukuru yari kabuhariwe mu kwiruka muri metero 100.\nYatsindiye umudari wa feza mu mikino yo muri Afurika yo mu 1987. Muri uwo mwaka yitabiriye amarushanwa y'isi yo mu 1987, agera muri kimwe cya kabiri hamwe n'ikipe ya relay. Yitabiriye kandi imikino Olempike yo mu 1992.\nIgihe cye cyiza ni amasegonda 10.23, yagezweho muri Mata 1990 muri Provo. "}
{"id": "15182", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15182", "title": "Mavis Akoto", "text": "Mavis Akoto (wavutse 22 Werurwe 1978) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguro wa bigize umwuga ukomoka muri Gana. Yitabiriye amarushanwa ya metero 4 \u00d7 100 mu bagore mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2000. "}
{"id": "15183", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15183", "title": "Ahmed Ali (football Gana)", "text": "Ahmed Ali (wavutse 15 Ukwakira 1972) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru wabigize umwuga ukomoka muri Gana. Yarushanwe mu kwiruka metero 4 \u00d7 400 mu bagore mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1996. "}
{"id": "15184", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15184", "title": "Alex Amankwah", "text": "Alex Amankwah (wavutse ku ya 2 Werurwe 1992) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Gana wiruka hagati muri metero 800. Yize kaminuza yitabira imikino ngororamubiri muri kaminuza ya Alabama, aho yaciye agahigo ku ishuri yari mu Ikipe ya mbere y'Abanyamerika muri metero 800. Yujuje metero 800 mu marushanwa y'isi ya 2015 yabereye i Beijing mu Bushinwa ariko ntiyabasha gukina kubera ikibazo cya viza. Yahagarariye Gana mu kwiruka metero 4 \u00d7 400 mu mikino nyafurika ya 2015. \nAmankwah yaserukiye Gana muri metero 800 mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2016 yabereye i Rio de Janeiro, muri Burezili. \nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nHanze\nMu nzu"}
{"id": "15185", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15185", "title": "Salomo Amegatcher", "text": "Solomon Amegatcher (wavutse ku ya 20 Ukuboza 1970) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru muri muri Gana wasezeye ubu uri mukiruhuko cyi zabukuru yari kabuhariwe muri metero 400.\nYageze muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza mu marushanwa y\u2019isi yo mu 1993, anitabira imikino Olempike yo mu 1992 na 1996.\nIbihe bye byiza cyane ni amasegonda 45.42 muri metero 400 n'amasegonda 21.15 muri metero 200, byombi byagezweho muri 1993. Amegatcher yafatanije na Gana muri metero 4 x 400 ya metero 3: 05.2 yatangiye kuva 1992 kugeza 2015. \nMuri kaminuza, Amegatcher yabaye NCAA inshuro 3 zose Umunyamerika kuri Alabama Crimson Tide muri metero 400 na metero 4 x 400, kandi yitabira gushyira amateka yishuri ryimbere muri metero 4X400 ya metero 3: 08.03 muri kaminuza. ya Alabama mu 1993 yakomeje kugeza mu 2006.\nNi umunyeshuri mu ishuri rya Mutagatifu Yohani, Sekondi"}
{"id": "15186", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15186", "title": "John Ametepey", "text": "John Ametepey (wavutse ku ya 25 Ukuboza 1938) ni umukinnyi wiruka na maguru akaba yarabigize umwuga ukomoka muri Gana wiruka hagati mu mukino. Yitabiriye metero 800 mu bagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1968. "}
{"id": "15187", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15187", "title": "Eric Amevor", "text": "Eric Amevor (yavutse ku ya 16 Mata 1938) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga wumunya Gana wiruka hagati muri Marato. Yitabiriye metero 1500 mu bagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1964. "}
{"id": "15188", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15188", "title": "Johnson Amoah", "text": "Johnson O. Amoah (wavutse 15 Kanama 1940) ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga ukomoka muri Gana. Yitabiriye imikino itatu yo gusimbuka mu bagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1968 na Olempike yo mu 1972. "}
{"id": "15189", "revid": "19167", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15189", "title": "Joseph Amoah (kwiruka)", "text": "Joseph Paul Amoah (wavutse ku ya 12 Mutarama 1997) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru ukomoka muri Gana kabuhariwe muri metero 100 na metero 200. Yitabiriye amarushanwa yi mikino ngororamubiri muri 2019 muri metero 100 na metero 4x100, na muri Shampiyona nyafurika ya 2019 yegukana umudali wa zahabu muri Metero 100. Yabaye uwa kane muri metero 100 muri Shampiyona nyafurika ya 2019.\nAmoah afite ibihe byiza byamasegonda 9.94 namasegonda 20.08 muri 100m na 200m. Ubutwari bwe mu kwiruka metero 200 bwarangije amateka ya Gana na Emmanuel Tuffour bari bayifashe inshuro eshatu mbere n'amasegonda 0.07. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nAmoah yavutse ku ya 12 Mutarama 1997 avuka kuri Thomas Amoah na Alberta Antwi i Greater Accra, muri Gana, arerwa na nyirarume Dr. Victor Antwi kuva mu mashuri yisumbuye. Siporo yakundaga gukura ni umupira w'amaguru, ariko yerekeje muri siporo ubwo yiga muri Prempeh College i Kumasi ahavumbuwe impano ye yo kwiruka. Afite imyaka 19, yagaragaye nkuwizeye imikino Olempike kuri Gana muri metero 100 akoresheje amasegonda 10.08 muri Shampiyona yabagabo ya Gana 2016. "}
{"id": "15190", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15190", "title": "William Amakye", "text": "Wilson William Amakye (wavutse 25 Nzeri 1958) ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga ukina hagati mu biruka ukomoka muri Gana. Yarushanwe muri metero 800 mu bagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1984. "}
{"id": "15191", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15191", "title": "Seth Amo", "text": "Seth Amoo (yavutse ku ya 20 Werurwe 1983) ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga mu gusiganwa ku maguru ukomoka muri Gana kabuhariwe muri metero 200 \nAmoo yaserukiye Gana mu mikino yo mu mpeshyi ya 2008 yabereye i Beijing. Yarushanwe mu kwiruka metero 200, aza ku mwanya wa kane mu cyiciro cya mbere cy'ubushyuhe mu masegonda 20.91, ntibyari bihagije kugira ngo akomeze mu cyiciro cya kabiri. "}
{"id": "15192", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15192", "title": "Yohana Ampoma", "text": "John Ampomah (yavutse ku ya 11 Nyakanga 1990) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga akaba umuterankunga uvuka i Konongo muri Gana. Ubu yiga muri kaminuza ya Leta ya Tennessee yo hagati kandi ari mu itsinda risiganwa rya Kaminuza.\nAmpomah yari ahagarariye Gana mu mikino yo mu mpeshyi ya 2016 yabereye i Rio de Janeiro, muri Burezili. Ni kapiteni w'ikipe ya Gana i Rio.\nImpano.\nSWAG Umugabo: 2012, 2015 \nAbakinnyi ba Gana-Etiyopiya y'indege 2015 "}
{"id": "15193", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15193", "title": "Janet Amponsah", "text": "Janet Amponsah (yavutse ku ya 12 Mata 1993) ni umukinnyi w\u2019umugore wabigize umwuga ukomoka muri Gana. Yahagarariye igihugu cye mu gikombe cyisi mu 2013 ntiyageze muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza. Yatsindiye umudari muri metero 4 \u00d7 100 muri Shampiyona ebyiri nyafurika no mu mikino ya bavuga icyongereza muri 2010. Yatoranijwe nk'utwaje ibendera rya Gana mu muhango wo gutangiza imikino ya bavuga icyongereza muri 2014, kandi yatowe nk'umukinnyi witwaye neza muri Gana muri 2015. Ntabwo yagize amahirwe yo kwitabira igikombe cyisi cyabereye mu Bushinwa mu 2015, biturutse ku bibazo yari afite cya viza ye. Mu mikino Olempike ya 2016, yitabiriye metero 200 na metero 100. \nYaje ku mwanya wa kabiri nyuma ya Cote d'Ivoire Marie Josee Ta Louat muri metero 100 mu bagore mu marushanwa y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri muri Afurika 2018 yabereye Asaba, muri Nijeriya. \nUmuntu mwiza.\nHanze\nMu nzu"}
{"id": "15194", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15194", "title": "Kenneth Andam", "text": "Kenneth Ekow Andam (wavutse ku ya 8 Mutarama 1976) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru ukomoka muri Gana wasezeye mu marushanwa ya metero 100 mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2000 yabereye muri Ositaraliya. Andam yarushanwaga muri amerika mu gusiganwa ku maguru mu ma rushanwaga muri kaminuza.\nAmateka.\nKenneth Ekow Andam yavutse ku ya 8 Mutarama 1976. ni mwene Takoradi wo muri Gana. Ababyeyi be ni Kenneth na Janet Andam, bivugwa ko akomoka mu idini.\nImyitozo ngororamubiri.\nUmukinnyi muto.\nMu 1995, Andam yatsinze inshuro eshatu mu marushanwa y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri nyafurika yabereye i Bouak\u00e9, muri Kote Divuwari muri metero 15,63 ndetse na Shampiyona yo muri Afurika y'Iburengerazuba asimbuka i Banjul, muri Gambiya. Yashyizeho agahigo ishuro eshatu yo gusimbuka metero eshatu muri metero 16.02, umujyi uri mu majyaruguru ya Gana mu marushanwa hagati ya zone ya 1995 maze aba umukinnyi witwaye neza mu bagabo muri iryo rushanwa.\nAkazi ka kaminuza.\nAndam yize muri kaminuza aho yarushanwe mu gusiganwa ku maguru muri metero 100, metero 200, metero 4 \u00d7 100, no gusimbuka aharehare. Kugeza mu mwaka wa 2012, afite amanota meza mbere kuri muri buri gikorwa, harimo amateka y\u2019ishuri mu marushanwa ya 4 \u00d7 100 yashyizweho mu 1999 hamwe n\u2019umunyakanada Lewonarido amasegonda 38.88. Andam iri ku mwanya wa gatatu kurutonde rwi bihe byose inyuma ya Frank Frederick na Myles-Mills, naho uwa gatatu inyuma ya Frederick na Oluyemi Kayode.\nYahawe Andam ni ibihembo by\u2019Iburengerazuba, harimo n\u2019umwaka wa mbere w\u2019umwaka haba mu nzu ndetse no hanze, igihembo cy\u2019imisozi y\u2019iburengerazuba hamwe n\u2019imikino ngororamubiri hamwe n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019imikino ngororamubiri ry\u2019igihugu Icyubahiro cy\u2019Abanyamerika. Kuva mu mwaka wa 2011, afite agahigo y'ibihe byose bya mumisozi muri metero 60 na metero 200, no hanze metero 100 na metero 200. \nMu 1999, Andam yabaye uwa 11 mu gihugu muri metero 100 na 7 muri metero 200 kandi yabaye u wa mbere mu gusimbuka birebire na 4 X 100. yakomeretse ubwo yamanukaga ntiyabasha kwitabira isiganwa rya metero 60 na 20. Mu marushanwa ya NCAA yo mu 1999 yaberaga hanze yaberaga i Boise, muri Idaho, yazamutse hamwe na Myles-Mills kugera muri kimwe cya kabiri cya metero 200 ndetse n\u2019ikipe ya 4 X 100 iri ku mwanya wa mbere mu gihugu, yujuje ibisabwa ku mukino wa nyuma.. hamwe no muri kimwe cya kabili yihuta cyane. Andam yakomeretse mbere yumukino wanyuma, kandi ikipe ya yarangije iza ku mwanya wa gatatu mu gihugu.\nAndam yakomeretse ukuguru kwavunitse muri Mutarama 2000, ariko akira gukina umukino wamuhesheje inshuro ebyiri umusozi wa West West Conference Abagabo Hanze Hanze Yumukino wumukinnyi wicyumweru. Muri icyo gihembwe, yabaye nyampinga wa MWC muri metero 100 na 200, kandi yujuje ibisabwa muri metero 100 na 4 X 100 mu marushanwa ya NCAA yo mu 2000 yo hanze no mu murima yabereye i Durham, muri Karoline y'Amajyaruguru.\nAmarushanwa mpuzamahanga.\nMu 1999, Andam yaserukiye Gana muri metero 200 mu marushanwa y'isi yabereye i Seville muri Espanye mu 1999. Yarangije ku mwanya wa gatandatu mu bushyuhe bwe bwa mbere (amasegonda 21.31) ananirwa gukomeza muri kimwe cya kabiri. Mu mwaka wa 2000 mu gikombe cy\u2019Afurika cy\u2019ibihugu byabereye muri Alijeriya, Andam yegukanye umudari wa bronze muri metero 100 (amasegonda 10.33) n\u2019umudari wa zahabu mu ikipe ya Gana ya 4 \u00d7 100 (amasegonda 39.90). Mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2000 yabereye i Sydney, yaserukiye Gana muri 4 X 100; ariko, ikipe ye yananiwe kurangiza ishyushye rya play off. Andam kandi yitabiriye metero 100 muri Shampiyona y'isi 2001 yabereye i Edmonton, muri Kanada. Mu bushyuhe bwe bwa mbere, yarangije umwanya wa gatatu muri 10.40 kugirango abone itike yo kujya muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza. Muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza, Andam ntiyigeze yitabira amarushanwa, arangiza ari uwa kane n'amanota 10.26."}
{"id": "15195", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15195", "title": "Vida Anim", "text": "Vida Anim (wavutse ku ya 7 Ukuboza 1983) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru uvuka muri Greater Accra muri Gana uzobereye muri metero 100 na 200. Hamwe na Mavis Akoto, Monica Twum na Vida Nsiah, afite rekodi yo muri Gana mu kwiruka metero 4x100 akoresheje amasegonda 43.19, ibyo bikaba byagezweho mu gihe cy'amarushanwa mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2000 yabereye i Sydney. "}
{"id": "15196", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15196", "title": "Stanley Allotey", "text": "Stanley Fabian Allotey (an haife shi a ranar 14 ga watan Nuwamba 1942) tsohon \u0257an wasan tsere ne na Ghana wanda ya fafata a gasar Olympics ta bazara ta shekarar 1964. Allotey ya kai wasan daf da na kusa da karshe a tseren mita 100 na maza, ta hanyar kammala na biyu a cikin zafinsa, amma ya kasa ci gaba. Har ila yau, ya kasance memba a tawagar 'yan wasan Ghana na gudun mita 4x100, wanda aka fitar da shi a wasan kusa da na karshe. A 1966 daular Burtaniya da wasannin Commonwealth ya lashe lambobin zinare biyu, a cikin yadi 220 da tseren yadi 4x110."}
{"id": "15197", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15197", "title": "Alice Annum", "text": "Alice Annum (wavutse 20 Ukwakira 1948) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga wo gusiganwa ku maguru uvuka i Accra muri Gana. Ibihe byiza yagize ni mu kwiruka metero 200 akoresha amasegonda 22.89, yageze mu mikino Olempike yabereye i Munich 1972. Niwe mugore wa mbere uhagarariye Gana mu mikino Olempike. Kuva icyo gihe, Alice yitabiriye imikino Olempike yo mu 1964 yabereye i Tokiyo, 1968 muri Mexico ndetse na Olempike yo mu 1972 yabereye i Munich. \nUbuzima bwite.\nAlice afite abana 3. "}
{"id": "15198", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15198", "title": "Martha Appiah", "text": "Martha Appiah (wavutse ku ya 19 Ukuboza 1965) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa na maguru muri Gana. Yitabiriye amarushanwa ya metero 4 \u00d7 100 mu bagore mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1987 yabereye kuri Sitade ya Olimpico, i Roma. Yarushanwe muri metero 4x400 mu 1984 muri i Losangeles. \nIhuza ryo hanze.\nMartha Appiya mumikino ngororamubiri yisi Martha Appiya mumikino ngororamubiri yisi Martha Appiya mumikino olempike.com Martha Appiya muri Olympia."}
{"id": "15200", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15200", "title": "Grace Armah", "text": "Grace Armah (wavutse ku ya 22 Nzeri 1958) ni umukinnyi imikino ngororamubiri ukomoka muri Gana wazobereye muri metero 100 no kwiruka birebire muri Marato. Yatsindiye umudari wa feza n'umudari wa bronze mu marushanwa ya Afurika yo mu 1984 na 1985. Ibihe byiza yabigize muri metero 100 byari amasegonda 11.98. Yarushanwe kandi muri Gana mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1984 yabereye i Losangeles mu rwego rwo gusiganwa metero 4 \u00d7 100 mu ikipe y\u2019abagore, yarangije ku mwanya wa 5 muri kimwe cya kabiri akananirwa gukomeza mu cyiciro cya nyuma. "}
{"id": "15201", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15201", "title": "John Asare-Antwi", "text": "John Asare-Antwi (wavutse 28 Ugushyingo 1935) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ukomoka muri Gana wabigize umwuga. Yitabiriye metero 400 mu bagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1960. "}
{"id": "15202", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15202", "title": "Philip Attipoe", "text": "Philip Attipoe (yavutse ku ya 23 Gashyantare 1963) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa wabigize umwuga ukomoka muri Gana. Yitabiriye metero 100 mu bagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1984. "}
{"id": "15203", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15203", "title": "Mark Anthony Awere", "text": "Mark Anthony Awere (wavutse ku ya 16 Nyakanga 1971) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga ukomoka muri Gana akaba akora umukino wa gusimbuka.\nYatsindiye imidari ya bronze muri Shampiyona nyafurika yo mu 1998 ndetse n\u2019imikino yo muri Afurika yo mu 1999. Yitabiriye kandi imikino Olempike 2000.\nGusimbuka kwe ku giti cye ni metero 8.04, yagezweho muri Kamena 1999 i Bad Langensalza.\nMuri 2003, Awere yipimishije neza muri doping muri Mulhouse. Yabujijwe amezi atatu. "}
{"id": "15204", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15204", "title": "Benjamin Azamati", "text": "Benjamin Azamati-Kwaku (wavutse 14 Mutarama 1998) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga wo gusiganwa ku maguru ukomoka muri Gana, ubu uhatanira ASICiSi Globali.\nYakoze amateka mu guca amateka y\u2019imyaka 22 y\u2019igihugu yari afite Leo Myles Mills ku ya 26 Werurwe 2021 i Texas akoresheje amasegonda 9.97 kugira ngo abashe kujya mu mikino Olempike izabera i Tokiyo. \nMinisitiri w\u2019imikino, Mustafa Ussif na Dr Bella Bello Bitugu, umuyobozi w\u2019ubuyobozi bwa siporo muri kaminuza ya Gana, bashimye Benjamin Azamati ku bikorwa by\u2019igihugu. \nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\nAzamati yavutse ku ya 14 Mutarama 1998 na John na Faustina Azamati i Akim oda, muri Gana. \u00a0\nImikino yakundaga gukura ni umupira wamaguru, ariko yimukira muri siporo ubwo yiga mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Presbyterian Boys i Accra aho impano ye yo kwiruka yavumbuwe na ba shebuja ba PE (Nathaniel Botchway, Gideon Dukplah na Kofi Dadzie). \u00a0"}
{"id": "15205", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15205", "title": "Grace Bakari", "text": "Grace Bakari (wavutse ku ya 27 Mata 1954) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa wabigize umwuga ukomoka mu gihugu cya Gana. Yitabiriye amarushanwa ya metero 4 \u00d7 400 mu bagore mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1984. "}
{"id": "15206", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15206", "title": "Veronica Bawuah", "text": "Veronica Bawuah (wavutse 5 Ukuboza 1967) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru wabigize umwuga ukomoka muri Gana. Yarushanwe muri metero 4 \u00d7 100 mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1988 na Olempike yo mu 2000. "}
{"id": "15207", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15207", "title": "Christiana Boateng (umukinnyi)", "text": "Christiana Boateng (wavutse ku ya 24 Gashyantare 1943) yari umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ukomoka itariki y'urupfu rutazwi muri Gana. Yitabiriye metero 100 mu bagore mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1964. "}
{"id": "15208", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15208", "title": "Frank Boateng (umukinnyi)", "text": "Frank Boateng (wavutse ku ya 11 Gicurasi 1974) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa oinzitizi yo muri Gana. Yarushanwe mu kwiruka metero 110 mu bagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1996. "}
{"id": "15209", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15209", "title": "Bonfils-Caleb Bimenyimana", "text": "yavutse ku ya 21 Ugushyingo 1997, ni umukinnyi w\u2019umupira wamaguru wabigize umwuga ukina nkumukinnyi ukinira ikipe ya Kaizer Chiefs yo muri Afurika yepfo ndetse n\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu y\u2019Uburundi.\nUmwuga.\nBimenyimana yari yinjiye mu ikipe ya FK Pohronie yo muri Silovakiya Super Liga hagati muri Kanama 2020, nyuma y\u2019abaskuti bamaze igihe kinini muri iyi kipe. Yasinyanye na \u017diar nad club ikorera muri Hronom imyaka ibiri. Yatangiye umukino wa mbere muri \u0160tadi\u00f3n Antona Malatinsk\u00e9ho ku ya 15 Kanama 2020 atangira kunganya na Spartak Trnava igitego 1-1. Trnava yafashe iya mbere mu minota icumi ibanza binyuze kuri Gergely Tumma mbere yuko Bimenyimana anganya amanota maze ashyira umukino wa nyuma kuri 1-1 nyuma y'isaha imwe yo gukina.\nYatsinze kandi umukino ukurikira ku ya 22 Kanama 2020, atsinze urugo rwatsinzwe na \u017dilina. Yatsinze igitego cyo gutsinda ibitego 2\u20131 mugice cya mbere mbere yuko asimburwa na Patrik Abrah\u00e1m, kubera imvune, nyuma yiminota 40. Igice cya kabiri, Patrik I\u013eko yanganyije ariko Pohronie yongeye gutsinda maze atsinda intsinzi binyuze kuri Alieu Fadera. Yatsinze igitego cye cya nyuma muri shampiyona yanganyije na iClinic Sere\u010f ibitego 2-2 ku ya 19 Nzeri ndetse n\u2019ibindi bitego bibiri iminsi itatu mbere yaberaga mu gikombe cyahuje FK Ra\u010da.\nNyuma yibi, Bimenyimana yari yananiwe gutsinda igitego mumikino icyenda yakurikiyeho maze ava muri iyo kipe muri Mutarama 2021. "}
{"id": "15210", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15210", "title": "Onana Essomba Willy L\u00e9andre", "text": "Alphonce wotowoto he is the best player currently signed under Simba sc in Tanzania\nUmwuga.\nMu mpeshyi ya 2021 yaje mu igeragezwa mu ikipe ya Rayon sport ndetse ahita aritsinda. Ubu akaba amaze imyaka ibiri muri shampiyona y'u Rwanda. Ni umukinnyi ngenderwaho muri Rayon sport aho amaze gutsinda ibitego 10 mumwaka wimikino wa 2022/2023 ndetse akaba yitezweho no gutsinda ibindi byinshi."}
{"id": "15211", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15211", "title": "Chama", "text": "Clatous Chama (wavutse 18 kamena 1991) numupira wamaguru wumupira wamaguru wa Zambiya ukina nkumukinnyi wo hagati utera Simba SC hamwe nikipe yigihugu ya Zambiya. Azwiho gutsinda ibitego, gukina, kuyobora, gufata ibihano nigipimo cyakazi.\nUmwuga wa club.\nChama yafashije ZESCO United FC kugera muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza muri CAF Champions League mbere yo gusinyana amasezerano yimyaka 3 n\u2019ikipe ya Al Ittihad yo mu Misiri. Icyakora, muri Gashyantare 2017, yavuye muri iyo kipe mbere yo kugaragara ku mugaragaro. Chama yakiniye Lusaka Dynamos FC mbere yo kwinjira muri Simba SC ya Tanzaniya muri 2018. \n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo urutonde rwa Zambiya ibitego byambere.\" "}
{"id": "15212", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15212", "title": "Vincent Enyeama", "text": "Vincent Enyeama (wavutse 29 Kanama 1982) numunyanijeriya wahoze akina umupira wamaguru wabigize umwuga wakinnye nkumuzamu. Nubwo afite uburebure buri munsi yikigereranyo kumuzamu, azwi cyane nkumwe mubazamu bakomeye bo muri Afrika mubihe byose ndetse no mubihe bye.\nMu buzima bwe bukuru, bumaze hafi imyaka 20, Enyeama yakiniye Ibom Stars, Enyimba, Iwuanyanwu Nationale, Bnei Yehuda, Hapoel Tel Aviv, Lille na Maccabi Tel Aviv. Yabaye kandi umwe mu bagize ikipe y'igihugu ya Nijeriya kuva mu 2002 kugeza mu Kwakira 2015, aba kapiteni wacyo kuva mu 2013 kugeza asezeye mu mupira w'amaguru mpuzamahanga mu 2015. Afite imipira 101, yari umukinnyi wafashwe cyane muri Nijeriya kugeza mu Gushyingo 2021 ubwo yarengwaga na Ahmed Musa."}
{"id": "15213", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15213", "title": "Pape Ousmane Sakho", "text": "Pape Ousmane Sakho ni umunya senegali wavuyse 21 ukuboza 2021 akaba akinira ikipe ya Quevilly-Rouen M\u00e9tropole.\nSakho azwi cyane kubushobozi afite bwo kuguma hamwe numupira, kwambuka, ariko kandi atsinda ibitego, Ku kibuga ikina nkibaba ryibumoso kandi rimwe na rimwe rishobora kugaragara iburyo."}
{"id": "15214", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15214", "title": "Moses Phiri", "text": "Moses Phiri (wavutse ku ya 3 Kamena 1993) ni umukinnyi wumupira wamaguru wa Zambiya ukinira Simba muri Tanzaniya.\nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga we muri Segunda Liga muri Acad\u00e9mico de Viseu ku ya 21 Gashyantare 2016 mu mukino yakinnye na Famalic\u00e3o."}
{"id": "15215", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15215", "title": "Ingaruka ku bidukikije ku buhinzi n'inyamaswa", "text": "Ingaruka ku bidukikije ku buhinzi bw\u2019inyamanswa ziratandukanye kubera ibikorwa bitandukanye by\u2019ubuhinzi bikoreshwa ku isi. Nubwo bimeze gurtyo, ibikorwa byose byu buhinzi bya garagaye ko bifite ingaruka zitandukanye ku bidukikije. Ubuhinzi bw\u2019inyamaswa, umusaruro w\u2019inyama bushobora gutera umwanda, ibyuka bihumanya ikirere, gutakaza urusobe rwi binyabuzima, indwara, no gukoresha cyane ubutaka, ibiryo, n\u2019amazi. Inyama ziboneka hakoreshejwe uburyo butandukanye, harimo ubuhinzi-mwimerere, ubuhinzi bw\u2019ubuntu, umusaruro w\u2019amatungo menshi hamwe n\u2019ubuhinzi butunzwe. Urwego rw\u2019ubworozi rurimo kandi ubwoya, n\u2019amagi n\u2019amata, amatungo akoreshwa mu guhinga, no korora amafi."}
{"id": "15216", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15216", "title": "Amazi yo guhinga", "text": "Amazi yo mu murima, azwi kandi nk'amazi yo mu buhinzi, ni amazi yi yemeje gukoreshwa mu gukora ibiribwa no gukusanya andi ma soko. Muri Amerika, hafi 80% by'amazi meza yakuwe mu nzuzi n'amazi yo mu butaka akoreshwa mu gutanga ibiribwa n'ibindi bicuruzwa bikomoka ku buhinzi. Amazi yo mu murima ashobora kuba arimo amazi akoreshwa mu kuhira imyaka cyangwa kuvomera amatungo."}
{"id": "15217", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15217", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Fuquene", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Fuquene ni ikiyaga kimeze nk'umutima giherereye mu kibaya cya Ubat\u00e9 muri Chiquinquira, igice cya Altiplano Cundiboyacense, mu majyaruguru ya Cundinamarca, muri Kolombiya, ku mupaka na Boyaca. Ikiyaga cya Andean, kiri butumburuke bwa metero 2,540, yafatwaga nk'uwera mu idini rya Muisca yari atuye muri ako gace mbere yuko Abesipanyoli bigarurira uyu mujyi wa Muisca mu myaka 1530. "}
{"id": "15218", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15218", "title": "Overdrafting", "text": "Kurenza urugero ni inzira yo kuvoma amazi ku butaka uyashyira hejuru yi bihingwa ugakoresha aringaniye mu kuvomerera. Amazi yo kuvomerera ni imwe mu masoko manini y\u2019amazi meza kandi aboneka mu nsi. Kugabanuka kw'amazi yo kuvomerera kugereranywa na konti ya banki ikuramo amafaranga menshi kuruta kubitsa. Impamvu nyamukuru itera amazi yubutaka kugabanuka ni ugupompa cyane amazi yubutaka hejuru yimigezi yo munsi."}
{"id": "15219", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15219", "title": "Ingaruka mbonezamubano n\u2019ibidukikije byamavuta yintoki", "text": "Amavuta yi ntoki, akomoka mu mikindo ya mavuta, ni soko ry'ibanze ry'injiza abahinzi benshi bo muri Aziya yepfo, Afrika yo hagati n'uburengerazuba, na Amerika yo hagati. Ikoreshwa mu gihugu nk'amavuta yo guteka, yoherezwa hanze kugirango ikoreshwe mu biribwa byinshi by ubucuruzi n'ibicuruzwa byita ku muntu kandi bihindurwamo ibinyabuzima. Itanga amavuta agera ku inshuro 10 kukurenza soya, cyangwa kungufu cyangwa izuba. "}
{"id": "15220", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15220", "title": "Peak farmland", "text": "Ubutaka bwo mu mpinga ni ubutaka bushobora gukoreshwa mu guhinga ibihingwa bitandukanye nibwo bwitwa ubutaka bw\u2019ubuhinzi, mu karere runaka (nk'igihugu cyangwa isi yose). Abashyigikiye igitekerezo cy\u2019imirima y\u2019ubuhinzi bavuga ko n\u2019ubwo umubare w\u2019abatuye isi ugenda wiyongera, hakenerwa ubutaka bwinshi bwo guhinga, kubera ko umusaruro w\u2019ibiribwa kuri hegitari imwe y\u2019ubutaka bwiyongera cyane kuruta uko isi ikenera ibiribwa. Ibi bishyigikiwe nuko agace keguriwe imirima mubihugu bimwe, byombi byateye imbere (urugero Finlande) no gutera imbere (urugero Ubuhinde, Ubushinwa), byatangiye kugabanuka. Ku isi hose, mu gihe umubare rusange w'ubutaka bwo guhingwa ukomeje kwiyongera, ubuso bw'inzuri zihoraho bwaragabanutse kuva mu 1998, byibuze hegitari miliyoni 60 ntizirirwa. Bavuga ko ibindi bihugu, nka Amerika, bifite isambu yera cyane. "}
{"id": "15222", "revid": "11899", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15222", "title": "Circle of Poison", "text": "Uruziga rw'uburozi (COP) bivuga kohereza mu mahanga imiti yica udukoko twabujijwe mugukoreshwa mu biribwa, bimwe muri byo bigaruka mu buryo bwo kubitumiza mu mahanga. \"Uruziga\" rwuzuye iyo imiti yubumara yoherejwe hanze noneho ikoreshwa muguhinga imbuto, inyama, numusaruro utumizwa mu mahanga kandi ushobora gukoreshwa no murugo. Uru ruziga rwamenyekanye bwa mbere ugereranije n\u2019Amerika bikareba umubano urebana hagati y\u2019ibindi bihugu byo ku isi y'Amajyaruguru n'Amajyepfo."}
{"id": "15223", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15223", "title": "Plasticulture", "text": "Ijambo plasticulture risobanura imyitozo yo gukoresha ibikoresho bya pulasitike mubikorwa byubuhinzi. Ibikoresho bya plastiki ubwabyo bikunze kwitwa \"ag plastike\". Plasticulture cyangwa ag plastike irimo firime ya fumigasi yubutaka, kuvomerera ibitonyanga cyangwa kuvoma, umugozi uziritseho ibihingwa bya pulasitike, inkono za pepiniyeri na bale, ariko iryo jambo rikoreshwa cyane mugusobanura ubwoko bwose bw ibiti bya plastiki cyangwa ibitwikiriye ubutaka. Ibifuniko nkibi bitangirira kuri ya pulasitike, gutwikira umurongo, tuneli ndende cyangwa ntoya, kugeza muri parike ya palastike."}
{"id": "15224", "revid": "10331", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15224", "title": "Soil compaction (agriculture)", "text": "Soil compaction cyangwa Guhuza ubutaka, bizwi nko kwangirika kwi miterere y'ubutaka, ni ubwiyongere bwubucucike bwinshi cyangwa kugabanuka ku butaka bitewe nu buremere bw'imbere cyangwa inyuma bi kubiri hejuru. Kubihuza birashobora kugira ingaruka mbi ku miterere y'umubiri, imiti n'ubuzima hamwe nu butaka. Hamwe n\u2019isuri y\u2019ubutaka, ifatwa nk'ikibazo gihenze kandi gikomeye cyane ku bidukikije cyatewe n\u2019ubuhinzi butari ubwu mwuga.\" \nIngaruka.\nIngaruka.\nUmutekano mu biribwa"}
{"id": "15226", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15226", "title": "Sustainable diet", "text": "Indyo irambye ni ibiryo bifite ingaruka nke ku bidukikije zigira uruhare mu biribwa, no kwihaza mu mirire, no mu buzima buzira umuze ku bihe bya bantu bazaza. Indyo zirambye zirinda kandi zubaha urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima, byemewe mu muco, bigezweho, ubukungu bwizewe kandi buhendutse, bihagije mu mirire, bafite umutekano, n\u2019ubuzima bwiza buzira umuze, kandi bitezimbere, umutungo kamere n\u2019abantu. \" Iyi ndyo igerageza gukemura ikibazo cyintungamubiri (imirire mibi) hamwe nibyikirengan\u2019ikirenga (umubyibuho ukabije), mu gihe harebwa ibintu by\u2019ibidukikije nk\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere, gutakaza urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima no kwangirika kw\u2019ubutaka. "}
{"id": "15227", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15227", "title": "Weed", "text": "Icyatsi ni igihingwa gifatwa nki cyifuzwa mu gihe runaka ku bwimpamvu, gikurira aho kidashaka. Igitekerezo cyi cyatsi gifite akamaro kanini mubuhinzi, aho ikigamijwe ari uguhinga ibihingwa cyangwa urwuri rwu bwoko bumwe, cyangwa kuvanga amoko make yifuzwa. Mu bidukikije, ubundi bwoko bwibimera bifatwa nkutifuzwa bityo rero urumamfu. Uretse ibyo, ibyatsi bimwe bifite imiterere itifuzwa bigatuma ibyonnyi byibimera ubisanga ahantu henshi hahurira na bantu. \nAkamaro k'ibidukikije.\nIrushanwa hamwe nibihingwa bihingwa kandi byanduye.\nMugihe ijambo \"urumamfu\" muri rusange rifite ubusobanuro bubi, ibimera byinshi bizwi nkibyatsi birashobora kugira akamaro. Ibyatsi bibi byinshi, nka dandelion (\"Taraxacum\") hamwe na kimwe cya kane cyintama biribwa, kandi amababi cyangwa imizi yabyo bishobora gukoreshwa mubiryo cyangwa imiti y'ibyatsi. Burdock isanzwe ku isi, kandi rimwe na rimwe ikoreshwa mu gukora isupu n'imiti muri Aziya y'Uburasirazuba. Ibyatsi bibi bimwe bikurura udukoko twiza, ari nako dushobora kurinda ibihingwa ibyonnyi byangiza. Ibyatsi bibi birashobora kandi gukumira udukoko twangiza udukoko kubona umusaruro, kubera ko kuboneka kwabo bihagarika ikibazo cyibimenyetso byiza udukoko dukoresha kugirango tumenye ibiryo byabo. Ibyatsi bibi birashobora kandi gukora nk \"ibimera bizima\", bitanga igifuniko cyubutaka kigabanya gutakaza ubushuhe kandi bikarinda isuri. Ibyatsi bibi birashobora kandi kuzamura uburumbuke bwubutaka; dandelion, kurugero, izana intungamubiri nka calcium na azote ziva mu butaka hamwe n\u2019umuzi wazo, kandi clover yakira bagiteri itunganya azote mu mizi yayo, ifumbira ubutaka mu buryo butaziguye. Dandelion kandi ni bumwe mu moko menshi atandukanya hardpan mu mirima ihingwa cyane, ifasha ibihingwa gukura neza mu mizi. Indabyo zimwe zo mu busitani zatangiye ari urumamfu mu murima wahinzwe kandi zororerwa guhitamo indabyo zabo cyangwa amababi akwiriye. Urugero rw'icyatsi cy'ibihingwa gihingwa mu busitani ni ibigori, (\"Agrostemma githago\"), cyari urumamfu rusanzwe mu mirima y'ingano y'i Burayi, ariko ubu rimwe na rimwe rugahingwa nk'igihingwa cy'ubusitani. \nGutatana.\nAmashakiro"}
{"id": "15228", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15228", "title": "Ihumana Rikomoka ku Ubuhinzi", "text": "Ihumana ry\u2019ubuhinzi ryerekeza ku binyabuzima biva mu buhinzi bivamo kwanduza cyangwa kwangiza ibidukikije, kandi bikomeretsa abantu n\u2019inyungu z\u2019ubukungu. Umwanda urashobora guturuka ahantu hatandukanye, uhereye kumyanda ihumanya y\u2019amazi ukagenda hamwe no gukwirakwira cyane, ku rwego rw\u2019imiterere, bizwi kandi ko bitanduye bituruka ku bidukikije ndetse n\u2019umwanda uhumanya ikirere. Iyo mwanda mu bidukikije ishobora kugira ingaruka mbi mu bidukikije, ni ukuvuga kwica inyamaswa zo muri ako gace cyangwa kwanduza amazi yo kunywa,"}
{"id": "15229", "revid": "11899", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15229", "title": "Climate resilience", "text": "Imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe isobanurwa nku bushobozi bw\u2019imibereho, ubukungu n\u2019ibidukikije kugira ngo duhangane n\u2019ibintu bishobora guteza akaga cyangwa inzara cyangwa imidugararo muri Rubanda. \u200aKubungabunga ikirere bifitanye isano n\u2019ingamba zo kurwanya imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere, Igamije kugabanya ingaruka z\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere kandi ikubiyemo gutekereza ku butababazi bw\u2019ikirere n\u2019uburinganire. Mu bikorwa bifatika harimo ibikorwa remezo byangiza ikirere, ubuhinzi bwangiza ikirere n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere. Uburyo buhari bufite intego yo gupima guhangana n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere bukoresha, hari ibisobanuro bihamye kandi bisobanutse byo guhangana n\u2019imihindagurikire yikirere, kandi bigatuma amatsinda atandukanye y\u2019abantu agereranywa hifashishijwe ibipimo bisanzwe kandi bifatika. "}
{"id": "15230", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15230", "title": "Ingaruka z\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere ku buhinzi", "text": "Ingaruka z\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere ku buhinzi zishobora gutuma umusaruro w\u2019ibihingwa ugabanuka ndetse n\u2019ubuziranenge bw'ibihigwa n'imirire bitewe n\u2019amapfa, imivumba, n\u2019umwuzure ndetse no kwiyongera kw\u2019udukoko tujya ku mwaka ndetse n\u2019indwara z\u2019ibimera. Ingaruka zikwirakwizwa ku isi ziterwa n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ubushyuhe, imvura n\u2019imiterere ya karuboni yo mu kirere bitewe n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere ku isi. Muri 2019, miliyoni zari zimaze guhura n\u2019ibura ry\u2019ibiribwa kubera imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere. Byongeye kandi, igabanuka ry\u2019umusaruro w\u2019ibihingwa ku isi ni 2% - 6% hafi buri myaka icumi. Muri 2019 byari byarahanuwe ko ibiciro by'ibiribwa bizamuka 80% muri 2050. Ibi birashoboka ko umutekano w\u2019ibiribwa wiyongera, bikagira ingaruka ku baturage batishoboye. Ubushakashatsi bwakozwe mu 2021 bwagaragaje ko ubukana bw\u2019ubushyuhe n\u2019amapfa ku musaruro w\u2019ibihingwa byikubye inshuro eshatu mu myaka 50 ishize i Burayi - kuva ku gihombo cya 2,2% mu 1964\u20131990 kugeza ku gihombo cya 7.3% muri 1991 kugeza2015. "}
{"id": "15231", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15231", "title": "Ifumbire", "text": "Ifumbire ni ikintu icyo ari cyo cyose gikomoka ku miterere karemano cyangwa y\u2019ubukorikori gikoreshwa mu butaka cyangwa mu bihingwa kugira ngo bitange intungamubiri z\u2019ibimera. Ifumbire irashobora gutandukana nu butaka butagira intungamubiri. Inkomoko nyinshi yifumbire ibaho, yaba ka remano cyangwa inganda. Kubikorwa byinshi byubuhinzi bugezweho, ifumbire yibanda ku ntungamubiri eshatu zingenzi: azote (N), fosifore (P), na potasiyumu (K) hiyongereyeho inyongeramusaruro nkifu yurutare kuri micronutrients. Abahinzi bakoresha iyi fumbire muburyo butandukanye: binyuze mumashanyarazi yumye cyangwa pelletised cyangwa yamazi, bakoresheje ibikoresho binini byubuhinzi cyangwa ibikoresho byintoki.\nIfumbire mvaruganda ni: nitrati ya amonium, fosifate ya amonium, sulfate ya amonium, urea na nitrati ya calcium amonium. Amoniya, aside sulfurike na aside fosforike ni ibintu by'ingenzi mu gukora iyi fumbire. Kugeza ubu, hydrog\u00e8ne ikenewe mubikorwa bya Haber-Bosch ikomoka mu bicanwa biva mu kirere (gaze gasanzwe cyangwa amakara), bikavamo imyuka ya CO2. Ammonia ishobora kuvugururwa irashobora gukorwa mugihe hydrog\u00e8ne ikozwe muri electrolysis y'amazi ukoresheje amashanyarazi ashobora kuvugururwa (ingufu z'izuba n'umuyaga). Bitewe n\u2019akarere kayo, Afurika ifite amahirwe menshi yo kubyara amoniya ishobora kuvugururwa no kugabanya gushingira ku ifumbire mvaruganda."}
{"id": "15232", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15232", "title": "Inguzanyo z'igiti", "text": "Inguzanyo ku giti ni igitekerezo cy\u2019ubuhinzi bushingiye ku buhinzi aho bahemba igiti cyangwa serivisi z\u2019ikirere. gahunda yatunganijwe hakenewe inzira yoroshye yo kubona inguzanyo kumuhinzii ku giti cye byibuze, kandi byoroshya ishyirwa mubikorwa nogukurikirana imishinga nkiyi hakoreshejwe uburyo bwunguka, kimwe nikigo cy'ubwishingizi.\nUbundi buryo bwo gutanga inguzanyo burimo ibiti byemewe kugabanuka kwa mazi ashingiye ku biguzi byo kugumana ibiti kugiti cye. Mu turere tumwe na tumwe, inguzanyo nini yo kugabanya ingano itangwa ku biti byabitswe hejuru y\u2019ibiti byatewe mu gihe mu tundi turere inguzanyo zishobora kugenwa hashingiwe ku bunini hamwe n\u2019ibiti. Ibintu byinyongera bishobora kugira ingaruka kumubare w'inguzanyo yatanzwe nubunini bwubutaka hamwe nigiti cyibiti kugirango harebwe inyungu zamazi yimvura. \nAmateka.\nInguzanyo y'ibiti yabazwe nk'inguzanyo y'amazi y'imvura, no gukoresha ibara rya karubone. \nSisitemu yo gutanga inguzanyo ikoresheje kode yakozwe na Ferdinand Swart. \nGutera ibiti byinshi byabaturage byateguwe cyangwa byatewe nuburyo bwo gutanga inguzanyo (OARM, PSA, GPS).\u00a0 yo mu Buhinde yashyizeho gahunda yo gutanga inguzanyo mu biti mu 2016. "}
{"id": "15233", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15233", "title": "Ibyuka bihumanya ikirere biva mu buhinzi", "text": "Ubuhinzi bugira uruhare mu ihindagurika ry\u2019ikirere binyuze mu byuka bihumanya ikirere no guhindura ubutaka butari ubuhinzi nk\u2019amashyamba mu butaka bw\u2019ubuhinzi. Ubuhinzi, amashyamba n\u2019imikoreshereze y\u2019ubutaka bitanga hagati ya 13 kugeza kuri 21 ku ijana by\u2019ibyuka bihumanya ikirere ku isi. imyuka mibi igizwe na kimwe cya kabiri cy\u2019ibyuka bihumanya ikirere biva mu buhinzi. Ubworozi ni soko nya mukuru yohereza ibyuka bihumanya ikirere. \nIncamake.\nIbikorwa byubuhinzi bisohora imyuka ya parike ya gaze karuboni, aside nitide, na metani. \nUmwuka wa karuboni.\nIbikorwa nko guhinga imirima, gutera ibihingwa, no kohereza ibicuruzwa bitera imyuka ya karuboni. Ubuhinzi bwangiza imyuka bingana na 11% byuka bihumanya ikirere. Imirima nko kugabanya guhinga, kugabanya ubutaka bwubusa, gusubiza biyomasi ibisigazwa by ibihingwa kubutaka, no kongera ikoreshwa ryibihingwa bitwikiriye bishobora kugabanya imyuka ihumanya ikirere. "}
{"id": "15234", "revid": "18414", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15234", "title": "Agroforestry", "text": "Ni Ubuhinzi-Bworozi buvanze n'amashyamba cyangwa ibiti. Bivuga uburyo ubwo aribwo bwose bwo gukoresha ubutaka aho urwuri n'ibihingwa bihujwe n'ibiti n'amashyamba.Guhuza ubuhinzi, ubworozi n\u2019amashyamba bifite inyungu nyinshi, nko kongera umusaruro ukomoka ku bihingwa by\u2019ibiribwa by\u2019ibanze, kuzamura imibereho y\u2019abahinzi kuva ku musaruro, kongera urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima, kuzamura ubutaka n\u2019ubuzima, kugabanya isuri mu mirima. Ubu buryo kandi bunabungabunga ibidukikije. Mu kwifashisha ubu buryo ushobora gutera ibiti by'imbuto, n'ibindi bicuruzwa by'ingirakamaro bifite agaciro mu bukungu. Ibikorwa by'ubuhinzi bwiganje cyane mu turere dushyuha, cyane ahantu hato dufite akamaro kanini muri Afurika yo munsi y'Ubutayu bwa Sahara. Nyamara, kubera inyungu zayo nyinshi, urugero ni intungamubiri zo kugabanya amapfa, byemejwe muri Amerika no mu Uburayi. "}
{"id": "15235", "revid": "10331", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15235", "title": "Ubworozi bwa karubone", "text": "Ubworozi bwa karubone ni zina ry'uburyo butandukanye bw'ubuhinzi bugamije kw'injiza karubone yo mu kirere mu butaka no mu mizi y\u2019ibihingwa, ibiti n'amababi yabyo. Intego yo guhinga karubone ni ukongera umuvuduko wa karubone yinjira mu butaka n\u2019ibiti by\u2019ibimera hagamijwe kugabanya karuboni mu kirere. Kongera ibinyabuzima mu butaka birashobora gufasha gukura ibihingwa, kongera ibinyabuzima byose bya karubone, kongera ubushobozi bwo gufata amazi yu butaka no kugabanya ikoreshwa ry\u2019ifumbire. Ubworozi bwa karubone ni kimwe mu bigize kubungabunga ikirere."}
{"id": "15236", "revid": "11899", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15236", "title": "Aimee Classen", "text": "Aim\u00e9e Classen ni umunyamerika ukora ku bidukikije wiga ku ngaruka z\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019isi n'amoko atandukanye y\u2019ibinyabuzima byo ku isi. Ibikorwa bye biramenyekana kubera kwita kubidukikije hamwe n\u2019ibitekerezo, hamwe n\u2019ubudasa bw\u2019ibinyabuzima byo ku isi bikubiyemo, birimo amashyamba, urwuri, ibiti, hamwe no mu turere dushyuha kandi duhindagurika. \nKugeza ubu ni umuyobozi w'ikigo cy\u2019ibinyabuzima cya kaminuza muri Michigani, umuryango w\u2019abanyeshuri n\u2019abashakashatsi muri kaminuza wahariwe kwiga ubwoko butandukanye bw\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibidukikije. Classeni ni umwanditsi mukuru w'ikinyamakuru cy\u2019ibidukikije muri Amerika. "}
{"id": "15237", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15237", "title": "Imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe n'uburobyi", "text": "Uburobyi bwibasiwe n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere mu buryo bwinshi harimo urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima byo mu mazi, nibyo mu nyanja bigira ingaruka ku kuzamuka ku bushyuhe bw\u2019inyanja, ndetse n'aside yo mu nyanja na nu mwuka yo mu nyanja, mu gihe urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima byo mu mazi meza bigira ingaruka ku ihinduka ry\u2019ubushyuhe bw\u2019amazi, umuvuduko w\u2019amazi, n\u2019amafi akabura aho aba. Izi ngaruka ziratandukanye mu rwego rwa buri burobyi. Imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe ihindura ubwiyongere bw\u2019amafi n\u2019umusaruro w\u2019amoko yo mu nyanja n\u2019amazi meza. Imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe iteganijwe gutuma habaho impinduka zikomeye mu kuboneka no gucuruza ibikomoka ku mafi. Ingaruka z'ibihe na politike z'ubukungu zizaba ingirakamaro, cyane mu bihugu biterwa cyane nu murenge. Kugabanuka gukomeye mu bushobozi bwo gufata bishobora gutegerezwa muri mberabyombi nko mu karere ka pasifika yepfo. "}
{"id": "15238", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15238", "title": "Ubusitani bw'ikirere", "text": "Ubusitani ikirere nuburyo ubusitani bushobora kugabanya ibyuka bihumanya ikirere biva mu busitani kandi bigashishikarizwa kwinjiza carbone nu butaka n\u2019ibimera hagamijwe kugabanya ubushyuhe bw\u2019isi. Kuba umuhizi atangiza ikirere bisobanura gusuzuma ibibera mu busitani n'ibikoresho byazanywemo n'ingaruka bigira ku mikoreshereze y'ubutaka n'ikirere. BIrashoboraka kandi gushiramo ibiranga ubusitani cyangwa ibikorwa mu busitani bifasha kugabanya ibyuka bihumanya ikirere ahandi ku isi. \nImikoreshereze yubutaka na gaze ya parike.\nIbyinshi mu byuka bihumanya ikirere bitera imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere byaturutse ku gutwika amavuta n\u2019ibimera. Ariko raporo idasanzwe y\u2019akanama gashinzwe guverinoma ihuriweho n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe yagereranije ko mu myaka 150 ishize by\u2019ibicanwa n\u2019umusemburo wa sima ari byo byonyine bigera kuri bibiri bya gatatu by\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere: ikindi cya gatatu cyatewe nu ko abantu bakoresha ubutaka.. \nImyuka itatu yingenzi ya parike ikorwa nu butaka budashoboka ni carbone, metani, na okiside. Carbone yumukara cyangwa soti birashobora kandi guterwa no gukoresha ubutaka budashoboka, kandi, nubwo atari gaze, irashobora kwitwara nka gaze ya parike kandi ikagira uruhare mu ihindagurika ry\u2019ikirere. "}
{"id": "15239", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15239", "title": "Ubuhinzi ubwiza bw' ikirere", "text": "Ubuhinzi bw\u2019ikirere (cyangwa ubuhinzi bwangiza ikirere) ni inzira ihuriweho yo gucunga ibibanza bifasha guhuza uburyo bw\u2019ubuhinzi, amatungo n\u2019ibihingwa n\u2019ingaruka z\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere, nkaho bishoboka, bikayirwanya hagabanywa ibyuka bihumanya ikirere biva mu buhinzi, icyarimwe hitawe ku baturage biyongera ku isi kugira ngo babashe kwihaza mu biribwa. Ntabwo hibandwa gusa ku buhinzi bwa karubone cyangwa ubuhinzi burambye, ahubwo no kongera umusaruro w\u2019ubuhinzi. \"bijyanye n'icyerekezo ku biribwa n'ubuhinzi birambye kandi ishyigikira intego yo gukora ubuhinzi, amashyamba n'uburobyi kurushaho gutanga umusaruro kandi birambye\". \nUburyo no gusuzuma.\nIshami rishinzwe ibiribwa n\u2019ubuhinzi ryagaragaje ko ibikoresho byinshi by\u2019ibihugu n\u2019abantu ku giti cyabo muburyo bwo gusuzuma, kugenzura no gusuzuma ibice bigize murigahunda ya CSA no kuyishyira mu bikorwa na FAO. Bimwe muri ibyo bikoresho birimo: "}
{"id": "15240", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15240", "title": "Gutema amashyamba n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere", "text": "Gutema amashyamba ni uruhare runini mu ihindagurika ry\u2019ikirere, kandi imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere igira ingaruka ku mashyamba. \nIhinduka ry'imikoreshereze y'ubutaka, mu buryo bwo gutema amashyamba, ni isoko rya kabiri rinini rya ya karuboni yo mu kirere, nyuma yo gutwikwa na peteroli. Imyuka ya parike isohoka mugihe cyo gutwika biyomasi yishyamba no kubora ibikoresho byi bimera bisigaye hamwe na karuboni yubutaka. Icyitegererezo cyisi yose hamwe nu bubiko bwa parike yi gihugu itanga ibisubizo bisa kubyangiza amashyamba. muri 2019, gutema amashyamba bishinzwe hafi 11 ku ijana mu byuka bihumanya ikirere. Ibyuka byangiza imyuka yo gutema amashyamba birihuta. Gukura amashyamba ni karuboni ifite ubushobozi bwo kugabanya ingaruka z\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere. Zimwe mu ngaruka z\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere, nk\u2019umuriro mwinshi, zishobora kongera amashyamba. \nGutema amashyamba biza muburyo bwinshi: umuriro w\u2019ishyamba, gutema ubuhinzi, korora amatungo, no gutema ibiti. Umubare munini wi bikorwa byu buhinzi bivamo amashyamba biterwa inkunga n\u2019imisoro ya leta. Amashyamba afite 31 ki ijana yubutaka bwisi kandi buri mwaka kilometero kare 75.700 (bingana na hegitari miliyoni 18.7) zishyamba ziratakara. Nk\u2019uko ikigo gishinzwe umutungo w\u2019isi kibitangaza, habayeho kwiyongera kwa 12 ku ijana mu gutakaza amashyamba y\u2019ibanze yo mu turere dushyuha kuva muri 2019 kugeza 2020. Gutema amashyamba menshi bikomeje kubangamira amashyamba yo mu turere dushyuha, ibinyabuzima bitandukanye, na serivisi y'ibidukikije batanga. Igice nyamukuru gihangayikishijwe no gutema amashyamba ni mumashyamba yimvura yo mu turere dushyuha kubera ko atuwe n\u2019ibinyabuzima byinshi ku isi.\nImpamvu zitera amashyamba.\nUbworozi.\nUbworozi bw'amatungo busaba igice kinini cy'ubutaka bwo korora amashyo y'amatungo n'ibihingwa by'amatungo kubyo abaguzi bakeneye. Nk\u2019uko ikigega cy'isi cyita ku nyamaswa kibitangaza, \"Ubworozi bw'inka nini ni bwo bwa mbere mu guteza amashyamba mu bihugu hafi ya byose bya Amazone, kandi bingana na 80% by'amashyamba muri iki gihe.\" Ubworozi bw\u2019amatungo bwashinzwe muri Tejas mugihe cya Misiyoni ya Espagne, hagati ya 1820 na 1865 kandi bwari butwarwa ahanini n\u2019inka zo muri Mexico. Nyuma, ubwo ubutumwa bwari bumaze gufungwa maze abapadiri n'abasirikare bava muri ako gace ariko bagasiga inka inyuma, umurimo wafashwe n'abenegihugu ku giti cyabo. Nyuma y'intambara y'abenegihugu, Texans yatangiye gukusanya inka no kugurisha amajyaruguru muri leta nka Kansas na Illinois. Nk\u2019uko bitangazwa na Greenpeace, umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta uharanira ibidukikije ku isi, inganda z\u2019inka nizo zifite uruhare runini mu kohereza imyuka ya metani kubera ko 60% by\u2019inyamabere zose ku isi ari inka z\u2019amatungo. Gusimbuza ubutaka bw\u2019amashyamba n\u2019inzuri bitera igihombo cy\u2019amashyamba, ibyo bikaba biganisha ku kongera imyuka ihumanya ikirere mu gutwika uburyo bw\u2019ubuhinzi no guhindura imikoreshereze y\u2019ubutaka. "}
{"id": "15241", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15241", "title": "Fermentation", "text": "Fermentation ya enteric ni inzira igogora aho karubone ya igabanywa na mikorobe ikabamo molekile yoroshye kugirango yinjire mumaraso yinyamaswa. Kubera ubuhinzi bw\u2019abantu bushingiye ku bice byinshi by\u2019isi ku nyamaswa zonona na fermentation ya enteric, ni kimwe mu bintu byongera imyuka ihumanya ikirere.\nIbihuha.\nAmatungo yinyamanswa naya afite rumen. Rumen ni igifu gifite abantu benshi kiboneka hafi yinyamabere zimwe na zimwe za artiodactyl, nk'inka, intama, n'impongo, bibafasha kurya selile ikomoka ku bimera bikomeye ndetse n'ibinyampeke bikomoka ku nyamaswa za monogastrici (ni ukuvuga, \"icyumba kimwe gifunze\"), nka abantu, imbwa, ninjangwe, ntibishobora gusya. Nubwo ingamiya zitekereza ko ari amatungo ntabwo ari amatungo yukuri. \nferimetatiyo ibaho mu gihe metane ikorewe muri rumeni mugihe habaye mikorobe. Amoko arenga 200 ya mikorobe aboneka muri rumeni, nubwo hafi 10 ku ijana gusa aribyo bigira uruhare runini mugusya. Ibyinshi muri ibyo bikoresho bifatanye ninyamaswa. Nyamara, ijanisha rito naryo rikorerwa mu mara manini kandi ryanyuze nko kuryama."}
{"id": "15242", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15242", "title": "Ibidukikije bikomoka ku bimera", "text": "Ibidukikije bikomoka ku bimera ni umuco wo kurya ibikomoka ku bimera iyo biterwa no gushaka gukora indyo irambye yirinda ingaruka mbi z\u2019ibidukikije ku musaruro w\u2019inyama. Amatungo muri rusange ateganijwe kuba hafi 15 ku ijana y\u2019ibyuya bihumanya ikirere ku isi. \nUsibye imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere, inganda z\u2019ubworozi nizo ntandaro y\u2019ibanze mu urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima no gutema amashyamba, mu gihe bifite akamaro kanini ku bijyanye n\u2019ibidukikije nko gukoresha amazi n\u2019ubutaka, umwanda, ndetse no kutabaho neza. \nIngaruka ku bidukikije ku bikomoka ku nyamaswa.\nIbice bine bya gatanu byangiza imyuka iva mu buhinzi biva mu bworozi. \nUbushakashatsi bwakozwe n'ikigo cya isi ireba mu 2009 bwavuze ko raporo yasuzuguye ingaruka zijyanye na metani, imikoreshereze y'ubutaka ndetse n'ubuhumekero, bigatuma amatungo agera kuri 51 ku ijana by'ibyuka bihumanya isi\nyose. "}
{"id": "15243", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15243", "title": "Gucunga neza (ubuhinzi)", "text": "Imicungire yuzuye mu buhinzi ni uburyo bwo gucunga umutungo watunganijwe mbere na Alani mu gucunga ubwatsi. Imicungire ya Holistike yagereranijwe ko uburyo bwa perimaculiture. Imicungire ya Holistike ni ikirango cyanditse.\nIbisobanuro.\nUbuyobozi bwuzuye busobanura sisitemu yo gutekereza kuburyo bwo gucunga umutungo. Ubusanzwe byakozwe na Alani, ubu birahuzwa kugirango bikoreshwe mu gucunga izindi sisitemu zifite imibereho iruhanyije nk'ibidukikije n\u2019ubukungu. Ubwatsi buteganijwe kurisha ubusa no kurisha kuzenguruka ariko buratandukanye kubera ko bumenya neza kandi butanga urwego rwo guhuza inzira enye z\u2019ibinyabuzima: uruziga rw\u2019amazi, [4 [5 Imicungire ya Holisitike yagereranijwe n'uburyo bwa permaculiture.\nUrwego.\nUburyo bwo gufata ibyemezo bya Holisitike bukoresha intambwe esheshatu zingenzi zo kuyobora imicungire yumutungo: "}
{"id": "15244", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15244", "title": "Itsinda rishinzwe amashyamba muri Uganda", "text": "Itsinda rishinzwe amashyamba muri Uganda n\u2019umuryango ukorera muri Uganda, mu rusobe rudasanzwe rw\u2019abafatanyabikorwa mu mashyamba, imiryango itegamiye kuri leta, ibigo bya masomo nu bushakashatsi bigira uruhare mu iterambere rirambye ry\u2019amashyamba muri Uganda bikaba bitandukanye mu bice bitandukanye byi gihugu iterambere. Yashinzwe mu 2001 kugira ngo igire uruhare mu iterambere ry\u2019amashyamba no gukurikirana mu bwigenge ishyirwa mu bikorwa rya Politiki y\u2019amashyamba na gahunda y\u2019i gihugu y\u2019amashyamba. \nUbufatanye.\nifatanya n\u2019imiryango itegamiye kuri Leta, Imiryango ishingiye ku baturage, Amashyirahamwe y\u2019abakoresha amashyamba Amashuri makuru n\u2019ibigo by\u2019ubushakashatsi hamwe n\u2019abanyamuryango ku giti cyabo bagize uruhare mu iterambere no kuramba by\u2019amashyamba muri Uganda. Kuva mu 2014 kugeza 2016, Itsinda rishinzwe amashyamba muri Uganda, ibiribwa n\u2019ubuhinzi by\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye n\u2019ishami rishinzwe gutera inkunga amashyamba munsi ya Minisiteri y\u2019amazi n\u2019ibidukikije ku nkunga y\u2019amafaranga yatanzwe n\u2019ishami rishinzwe iterambere mpuzamahanga, mu Bwongereza, yashyize mu bikorwa umushinga \u201cKongera igihe cy\u2019amashyamba n\u2019imiyoborere muri Uganda\u201d kugira ngo ugerageze inzira yo kwandikisha amashyamba yigenga no gutangaza amashyamba y\u2019abaturage muri Uganda, nkuko biteganijwe, ariko ntibyigeze bishyirwa mu bikorwa, mu itegeko ry\u2019igihugu ry\u2019amashyamba n\u2019ibiti mu 2003. "}
{"id": "15245", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15245", "title": "Raporo idasanzwe ku bijyanye n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe n\u2019ubutaka", "text": "Raporo idasanzwe y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ishinzwe imihindagurikire yi kirere, iyi yerekana, ubutayu, iyangirika ryu butaka, imicungire yu butaka burambye, umutekano wi biribwa, na pariki. gazi itemba mu bidukikije ku isi, ni ubushakashatsi bwibanze kuva mu mwaka wa 2019 ni mpuguke 107 zaturutse mu bihugu 52. itanga ishusho rusange yimiterere yi kirere ku nshuro ya mbere kandi ifata icyemezo cyo kwandikisha ubutaka nku mutungo wingenzi. Isomo rya 50 ryemeje ku mugaragaro Incamake ku bafata ibyemezo kandi yemeza raporo ishingiyeho. hamwe ni nyandiko yuzuye ya \"Raporo idasanzwe yerekeye imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe n\u2019ubutaka,\" mu buryo butemewe, yasohotse ku ya 8 Kanama 2019. Raporo ifite impapuro zirenga 1.300 kandi ikubiyemo imirimo yinzobere 107 zaturutse mu bihugu 52.\nRaporo ni iya kabiri muri Raporo eshatu zidasanzwe muri raporo y\u2019isuzuma rya gatandatu (AR6) yatangiye muri 2015 ikazarangira mu 2022. Iya mbere yari Raporo idasanzwe ku bushyuhe bwa 1.5, naho iya gatatu ni Raporo idasanzwe ku nyanja na koroyosifera mu bihe by\u2019i mihindagurikire y\u2019i bihe yasohotse ku ya 25 Nzeri 2019. Inzira ya AR6 ifatwa na IPCC ko ari yo irarikira cyane kuva itsinda ryashingwa mu 1988.\u200a \nIsuzuma ryambere ryizunguruka na raporo zidasanzwe.\nKuva yashingwa mu 1988, IPCC iha guverinoma z\u2019ibihugu 195 bigize uyu muryango, incamake y\u2019incamake y\u2019isuzuma ry\u2019ubumenyi ku bashoramari b\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere, harimo ingaruka ziriho ndetse n\u2019ingaruka zishobora kubaho. Raporo kandi yashyize ahagaragara ibisubizo bishoboka mubijyanye no kurwanya imihindagurikire y'ikirere. IPCC yasohoye Raporo eshanu z\u2019isuzuma, na raporo y\u2019isuzuma rya mbere rya IPCC mu 1990 \"(\" FAR), bizwi \"nk\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe 2007\", na Raporo ya gatanu yo gusuzuma. Buri raporo ikubiyemo kandi \"isuzuma ryuzuye rya siyansi na tekiniki ry\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere, muri rusange mu bitabo bitatu, imwe kuri buri tsinda ry\u2019imirimo ya IPCC, hamwe n\u2019incamake y\u2019abafata ibyemezo, na Raporo ya Synthesis.\" \nIbice.\nIbice.\nIgice cya 1: Imiterere n'imiterere.\nUbuyobozi bwa siyansi bwa SRCCL bwarimo impuguke 107 zaturutse mu bihugu 52 nku guhuza abanditsi bayobora hamwe n\u2019abanditsi bayobora mu matsinda atatu ya IPCC hamwe na Task Force ishinzwe ibarura rya parike y\u2019igihugu ku nkunga yatanzwe n\u2019ishami rishinzwe ubufasha bwa tekinike mu itsinda rya III. 53% by'abanditsi ba raporo bakomoka mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere naho mirongo ine ku ijana by'abanditsi bayobora ni abagore. \nIbisubizo.\n\"The Economist\" yavuze ko raporo \"irasa indi miburo irasa ku miterere y'isi ndetse n'uburyo abantu bahinduka hafi ya buri mugabane wa buri mugabane. Ibikorwa by'abantu bigira ingaruka kuri bitatu bya kane by'ubutaka butagira urubura ku isi, bikagira ingaruka zikomeye ku kirere. \" BBC yasohoye urukurikirane rw'ingingo zijyanye no gutangaza raporo. Roger Harrabin, umusesenguzi w\u2019ibidukikije kuri BBC, yavuze ko iyi raporo \"izaba raporo yemewe nyamara mu buryo dukoresha no gukoresha nabi ubutaka.\" Ingingo yo ku ya 8 Kanama 2019 yanditswe na \"New York Times\" (NYT) yagaragaje ukuri ko SRCCL \"yateguwe n'impuguke zirenga 100 zaturutse mu bihugu 52\" kandi ko yasanze \"igice cya miliyari igice cy'abantu basanzwe baba ahantu hahindutse ubutayu, kandi ubutaka burimo gutakara hagati y\u2019incuro 10 na 100 kurenza uko bumeze. \" NYT yerekanye kandi ko umubare w\u2019abimukira wiyongereyeho gatanu ku mupaka w\u2019Amerika na Mexico uva El Salvador, Guatemala na Honduras \"uhurirana n\u2019igihe cyumye cyasize benshi badafite ibiryo bihagije.\" Bamwe mu bahanga \"basabye ko ari ikimenyetso cy\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere.\" Ingingo yo muri \"Atalantike\" yari ifite umutwe ugira uti: \"Iki Gihugu Nicyo gihugu cyonyine gihari\". Iyo ngingo yavuze ari intambwe ikomeye kuko ivuga ko ubutaka butarangwamo urubura ubwabwo, abantu bakeneye gukura mu biribwa, \"ari buke kandi bufite agaciro\". Iyi ngingo yerekanye bamwe mu bahanga mu bumenyi bw\u2019ikirere n\u2019abashakashatsi bafite, mbere ya SRCCL, rimwe na rimwe bagaragaje ko ubutaka ari \"isuku\" itagira umupaka \"yoza isi\", mu buryo bwo kongera ibiti bihagije byagabanya cyane umutwaro wa CO. \"Ikinyamakuru\" ubushakashatsi bwibanze. "}
{"id": "15246", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15246", "title": "Cakao ivugurura", "text": "Cacao ivugurura isobanurwa nka cacao ikorerwa mu murima ukoresha ubuhinzi bushya nu buryo bwo guhinga amashyamba. Ifitanye isano rya bugufi na shokora yo muri ikerene, itanga ibiribwa kama umuryango wo kubungabunga amashyamba yimvura, hamwe n\u2019umushinga w\u2019ubuhinzi bw'umwimerere. Cacao nibikoresho fatizo bikoreshwa mu gukora shokora.\nCacao ivuguruye irangwa nu buhinzi bw'ibinyabuzima butandukanye bwi biti aho ibiti bya cakao bihingwa mu gicucu cy\u2019ibindi biti, bigana m' urusobe rwi binyabuzima rusanzwe. Ubu buryo bwo guhinga bukoreshwa nk'uburyo bwo kugarura amashyamba ku rwuri rw\u2019inka zatereranywe ndetse no mu tundi turere tw\u2019ubuhinzi bw\u2019amashyamba. Mubisanzwe bifatwa nkingamba zo gucunga neza ubutaka, aho abahinzi bashobora kubyara ibiryo ninjiza mugihe cyo kuvugurura amashyamba. \nUrugendo rwa cacao rusubirwamo ni ingamba zo kurwanya imirima ya cacao, ikaba akenshi itera amashyamba mu turere dushyuha.\nUbuhinzi.\nAgroforestry ivugurura ikoresha iri hame nkuburyo bwo gusana amashyamba. Imwe mu nyungu zubu buryo ni ugukuraho neti ya CO2 mukirere. Izindi nyungu zirimo kongera umusaruro ukomoka ku bihingwa by\u2019ibiribwa, kuzamura imibereho y\u2019abahinzi kuva ku musaruro winjiza, kongera urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima, kuzamura ubutaka n\u2019ubuzima, no kugabanya isuri. Hamwe nimiterere yubutaka bwiza, ibihingwa biva mubuhinzi bushya burimo vitamine zimwe na zimwe, imyunyu ngugu, na phytochemiki. Imiti myinshi ya phytochemiki irashobora kongera uburyohe bwibiryo ugereranije nibikorwa bisanzwe byubuhinzi. Muri rusange, ubuhinzi bushya bwubuhinzi nuburyo bwubuhinzi bushya bukoresha ibiti cyane kuruta ibihingwa byumwaka.\nIbiti bya Cacao, bikomoka mu mashyamba y\u2019imvura yo muri uquateur, mu bisanzwe byahinduwe kugira ngo bibeho kandi bitere imbere mu nsi y\u2019ishyamba rishyuha. Ibi, bifatanije no kwiyongera kwisi yose kuri shokora, bituma ibiti bya cakao ari ikintu cyiza cyibiti by\u2019amashyamba yi mbera byombi. \nKugabanya imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe.\numuyobozi ushinzwe amategeko n\u2019ubukangurambaga, avuga ko igisubizo kimwe ari uko inganda za shokora zishobora guhinduka mu buhinzi bw\u2019amashyamba no mu bwoko bwa cakao zikuze mu gicucu, kandi ko hagomba kunozwa uburyo bw\u2019imyororokere ya cacao. "}
{"id": "15247", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15247", "title": "Ubuhinzi bushya", "text": "Ubuhinzi bushya ni uburyo bwo kubungabunga no gusubiza mu buzima busanzwe ibiribwa hamwe nu buhinzi. Yibanze mu kuvugurura ubutaka, kongera urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima, kuzamura uruziga rwa mazi, kuzamura serivisi z\u2019ibidukikije, gushyigikira ibinyabuzima, kongera imbaraga mu guhangana n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere, no gushimangira ubuzima n\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019ubutaka bw\u2019imirima.\nUbuhinzi bushya ntabwo ari imyitozo yihariye ubwayo. Ahubwo, abashyigikira ubuhinzi bushya bakoresha uburyo butandukanye bwu buhinzi burambye hamwe. Imyitozo ikubiyemo gutunganya imyanda myinshi yu murima bishoboka no kongeramo ifumbire mvaruganda ituruka hanze yu murima. Ubuhinzi bushya ku mirima mito nu busitani akenshi bushingiye kuri filozofi nka perimaculiture, Ubuhinzi, ecologiya, igishushanyo mbonera, hamwe nu buyobozi bwuzuye. Imirima minini nayo igenda ikoreshwa mu buryo nkubu, kandi akenshi ikoresha oya kugeza cyangwa kugabanuka kugeza.\nMu gihe ubuzima bwu butaka bugenda butera imbere, ibisabwa byinjira birashobora kugabanuka, kandi umusaruro wi bihingwa urashobora kwiyongera kuko ubutaka bushobora guhangana ni kirere gikabije kandi bukabamo udukoko twangiza na virusi. \nImyitozo.\nImyitozo n'amahame akoreshwa mu buhinzi bushya harimo: "}
{"id": "15248", "revid": "10331", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15248", "title": "Ikimenyetso cy\u2019amapfa", "text": "Icyerekezo cy\u2019amapfa, mu karere gikunze gukoreshwa mu gukurikirana ibiza by\u2019amapfa no kwiga urugero nu buremere bw\u2019ibihe by\u2019amapfa. Ironderero rikoresha imvura nu bushyuhe bwo kwiga itangwa rya mazi ni bisabwa ukoresheje uburyo bworoshye bwo kuringaniza amazi. Yakozwe n\u2019iteganyagihe witwa Wayine, wasohoye bwa mbere uburyo bwe mu mpapuro zo mu 1965 \"z\u2019amapfa y\u2019ikirere\" ku biro bishinzwe ikirere cy\u2019ibiro by\u2019ikirere muri Amerika.\nAbanyamateka bavuze ko akamaro k'ibipimo bigabanuka kubera imiterere yinzira uko bishakiye, harimo n'ubuhanga bukoreshwa mu kugereranya. Indangagaciro idashobora kubara ubukonje nu butaka butose nabyo byavuzwe nkintege nke. "}
{"id": "15249", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15249", "title": "Mootral", "text": "Mootral ni isosiyete y'Abongereza n'Ubusuwisi itegura ibiryo byinyogera bigabanya imyuka ya metani ituruka ku nyamaswa zororoka, inka n'intama, n'ihene. Methane ni intego nya mukuru ya gaze ya parike kandi muri raporo ya 4 y\u2019akanama gashinzwe guverinoma ku bijyanye n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe irasabwa kwiyongera kuva kuri 23 ikagera kuri 72 kubera ubunini bw\u2019ingaruka zayo ugereranije na carbone no kuramba mu kirere cy\u2019isi.\nIbyokurya bisanzwe.\nIbigo bikoresha ibiryo bya Mootral bitanga inguzanyo ya karubone ishobora gukoreshwa kugirango igabanye ibyuka bihumanya ikirere cyangwa igurishwa kubandi bantu. Ukuboza 2019, Verra yatangaje ko yemeye Mootral nk'uburyo bwa mbere ku isi bwo kugabanya imyuka ihumanya metani ituruka ku matungo magufi. \nKumenyekanisha.\nMootral yitabiriwe cyane nku wakabiri mu mpinduka zibihe na mahame yo mu Buholandi.\u00a0\nMootral yabaye uwanyuma muri 2009 nkumwe mubisubizo 12 bitanga igisubizo cyimihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere. "}
{"id": "15250", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15250", "title": "Ubuhinzi &amp; Ubworozi Australiya", "text": "Inyama &amp; Ubworozi Australiya ni sosiyete yigenga igenga ibipimo ngenderwaho mu micungire y\u2019inyama n\u2019amatungo ku masoko ya Ositaraliya n\u2019amahanga. Icyicaro gikuru kiri mu majyaruguru ya Sydney muri Ositaraliya ; M&amp;LA ikorana cyane na guverinoma ya Ositarariya, n\u2019inganda z\u2019inyama n\u2019ubworozi. Nu buyobozi bu tandukanye, M&amp;LA ifite uruhare runini mubice by'imari, ibya leta nu bushakashatsi. Itsinda ry\u2019ibigo M&amp;LA rikora ubushakashatsi kandi ritanga serivisi zo kwamamaza ku bakora inyama, inzego za leta n\u2019abasesengura isoko. Ihuriro nibikorwa nabyo bikoreshwa na M&amp;LA bigamije guha abaproducer amahirwe yo kwishimana nabandi bitabiriye gutanga isoko. \nIcyorezo cya Corona cya hungabanije amasoko yu bukungu nu musaruro ku isi. Icyorezo cya COVID nacyo cyagize ingaruka ku kwinjiza amatsinda ya M&amp;LA. Mu mwaka w\u2019ingengo y\u2019imari wa 2019\u201320, M&amp;LA yinjije muri rusange amadori miliyoni 269.7. M&amp;LA yagize igabanuka rya 0.1 ku ijana mu kwinjiza ugereranije n\u2019umwaka w\u2019ingengo y\u2019imari wa 2018\u201319, aho itsinda ry\u2019ibigo ryinjije amadorari miliyoni 269.9. \nItsinda rusange.\nItsinda rya M&amp;LA ryashinzwe nyuma yo guhuza ikigo cy\u2019inyama n\u2019ubworozi cya Ositaraliya (AMLC) n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019ubushakashatsi ku nyama (MRC) cyemerera abikorera ku giti cyabo izo nzego za leta mu 1998. Itsinda ryi bigo bya M&amp;LA ryashinzwe imirimo yubushakashatsi niterambere rya AMLC nintego ya MRC yo gutanga inkunga yumusaruro. \nInyama n\u2019amatungo Australiya igarukira.\nIcyorezo cya COVID-19 cyatumye gukusanya amakuru n'imibare biva ku masoko yo mu karere ndetse no ku isi bigorana. Kubera COVID-19 yabujijwe no kugabanya kubona amakuru, M&amp;LA yahagaritse by'agateganyo umusaruro wa EYCI hagati ya Werurwe na Kamena 2020. Nyuma yo koroshya imipaka ya COVID-19 muri Ositaraliya, igipimo cy\u2019isoko cyagarutse mu cyumweru gishize cya Kamena 2020. M&amp;LA igamije gukomeza guha abasesengura n\u2019abasesengura isoko amakuru ku miterere y\u2019isoko mpuzamahanga bashyira mu bikorwa ubushakashatsi ku masoko y\u2019amahanga, bushimishije n\u2019abakora ibicuruzwa muri Ositaraliya ku bijyanye n\u2019ibyoherezwa mu mahanga. Muri 2018\u201319, Australiya yohereje 72% by\u2019inyama z\u2019inka n\u2019inyama zose, naho Ubushinwa bugira 24% by\u2019inyama z\u2019inka zo muri Ositaraliya mu mwaka wa 2019. M&amp;LA yakoze ubushakashatsi ku baguzi mu Bushinwa kugira ngo isesengure imyitwarire y\u2019abaguzi n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019icyorezo cya COVID-19. Ibyavuye mu bushakashatsi byagaragaje ko hakomeje kwiyongera ku baguzi bakeneye inyama zitukura mu Bushinwa, hamwe n\u2019inyama z\u2019inka za Ositaraliya ziyongereyeho 43% ku masoko y\u2019Ubushinwa mu gihe cy\u2019icyorezo. Ubu bushakashatsi bugamije kunoza icyizere cya producer no gutanga \namakuru kubasesengura isoko mugihe cyorezo cya COVID-19. \u00a0"}
{"id": "15251", "revid": "11899", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15251", "title": "Indyo ya karubone nkeya", "text": "Indyo ya karubone nkeya bivuga guhitamo ubuzima bujyanye no kurya ibiryo kugirango ugabanye ibyuka bihumanya ikirere. Guhitamo indyo yuzuye ya karubone nimwe mu bice byo guteza imbere indyo irambye yo ngerera igihe kirekire ikiremwamuntu.\nIbyuka bihumanya biterwa n'umusaruro w'amatungo, n'abandi. gereranya ko kwisi yose, metani ihwanye na 30.2 ku ijana. Kimwe nizindi myuka ya parike, metani igira uruhare mubushyuhe bwisi iyo ikirere cyayo kizamutse. Nubwo imyuka ya metani iva mu buhinzi n\u2019andi masoko ya antropogeneque yagize uruhare runini mu gushyuha kwashize, ntabwo bifite akamaro kanini kubushyuhe bwa none na vuba. Ni ukubera ko mu myaka yashize habaye kwiyongera gake cyane mu kirere cya metani yo mu kirere methane idasanzwe ituruka mu bishanga karemano, cyane cyane mu turere dushyuha, aho kuba isoko ya antropogene. "}
{"id": "15252", "revid": "11899", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15252", "title": "Igicucu kirekire", "text": "Ibibazo by\u2019ibidukikije n\u2019amahitamo ni raporo y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye, yashyizwe ahagaragara n\u2019umuryango w\u2019ibiribwa n\u2019ubuhinzi yu muryango wa bibumbye ku ya 29 Ugushyingo 2006, igamije gusuzuma ingaruka zose zu bworozi ku bidukikije ibibazo, hamwe nu buryo bwa tekiniki na politiki bushobora kugabanywa \". Yavuze ko amatungo angana na 18 ku ijana yi byuka bihumanya ikirere, iyo mibare yahindutse igera kuri 14.5 ku ijana mu bushakashatsi bwakozwe mu 2013 \"mu guhangana n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere binyuze mu bworozi\".\nUmwanditsi mukuru Henning Steinfeld yavuze ko amatungo ari umwe mu bagize uruhare runini mu bibazo by\u2019ibidukikije by\u2019iki gihe\" kandi ko hakenewe ingamba zihutirwa kugira ngo iki kibazo gikemuke. \nIngingo yo mu 2009 mu kinyamakuru Worldwatch Institute yanditswe n'abanditsi Anihangi, icyo gihe bakoreraga muri Banki y'Isi, bavuze ko raporo idahwitse kandi ko ubworozi bugira uruhare runini mu byuka bihumanya ikirere ku isi, nibura 51 ku ijana, bifata hitawe ku guhumeka kw'inyamaswa n'ubushobozi bwa fotosintetike y'ubutaka bukoreshwa mu kugaburira no gutura amatungo. Igisubizo cya 2011 kuri iki kibazo cyashyizwe ahagaragara hamwe n\u2019umuryango mpuzamahanga w\u2019abahanga, batesha agaciro ingingo y\u2019iki kinyamakuru kandi gishimangira isuzuma rya 2006. Ariko iki gisubizo cyashubijwe bongera gushimangira igereranyo ryabo mu gihe abahanga banze gukomeza impaka nubwo ubutumire bwatumiwe. Mu mwaka wa 2013, yafatanyije ku mugaragaro n\u2019ubunyamabanga mpuzamahanga bw\u2019inyama n\u2019ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga ry\u2019amata kandi benshi mu banditsi bamwe ba raporo ya mbere bashyize ahagaragara ubushakashatsi bwakurikiyeho (2013) bwakorewe, bavugurura igereranyo cy\u2019imyuka ihumanya ikirere bitewe n\u2019amatungo amanuka; kugeza 14.5 ku ijana udakemuye amakosa ayo ari yo yose avugwa yagaragaye muri raporo ya Anhangi cyangwa mu mpaka zasuzumwe n\u2019urungano."}
{"id": "15253", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15253", "title": "Ikigo mpuzamahanga gishinzwe iterambere ryimisozi", "text": "ifite icyicaro mu mujyi uherereye mu kibaya cya Katihimandu muri Nepali. Kuri Godavari muri Lalitipuri, ifite Parike yubumenyi yerekana bimwe mubikorwa byu bushakashatsi. Byongeye kandi, ifite ibiro byigihugu muri Afuganisitani na Pakisitani. Imiryango ifatanyabikorwa irimo ibigo bya siyansi byi gihugu ndetse na mahanga, ibigo bya leta, ibigo by\u2019abaterankunga, n\u2019abikorera, haba ndetse no hanze yacyo. \nIcyerekezo n'intego.\nIcyerekezo cya ICIMOD ni: \"Abagabo, abagore, ndetse n'abana bo muri Hindu Kush Himalaya bishimira ubuzima bwiza babayeho neza.\" \nInshingano z'uyu muryango ni: \"Gufasha iterambere rirambye kandi rirambye ry'imisozi kugira ngo imibereho myiza irusheho kuba myiza binyuze mu bumenyi n'ubufatanye bw'akarere.\" \nIntego ya ICIMOD ni \"Ku misozi n'abantu\". "}
{"id": "15254", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15254", "title": "Gregory V. Jones", "text": "Gregory V. Jones ni umugabo ukomoka ku mugabane wa amerika mu bushakashatsi bwi kirere akaba ari nzobere mu bijyanye ni kirere cyu buhinzi bwi mbuto, yibanda ku kuntu imihindagurikire yi kirere igira ingaruka ku mikurire yi mizabibu, umusaruro wa divayi, ndetse nu bwiza bwa divayi ikorwa. Jones akaba ari umuyobozi mukuru wa Abacela Vineyards na Winery i Roseburg, Oregon. Mbere yahoze akora nku muyobozi wi kigo gishinzwe kwigisha divayi kandi ni umwarimu mu bushakashatsi bwi bidukikije muri kaminuza ndetse anaba umuyobozi wi shami ryu bucuruzi, itumanaho ni bidukikije muri kaminuza y\u2019amajyepfo ya Oregon muri Oregoni kandi yari Porofeseri muri gahunda yu bumenyi ni bidukikije muri kaminuza.\nUbushakashatsi.\nUbushakashatsi bwa Jones bwasobanuwe kandi ubuhanga bwe bwagaragaye mu bitabo by\u2019ubucuruzi bwa divayi no ku mbuga za interineti harimo: Ikinyamakuru muri Gicurasi 2015, \"cya Oregoni muri\" Gicurasi 2015, [\"3\" \"Divayi nini yo mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba\" Mata 2015, (Ukuboza 2014), Nzeri 2013), Ikinyamakuru mu gushyingo 2012), n'ikinyamakuru \"Mail Tribune\" (Kamena 2009). \nIcyubahiro n'ibihembo.\nMu mwaka wa 2016, Jones yahawe igihembo cy'icyubahiro na Ranki na Conifirariya kubera akazi yakoranye n'inganda zikora divayi muri Porutugali. "}
{"id": "15255", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15255", "title": "Ibiribwa na lisansi", "text": "Ibiribwa hamwe na lisansi ni ikibazo kijyanye n'ingaruka zo gutandukanya imirima cyangwa ibihingwa kugirango umusaruro wa biyogaze ubangamire itangwa ry'ibiribwa. Impaka za biyogizi ni biribwa zirimo ibitekerezo byinshi, kandi ni kuva kera, bitavugwaho rumwe mu bitabo. Hariho ukutumvikana ku kamaro ki kibazo, ikibitera, ni bishobora gukorwa cyangwa kugirango iki kibazo gikemuke. Ibigoye kandi bidashidikanywaho biterwa nu mubare munini wingaruka ni bisubizo bishobora kugira ingaruka nziza cyangwa mbi kuri sisitemu yi biciro. Byongeye kandi, imbaraga zigereranijwe zizi ngaruka nziza kandi mbi ziratandukanye mu gihe gito kandi kirekire, zirimo ingaruka zitinze. Uruhande rwa masomo yi mpaka narwo ruyobowe no gukoresha uburyo butandukanye bwu bukungu nu buryo bwo guhatanira gusesengura imibare. \nIfaranga ry'ibiciro by'ibiribwa.\nKuva 1974 kugeza 2005 ibiciro byibiribwa nyabyo (byahinduwe kugirango ifaranga) byagabanutseho 75%. Ibiciro byibicuruzwa byari bihagaze neza nyuma yo kugera ku ntera mu 2000 na 2001. Kubwibyo, kwiyongera kwibiciro byibiribwa vuba bifatwa nkibidasanzwe. Impapuro zikora ubushakashatsi kuri politiki ya Banki y'Isi yasohotse muri Nyakanga 2008 zagaragaje ko izamuka ry\u2019ibiciro by\u2019ibiribwa ryayobowe n\u2019ibinyampeke, hamwe n\u2019izamuka ry\u2019ibiciro mu 2005 nubwo ibihingwa byanditswe ku isi. Kuva muri Mutarama 2005 kugeza muri Kamena 2008, ibiciro by'ibigori byikubye hafi gatatu, ingano ziyongereyeho 127 ku ijana, n'umuceri wazamutseho 170 ku ijana. Ubwiyongere bw'ibiciro by'ingano bwakurikiwe no kwiyongera kw'amavuta n'ibiciro bya peteroli hagati ya 2006. Ku rundi ruhande, ubushakashatsi bwerekanye ko umusaruro w\u2019ibisheke wiyongereye vuba, kandi wari munini bihagije kugira ngo igiciro cy\u2019isukari cyiyongere gito usibye 2005 na mbere ya 2006. Uru rupapuro rwanzuye ko ibicanwa biva mu binyampeke byazamuye ibiciro by\u2019ibiribwa bifatanije n\u2019ibindi bintu bifitanye isano hagati ya 70 na 75 ku ijana, ariko Ethanol ikomoka mu bisukari ntabwo yagize uruhare runini mu izamuka ry\u2019ibiciro by\u2019ibiribwa biherutse. "}
{"id": "15256", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15256", "title": "Guhinga", "text": "Guhinga kwimura ni gahunda yu buhinzi aho usanga imirima ihingwa byigihe gito, hanyuma igatereranwa mugihe ibimera bitangiye guhungabana byemerewe gukura kubuntu mugihe umuhinzi yagiye guhinga ahandi. Igihe cyo guhinga gikunze kurangira iyo ubutaka bwerekana ibimenyetso by umunaniro cyangwa, iyo umurima urengerwa ni byatsi. Igihe cyigihe umurima uhingwamo ubusanzwe ni kigufi ugereranije nigihe ubutaka bwemerewe kubyara bushya kubeshya.\nIbidukikije muri politiki.\nGuhinduranya guhinga ni uburyo bwu buhinzi cyangwa gahunda yo guhinga, aho, mugihe runaka, mugihe gito, umurima muto uhingwa kandi benshi bari mu byiciro bitandukanye byo kongera gukura. Igihe kirenze, imirima ihingwa mugihe gito ugereranije, kandi yemerewe gukira, cyangwa igwa, mugihe kirekire. Amaherezo umurima wahinzwe mbere uzahanagurwa ku bimera karemano hanyuma uzongere guhingwa mu bihingwa. Imirima muri sisitemu yo guhinga yashyizweho kandi ihamye ihingwa kandi igwa buri gihe. Ubu bwoko bwo guhinga bwitwa jhumming mu Buhinde. "}
{"id": "15257", "revid": "11899", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15257", "title": "Igiterwa-ku-Umubumbe", "text": "Ibimera ku mubumbe ni umuryango ugamije gukangurira abana ndetse n\u2019abantu bakuru ku bijyanye n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere n\u2019ubutabera ku isi. ni igikorwa ikora kandi mu gutera ibiti kandi ibona ko iki ari igikorwa gifatika kandi cyi kigereranyo mu rwego rwo kugabanya ingaruka z\u2019imihindagurikire yi kirere. Muri 2011, yageze ku ntego yo gutera ibiti miliyoni. \nUyu muryango uri mu bafatanyabikorwa b\u2019urufatiro rwa Fondasiyo f 20, umuyoboro mpuzamahanga wi mishinga ni miryango ya bagiraneza. "}
{"id": "15258", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15258", "title": "Igifuniko gihoraho cyibimera", "text": "Igifuniko cyi bimera gihoraho bivuga ibiti, ibyatsi byinshi cyangwa nicyatsi, ibinyamisogwe, ni bihuru bifite ubuzima buteganijwe byibuze imyaka 5.\nMuri Reta zunze ubumwe za Amerika, hacyenewe igifuniko gihoraho ku butaka bwinjiye muri gahunda yo kubungabunga ibidukikije."}
{"id": "15259", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15259", "title": "Ubuhinzi bwa Kamere", "text": "Ubuhinzi bwa Kamere bwa shinzwe mu 1936 na Mokichi Okada, washinze Itorero ry isi mesiyaniti, gahunda y\u2019ubuhinzi yiswe nta feritilize farming. \nOffshoots nka Sekai Kyusei Kyo, iteza imbere 'ubuhinzi bw\u2019ibidukikije bwa Kuyuseyi', ni shyirahamwe rya Mokichi Okada rya shinzwe nyuma yu rupfu rwe kugira ngo rikomeze guteza imbere umurimo mu Buyapani no muri Aziya y'Amajyepfo-Uburasirazuba. \nihuriro ryu buhinzi muri Afurika yepfo rya hinduye iryo jambo muri Afurika. \nNk\u2019uko ikigo mpuzamahanga gishinzwe kubungabunga ibidukikije kiri i Nagano, mu Buyapani kibitangaza, gishingiye ku nyigisho zivuga ngo:"}
{"id": "15260", "revid": "11899", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15260", "title": "Ubuhinzi karemano", "text": "Sisitemu ikorana ni binyabuzima bitandukanye bya buri gace ka hinzwe, ishishikariza ibinyabuzima bifite ubuzima, ibimera ni nyamaswa, bigira uruhare runini mu binyabuzima kugira ngo bitere imbere hamwe ni bimera. Fukuoka yabonaga guhinga ari uburyo bwo gutanga ibiryo ndetse nku buryo bwiza cyangwa ubwumwuka mu buzima, intego nya mukuru yari iyo, guhinga no gutungana kwa bantu. Yasabye ko abahinzi bashobora kungukirwa no gukurikiranira hafi imiterere yaho. Ubuhinzi karemano ni uburyo bufunze, busaba ko nta nyongeramusaruro zitangwa n'abantu kandi bigana kamere. \nFukuoka yavuze ko uburyo bwe bukumira umwanda w\u2019amazi, gutakaza urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima ndetse n\u2019isuri y\u2019ubutaka, mu gihe bitanga ibiribwa byinshi, kandi ko hari ibikorwa byinshi bya siyansi bigenda byiyongera mu bijyanye n\u2019ubuhinzi n\u2019ubuhinzi bushya, ibyo bikaba bishyigikira ibyo birego. "}
{"id": "15261", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15261", "title": "Amababi yangiza", "text": "Rimwe na rimwe nti bisobanutse icyateye HABs yihariye kuko ibibera ahantu hamwe bigaragara ko ari ibintu bisanzwe, mu gihe ahandi bigaragara ko ari ibisubizo byi bikorwa bya bantu. Mu turere tumwe na tumwe hari aho uhurira na bashoferi nki ntungamubiri, ariko nazo zabayeho kuva mbere yuko abantu batangira kugira ingaruka kubidukikije. HABs iterwa na eutrophication, ikaba ari intungamubiri nyinshi mu mazi. Intungamubiri ebyiri zikunze kugaragara ni azote (nitirate, ammonia, na urea) na fosifate. Intungamubiri zirenze urugero zitangwa n'ubuhinzi, umwanda w\u2019inganda, gukoresha ifumbire ikabije mu mijyi / mu mijyi, hamwe no gutemba kw'imijyi. Ubushyuhe bwo hejuru bwamazi no gutembera gake nabyo bigira uruhare.\nIbisobanuro no kubiranga.\nIrashobora kugaragara nkifuro, ibibyimba, cyangwa mateli hejuru cyangwa munsi yubutaka bwamazi kandi irashobora gufata amabara atandukanye bitewe nibibara. ibiro byimshwe irabya mu biyaga cyangwa imigezi y'amazi meza bishobora kugaragara nk'icyatsi kibisi, akenshi gifite imirongo igaragara isa n'irangi ireremba. Indabyo za Cyane bacteriya nikibazo cyisi yose. "}
{"id": "15262", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15262", "title": "Gutunganya amazi y\u2019ubuhinzi", "text": "Abahinzi barashobora gu shiraho ibikorya birwanya isuri nziza kugirango bagabanye imigezi kandi bagumane ubutaka mu mirima yabo. \u200aUbuhanga busanzwe burimo guhinga konteri, guhinga ibihingwa, guhinduranya ibihingwa, gutera ibihingwa bimaze igihe no gushyiraho imigezi yinzuzi. \u200aAbahinzi barashobora kandi guteza imbere no gushyira mubikorwa gahunda yo gucunga intungamubiri kugirango bagabanye gukoresha intungamubiri zikabije no kugabanya ubushobozi bwo kwanduza intungamubiri. Kugabanya ingaruka ziterwa nudukoko, abahinzi barashobora gukoresha uburyo bwo kurwanya udukoko twangiza (bushobora no kurwanya udukoko twangiza) kugirango bakomeze kurwanya udukoko, kugabanya kwishingira imiti yica udukoko, no kurinda ubwiza bw\u2019amazi. "}
{"id": "15263", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15263", "title": "Ibinyabuzima bitandukanye mu buhinzi", "text": "Ibinyabuzima bitandukanye mu buhinzi ni igipimo cyi binyabuzima ki boneka ku butaka bwu buhinzi. Ibinyabuzima bi tandukanye nu bwoko butandukanye bwi binyabuzima biboneka mu karere ku nzego zose zi binyabuzima. Irangwa nu buturo butandukanye butera inkunga ibidukikije bitandukanye. Mu bice by\u2019ubuhinzi, urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima rugabanuka uko ahantu nyaburanga hatakaye kandi ibihingwa kavukire bigasimbuzwa ibihingwa bihingwa. Kongera urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima mu buhinzi birashobora kongera imirima irambye binyuze mu kugarura serivisi z\u2019ibidukikije zifasha mu kugenzura ubutaka bw\u2019ubuhinzi. Ibinyabuzima bitandukanye mu buhinzi birashobora kwiyongera binyuze mu nzira yo gusana ubuhinzi bw\u2019ibinyabuzima, kubera ko urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima ari kimwe mu bigize ubuhinzi.\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nUbuhinzi buteza amakimbirane ku mikoreshereze y\u2019ubutaka hagati y\u2019ibinyabuzima n\u2019abantu. Imikoreshereze yubutaka mu buhinzi yabaye imbarutso yo guteza igihombo cy\u2019ibinyabuzima. Ubwiyongere bw'inzuri n'ubutaka bw'ibihingwa mu myaka magana ashize byatumye habaho gutakaza vuba aho gutura. Ishami ry'Umuryango w'Abibumbye ryita ku biribwa n'ubuhinzi rivuga ko ubu hejuru ya 40% by'ubutaka bw'isi bukoreshwa mu buhinzi. Kubera ko ubutaka bwinshi bwahinduwe mubuhinzi, gutakaza aho gutura bizwi nkimbaraga zitera ibinyabuzima bitandukanye. Igabanuka ryibinyabuzima bitandukanye birashobora guterwa nimpinduka mubikorwa byubuhinzi no kongera ingufu mubuhinzi. Nubwo bimeze bityo ariko, nk'uko ibivuga, \"urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima ni ingenzi cyane mu mirima no mu mirima nk'uko biri mu mibande miremire cyangwa mu mashyamba y'ibicu byo mu misozi\". Mu myaka yashize, isi yemeye agaciro k\u2019ibinyabuzima binyuze mu masezerano yashyizweho, nko mu Masezerano yo mu 1992 yerekeye ibinyabuzima bitandukanye. "}
{"id": "15264", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15264", "title": "Ubuhinzi bugenzurwa-ibidukikije", "text": "Urebye ubuhinzi bwo mu mijyi, irashobora kubaho imbere uko batswe, hakiyoneraho kubigenewe cyangwa mu butaka no munsi yisi. Icyerekezo kigenda cyi yongera mu buryo butandukanye biribwa, kuko ba rwi yemezamirimo n'urugo bashaka guhaza ibikenerwa byi biribwa bishya. \nGushyira mu bikorwa tekinike.\nUburyo bwa CEA burashobora gukoreshwa mugukura mubyukuri ibihingwa ibyo aribyo byose, nubwo ikigaragara ari igihingwa kigomba kubaho neza mubukungu kandi ibi bizatandukana cyane bitewe nigiciro cyisoko ryaho, nigiciro cyumutungo. Kugeza ubu, inyanya, icyatsi kibisi n\u2019ibimera nigihingwa cyiza cyane mubukungu. \nImpamvu.\nCEA ikoreshwa mubushakashatsi kugirango ikintu runaka cyumusaruro gishobora kwigunga mugihe izindi mpinduka zose ziguma ari zimwe. Kurugero, ikoreshwa ryikirahure cyirabura cyashoboraga kugereranywa nikirahure kiboneye murubu buryo mugihe cyiperereza ryakozwe na fotosintezeza. \nIngaruka zo mu mujyi.\nUkurikije ibyavuye mu mahugurwa ya USDA muri 2018:\nInganda.\nKuva hagati ya 2021, bivugwa ko miliyoni kare 16.55 (hegitari 380 / hegitari 154) z'imirima yo mu nzu yakoraga ku isi. Raporo \"y\u2019ubuhinzi bw\u2019imbere mu gihugu\" ivuga ko ibi biziyongera kugera kuri miliyoni 22 (hegitari 505 / hegitari 204) mu 2022. (Ugereranije, USDA yatangaje ko hegitari \"miliyoni\" 915 (hegitari \"miliyoni\" 38) z\u2019ubutaka bwo muri Amerika, bwonyine, muri 2012.) \nUbukungu.\nUbukungu bw\u2019ubuhinzi bwo mu ngo bwabaye ingorabahizi, hamwe n\u2019ishoramari ryinshi n\u2019igiciro cyo gukoresha ingufu - cyane cyane igiciro cy\u2019amashanyarazi - kandi gutangiza byinshi byahagaritswe. Ubushakashatsi bwakozwe muri Amerika muri 2018 bwerekanye ko 51% gusa by\u2019ibikorwa byo guhinga mu ngo byunguka. "}
{"id": "15265", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15265", "title": "Nelson Boateng", "text": "Samuel Nelson Boateng (wavutse ku ya 14 Gicurasi 1968) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa kumaguru wabigize umwuga ukomoka muri Gana wasezeye mu kwiruka yari kabuhariwe muri metero 200. \nYatsindiye umudari muri Shampiyona nya furika yo mu 1989. Muri Shampiyona nya furika yo mu 1993 yatsindiye imidari haba muri metero 100 na 200. Muri uwo mwaka yitabiriye amarushanwa yi si ya 1993. Yaviriyemo muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza, amaze gushyiraho agahigo ka amasegonda 20.52. Yitabiriye kandi imikino Olempike yo mu 1992 yabereye i Barcelona. \nMuri kaminuza, yabaye umukinnyi mwiza inshuro 2, mu banyamerika muri metero 200 mu 1993 na metero 4 X 100 mu 1991 nku mukinnyi wa nyuma muri ibyo birori byombi. "}
{"id": "15266", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15266", "title": "Tanko Braimah", "text": "Tanko Braimah (wavutse ku ya 12 Gicurasi 1979) ni umukinnyi wa siporo wabigize umwuga ukomoka muri Gana yari kabuhariwe muri metero 200. \nYitabiriye imikino Olempike yo mu 2000 na 2004, ariko ntiyatsindai. Mu 2000 nti yemerewe gukina metero 200 kubera ibwangobwa. Mu 2004 yarushanwe muri metero 4 x 100. \nIbihe byiza yagize amasegonda 6.72 muri metero 60, yagezeho muri Mutarama 2006 i Ann Arbor; amasegonda 10.31 muri metero 100, yagezweho muri Nyakanga 2003; n'amasegonda 20.62 muri metero 200, byagezweho muri Gicurasi 1999. "}
{"id": "15267", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15267", "title": "Rex Brobby", "text": "Rex Brobby (yavutse ku ya 21 Gashyantare 1958) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga wo gusiganwa muri Gana. Yitabiriye imikino ya metero 4 \u00d7 100 mu bagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1984. "}
{"id": "15268", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15268", "title": "Sam Bugri", "text": "Sam Bugri (wavutse ku ya 2 Mata 1943) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga wo gusiganwa ku maguru ukomoka muri Gana. Yarushanwe muri metero 400 mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1968 na Olempike yo mu 1972. "}
{"id": "15269", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15269", "title": "George Daniels (umukinnyi)", "text": "George Kofi Daniels (8 Werurwe 1950 - 13 Kanama 2005) yari umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga mu gusiganwa ku maguru ukomoka muri Gana witabiriye imikino Olempike yo mu 1972. "}
{"id": "15270", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15270", "title": "Emmanuel Dasor", "text": "Emmanuel Dasor (wavutse ku ya 14 Nzeri 1995) ni umukinnyi siporo wa bigize umwuga ukomoka muri Gana, yari kabuhariwe mu kwiruka metero 200 na metero 400. Yaserukiye igihugu cye cya Gana, mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga yo mu nzu muri 2016 gusa ntiyakomeza mucyiciro cyi sumbuyeho.\nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nHanze\nMu nzu"}
{"id": "15271", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15271", "title": "Makarios Djan", "text": "Makarios Djan (wavutse ku ya 3 Kamena 1955) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru wa bigize umwuga ukomoka muri Gana. Yitabiriye imikino ya metero 4 \u00d7 100 mu bagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1984. "}
{"id": "15272", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15272", "title": "Francis Dodoo", "text": "Francis Dodoo (wavutse ku ya 13 Mata 1960) ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga ukomoka mu gihugu cya Gana wasezeye mu marushanwa yo kwiruka muri marato no gusimbuka inshuro eshatu. Yatsindiye umudari wa zahabu mu mikino yo muri Afurika yo mu 1987 nu mudari wa feza muri Shampiyona ny'afurika yo mu 1992, kandi yatsinze mu mikino Olempike aza ku mwanya wa 17 kuva mu 1988.\nFrancis Dodoo ubu ni umuhanga mu byi mibereho ya bantu muri kaminuza ya Penisilivaniya."}
{"id": "15273", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15273", "title": "Abu Duah", "text": "Abu Duah (wavutse ku ya 5 Kamena mumwaka wi 1978) Ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga ukora siporo yo kwiruka ukomoka muri Gana uzobereye muri metero 100. Yarushanwe muri metero 4 \u00d7 400 mu mikino Olempike yo mu mwaka wi 1996 na Olempike yo mu 2000. \nDuah yegukanye umwanya wa gatanu muri metero 4 x 100 mu marushanwa ya Shampiyona y'isi yabaye mu mwaka wi 1997, ari kumwe na bagenzi be aribo Eric Nkansah, Aziz Zakari na Emmanuel Tuffour. Iyi kipe yari imaze gushyiraho agahigo mu gihugu k'amasegonda 38.12 muri kimwe cya kabiri cy'irangiza. \nIgihe byiza yagize ni mu ntera yu muntu kugiti cye akoresha amasegonda 10.31 yageze muri Nyakanga 2001 muri Arnhem. Kugeza ubu agahigo afite muri Gana ni iya Leonard Myles-Mills n'amasegonda 9.98. "}
{"id": "15274", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15274", "title": "Nadia Eke", "text": "Nadia Eke (yavutse ku ya 11 Mutarama 1993,) ni umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga ukomoka i Accra muri Gana usimbuka gatatu.\nUburezi.\nEke afite impamyabumenyi muri kaminuza ya Columbia mu 2015. \nUmwuga.\nMuri 2014, yarangije mu cya cumi mu mikino ya bavuga icyongereza yabereye i Glasgow, ye gukana umudali wa ifeza mu marushanwa nya furika yabereye i Marrakech kandi aba uwa karindwi mu gikombe cyu mugabane wa IAAF.\nYatsindiye kandi umudali wu muringa mu mikino nya furika yabereye i Brazzaville mu 2015. Muri 2016, yabaye shampiyo wa furika muri Shampiyona ya furika muri 2016. \nYarafite ibyangombwa byo guhagararira Gana mu mikino Olempike ya 2020 mu birori byo gusimbuka mu bagore ari batatu. \nIbyiza bye bwite.\nHanze\nMu nzu"}
{"id": "15275", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15275", "title": "Billy Fordjour", "text": "William Fordjour (wavutse ku ya 26 Werurwe 1948) ni umukinnyi ukomoak muri Gana wiruka aharingani nko hagati. Yitabiriye metero 1500 mu bagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1972. "}
{"id": "15276", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15276", "title": "Ignisious Gaisah", "text": "Ignisious Gaisah (wavutse ku ya 20 Nyakanga 1983) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga uvuka muri Gana uhatanira gusimbuka birebire mu Buholandi.\nUmwuga.\nGaisah yimukiye mu Buholandi mu 2001, ubu akaba atuye na gari ya moshi i Rotterdam. Arahatanira PAC Rotterdam.\nMu 2005 yasimbutse metero zigera kuri 8.34 ku giti cye, kugira ngo yegukane umudari wa feza mu marushanwa y'isi yabereye i Helsinki, arangiza inyuma ya Dwight Phillips. Ku ya 2 Gashyantare 2006, i Stockholm yasimbutse agira agahigo muri Afurika yo mu nzu yamuhesheje umudari wa zahabu muri uyu mukino asimbuka metero 8.36. Yakomeje kwitwara neza kugira ngo yegukane igikombe cya Shampiyona y\u2019imbere mu nzu ya IAAF 2006 nyuma yu kwezi kumwe asimbuka metero 8,30, ahabwa umudari wa zahabu mugihugu bivu icyongereza muri 2006 mu gusimbuka metero 8.20.\nMu marushanwa ya Afurika yo mu 2006 yaberaga mu mikino ngororamubiri i Gaisah yegukanye umudari wa zahabu asimbuka metero 8.51, yegukana kuba shapiyo wa furika muri metero 8.46 kuva mu 1997, ariko kubera ko umuyaga wari mwinshi ukoresha 3.7. Kuva muri Nyakanga 2013 Gaisah yitabira mu buholandi andi marushanwa nyuma yo kubona pasiporo ye yo mu Buholandi. "}
{"id": "15277", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15277", "title": "Salaam Gariba", "text": "Salaam Gariba (wavutse ku ya 23 Mutarama 1969) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa wabigize umwuga uvuka i Tamale muri Gana wasezeye ajya mu kiruhuko cyi zabukuru yari kabuhariwe muri metero 100. \nYatsindiye umudari muri Shampiyona nya furika yo mu 1989. Yageze muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza muri Shampiyona yisi 1991 nomuri Shampiyona y'isi muri 1987. Yitabiriye kandi amarushanwa y'isi yo mu 1993 ndetse ni mikino Olempike yo mu 1988. \nIbihe byiza yagize ni amasegonda 10.27, yagezweho muri Mata 1991 muri Philadelphia. "}
{"id": "15278", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15278", "title": "Beatrice Gyaman", "text": "Beatrice Gyaman (wavutse ku ya 17 Gashyantare 1987) ni umukinnyi uvuka muri Gana wa kinaga amasiganwa ku maguru uzobereye mu gu siganwa ku maguru. Yatsindiye imidari mu kwiruka metero 4 \u00d7 100 muri Shampiyona eshatu nya furika, ndetse n'imikino ya bavuga icyongereza muri 2010. \nUburezi.\nGyaman yize uburezi bwibanze muri kaminuza ya Cape Coast. \nIbyiza bye bwite.\nHanze"}
{"id": "15279", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15279", "title": "Robert Hackman", "text": "Robert Hackman (1 Mutarama 1941 - 23 Werurwe 2018) yahoze ari umukinnyi wu bagabo ukomoka muri Gana. Yahagarariye Gana muri metero 3000 mu kwiruka mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1972. "}
{"id": "15280", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15280", "title": "Rose Hart", "text": "Rose Hart (wavutse ku ya 9 Mutarama 1942) ni umukinnyi wabigize umwuga mu bagore wasezeye ari mu kiruhuko cyiza ukomoka muri Gana. Yari inzobere mu kugenda, gusiganwa ku maguru no gutera umuhunda mu gihe cye. \nHart yaserukiye Gana mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1964. Yatsinze inshuro ebyiri umudari wa zahabu,ahagarariye igihugu cye kavukire cya Afurika y'Iburengerazuba mu mikino ya Afurika muri 1965 na 1973. "}
