{"id": "15284", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15284", "title": "Ohene Karikari", "text": "Ohene Karikari (wavutse ku ya 1 Ukuboza 1954) yahoze ari umukinnyi wabigize umwuga ukina siporo ukomoka muri Gana, wari uhagarariye igihugu cye kavukire cya Afurika y'Iburengerazuba mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1972 yabereye i Munich, mu Budage bw'Uburengerazuba. Azwi cyane mu gutsindira imidari ibiri ya zahabu muri metero 100 na 200 mu mikino yabereye muri Afurika 1973 yabereye i Lagos, muri Nijeriya. "}
