{"id": "15294", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15294", "title": "John Myles-Mills", "text": "John Myles-Mills (wavutse ku ya 19 Mata 1966) ni umukinnyi wagusiganwa ukomoka muri Gana wasezeye mu marushanwa ya metero 100 na 200. Yahagarariye Gana mu mikino Olempike mu 1988 na 1992, ahagararira igihugu muri ibyo bihe byombi. Yirutse mu ikipe y'igihugu haba muri Shampiyona y'isi yo muri 1987 na 1991 mu kwiruka Bagenzi be barimo Eric Akogyiram, Salaam Gariba na Emmanuel Tuffour, ndetse na Nelson Boateng mu ikipe ya Olempike.\nMurumuna we Leonard Myles-Mills na we yari umukinnyi wa siporo. "}
{"id": "15295", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15295", "title": "Leonard Myles-Mills", "text": "Leonard Myles-Mills (yavutse ku ya 9 Gicurasi 1973,) avukira mu Karere ka Girita i Accra muri Gana,afite ubwenegihugu bwa kanada wahoze ari umukinnyi wi nzobere muri metero 100. Yirutse ku giti cye amasegonda 9.98 muri ayo marushanwa mu 1998, aba umunya Gana wa mbere watsinze inzitizi y'amasegonda 10. Ibihe byiza yagize ni amasegonda 6.45 kuri metero 60 ni agahigo ko muri afurika. Myles-Mills yahagarariye igihugu cye inshuro ebyiri mu mikino Olempike ndetse no mu mikino ya bavuga icyongereza. yatsinze inshuro ebyiri mu marushanwa ya bagabo muri metero 100 aba uwambere, mu gihe yarimo kwiyamamariza muri kaminuza ya Brigham.\nMurumuna we John Myles-Mills na we yari umukinnyi wa siporo. \nYatsindiye umudari wa zahabu mu mikino yo muri Afurika yo mu 1999, umudari wa feza mu mikino yo muri Afurika yo mu 2003 ndetse nu mudari muri Shampiyona nyafurika yo mu 1998. Mu 1999 yashyizeho agahigo muri afurika muri metero 60 na masegonda 6.45. Umuhigo mwiza yagize ni muri metero 100, akoresha amasegonda 9,98 kari agahigo muri Gana kugeza Benjamin Azamati agakuyeho yiruka amasegonda 9.97 muri metero 100 muri Texas ku ya 26 Werurwe 2021. \nYitabiriye imikino Olempike yo mu 2004, yegukanye umwanya wa gatatu muri metero 100, bityo abona impamyabumenyi i. yashoboye kujya muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza, akurikira umwanya wa gatatu muri iryo siganwa kandi yandika ko hari byinshi byateye imbere. Yarangije kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza ku mwanya wa gatandatu, bityo ananirwa kubona ibyangombwa kugeza ku mukino wa nyuma. \nMyles-Mills ni umwe mu bagize Itorero rya Yesu Kristo ry'abatagatifu ba nyuma. \nAmarushanwa mpuzamahanga.\nAmarushanwa mpuzamahanga yagiyemo"}
{"id": "15296", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15296", "title": "Eric Nkansah", "text": "Eric Nkansah Appiah (yavutse ku ya 12 Ukuboza 1974) ni umukinnyi wirukanka ukomoka muri Gana yari kabuhariwe muri metero 100.\nNi umwe mu bafite amateka y\u2019igihugu mu kwiruka metero 4 x 100 akoresha amasegonda 38,12, yagezeho muri Shampiyona y'isi yo muri 1997 yabereye muri Atenayi aho ikipe ya Gana yarangije ku mwanya wa gatanu ku mukino wa nyuma. \nYitabiriye imikino Olempike yo mu 2004, yageze ku mwanya wa gatandatu mu marushanwa muri metero 100, bityo abura umwanya wo kujya mu cyiciro cya 2 cya marushanwa. Yatsindiye umudari muri Shampiyona nyafurika 2006\nIbihe byiza yagize ni amasegonda 10.00, yagezweho bwa mbere muri kamena 1999 i Nuremberg. Kugeza ubu agahigo ko muri Gana ni iya Leonard Myles-Mills na masegonda 9.98. "}
{"id": "15297", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15297", "title": "Christian Nsiah", "text": "Christian Nsiah (wavutse ku ya 25 Ukuboza 1975) ni umukinnyi ukora siporo wo gusiganwa muri Gana wasezeye mu marushanwa ya metero 200.\nYagiye mu gikombe cy'isi mu 1999 no mu mikino Olempike mu 1996, 2000 na 2004, ariko ntiyagera mu cyiciro cyi sumbuye. \nIbihe byiza yagize ni amasegonda 6.58 muri 60m, yagezweho muri Mutarama 1999 muri Colorado, 10.19 mu kwiruka metero 100, yagezweho muri Nyakanga 2000 i Lapinlahti; na masegonda 20.48 mu kwiruka metero 200, byagezweho muri Mata 2002 i Knoxville.\nHamwe na Leo Myles-Mills, Aziz Zakari, na Eric Nkansah, begukanye umudari wa zahabu mu isiganwa rya metero 4x100 mu gikombe cy'Afurika 2003 cyabereye Abuja, muri Nijeriya. Niwe ufite agahigo mu kwiruka mu nzu mu iminota 6.24. Hari igihe yibeshye yahawe umudari wisi ku isi mu kwiruka metero 55, nyuma yigihe cye cya masegonda 5.81 banditswe nabi muri elegitoroniki.\nYize muri kaminuza ya Leta ya Tennessee i Murfreesboro, muri Leta ya Tennesse, aho yakuye impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bucuruzi bwu bucuruzi muri 1999, impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu by'ubukungu muri 2001, na Dogiteri wa Filozofiya mu by'ubukungu muri 2005. Andi mashuri yize harimo kaminuza y\u2019amajyepfo ya Orleans, Kaminuza ya Gana, Ishuri rya Opoku Ware, n\u2019ishuri ryitegura ry\u2019a bahowe Imana Uganda muri Gana."}
{"id": "15298", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15298", "title": "Vida Nsiah", "text": "Vida Nsiah (wavutse ku ya 13 Mata 1976) ni umukinnyi wu mukobwa wa sezeye uri mukiruhuko cyi zabukuru ukomoka muri Gana. Mu mikino ya bavuag icyongereza yabereye i Kuala Lumpur mu 1998, yaje ku mwanya wa gatanu muri metero 100 na gatandatu muri 200m \nHamwe na Mavis Akoto, Monica Twum na Vida Anim, afite agahigo muri Gana mu kwiruka metero 4x100 na masegonda 43.19, ibyo bikaba byagezweho mu mu mikino y'Olempike yo mu 2000 yabereye i Sydney. "}
{"id": "15299", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15299", "title": "Michael Okantey", "text": "Michael Okantey (wavutse 30 Ukwakira 1939) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muriGana wahoze yiruka mu marushanwa ya Olempike yo mu 1960 ndetse no mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1964. "}
{"id": "15300", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15300", "title": "Sandy Osei-Agyemang", "text": "Sandy Osei-Agyemang (wavutse ku ya 19 Nyakanga 1949) ni umukinnyi wa bigize ukomoka muri Gana wahoze yiruka mu marushanwa ya Olempike yo mu 1972. \nSandy yazamutse mu cyiciro cya kabiri muri metero 100 z'abagabo na metero 4 \u00d7 100 z'abagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1972."}
{"id": "15301", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15301", "title": "Kennedy Osei", "text": "Kennedy Osei (wavutse ku ya 21 Ukwakira 1966) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Gana uri mu kiruhuko cyi zabukuru wi ruka hagati ya metero 800.\nYatsindiye umudari mu mikino yo muri afurika yo mu 1991. Yitabiriye kandi amarushanwa y\u2019isi mu 1993 na 1997 ndetse n\u2019irushanwa ry\u2019imbere mu nzu mu 1993 na 1997, agera muri kimwe cya kabiri kuri buri mwanya."}
{"id": "15302", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15302", "title": "James Owoo", "text": "James Owoo (wavutse ku ya 16 Ukuboza 1927) yari umukinnyi uvuka muri Gana. Yitabiriye gusimbuka hejuru mu bagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1952. "}
{"id": "15303", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15303", "title": "Flings Owusu-Agyapong", "text": "Flings Owusu-Agyapong (yavutse ku ya 16 Ukwakira 1988) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa wabigize umwuga yavukiye i Kumasi, muri Gana ku babyeyi Kwadwo Agyapong na Adwoa Akomaa yimukira i Toronto, muri Kanada afite imyaka 9. Yatangiye imyitozo hamwe na ikipe ngororamubiri ya Flying Angels nyuma yumwaka wa kabiri w'amashuri yisumbuye. Muri 2006 na 2007 yakoze ikipe y'intara ya Ontario muri Shampiyona yi gihugu yo mu nzu. \nOwusu-Agyapong yize muri kaminuza ya Syracuse yiga ya siporo. Yiga yagize agahigo muri metero 55, 60, na 100 yari inshuro ya kabiri ikipe ya 2 muri merika. Yarangije muri Syracuse afite impamyabumenyi mu buzima rusange. \nYarushanwe muri metero 100 na metero 4 x 100 mu mikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi ya 2016 yabereye i Rio de Janeiro, muri Burezili. Yabaye kandi ibendera ryi kipe ya Gana mu birori byo gutangiza. \nUmwuga.\nOwusu-Agyapong yitabiriye metero 60 mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga yo mu nzu muri 2014 na 2016 gusa nytiyasoje icyiciro cya cya mbere.\nYarushanwe muri metero 100 na metero 4 x 100 mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2016. Yabonye itiki ya metero 100 muri Mata 2016 yiruka muri 11.30 mu butumire bwa Miyami muri 2016 i Miami, muri Floride. Hamwe na bagenzi be Gemma Acheampong, Janet Amponsah, na Beatrice Gyaman yatsindiye itike yo kwiruka metero 4 x 100 ku ya 8 Nyakanga 2016 yiruka 42.67 kugira ngo atsinde metero 4 x 100 muri Cape Coast. Igihe cya 42.67 cyari ibihe byiza mu gihugu, usibye agahigo yagize 43.19 yari ahagaze muri 2000. Iyi kipe kandi yatsindiye umudari wa feza muri Shampiyona nyafurika ya 2016 yabereye i Durban muri Kamena 2016 mu gihe cya 44.05. \nMu mikino Olempike ya 2016 yarangije ku mwanya wa 4 mu bushyuhe bwa metero 100 mu gihe cya 11.43 ariko ntiyerekeza muri kimwe cya kabiri. Muri metero 4 \u00d7 100 ikipe yarangije umwanya wa 8 mubushyuhe bwayo mugihe cya 43.47 kandi ntabwo yujuje ibyanyuma.\nAmarushanwa.\n1 Ntibemerewe muri kimwe cya kabiri\nIbyiza byawe bwite.\nHanze\nMu nzu"}
{"id": "15304", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15304", "title": "Andereya Owusu", "text": "Dr. Andrew Owusu (wavutse ku ya 8 Nyakanga 1972) ni umukinnyi wiruka ukomoka muri Gana wi tabiriye gusimbuka gatatu no gusimbuka birebire.\nIbihe byiza yagize ni ugusimbuka gatatu muri metero 17.23, yageze muri Kanama 1998 i Dakar. Ubu ni agahigo muri Gana kimwe na kane mu gusimbuka inshuro eshatu muri Afurika, inyuma ya Ndabazinhle Mdhlongwa muri metero 17.34, Ajayi Agbebaku metero 17.26 na Khotso Mokoena muri metero 17,25. Ibihe byiza bye ku giti cye mu gusimbuka birebire ni metero 8,12, yagezweho ku ya 24 Kamena 1995, i Saarij\u00e4rvi. Ibihe byiza bye mu gusimbuka birebire ni agahigo muri Gana hagati ya 1995 na 2003.\nYabonye dogiteri yakuye muri kaminuza ya Leta ya Tenesee yo hagati mu 2004, guhera mu 2021, ni Porofeseri wuzuye mu gice cy\u2019ubuzima rusange mu ishami ry\u2019ubuzima n\u2019imikorere y\u2019abantu muri kaminuza ya Leta ya Tenese. Yitanze kandi nku mutoza wu ngirije mu mikino yo gusimbuka gutambitse.\nDr. Owusu yari umuhuzabikorwa w\u2019igihugu cya Gana muri gahunda yo kugenzura ubuzima bw\u2019abanyeshuri bushingiye ku ishuri rya Gana muri 2006 kugeza 2020. Sisitemu ya nyuma yo kugenzura yacunzwe ku bufatanye n\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubuzima ku isi, Ikigo cy\u2019Amerika gishinzwe kurwanya no gukumira indwara na serivisi ishinzwe uburezi muri Gana. \nAmarushanwa.\n1 Ntabwo yatangiriye kumukino wanyuma"}
{"id": "15305", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15305", "title": "Edward Owusu", "text": "Edward Owusu (wavutse ku ya 15 Werurwe 1944) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Gana wahoze asiganwa ku maguru witabiriye imikino Olempike yo mu 1968. "}
{"id": "15306", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15306", "title": "Alemitu Tariku", "text": "Alemitu Tariku (28 Nzeri 2000) ni umukinnyi ukomoko muri Etiyopiya. \nUmwuga.\nAlemitu Tariku yabonya ubunararibonye mpuzamahanga bwa mbere mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga yaberaga mu gihugu muri 2019 yabereye i Aarhus, yegukanye umudari wa feza mu cyiciro cya batarengeje imyaka 20 mu minota 20:50 inyuma yu munyakenya Beatrice Chebet kandi yegukana umudari wa zahabu i kipe ya Etiyopiya. Yatsinze metero 3000 mu marushanwa ya Afurika yaberaga i Abidjan mu minota 9: 33.53. Muri Kanama yegukanye umudari wa bronze muri metero zirenga 5000 mu minota 15: 37.15 mu mikino nya furika ya bereye i Rabat inyuma y\u2019umunyakenya Lilian Kasait Rengeruk na mugenzi we Hawi Feysa. "}
{"id": "15307", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15307", "title": "Houda Ben Daya", "text": "Houda Ben Daya (wavutse ku ya 21 Nyakanga 1979) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa jido ukomoka muri Tuniziya, wi tabiriye icyiciro cya kabiri cya marushanwa ya bagore baremereye. Yatwaye imidari itanu, harimo iya zahabu eshatu zo muri Shampiyona nya furika ndetse nu muringa mu mikino ya mediterane yo mu 2001 yabereye muri Tuniziya, maze ahagararira igihugu cye cya Tuniziya mu birometero 78 mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2004. \nBen Daya yujuje ibisabwa mu ikipe ya Tuniziya mu cyiciro cya bagore baremereye mu biro 78 mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2004 yabereye muri Atenayi, mu kuza ku mwanya wa jido no guhabwa ikiruhuko muri Shampiyona nya furika yabereye muri Tuniziya. Yatsinzwe umukino wo gufungura na Edinanci Silva wo muri Berezile, watsinze ippon maze amurusha imbaraga kuri tatami akoresheje uchi mata mu minota itatu na masegonda cumi n'u munani. "}
{"id": "15308", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15308", "title": "Mohamed Sofiane Belrekaa", "text": "Mohamed Sofiane Belrekaa (wavutse ku ya 21 Werurwe 1991) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa jido ukomoka muri Alijeriya. Yahagarariye Alijeriya mu mikino nyafurika ya 2019 yabereye i Rabat, muri Maroke kandi yegukana umudari wa feza mu bagabo + 100 kg. \nMu marushanwa ya Afurika 2021 yabereye i Dakar, muri Senegali, yegukanye umudari wa feza mu birori bye. \nYatsindiye umudari wa feza mu bagabo mu biro 100 mu birori bya 2022 Mediterane yabereye Oran, Alijeriya. "}
{"id": "15309", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15309", "title": "Sami Belgroun", "text": "Sami Belgroun (wavutse 12 Mata 1975) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa jido ukomoka muri Alijeriya."}
{"id": "15310", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15310", "title": "Adil Belga\u00efd", "text": "Adil Belga\u00efd (yavutse 15 Nzeri 1970)ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa jido ukomoka muri Maroke."}
{"id": "15311", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15311", "title": "Sofiya Belattar", "text": "Sofia Belattar (yavutse ku ya 9 Gashyantare 1995) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa jido ukomoko muri Maroke.\nMuri 2019, yegukanye umudari wa feza mu bagore bapima 63 mu marushanwa ya Afurika ya Jido yabereye i Cape Town, muri Afurika y'Epfo. Muri 2020, yatsindiye umudari wa feza muri iki gikorwa mu marushanwa nyafurika ya Jido yabereye i Antananarivo, muri Madagasikari. "}
{"id": "15312", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15312", "title": "Djegui Bathily", "text": "Djegui Bathily (yavutse ku ya 25 Gashyantare 1977) ni umukinnyi ukina umukina wa jido ukomoka muri Senegali, wakinnye mu cyiciro kiremereye. Yatsindiye imidari ibiri mu cyiciro mu mikino yaberaga muri afurika yo mu 2007 yabereye muri Alijeriya, no mu marushanwa ya Afurika ya Jido yo mu 2008 yabereye i Agadir, muri Marocke. \nBathily yaserukiye Senegali mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2008 yabereye i Beijing, aho yarushanijwe mu cyiciro kiremereye cy\u2019abagabo bafite ibiro 100. Yakiriye neza icyiciro cya kabiri kibanziriza iki, mbere yo gutsindwa, na yuko ebyiri hamwe na tekinike yo kutarwana, na Jidoka wo muri Amerika Daniel McCormick. "}
{"id": "15313", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15313", "title": "Isa Bassu", "text": "Issam Bassou (wavutse 10 Ukwakira 1998) ni umukinnyi ukuna umukino wa jido ukomoka muriMaroke. Yatsindiye imidari ya zahabu mu mikino nya furika yo muri 2019 na Shampiyona nya furika yo muri 2018 mu bagabo batarengeje ibiro 60. Murumuna we Imad Bassou nawe ni umukinnyi wa jido. \nMuri 2020, yatsindiye umudari wa feza mu bagabo batarengeje ibiro 60 mu marushanwa ya furika ya Jido muri 2020 yabereye Antananarivo, Madagasikari. \nMu marushanwa ya furika 2021 yabereye i Dakar, muri Senegali, yegukanye umudari wa zahabu mu marushanwa ya bafite ibiro 60 mu bagabo. \nYatsindiye umwe mu midari mu bagabo mu biro 60 mu bagabo mu mikino ya Mediterane ya 2022 yabereye i Oran, muri Alijeriya. \nIhuza ryo hanze.\nIssam Bassou muri federasiyo mpuzamahanga ya Judo\nIssam Bassou kuri JudoInside.com\nIssam Bassou kuri AllJudo.net (mu gifaransa)\nIssam Bassou kuri The-Sports.org"}
{"id": "15314", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15314", "title": "Abbao Bartolomeu", "text": "Abb\u00e3o Dias Bartolomeu (wavutse 15 Werurwe 1966) ni umukinnyi wahoze ari umukinnyi wa jido, ukomoka muri gihugu cya Angola. Yitabiriye amarushanwa adasanzwe y\u2019abagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1988. "}
{"id": "15315", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15315", "title": "Ahmed Barbach", "text": "Ahmed Barbach (wavutse 1963) Ni umukinnyi ukina imikono ya jido ukomoka muro Maroke. Yitabiriye imikino ya kimwe cya kabiri mu baremereye mu bagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1988. "}
{"id": "15316", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15316", "title": "Mamadama Bangoura", "text": "Mamadama Bangoura (yavutse ku ya 10 Ugushyingo 1993) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa jido ukomoka muri Gineya.\nUmwuga.\nYitabiriye imikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi ya 2016 mu bagore baterengeje ibiro 63, aho yatsinze na Estefania Garc\u00eda mu cyiciro cya mbere. Yabaye ibendera rya Gineya muri Parade y\u2019ibihugu. \nMamadama Bangoura ntiyagarutse muri Gineya nyuma y'imikino Olempike yo mu 2016 yabereye muri Burezili, kuko yaburiwe irengero nyuma yo gusiga ubutumwa avuga ko ashaka kugerageza amahirwe mu mahanga. "}
{"id": "15317", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15317", "title": "Ahmed Baly", "text": "Ahmed Baly (wavutse ku ya 3 Gashyantare 1976) ni umukinnyi ukina imikino ya jido ukomoka mu Misiri. "}
{"id": "15318", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15318", "title": "Mariama Sonah Bah", "text": "Mariama Sonah Bah (yavutse ku ya 21 Gicurasi 1978) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa jido ukomoka muri Gineya. Yarushanwe mu bagore baremereye hagati mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2000. "}
{"id": "15319", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15319", "title": "Mamadou Samba Bah", "text": "Mamadou Samba Bah (wavutse ku ya 13 Gicurasi 1995) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa jido ukomoka muri Gineya uhata mu cyiciro cya batarengeje ibiro 73.\nYatoranijwe kuzitabira imikino Olempike yatsinze mu 2020 yabereye i Tokiyo, yanganyije umukino we wa mbere na Tsend-Ochiryn Tsogtbaatar uzakomeza yegukana umudari muri Mongoliya. Nkumuntu ukomoka muri Gineya yagombaga guhabwa uruhushya rudasanzwe kugirango arushanwe kuko yari yabuze ibiro byemewe nyuma yuko federasiyo ya Gineya yabanje gukura abakinnyi babo mu mikino kubera ubwoba bw\u2019icyorezo cya COVID-19, mbere yo gukuraho icyo cyemezo nyuma yi mikino itangiye. "}
{"id": "15320", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15320", "title": "Yusuf Baras\u0131", "text": "Yusuf Baras\u0131 (yavutse 31 Werurwe 2003) ini umukinnyi ukina umupira wa maguru ukina mu ikipe ya AZ Alkmaar. Baras\u0131 yavukiye mu Buholandi, ahagarariye Turukiya ku rwego mpuzamahanga.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nBaras\u0131 yavukiye mu Buholandi, akomoka muri Turukiya. Ni umukinnyi mpuzamahanga mu Buholandi. Baras\u0131 yahinduye guhagararira Turukiya yabatarengeje imyaka 21, maze atangira gukina nabo batsinze Kosovo yabatarengeje imyaka 21 ibitego 3-0 ku ya 17 Ugushyingo 2020. "}
{"id": "15321", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15321", "title": "Hassane Azzoun", "text": "Hassane Azzoun (Arabic ; wavutse 28 Nzeri 1979) ni umukinnyi ukona umukino wa jido ukomoka muri Alijeriya, wakinnye icyiciro cya kabiri cya baremereye. Yatsindiye umudari inshuro esheshatu muri Shampiyona nya furika ya Jido, yegukanye umudari mu cyiciro cye mu mikino yabereye muri Afurika yabereye muri Algiers 2007.\nAzzoun afite imyaka makumyabiri n'icyenda, yatangiye gukinira ku mugaragaro imikino Olempike yo mu 2008 yabereye i Beijing, aho yarushanijwe mu cyiciro cya bagabo baremereye barengeje ibiro 100. Yatsinzwe umukino ubanza na ippon na sode tsurikomi goshi na Movlud Miraliyev wo muri Azaribayijan. Kubera ko uwo bahanganye yateyeyagiye muri kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza, Azzoun yatanze umudari yinjira mu cyiciro cya basubiramo. Yatsinzwe ku mukino we wa mbere na Jeworujiya witwa Levan Zhorzholiani, watsinze neza ippon na kuzure kami shiho gatame, mu minota itatu n'amasegonda mirongo itanu n'ane. "}
