{"id": "15324", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15324", "title": "Amar Benikhlef", "text": "Amar Benikhlef (wavutse ku ya 11 Mutarama 1982) niumukinnyi ukina umukino wa jido, ukomoka muri muri Alijeriya witabiriye amarushanwa yo mucyiciro cyo hagati. Yatsindiye umudari wa feza mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2008 yabereye i Beijing. Muri Nzeri 2021, Benikhlef ubu yahagaritswe imyaka 10, kugeza muri Nyakanga 2031. \nUbuzima.\nNyuma ya jido yatoje, Fethi Nourine, yatoranijwe kuzitabira imikino yimpeshyi ya 2020 muri batarengeje ibiro 73, Nourine na Benikhlef buri wese yatangaje ko Nourine yavuyemo nyuma yo kurangiza kunganya kwa banywanyi. Bavuze ko ukuvamo ari ukubera ko bashyigikiye ikibazo cya Palesitine mu guhangan na Isiraheli Tohar Butbul, umuhanga muri Jido kurusha Nourine ndetse n\u2019imbuto ya 5 muri iri rushanwa, Nourine akaba yari yarahuye na bo mu cyiciro cya kabiri, yatsinze mu cyiciro cya mbere. IJF yatangaje ko we na Nourine bahagaritswe bidatinze ku ya 24 Nyakanga 2021, mu gihe hagitegerejwe ko hakorwa iperereza, maze bombi barataha mu gihugu cyabo muri Alijeriya bava i Tokiyo. Federasiyo yasobanuye:Nkurikije amategeko ya IJF, hakurikijwe Amasezerano Olempike ku itegeko 50.2 riteganya kurengera kutabogama kwa siporo mu mikino Olempike no kutabogama kwi mikino ubwabo, ivuga ko nta myigaragambyo cyangwa politiki, poropagande ishingiye ku idini cyangwa ku moko yemewe ahantu hose mu mikino Olempike, mu bibuga cyangwa ahandi, Fethi Nourine na Amar Benikhlef ubu bahagaritswe kandi bazafatirwa icyemezo na komisiyo ishinzwe imyitwarire ya IJF, ndetse ni bihano na komite yi gihugu ya Olempike yo muri Alijeriya mu gihugu cyabo. '\" Yagira iti: \"Siporo ya Jido ishingiye ku mahame mbwirizamuco akomeye, harimo kubaha no kugirana ubucuti, kugira ngo habeho ubufatanye kandi ntituzemera ivangura iryo ari ryo ryose, kuko binyuranyije na mahame remezo n'amahame ya siporo yacu.\" Komisiyo ishinzwe imyitwarire ya federasiyo izakemura ibihano bya nyuma birenze imikino Olempike. Muri Nzeri 2021, Benikhlef yahagaritswe imyaka 10, kugeza muri Nyakanga 2031. "}
{"id": "15325", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15325", "title": "Mounir Benamadi", "text": "Mounir Benamadi (wavutse ku ya 5 Mata 1982) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa jido ukomoka muri Alijeriya, wakinnye icyiciro cya kabiri muboroheje. Yatsindiye umudari wa zahabu mu cyiciro cye mu mikino yo muri Afurika yo muri 2007 yabereye muri Algiers, na feza mu marushanwa ya Afurika ya Jido yo muri 2008 yabereye muri Agadir. \nBenamadi yari ahagarariye Alijeriya mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2008 yabereye i Beijing, aho yarushanijwe mu cyiciro cya kabiri cy'abagabo batarengeje ibiro 66. Yatsinze umunya Ositaraliya Steven Brown mu cyiciro cya mbere kibanza, mbere yo gutsindwa umukino we utaha na koka imwe na Mirali Sharipov wo muri Uzubekisitani. "}
