{"id": "15327", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15327", "title": "Muhammad bin al-Uthaymin", "text": "Muhammad bin Salih al-Uthaymin (9 Werurwe 1929\u00a0\u2013 10 Mutarama 2001) yari umukinnyi ukina umukino w'intiti akaba yari umusilamu ukomoka muri Arabiya Sawudite. \nUbuzima.\nIbin al-Uthaymin yavutse ku ya 9 Werurwe 1929, avukira mu mujyi wa Unayzah, mu karere ka Qaseem muri Arabiya Sawudite. Bavuga ko yafashe mu mutwe igitabo cya Korowani akiri muto kandi akurikirana amashuri muri tewolojiya, ururimi rw'icyarabu ndetse nu bundi bushakashatsi bwa kisilamu, nyuma arangiza muri kaminuza ya Shariya i Riyadh\u00a0. Yakomeje kuba umunyamuryango wa komisiyo ishinzwe ubumenyi bwa bayisilamu bo muri Arabiya Sawudite, umwarimu muri koleji ya Shari'a muri kaminuza ya kisilamu ya Imamu Mohammad bin Saud i Qassim akaba nu mwe mu bagize akanama kayo k\u2019amasomo ndetse n\u2019ibitabo bivuga ku bintu bitandukanye bigize Islamu. inyigisho\u00a0. Ibitabo bye by'ingenzi ni igitabo cye cy'umubumbe wa 15 kuri fiqihi ni gitabo cya 10 cyerekeye gusobanura Qor'an ntagatifu. Yakundaga kandi kwigisha ku musigiti mutagatifu i Maka muri Ramazani\u00a0.\nUburezi.\nAmaze kurangiza gufata mu mutwe Korowani nu bushakashatsi bw\u2019ibanze, yatangiye amasomo ye yayobowe na Sheikh Muhammad bin Abd Abd al-Aziz al-Mutawwa na Sheikh Ali al-Salihi muri Unayzah. Aba ni abarimu bombi sheikh Abd al-Rahman al-Sa'di yari yarashyizeho kugira ngo yigishe abanyeshuri batangiye. Nyuma y'umwaka umwe yiga munsi y'abo barimu bombi, al-Uthaymeen yatangiye kwiga munsi ya sheikh Abd al-Rahman al-Sa'di mu 1945 kandi akomeza kuba umunyeshuri we kugeza al-Sa'di apfuye. Umwaka wa 1952, al-Salihi yigiriye inama al-Uthaymeen kwiyandikisha muri \"Ma'had al-'Ilmi\" iherutse gufungurwa i Riyadh, ibyo akaba yarabikoze nyuma yo gusaba uruhushya al-Sa'di. Agezeyo, yize kuri Sheikh Muhammad al-Ameen al-Shinqiti, Sheikh 'Abd al -Aziz bin Baz, na sheikh' Abd al-Razzaq 'Afeefi, n'abandi. Yizeyo imyaka ibiri mbere yo gusubira muri Unayzah, ari naho yatangiye kwigisha akomereza amasomo ye kuri al-Sa'di. \nInzego enye zo gusubiza mu mwuka ibyago.\nIgitekerezo cya Uthaymeen ku nzego enye zo gusubiza mu mwuka ibyago byavuzwe hano. Iyi nyigisho irashobora gutandukanywa nicyitegererezo cya K\u00fcbler-Ross cyibyiciro bitanu byintimba.\nUrupfu.\nShaykh yapfuye ku wa gatatu 15 Shawwaal 1421 AH / 10 Mutarama 2001 IC afite imyaka 71. "}
