{"id": "15330", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15330", "title": "Meriem Bjaoui", "text": "Meriem Bjaoui ni umukinnyi ukina uukino wa jido ukomoka muri Tuniziya. Yatsindiye umudari wa bronze inshuro ebyiri mu bagore batarengeje ibiro 63 mu mikino nya furika, yabaye muri 2015 na 2019. Yatsindiye umudari wa feza mu bagore batarengeje ibiro 63 mu mikino ya Mediterane yabaye muri 2018 yabereye i Tarragona, Espanye. \nYatsindiye kandi imidari mu marushanwa menshi ya Shampiyona nya furika.\nYatsindiye umudari umwe wa feza mu bagore batarengeje ibiro 63 mu mikino nya furika yabaye muri 2019 yabereye i Rabat, muri Maroke. Mu marushanwa ya Afurika 2021 yabereye i Dakar, muri Senegali, yegukanye umudari umwe wa feza mu birori bye. "}
