{"id": "15334", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15334", "title": "Nihel Bouchoucha", "text": "Nihel Bouchoucha (n\u00e9e Landolsi, wavutse 1 Nyakanga 1995) ni umukinnyi ukina imikino ya Jido ukomoka muri Tuniziya. yegukanye umudari inshuro ebyiri mu mikino nya furika. Yatsindiye kandi umudari wa zahabu inshuro ebyiri muri Shampiyona nyafurika.\nUmwuga.\nYatsindiye umwe mu midari ya feza mu marushanwa ya Afurika ya Jido ya 2018 yabereye muri Tuniziya. Muri 2019, yegukanye umudari wa zahabu mu bagore bafite ibiro 70 mu marushanwa ya Afurika ya Jido yabereye i Cape Town, muri Afurika y'Epfo. Nyuma y'amezi make, yakuweho mu mukino wa mbere mu bagore batarengeje ibiro 70 mu marushanwa ya Jido y'isi ya 2019 yabereye i Tokiyo mu Buyapani.\nMu marushanwa ya Afurika 2021 ya Jido yabereye i Dakar, muri Senegali, yegukanye umudari wa zahabu. Yagiye kandi mu bagore batarengeje ibiro 70 mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Jido yabereye i Budapest, muri Hongiriya. Yakuweho mu mukino wa kabiri na Maria Portela wo muri Berezile.\nYitabiriye amarushanwa ya bafite ibiro 70 mu bagore mu mikino Olempike ya 2020 yabereye i Tokiyo, mu Buyapani. \nYatsindiye umudari wa fezamu bagore 70 kg mu mikino ya Mediterranean 2022 yabereye Oran, Alijeriya. "}
{"id": "15335", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15335", "title": "Faycal Bousbiat", "text": "Faycal Bousbiat (yavutse 13 Nyakanga 1970) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino waJido ukomoka muri Kanada. Yahoze ahagarariye igihugu cya Alijeriya.\nUbu ni umutoza."}
{"id": "15336", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15336", "title": "Ly\u00e8s Bouyacoub", "text": "Ly\u00e8s Bouyacoub (wavutse ku ya 3 Mata 1983) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa jido ukomoka muri Alijeriya wegukanye igikombe cya Afurika muri 2014 na 2015, akaza ku mwanya wa kabiri muri 2013 na 2016. Yitabiriye imikino Olempike ya 2016, ariko asezererwa mu cyiciro cya gatatu. "}
{"id": "15337", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15337", "title": "Marie Branser", "text": "Marie Branser (wavutse ku ya 15 Kanama 1992) ni umukinnyi uvuka mu budage wavukiye i Leipzig mu Budage ariko ukomoka mu gihugu cya Gineya, ariko yahoze ahagarariye Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo mu mikino Olempike. Ni inshuro ebyiri yegukanye umudari wa zahabu muri Afurika ya Jido. Mu 2021, yitabiriye amarushanwa ya bafite ibiro 78 mu bagore mu mikino Olempike ya 2020 yabereye i Tokiyo, mu Buyapani. \nUmwuga.\nUbudage.\nBranser yegukanye umudari umwe wa feza nu mudari wa feza mu marushanwa ya Jido yU budage, ariko ntabwo yigeze ahagararira Ubudage mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga akomeye. \nDR Congo.\nMuri 2019, yahinduye ubwenegihugu aba uwo muri Kongo kugira ngo agerageze kwitabira imikino Olempike yo mu mpeshyi ya 2020. Aracyaba kandi yitoreza i Leipzig ariko ahagarariye Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga. \nMuri 2020, yatsindiye umudari wa zahabu mu bagore batarengeje ibiro 78 muri Shampiyona nya furika ya 2020 yabereye muri Antananarivo, Madagasikari. \nMuri Gicurasi 2021, yagumanye igikombe cya shampiyona nyuma yo gutsinda mu bafite ibiro 78 mu bagore mu marushanwa ya Afurika ya Jido 2021 yabereye i Dakar, muri Senegali. \nGineya.\nMu 2022, Branser yahisemo guhindura ubwenegihugu muri Gineya, avuga ko kudakora ndetse n'uburangare bya federasiyo ya Jido ya Kongo kuva imikino Olempike. Nyuma yo guhinduranya, yagiye gutsindira Afurika 2022 yabereye i Dakar mu gusohoka bwa mbere muri Gineya. "}
{"id": "15338", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15338", "title": "Tatiana Bvegadzi", "text": "Tatiana Martine Bvegadzi (yavutse ku ya 30 Mutarama 1979) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa jido ukomoka i Brazzaville muri Kongo, wahataniraga mu cyiciro kiremereye mu bagore. Yatwaye umudari wafeza mu barengeje ibiro 78 mu marushanwa ya Jido nya furika yo muri 2004 yabereye muri Tuniziya, ahagarariye Repubulika ya Kongo mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2004. \nUmwuga.\nBvegadzi yujuje ibisabwa nku mukinnyi wa jido wenyine mu ikipe ya Kongo mu cyiciro kiremereye mu bagore batrengeje ibiro 78 mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2004 yabereye muri Atenayi, mu gushyira ku mwanya wa gatatu no guhabwa ikiruhuko muri Shampiyona nya furika yabereye muri Tuniziya. Yatsinzwe umukino wo gufungura jido ndetse nu watsindiye umudari wa feza Daima Beltr\u00e1n, wahise amukubita hasi amuyoboka kuri tatami akoresheje ashi guruma (uruziga rw'amaguru) mu masegonda mirongo ine n'atatu. \nBvegadzi yihaye amahirwe yo kwegukana umudari wa mbere wa Olempike muri iyi mikino binyuze mu gusubiramo, ariko yaje guhura ni kindi gutsindwa na Karina Bryant wo mu Bwongereza na ippon na tsuri goshi hafi iminota ibiri ngo bakine umukino wa mbere wa umushinga. "}
{"id": "15339", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15339", "title": "Taciana Cesar", "text": "Taciana Rezende de Cesar Bald\u00e9 yavutse ari Lima (yavutse ku ya 12 Ukuboza 1988) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri burezili wavukiye i Olinda muri Gineya-biso ukina umukino wa jido. Yitabiriye imikino Olempike yo mu mwaka wa 2016 mu bagore batarengeje ibiro 48, aho yaviriyemo mu cyiciro cya kabiri na Galbadrakhyn Otgontsetseg Yabaye indashyikirwa muri Gineya-Biso mu muhango wo gusoza. \nMuri 2019, yitabiriye amarushanwa ya bagore batarengeje ibiro 52 mu marushanwa ya Jido y'isi ya 2019 yabereye i Tokiyo, mu Buyapani. \nYitabiriye imikino ya bagore mu biro 52 mu mikino Olempike ya 2020. "}
{"id": "15340", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15340", "title": "Raoudha Chaari", "text": "Raoudha Chaari (yavutse 4 Gashyantare 1973) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Tuniziya. Yitabiriye imikino yoroheje ya bagore mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1996. "}
{"id": "15341", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15341", "title": "Anis Chedly", "text": "Anis Chedly (wavutse 19 Gashyantare 1981) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa jido ukomoka muri tuniziya witabiriye amarushanwa aremereye abafite ibiro 100 no gufungura irushanwa. Ni umunyafurika watwaye umudali inshuro ya esheshatu, ndetse na shampiyona yi gikombe cy'isi inshuro ebyiri mu cyiciro kimwe, kandi yegukana umudari wa zahabu mu mikino ya bereye muri Afurika muri 2007 yabereye muri Alijeriya. Mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2008, Chedly yavanyweho mu cyiciro cya mbere mubagabo bafite ibiro birenga 100, nyuma yo gutsindwa nu mufaransa Teddy Riner, waje gutwara umudari wa feza. Yabaye kandi uwatwaye ibendera ry'igihugu mu birori byo gutangiza. "}
{"id": "15342", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15342", "title": "Nihel Cheikh Rouhou", "text": "Nihel Cheikh Rouhou (wavutse 5 Mutarama 1987 i) ni umukinnyi ukina umukio wa jido ukomoka muri Tuniziya. Yitabiriye imikino Olempike yo mu 2008 na 2012 mu birori 78. \nMu mikino Olempike yo mu 2008, yatsinze Carmen Chal\u00e1 mu cyiciro cya mbere yo gutsindwa na Kim Na-Young. \nMu mikino Olempike ya 2012, yatsinzwe na Maria Suelen Altheman. \nMuri 2019, yatsindiye umudari wa zahabu mu bagore barengeje 78 mu mikino nya furika yabereye i Rabat, muri Maroke. \nMu 2021, yatsindiye umudari umwe wa feza mu birori yabereye muri Jido yabereye i Doha, muri Qatar. Mu marushanwa ya Afurika 2021 ya Jido yabereye i Dakar, muri Senegali, yegukanye umudari wa zahabu. Muri Kamena 2021, yitabiriye amarushanwa y'abagore bafite ibiro 78 mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya Jido 2021 yabereye i Budapest, muri Hongiriya. Yitabiriye kandi imikino y'abagore barengeje ibiro 78 mu mikino Olempike ya 2020 yabereye i Tokiyo, mu Buyapani. \nYatsindiye umudari wa silver mu bagore barengeje ibiro 78 mu mikino ya Mediterane 2022 ya bereye Oran, Alijeriya. "}
{"id": "15343", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15343", "title": "Priscilla Cherry", "text": "Priscilla Cherry (yavutse ku ya 9 Kanama 1971) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa jido ukomoka muri Morise. Yarushanwe mu bagore baremereye hagati mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1996. "}
