{"id": "15576", "revid": "18057", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15576", "title": "Ibishanga n'ibidukikije", "text": "Mu Rwanda ni igihugu kimwe mu bihugu bafashe iyambere mukubungabunga ibishanga ndetse n'ibidukikije \nmuri rusange kuko bamenye neza ko ari umutungo kamere w'igihugu ndetse abanyarwanda muri rusange, abaturage bamaze gusobanukirwa neza akamaro ko kubungabunga ibidukikije\nkubungabunga ibidukikije.\nMu Rwanda hatowe amategeko atandukanye yo kubungabunga ibidukikije muri rusange hakubiwemo n'ibishanga kurinda cyangwa kubungabunga ndetse no guteza imbere ibidukikije haba k'umuntu kugiti cye cyangwa mubikorwa\nrusange bikorwa nabaturage.\nImyanzuro rusange yo kurinda no kubungabunga ibidukikije.\nKu rwego rw\u2019Umujyi wa Kigali, Akarere, Umurenge n\u2019Akagari hashyizweho komite ishinzwe kubungabunga, kurengera no guteza imbere ibidukikije ndetse n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe. Imiterere, imikorere n\u2019inshingano bya Komite zo kurengera ibidukikije n\u2019abazigize bigenwa n\u2019Iteka rya Minisitiri w\u2019Intebe."}
{"id": "15577", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15577", "title": "Udusozi wasanga muri Pariki y'Akagera", "text": "Pariki y\u2019Igihugu y\u2019Akagera ifite imisozi migufi ariko ihererekanye ku buryo bunogeye ijisho, iri mu bihongerera ubwiza nyaburanga, iyo uri kuri iyi misozi nibwo unabona uruhererekane rw\u2019ibiyaga benshi baba barabwiwe cyangwa barasomye mu bitabo.\nPariki y\u2019Akagera ifite imisozi n\u2019 udusozi byinshi bigaragarira ijisho yewe utwinshi muri two biragoye no kumenya amazina yatwo gusa hari amazina azwi nka: Mutumba, Ibere ry\u2019Inkumi cyangwa Ibere rya Nyamatete, Gihinga, Kageyo, Nyagakonji, Rwisirabo, n\u2019utundi.\nUdusozi turimo.\nAgasozi gahabura abahabye ka Gihinga.\nIyo uhari uba ureba Tanzaniya, ndetse n\u2019icyerekezo cya Uganda. Ni mu Murenge wa Karangazi, Akarere ka Nyagatare.\nAgasozi ka Kiyonza.\nIyo uri hano usanganizwa urugwiro, ni na ho hari ibiro bikuru bya pariki, ndetse na hoteli Akagera Game Lodge. Uba witegeye ibiyaga bya Birengero, Shakani n\u2019Ihema ndetse ureba Tanzania.\nIsunzu rya Muhororo (Muhororo crest).\nUhagaze aha hantu uba witegeye neza ikibaba bya Kilala na Muhana, uba ureba ahitwa Nyamatete ndetse n\u2019uruhererekane rw\u2019imisozi ya Mutumba. Ni mu karere ka Nyagatare. Iyo uri hano, uba ureba ikirere giherereyemo icumbi rya Magashi (Magashi Lodge) n\u2019icumbi rya Karenge (Karenge Bush Camp).\nIsunzu Nyagakonji.\nHabarizwa Rhino Lodge n\u2019Ihema View Camp, ni mu Murenge wa Kabare, mu Karere ka Kayonza. Iyo ugeze aha hantu uba ureba ubwiza bwa Pariki y\u2019Akagera nk\u2019ikiyaga cy\u2019Ihema, na Tanzania.\nAgasozi ka Kageyo.\nIyo uhari uba ureba Tanzania hafi yawe. Ni mu Murenge wa Mwiri, Akarere ka Kayonza.\nIbindi.\nIyo misozi yose ndetse n\u2019indi itavuzwe ibitse amateka anyuranye y\u2019ubukerarugendo no kubungabunga Pariki y\u2019Akagera (the cradle of tourism and conservation of Akagera national park)."}
{"id": "15578", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15578", "title": "Igishanga cya Rwampala", "text": "\"Igishanga cya Rwampala kizwi ku izina rya ETR (Ecole Technique Rwamapala) giherereye mu rugabano rw\u2019Akarere ka Kicukiro n\u2019aka Nyarugenge.\"\nIbyo Wamenya kugishanga cya Rwampara.\nIgishanga cya Rwampara gishobora kuba gifite hectare zigera ku 100,Mu mwaka wa 2012 abagituriye bavugaga yuko ku muhanda unyura rwagati muri iki gishanga nta rumuri rusange rwaharangwaga bityo bigatera ikabazo cyuko hasangwaga hakorerwa ubugizi bwanabi.Ubuyobozi\nbwa Akarere bwavugagako umuhanda unyura mugishanga kuwushyiramo kaburimbo ukanashyirwamo urumuri rusange byafasha ukarushaho kuba nyabagendwa ku manywa na nijoro akaba ari kimwe mu bisubizo birambye by\u2019iki kibazo cyari gihari mumyaka yashize.Mu mwaka wa 2012 igishanga cya Rwampara haguye abantu bane (4) mu mezi atatu, ndetse hanatoraguwe n\u2019abana b\u2019impinja batatu bahajugunywe nkuko abaturage babyemeza.Tariki 24 Mata mu mwaka 2012, hari umugore w\u2019umucuruzi wahamburiwe amafaranga ku bw\u2019amahirwe ntibamwica, ariko abagizi ba nabi basize bamumennye umuti w\u2019inkweto mu maso.Iki gishanga bitewe n\u2019urubingo rwinshi rugiteyemo, cyabaye indiri y\u2019abagizi ba nabi."}
{"id": "15579", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15579", "title": "Igishanga cya Gikondo", "text": "Ubushakashatsi bwerekana, ubwinshi bw\u2019ibishanga muri Kigali bwavuye kuri kilometero kare 100 bugera kuri kilometero kare 77.\nIbyo wamenya.\nIbishanga bigomba kuvugururwa mu mujyi wa Kigali biri kuri kilometero kare 15, bingana na 20%, ibishanga bisabwa gukoreshwa mu buryo burambye bingana na 29%, ibishanga byo kubungabunga 38% naho ibindi bikazashyirwamo ibikorwa by\u2019imyidagaduro.Itegeko rigena ko mu bishanga hatubakwa, ariko nk\u2019inyubako zirebana n\u2019ubukerarugendo zishobora gutangirwa uburenganzira na Minisiteri ifite kurengera ibidukikije mu nshingano.REMA ivuga ko inkunga ituruka ku kigo cyita ku bidukikije ku isi (GEF) binyuze muri Banki y\u2019Isi izafasha kubungabunga ibishanga byangiritse mu Mujyi wa Kigali, bikaba byari byitezweho ko u Rwanda rwagombaga guhabwa miliyoni 7 z\u2019amadolari muri uwomushinga.abantu bari bafite inganda mu gishanga cya Gikondo cyari cyarahinduwe icyanya cy'inganda, ariko ziza kwimurwa, zijyanwa mu cyanya inganda zagenewe i Masoro mu Karere ka Gasabo.Ni umushinga watangiye ahagana mu mwaka wa 2013, kugira ngo hatunganywe hashyirwe ubusitani bw\u2019icyitegererezo n\u2019ibindi bikorwa nyaburanga. Wagombaga kurangira mu mwaka wa 2016, gusa ukomeza kugenda wigizwa inyuma bitewe n\u2019ubushobozi buhambaye byasabaga."}
{"id": "15580", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15580", "title": "Ikikongo", "text": "Ikikongo cyangwa Kikongo ni ururimi rw'abantu ruvugwa mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bwa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, Amajyaruguru ya Angola no mu majyepfo ya Repubulika ya Kongo. Bivugwa n'abantu miliyoni 10.\nAmagambo.\n\"Muntu\"=Umuntu\n\"Bantu\"=Abantu\n\"Ntu\"=Umutwe\n\"Maza\"=Amanzi\n\"Madia\"=Ukurya/Ibyokurya\n\"Kulala\"=Gusinzira\n\"Ntima\"=Umutima\n\"Ndinga\"=Ururimi\n\"Mukanda\"=Igitabo\n\"Bayaka\"=Abayaka\n\"Fufu\"=Ubugari\n\"Nzambi\"=Imana\n\"Kisika ya kulala\"=Icumbi\n\"Mosi\"=Rimwe\n\"Zole\"=Ebyiri\n\"Tatu\"=Bitatu\n\"Iya\"=Bine\n\"Tanu\"=Bitanu\n\"Sambanu\"=Atandatu\n\"Nsambwadi\"=Karindwi\n\"Nana\"=Umunani\n\"Uvwa\"=Icyenda\n\"Icumi\"=Kumi\nIcyitegererezo.\nAbantu bose bavuka ariko bakwiye agaciro no kwubahwa kimwe. Bose bavukana ubwenge n'umutima, bagomba kugirirana kivandimwe.\nIbisobanuro\n\"Bantu nyonso, na mbutukulu kevwandaka na kimpwanza ya bawu, ngenda mpe baluve ya mutindu mosi. Mayela na mbanzulu ke na bawu, ni yawu yina bafwana kusalasana na bumpangi.\""}
{"id": "15581", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15581", "title": "Tochukwu Nnourge", "text": "Tochukwu Nnourge (wavutse ku ya 15 Nyakanga 1995) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa volleyball ukomoka muri Nijeriya ukina mu ikipe ya gasutamo ya Nigeria ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya volleyball y'abagore. \nNi kapiteni w'ikipe ya gasutamo ya Nigeria. \nUbuzima.\nIkhiede yavukiyei Asaba mu 1995. \nIbyagezweho.\nIkhiede akina mu ikipe ya bakinira volleyball yo ku mucanga b mu ikipe y'igihugu ya volleyball y'abagore. \nMu ntangiriro za 2019 yari i Yawunde muri Kameruni aho we na Francisca Ikhiede begukanye umudari wa zahabu muri Shampiyona mpuzamahanga ya Volleyball ya Camtel. \nYari mu ikipe yari ihagarariye Afurika mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya FIVB ya Volleyball ya 2019 yabereye i Bariloche, muri Rio Negro muri Arijantine. Ari kumwe na bagenzi be batsinze Argentine yakiriye umukino ubanza 2-1 (13-15, 15\u201311, 15\u201311). \nYari mu ikipe yari ihagarariye Nijeriya mu marushanwa ya mbere y\u2019umwaka wa 2019 wa Shampiyona y\u2019isi ya Volleyball yaberaga i Hamburg mu Budage. \nIkipe ya Nigeriya yari iya kabiri mugihe Kenya yujuje ibisabwa kugirango imikino Olempike isubitswe 2020. \nYari mu ikipe ya gasutamo ya Nijeriya yagumanye igikombe cya Perezida Beach Volleyball mu 2021 i Kaduna ari kumwe na mugenzi we Francisca Ikhiede. "}
{"id": "15582", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15582", "title": "Amarachi Uchechukwu", "text": "Amarachi Uchechukwu (yavutse ku ya 2 Gashyantare 2001) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa volleyball wo muri Nijeriya ukina mu ikipe ya gasutamo ya Nijeriya ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya volley ball ya bagore. \nIbyagezweho.\nAmarachi akina mu ikipe yo kumucanga ya volleyball muri b mu ikipe y'igihugu ya volleyball ya bagore. \nYari mu ikipe yatoranijwe mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo gushaka itike yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cya CAVB mubatarengeje 21muri 2019 i Accra, muri Gana. \nYabaye kandi mu ikipe izagaragara muri Shampiyona y'isi ya 2019 izabera i Doha. \nYari mu ikipe yari ihagarariye Afurika mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya FIVB ya Volleyball ya 2019 yabereye i Bariloche, muri Rio Negro muri Arijantine. Ari kumwe na bagenzi be batsinze Argentine yakiriye umukino ubanza 2 kuri 1 (13-15, 15\u201311, 15\u201311). \nYari mu ikipe yari ihagarariye Nijeriya mu marushanwa ya mbere y\u2019umwaka wa 2019 wa Shampiyona y\u2019isi ya Volleyball yaberaga i Hamburg mu Budage. \nIkipe ya Nigeriya yari iya kabiri mugihe Kenya yujuje ibisabwa kugirango imikino Olempike isubitswe 2020. "}
{"id": "15583", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15583", "title": "Priscilla Agera", "text": "Priscilla Agera ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa volleyball ukomoka muri Nijeriya wakinnye mu ikipe y\u2019abagore ya gasutamo ya Nigeriya ndetse n\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu ya volley ball ya bagore. \nIbyagezweho.\nPriscilla yakinnye mu ikipe ya yo kumucanga ya volleyball b mu ikipe y'igihugu ya bagore ya volleyball.\nYabaye kandi umutoza akaba na kapiteni w'ikipe y'abagore ya gasutamo ya Nijeriya. \nYari mu ikipe yatsinze Afurika y'Epfo gutwara umudari wa zahabu mu mikino ya 11 ya Afurika Yose ya 2015 yabereye muri Kongo. Yari mu ikipe yegukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo kuzitabira imikino Olempike muri Afurika y'Abagore Beach Beach Volleyball 2016 i Jabi Lakeside, Abuja. \nYabaye mu ikipe y\u2019abagore ya gasutamo ya Nigeriya yagaragaye muri Shampiyona y\u2019abakobwa ya Volleyball muri Afurika 2019 yabereye i Cairo, mu Misiri. \nUbu ni umuyobozi wa tekinike muri federasiyo ya Paravolley ya Nigeria. "}
{"id": "15584", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15584", "title": "Ururimi Isabella", "text": "Isabella Langu ni umukinnyi wa volley ball wo muri Nijeriya ukina mu ikipe ya Nijeriya ishinzwe umutekano n\u2019ingabo zirwanira mu gihugu ndetse n\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu ya Nigeriya y\u2019abagore. \nIbyagezweho.\nIsabella akina mu ikipe yo kumucanga ya volleyball ya b mu ikipe y'igihugu ya volleyball ya bagore. \nYari mu ikipe yatsinze Afurika y'Epfo gutwara umudari wa zahabu mu mikino ya 11 ya Afurika Yose ya 2015 yabereye muri congo. Yari mu ikipe yegukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo kuzitabira imikino Olempike muri Afurika y'Abagore yo kumucanga ya Volleyball 2016 i lakeside, Abuja. \nYabaye kandi mu ikipe izagaragara muri Shampiyona y'isi ya 2019 izabera i Doha. \nYari mu ikipe yari ihagarariye Afurika mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya FIVB ya Volleyball ya 2019 yabereye i Bariloche, muri Riyo Negoro muri Arijantine. Ari kumwe na bagenzi be batsinze Argentine yakiriye umukino ubanza 2-1 (13-15, 15\u201311, 15\u201311). \nYari mu ikipe yari ihagarariye Nijeriya mu marushanwa ya mbere y\u2019umwaka wa 2019 wa Shampiyona y\u2019isi ya Volleyball yaberaga i Hamburg mu Budage. "}
{"id": "15585", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15585", "title": "Albertina Francis", "text": "Albertina Francis (wavutse ku ya 15 Nyakanga 1995) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa volleyball ukomoka muri Nijeriya ukina mu ikipe ya Nigeriya ishinzwe umutekano n\u2019ingabo zirwanira mu gihugu ndetse n\u2019ikipe y\u2019igihugu ya volleyball ya bagore. \nIbyagezweho.\nAlbertina akina mu ikipe yo kumucanga ya volleyball ya b mu ikipe y'igihugu ya volleyball ya bagore. \nYatsindiye gusubira mu gikombe cy\u2019igihugu cya Volleyball hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Nigeriya ishinzwe umutekano n\u2019ingabo zirwanira mu gisirikare muri 2019 na 2021. \nAlbertina yari mu ikipe ya Nigeriya yatoranijwe mu marushanwa ya FIVB y\u2019abagore ku isi ya Volleyball y\u2019isi ya 2018 yabereye muri kote Divuwari hamwe na Francisca Ikhiede na Priscilla Agera. \nAri kumwe na Tochukwu Nnourge, Francisca Ikhiede, Isabella Langu na Amarachi Uchechukwu bahagarariye Nigeriya mu isiganwa ry\u2019isi rya FIVB ry\u2019imikino ya Volleyball 2019 ryabereye i Bariloche, muri Rio Negro muri Arijantine. Ari kumwe na bagenzi be batsinze Argentine yakiriye umukino ubanza 2-1 (13-15, 15\u201311, 15\u201311). \nIkipe ya Nigeriya yari iya kabiri mugihe Kenya yujuje ibisabwa kugirango imikino Olempike isubitswe 2020. \nYagaragaye kandi muri Shampiyona nyafurika ya 2016 yabereye muri Tuniziya ndetse na Shampiyona y\u2019Africa ya 2018 yabereye mu Misiri hamwe n\u2019ikipe ye. "}
{"id": "15586", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15586", "title": "Anita Amenuku", "text": "Anita Amenuku (wavutse 27 Nyakanga 1985) ni umukinnyi w'umupira wamaguru w'abagore bo muri Gana ukina mu b'imbere. Ni umwe mu bagize ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Gana. Yabaye mu ikipe yari mu gikombe cy'isi cy\u2019abagore cya FIFA 2007. Ku rwego rwa ikipe akinira muri Ghatel Ladies muri Gana. Yatangiye gukinira Gana ku ya 12 Nzeri 2007 na Ositaraliya. "}
{"id": "15587", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15587", "title": "Igishanga cya Mugogo", "text": "Ikibaya cya Mugogo kiri ku buso bwa Hegitari 79.\nIbyo wamenya ku Igishanga cya Mugongo.\nAbakorera mu gishanga cya Mugogo bakomeje kwibaza uko bazakomeza bahangana n\u2019ibihe biri imbere mu bijyanye n\u2019imirire, bitewe n\u2019uko amazi y\u2019imvura ikomeje kugwa akarengera igishanga, bikaba bitaborohera kubona uburyo bahinga.Abatuye mu ngo zegereye icyo gishanga cya Mugogo, bafite impungenge z\u2019uko igihe nkicyi cy\u2019itumba turimo, imvura irimo igwa ari nyinshi nabwo amazi ashobora kuzaba menshi kurushaho,bakisanga yageze mu ngo zabo.Ukurikije uburyo imvura irimo igwa muri iyi minsi, yangije kiriya kibaya, bigaragaza ko hakiri icyuho gikomeye mu kubona igisubizo cyaho kirambye mukukibungabunga.Abahanga bagiye basesengura ndetse n\u2019inyigo zagiye zikorwa, bikagaragara ko gukemura kiriya kibazo bikiri ingorabahizi, bigomba guhera ku gukumira amazi aturuka mu misozi miremire harimo nk'imisozi yo muri Nyabihu no mu birunga; ndetse kandi na Leta ikaba hari imishinga yanatangiye gushyira mu bikorwa.Minisiteri ibifite mu nshingano, mukwita no kwiga kuri kiriya kibazo cy\u2019ikibaya cya Mugogo cyuzura, kiri mu byihutirwa Leta irimo gushakira ingengo y\u2019imari yo kugikemura no gushaka igisubizo kirambye."}
{"id": "15588", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15588", "title": "Mavis Danso", "text": "Mavis Danso (wavutse 24 Werurwe 1984) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'abagore bo muri Gana ukina nka myugariro. Ni umwe mu bagize ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru muri Gana. Yabaye mu ikipe yari mu gikombe cy'isi cy\u2019abagore cya FIFA 2003 ndetse n\u2019igikombe cy\u2019isi cya FIFA 2007. Ku rwego rwa ikipe akinira Robert Morris College muri Amerika. "}
{"id": "15589", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15589", "title": "Igishanga Cya Bugugu", "text": "Igishanga cya Bugugu kigabanya Umurenge wa Kigabiro na Rubona.\nIbyo Wamenya ku Igishanga cya Bugugu.\nIgishanga cya Bugugu kitaratunganywa bagiraga ubwoba bwo guhinga ahantu hanini kuko nta mazi ahagije yari ahari.Abahinzi bavuga ko nyuma y\u2019uko iki gishanga gitunganyirijwe,Igishanga cya Bugugu cyikongerwamo amazi, bongereye ubuso buhingwamo kuko babonaga ikibazo cy\u2019amazi gikemutse.Igishanga cya Bugugu kitaratunganywa cyahingwagamo n\u2019abahinzi 900 ariko bariyongereye bagera ku kigero cya 1 200. Umusaruro wo mu bihembwe, urugero bibiri bishize wikubye ku inshuro ebyiri kuko wavuye kuri toni 3 kuri hegitari ugera kuri toni 5.3, hakaba hari umuhigo w\u2019uko umusaruro uzagera kuri toni 7 kuri hegitare.Ubu bari muri gahunda yo kwagura imirima ikaba migari kuko amazi ahagije.Kuri ubungubu nukuvuga ngo batangiye guhinga neza n\u2019amazi babona ahagije kuko ibihembwe bibiri bishize, umusaruro waboneka kuri hegitare nawo wariyongereye kuko amazi yabonetse n\u2019abatabiraga ibijumba hafi binjiye mu buhinzi bw\u2019umuceri."}
{"id": "15590", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15590", "title": "Mavis Dgajmah", "text": "Mavis Dgajmah (wavutse ku ya 21 Ukuboza 1973) ni umukinnyi mpuzamahanga akaba ukuminnyi wu mupira w'amaguru w\u2019abagore bo muri Gana ukina imbere. Yari umwe mu bagize ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru muri Gana. Yabaye mu ikipe mu gikombe cy'isi cy\u2019abagore cya FIFA mu 1999 ndetse no mu gikombe cy\u2019isi cya bagore cya FIFA 2003. Ku rwego rwa ikipe yakiniye La Ladies muri Gana. "}
{"id": "15591", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15591", "title": "Evelyn Badu", "text": "Evelyn Badu (wavutse ku ya 11 Nzeri 2003) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Gana ukina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati mu ikipe ya Noruveje y'Avaldsnes IL ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu y'abagore ya Gana.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nBadu yakiniye ikipe ya Hasaacas Ladies yo muri Gana, agaragara mu marushanwa ya nyuma ya 2021 CAF y'abagore ba shampiyona ny'afurika. Yimukiye muri Noruveje Avaldsnes IL muri shampiyona 2022. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nBadu yari mu ikipe ya Gana yitabiriye igikombe cy'isi cy'abagore FIFA bari munsi yimwaka 20 muri 2018, ariko nta mukino yakinnye. Yatsindiye ku rwego rwo hejuru mu marushanwa yo gushaka itike yo kuzitabira imikino Olempike y'abagore ya CAF 2020 (icyiciro cya gatatu). \nIcyubahiro.\nHasaacas Banyarwandakazi\nUmuntu ku giti cye"}
{"id": "15592", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15592", "title": "Kai havert", "text": "Kai havertz n'umukinyi w'umudage \nwavutse muwa 1999 kurubu akaba \nafite imyaka 23 kuruba akaba akinira \nikipe ya chelsea akaba yaravukiye ahitwa\nAachen mubudage."}
{"id": "15593", "revid": "10821", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15593", "title": "Enzo fernandez", "text": "Enzo Fernandez n'umukinyi ukina \nhagati mukibuga akaba akinira ikipe\nya chelsea mu kibuga hagati. akaba yaravukiye mu gihugu \ncya arijantine.yavutse mu 2001, \nkuruba akaba afite imyaka 22 yamavuko.\nyavukiye mumujyi wa San martin."}
{"id": "15594", "revid": "10821", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15594", "title": "Kepa arrizabalaga", "text": "Kepa Arrizabalaga n'umugabo ukomoka\nmugihugu cya esipanye ahitwa Ondorroa\nakabafika umupira w'amaguru nk'uwabigize \numwuga akaba akina aringa izamu cyangwa \nse umunyezamu mu ikipe ya chelsea akaba uyu mugabo akaba \nyaravutse kuw 3 ukwakira 1994.akaba apima \n1.86M (6 ft 1 in). "}
{"id": "15595", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15595", "title": "Kalidou koulibaly", "text": "Kalidou koulibaly ni umukinnyi wa bigize \numwuga ukomoka mu gihugu cya senegali\nakaba akinira ikipe ya chelsea akababa \nyaravukiye mu gihugu cy'ubufaransa \nahitwa Saint Die Des vosgas Koulibaly \nuyu mugabo akaba yaravutse ; 20 june 1991."}
{"id": "15596", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15596", "title": "Nadia Medjmedj", "text": "Nadia Medjmedj (wavutse ku ya 20 Werurwe 1974) ni umukinnyi wa Paralempike ukomoka muri Alijeriya uhatanira mu cyiciro cya F 56 cyo gutera no kujugunya umuhunda. \nYitabiriye imikino Paralempike yo mu 2008 yabereye i Beijing mu Bushinwa. Agezeyo, yatsindiye umudari wa bronze mu ishoti ry\u2019abagore ryashyize mu majwi F 57 na F 58 ndetse na disikuru y\u2019abagore itera F 57 na F 58."}
{"id": "15597", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15597", "title": "Asmahan Boudjadar", "text": "Asmahan Boudjadar ni umukinnyi wo muri Alijeriya uhatanira gutera no kujugunya umuhunda. Yatsindiye umudari wa zahabu mu ishoti rya F 33 ryashyizwe mu mikino Paralempike ya 2016 yabereye i Rio de Janeiro, muri Burezili.\nUmwuga.\nAsmahan Boudjadar yarushanwe mu ishoti ryashyizwe mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri ya 2015 yabereye i Doha, muri Qatar. Yataye ikimenyetso k'umukino wanyuma, arangirira k'umwanya w'anyuma. Muri Werurwe 2016, yangije ishoti nyafurika F33 yashyizeho amateka atera 5.56 metres (18.2\u00a0ft) muri IPC Abakinnyi ba Grand Prix i Dubai. Boudjadar yateye kandi muri ku muhunda, aho yashyizeho amateka mashya ya F 33. \nYitabiriye imikino Paralympike ye ya mbere mu 2016 i Rio de Janeiro, muri Burezili, nyuma yuwo mwaka. Yagize uruhare mu kurasa F33 mu bagore, yegukanye umudari wa zahabu afite amateka mashya ya Afurika afite metero 5.72, imbere ya Qatar Sara Hamdi Masoud na Sara Alesanaani wo muri Leta zunze ubumwe z'Abarabu ku mwanya wa kabiri n'uwa gatatu. Boudjadar yagize icyo avuga nyuma yibi birori, avuga ko yumva ari ukumwihorera nyuma y\u2019ibyavuye mu marushanwa yabanjirije aya. Mu birori bya mbere bya Grand Prix yo muri 2017, yongeye kwandika amateka ya javelin ku isi, atera 12.82 metres (42.1\u00a0ft). "}
{"id": "15598", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15598", "title": "Ahmed Mahour Bacha", "text": "Ahmed Mahour Bacha (wavutse ku ya 16 Kamena 1961) ni umuknnyi wa alijeriya wahoze ari umukinnyi wi mikino ngororamubiri w'asiganwe mu gutera umuhunda. Bacha yari muri yambere ny'afurika nicyarabu m'umyaka ya za 1980 n'intangiriro ya 1990.\nYatsindiye ibikombe 23 by'igihugu mu mwuga we mugutera umuhunda ndetse no mu birori bitandukanye, harimo icyenda. Yabaye nyampinga wa Afurika inshuro eshanu - inshuro enye muri decathlon na rimwe muri javelin. Yabaye kandi inshuro ebyiri yegukanye umudari wa zahabu muri decathlon mu mikino yose ya Afurika, yatsinze mu 1987 na 1991. Yatsindiye ibikombe bitatu bya decathlon mu marushanwa y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri y\u2019Abarabu kuva 1981 kugeza 1987 kandi yegukanye umudari wa zahabu inshuro ebyiri mu mikino ya Pan Arab Arab 1985, aza ku mwanya wa mbere muri podiyumu ya decathlon na javelin. \nBacha yagaragaye rimwe kurwego rwisi, muri Shampiyona yisi 1983 yaberaga muri siporo. Ntabwo yananiwe kwandika ikimenyetso cyemewe mumikino yo kurasa ahitamo kutarangiza amarushanwa. \nYashyizeho ubuzima bwiza amanota 7934 kuri decathlon ku ya 9 Nyakanga 1985 muri Algiers. Javelin yataye neza hamwe na moderi nshya yari 70.20\u00a0m ("}
{"id": "15599", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15599", "title": "Zakayo Malekwa", "text": "Zakayo Malekwa (wavutse ku ya 2 Gashyantare 1951) ni umukinnyi wi kiruhuko uri mu cyiruhuko cy'izabukuru ukomoka mu gihugu cya Tanzaniya, witabiriye imikino yo gutera umuhunda y'abagabo mu gihe cye. Yahagarariye igihugu cye kavukire mu mikino Olempike itatu yikurikiranya, guhera i Moscou, Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Abasoviyeti (1980). Ngaho yashyizeho ibisubizo byiza bya olempike arangiza kumwanya wa 16 kurutonde rusange."}
{"id": "15600", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15600", "title": "Flora Ugwunwa", "text": "Flora Ugwunwa (wavutse ku ya 26 Kamena 1984 Yaserukiye Nigeriya mu mikino Paralempike ya 2016 yabereye i Rio de Janeiro, muri Burezili kandi yegukana umudari wa zahabu mu bagore bajugunye amajosi ya F 54. Yashyizeho kandi amateka mashya ya 20.25m muri ibi birori. \nYaserukiye Nijeriya mu mikino Paralempike ya 2020 yabereye i Tokiyo, mu Buyapani nyuma yo kwegukana umudari wa feza mu marushanwa y'umuhunda yo guta mu bagore F 54 mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri ya Para yabereye i Dubai muri Leta zunze ubumwe z\u2019Abarabu. Yitabiriye kandi amasasu y'abagore ashyira F 54 ibirori aho yarangije ku mwanya wa 6. "}
{"id": "15601", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15601", "title": "Kelechi Nwanaga", "text": "Kelechi Isezerano Nwanaga (wavutse 24 Ukuboza 1997) ni umukinnyi akaba umutera wa Nijeriya. \nKelechi Nwanaga Nkumuto yatsindiye umudari wa feza muri Shampiyona ny'afurika yabato 2015. Yatsindiye umudari wa zahabu mu mikino nyafurika ya 2015, yegukana umwanya wa kane muri Shampiyona nyafurika ya 2016, uwa gatandatu mu mikino ya bavua icyongereza 2018, yegukana umudari wa zahabu muri Shampiyona nyafurika ya 2018 anarinda umudari wa zahabu mu mikino ny'afurika ya 2019. \nNwanaga ku giti cye ni metero 58.15, yagezweho muri Nyakanga 2017 muri Ozoro, ashyiraho amateka mashya ya Nigeriya. "}
{"id": "15602", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15602", "title": "Silver Ezeikpe", "text": "Chinedu Silver Ezeikpe (wavutse 2 Mata 1971) ni umukinnyi w'amugaye ukina muri paralempike ukomoka muri Nijeriya uhatanira mu cyiciro cya F 58. \nChinedu yarushanwe mu kurasa na muhunda mu mikino Paralempike yo mu 2004 y'egukana umudari wa zahabu muri J 58 ya F 58 no gushyiraho agahigo ku isi. Nyuma yaje kwitabira imikino Paralempike yo mu mwaka wa 2008 muri bitatu byose ariko ntiyabasha gukurikira imikino ya mbere, agenda nta mudari. "}
{"id": "15603", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15603", "title": "Pius Bazighe", "text": "Pius Bazighe (wavutse ku ya 15 Werurwe 1972) ni umukinnyi akaba umugabo wagiye mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru ukomoka muri Nijeriya, wari uhagarariye igihugu cye kavukire mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1996 yabereye i Atlanta, muri Jeworujiya. Yashyize ahagaragara ibihe byiza bye muri metero 81.08 ku ya 16 Kamena 1999 mu marushanwa yahuriyemo nama yabereye i Atenayi, mu Bugereki, ahagarika amateka y'igihugu cya Nigeriya."}
{"id": "15604", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15604", "title": "Tazmin Brits", "text": "Tazmin Brits (yavutse ku ya 8 Mutarama 1991) ni umukinnyi w'umugore ukomoka muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yatsindiye zahabu mu gutera umuhunda mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga y'urubyiruko mu 2007. Yiteguye gutorwa mu mikino Olempike izabera i Londere 2012, mbere yo kugira impanuka yo mu muhanda, imusiga mu bitaro amezi abiri. Yatangiye gukinira mpuzamahanga mu ikipe ya Ciriketi ya bagore muri Afurika y'Epfo muri Gicurasi 2018. \nUmwuga.\nMuri Mata 2018, yashyizwe mu ikipe y\u2019umukino wa Criketi mu bagore muri Afurika yepfo mu marushanwa y\u2019abagore 20 bambere yakinnye na Bangaladeshi. Mbere y\u2019uruzinduko, yayoboye Afurika yepfo Abakinnyi bakizamuka bakina muri Ositaraliya. Yatangiye gukinira muri Afurika y'Epfo na Bangaladeshi ku ya 19 Gicurasi 2018. \nMuri Gashyantare 2019, Ciriketi Afurika y'Epfo yamwise umwe mu bakinnyi bagize ishuri rikuru ry\u2019abagore rya Powerade mu mwaka wa 2019. Muri Nzeri 2019, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya F van der Merwe XI mu irushanwa rya mbere ry\u2019abagore T20 shampiyona muri Afurika yepfo. Muri Nyakanga 2020, Abongereza bahawe igihembo cy'umukinnyi witwaye neza mu Ntara mu bagore ba CSA. Ku ya 23 Nyakanga 2020, Brits yashyizwe mu itsinda ry\u2019abagore 24 bo muri Afurika yepfo kugira ngo atangire imyitozo i Pretoria, mbere y\u2019uruzinduko rwabo mu Bwongereza. \nMuri Mutarama 2021, yashyizwe mu ikipe y'Abagore bo muri Afurika y'Epfo Umunsi umwe (WODI) kubera imikino yakinnye na Pakisitani. Yatangiye gukinira WODI muri Afurika y'Epfo, na Pakisitani, ku ya 26 Mutarama 2021. \nMuri Gashyantare 2022, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Afurika y'Epfo mu gikombe cy'isi cya Cricket mu bagore 2022 muri Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande. Muri Gicurasi 2022, Ciriketi Afurika y'Epfo yahaye Abongereza amasezerano ye ya mbere yo hagati, mbere ya shampiyona 2022-23. Muri Nyakanga 2022, Brits yongerewe mu ikipe ya Afurika y'Epfo mu marushanwa ya Ciriketi mu mikino ya bavuga icyongereza 2022 yabereye i Birmingham, mu Bwongereza. "}
{"id": "15605", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15605", "title": "Anneke Bosch", "text": "Anneke Bosch (wavutse ku ya 17 Kanama 1993) ni umukinnyi ukina ciriketi ukomoka muri Afurika yepfo. Yatangiye gukinira umupira wa ciriketi mu bagore umunsi (WODI) yakinnye na Ositaraliya ku ya 18 Ugushyingo 2016. \nMuri Nzeri 2019, yashyizwe mu itsinda rya Terebalaniche mu marushanwa yo gutangiza ku nshuro ya mbere ya bagore T 20 muri shampiyona muri Afurika y'Epfo. Nyuma yaho muri uko kwezi, yashyizwe mu ikipe y\u2019abagore ya 20 (WT20I) yo muri Afurika yepfo kubera imikino yakinnye n\u2019Ubuhinde. Yatangiye bwa mbere muri WT20I muri Afurika y'Epfo, n'Ubuhinde, ku ya 3 Ukwakira 2019. Ku ya 23 Nyakanga 2020, Bosch yashyizwe mu itsinda ry\u2019abagore 24 bo muri Afurika yepfo kugira ngo atangire imyitozo i Pretoria, mbere y\u2019uruzinduko rwabo mu Bwongereza. \nMuri Mata 2021, yari mu ikipe y\u2019Abanyafurika yepfo umugore yazengurutse Bangladesh. Muri Gashyantare 2022, yashyizwe ku rutonde rw'abakinnyi batatu bari mu ikipe ya Afurika y'Epfo mu gikombe cy'isi cya Ciriketi mu bagore 2022 muri Zelande. Muri Kamena 2022, Bosch yashyizwe mu bakinnyi b\u2019ibizamini by\u2019abagore bo muri Afurika yepfo kubera umukino umwe bakinnye n\u2019abagore b\u2019Ubwongereza. Yatangiye Ikizamini ku ya 27 Kamena 2022, yerekeza muri Afurika y'Epfo n'Ubwongereza. \nMuri Nyakanga 2022, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Afurika y'Epfo mu marushanwa ya Cricket mu mikino ya Commonwealth 2022 yabereye i Birmingham, mu Bwongereza. "}
{"id": "15606", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15606", "title": "Kirsten Blair", "text": "Kirsten Blair (wavutse ku ya 29 Nyakanga 1984) ni umukinnyi w\u2019umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Afurika yepfo wakinnye nka all-round, atsinda ukuboko kwi buryo no gu kubita iburyo. Yagaragaye mu bihugu bibiri by\u2019umunsi umwe muri Afurika yepfo mu 2007, bombi bakina na Pakisitani. Yakinnye umupira w'amaguru mu gihugu cya Easterns na Gauteng, ndetse anagaragara mu mukino umwe wo kuzenguruka Amajyaruguru. "}
{"id": "15607", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15607", "title": "Bernadine Bezuidenhout", "text": "Bernadine Michelle Bezuidenhout (wavutse ku ya 14 Nzeri 1993) ni umukinnyi mpuzamahanga wa Afurika yepfo wavukiye muri Nuvele-Zelande, ubu ukinira akarere ko mu majyaruguru. Yakiniye ikipe y'igihugu ya Ciriketi y'abagore bo muri Afurika y'Epfo hagati ya 2014 na 2015 mbere yo kwerekeza i Christchurch, muri Nuvele Zelande kandi kuva icyo gihe yagiye ahagararira White Ferns yo muri Nuvele-Zelande, nyuma y'imyaka itatu ihagaze. Ku ya 6 Gicurasi 2018, yakinnye bwa mbere mu bagore ba 20 (WT20I) muri Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande na Irlande. \nMuri Kanama 2018, yahawe amasezerano yo hagati na New Zealand Cricket, nyuma yo kuzenguruka Irlande n'Ubwongereza mu mezi ashize. Mu Kwakira 2018, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Nouvelle-Z\u00e9lande mu marushanwa ya ICC y'abagore ku isi ya Twenty20 2018 azabera mu burengerazuba bwa Indies. "}
{"id": "15608", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15608", "title": "Olivia Anderson", "text": "Olivia Victoria Anderson (wavutse kuwa 18 Ugushyingo 1987) ni umukinnyi w\u2019umupira w'amaguru muri Afurika yepfo wakinnye nk'umukinnyi w\u2019iburyo ndetse anakina nkumuzamu. Yagaragaye mu bihugu bitanu by\u2019umunsi umwe n\u2019amahanga abiri ya 20 muri Afurika yepfo muri 2008. Yakinnye umupira wamaguru mu gihugu mu by'urengerazuba, Kwa Zulu-Natali, Devon na Surrey. \nMuri shampiyona y\u2019abongereza 2010, yakiniye Shepperton, haba mu ikipe y\u2019abagore, ndetse no mu itsinda rya kabiri ry\u2019abagabo, muri bo bombi akaba ari we watsinze ibitego byinshi (nawe uza ku mwanya wa 5 mu mpuzandengo y\u2019abagabo) ndetse no gukomeza gutsinda.\u00a0Yabaye umukinnyi wambere watsinze ibitego byinshi muri Shampiyona y\u2019abagore mu Ntara ya 2010. "}
{"id": "15609", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15609", "title": "Hamdy El-Safy", "text": "Hamdy Awad El-Safi(yavutse 14 Mata 1972) yahoze ari umukinnyi ukina umukino wa maboko wa volley ball ukomoka mu misiri. Yinjijwe mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Misiri y'abagabo ya volley ball yarangije ku mwanya wa 11 mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2000 yabereye i Sydney, muri Ositaraliya. \nAmakipe.\n- 14 Shampiyona ya Volleyball yo muri Egiputa: 1989\u201390, 1993\u201394, 1994\u201395, 1995\u201396, 1998\u201399, 1999\u20132000, 2001/02, 2002/03, 2003/04, 2005/06, 2006/07, 2008/09, 2009 / 10, 2010/11.\n-ibikombe 12 Igikombe cya Volleyball cyo muri Egiputa: 1989/90, 1995/96, 1998/99, 2001/02, 2002/03, 2003/04, 2004/05, 2005/06, 2006/07, 2007/08, 2009/10, 2010/11.\n- 7 Champiyona y'amarushanwa yo muri Afurika Amakipe (volleyball): 1995 - 1996 - 1997 - 2003 - 2004 - 2006 - 2010.\n- 6 Abatsinze Igikombe cya Afurika Amakipe: 1991 - 1992 - 1995 - 1996 - 1997 - 2000 1: 2001\n- 5 Champiyona y'amarushanwa ya makipe yabarabu (volley ball): 2001 - 2002 - 2005 - 2006 - 2010.\n 1 Abatsindiye Igikombe cya Afurika Amakipe: 1993 (inguzanyo)\n 1 Championship Amarushanwa ya AVC Club ya Volleyball: 1998 (inguzanyo)\n 1 Championship Amarushanwa yamakipe yabarabu (volley ball): 2008 (inguzanyo)"}
{"id": "15610", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15610", "title": "Mohammed Musa", "text": "Mohamed Mousa Abbas Ali (wavutse ku ya 23 Werurwe 1986) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru muri Qatari ukomoka muri Sudani ukinira Al-Duhail. \nImibare yumwuga wa club.\n\"Imibare nyayo guhera ku ya 13 Mutarama 2023\" \n1 \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nKu ya 5 Ugushyingo 2010, myugariro yabonye guhamagarwa mu ikipe y\u2019umupira wamaguru y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 23 ya Qatar, mu mikino ya Aziya. \n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo urutonde rwa Qatar ibitego byambere.\" "}
{"id": "15611", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15611", "title": "Hany Mouselhy", "text": "Hany Mouselhy (yavutse (1968-06-24) yahoze ari umukinnyi ukina umukino wa volleyball mu gihugu cya Misiri. Yinjijwe mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Misiri y'abagabo ya volleyball yarangije ku mwanya wa 11 mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2000 yabereye i Sydney, muri Ositaraliya. Murumuna we ni Mohamed Mouselhy. Yabaye kandi mu ikipe yigihugu ya volley ball mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2000. "}
{"id": "15612", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15612", "title": "Azmi Mohammed Magahed", "text": "Azmi Mohamed Megahed (15 Mata 1950 \u2013 12 Nzeri 2020) yari umukinnyi ukina umukino wa maboko wa volleyball wo muri Egiputa. Yitabiriye imikino y'abagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1976 \nUbuzima.\nYavukiye i Dakahlia, muri Megahede yakiniye ikipe ya Zamalek SC n'ikipe yi gihugu ya Misiri imyaka 16. Yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi witwaye neza muri Afurika mu 1974. Yatsindiye kandi ibihembo byinshi ku giti cye, byaho ndetse nu mugabane nkumukinnyi numuyobozi. Nyuma yaje kuba umwe mu bagize inama y'ubutegetsi ya Zamalek SC, akora nk'umusobanuzi wa politiki akaba n'umunyamakuru wa TV kuri Al Assema TV. Umuhungu we Amir Azmy, yabaye umupira wamaguru. \nYapfuye ku ya 12 Nzeri 2020 mu bitaro i Cairo azize COVID-19 mu gihe icyorezo cya Misiri."}
{"id": "15613", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15613", "title": "Halim Ebo", "text": "Halim Ebo (yavutse ku ya 3 Kamena 1989), azwi kandi nka (Larabci, cyangwa Abd Elhalim Mohamed Abou na Abou Abd Elahim) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa volleyball yo mu gihugu cya Misiri. Hamwe n'ikipe ya Al-Ahly Sporting Club yitabiriye amarushanwa ya Volleyball ya FIVB ya 2011. Kuva mu 2013, ni umwe mu bagize ikipe ya volleyball y'abagabo yo mu Misiri. Yitabiriye imikino Olempike yo mu 2016, Shampiyona y'isi 2014 ndetse na Shampiyona ya Volleyball ya FIVB 2015. \nIntsinzi ya siporo.\nAmatsinda.\n- 4 Team Ikipe ya Volleyball yo mu Misiri: 2010/11, 2012/13, 2013/14, 2017/18.\n- 4 Cup Igikombe cya Volleyball yo muri Egiputa: 2010/11, 2012/13, 2013/14, 2017/18.\n- 4 \u00d7 Shampiyona nyafurika (Volleyball): 2015 - 2017 - 2018 - 2022."}
{"id": "15614", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15614", "title": "Mohammed Badawy", "text": "Badawy Mohamed Moneim (yavutse ku ya 11 Mutarama 1986) \n ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa volley ball ukomoka muri Misiri. Nkumunyamuryango w'ikipe ya volley ball y'abagabo yo muri Egiputa, yitabiriye imikino Olempike ya 2008 na 2016 ndetse na Shampiyona yisi ya 2010 na 2014. "}
{"id": "15615", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15615", "title": "Wael Al-Aydy", "text": "Wael Al-Aydy (yavutse ku ya 8 Ukuboza 1971) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa volley ball yo mu gihugu cya Misiri, w'akinnye n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Misiri, mu mikino Olempike yo mu 2008 Akina nka libero. Yabaye mu ikipe ya volley ball y'abagabo yo mu Misiri mu marushanwa ya FIVB y'abagabo ya Volleyball mu 2010 mu Butaliyani. Yakiniye Zamalek mu 2010. "}
{"id": "15616", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15616", "title": "Mervyn Jocelyn", "text": "Jean Mervyn Jocelyn (wavutse ku ya 21 Kanama 1991) ni umukinnyi mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru wa Morise ukinira muri Pamplemousses nka myugariro wo hagati.\nUmwuga.\nJocelyn yavukiye muri Beau Bassin-Rose Hill, yakinnye umupira wamaguru mu makipe ya Chebel Citizens, Riviere du Rempart, La Cure Sylvester na Pamplemousses. \nYatangiye gukinira mu mikino mpuzamahanga muri Morise muri 2017. ku ya 19 Kanama 2017, yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere kandi cy'onyine yatsinze Ubuhinde mu gutsindwa 1 kuri 2. \n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo ni urutonde rwa intego ya Maurice. \""}
{"id": "15617", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15617", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Sake", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Sake ni ikiyaga cyo mu Rwanda. Giherereye mu Akarere ka Ngoma, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba.\nIki kiyaga gihana imbibi n'imirenge itatu: Sake, Jarama na Rukumberi. Ni ikiyaga gito kandi kidafite ubujyakuzimu burebure. Kizwiho kugira amafi menshi n'ingona. Abaturage bagituriye barobamo amafi kandi bamwe bavomamo amazi.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga cya Sake kiri ku butumburuke bwa metero 1 350. Ubujyakuzimu bwacyo ntiburenza metero 4,3.\nIki kiyaga gihana imbibi n'imirenge itatu y'Akarere ka Ngoma. Ni Umurenge wa Sake, Umurenge wa Jarama n'Umurenge wa Rukumberi.\nIbimera n'inyamaswa.\nKu nkombe z'ikiyaga hamera urufunzo (\"Cyperus papyrus\"). Hamera kandi ubwatsi bwitwa \"Echinochloa pyramidalis\".\nIkiyaga cya Sake kizwiho kugira amafi menshi. Mu kiyaga haba kandi inyamaswa yitwa \"Lutra maculicollis\". Haba kandi ingona.\nImikoreshereze.\nAbaturage baturiye ikiyaga barobamo amafi. Bamwe muri bo bavomamo amazi. Mu mwaka wa 2016, abaturage bavugaga ko batinya ingona ziba mu kiyaga. Ubuyobozi bw'Umurenge wa Sake bwasabaga abaturage kutavoma amazi y'iki kiyaga. Bwabasabaga kuvoma ku mavomo no ku masoko.\nMu mwaka wa 2012, ubuyobozi bw'Akarere ka Ngoma bwateganyaga kugira inkengero z'ikiyaga ahantu nyaburanga. Icyo gihe ibiti byari biherutse guterwa ku nkengero zacyo kugira ngo kibungabungwe."}
{"id": "15618", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15618", "title": "Ubusitani bwa Sake", "text": "Mu nkengero z\u2019Ikiyaga cya Sake mu Murenge wa Rukumberi, Akagari ka Rubago ni ho haherereye \u2018Sake Beach\u2019 hamwe mu hantu nyaburanga hatunganyirijwe gukorerwa ubukerarugendo hafunguwe muri 2019, hari ubusitani bukora ku mazi y\u2019Ikiyaga cya Sake ku mucanga.\nAkamaro.\nUretse ubusitani buhari, kuri ubu hari kubakwa amacumbi, bikaba biteganyijwe ko hazubakwa n\u2019inzu ziberamo inama, umwanya w\u2019imyidagaduro, gushyiraho ikibuga cya Volley ku mucanga, gushyiraho aho abana bidagadurira, na Piscine yihariye ku batinya kujya mu mazi magari y\u2019ikiyaga. Wongeyeho ko ubu uretse abo mu Karere ka Ngoma hari n\u2019abo mu bindi bice baza kuhatemberera no kuhiyakirira, nubwo bakiri bake.\nIbindi.\nAkarere ka Ngoma gaherutse gutangaza ko kiteguye gukemura imbogamizi zirimo iz\u2019umuhanda werekeza kuri Sake Beach udakoze neza no kwihutisha uburyo bwo kuhageza amashanyarazi."}
{"id": "15619", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15619", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Mugesera", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Mugesera ni ikiyaga cyo mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba y'u Rwanda. Kiri mu Akarere ka Ngoma, mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Kigali. Gihana imbibi kandi n'Akarere ka Rwamagana.\nIkiyaga cya Mugesera gifite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 39. Ni cyo kiyaga kinini mu biyaga n'ibishanga by'ikibaya cya Nyawarungu. Muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, Abatutsi benshi bajugunywe muri iki kiyaga. Kubera iyo mpamvu, gifatwa nk'urwibutso rwa Jenoside.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga cya Mugesera kiri mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Kigali. Kiri mu Karere ka Ngoma, mu Murenge wa Mugesera, uwa Zaza n'uwa Rukumberi. Gihana imbibi kandi n'Umurenge wa Karenge wo mu Karere ka Rwamagana.\nIkiyaga cya Mugesera kiri ku butumburuke bwa m 1 360. Gifite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 39. Ubujyakuzimu bwacyo bugera kuri m 4,5. Ubujyakuzimu buringaniye ni m 3.\nIkiyaga kiri mu kibaya gifite ubugari bwa km 35. Umugezi wa Nyawarungu unyura muri icyo kibaya ugana mu majyepfo. Uwo mugezi utera ibishanga n'ibiyaga bihoraho. Ikiyaga cya Mugesera kiri iburasirazuba bw'uwo mugezi. Ni cyo kiyaga kinini muri ibyo biyaga. Ni kimwe mu biyaga byo hejuru by'uruzi rw'Akagera.\nAmazi y'ikiyaga aturuka ku migezi mito imanuka ku misozi yo mu majyaruguru, iburasirazuba no mu majyepfo. Iyo migezi izana amazi menshi mu bihe by'imvura. Ikirere cyaho gifite ubushyuhe buringaniye kubera ubutumburuke. Ibihe by'imvura ni kuva muri Werurwe kugeza muri Gicurasi, no kuva muri Nzeri kugeza mu Kuboza.\nIbinyabuzima n'uburobyi.\nUbushyuhe bw'amazi yo hejuru buri hagati ya \u00b0C 23 na 25. Mu kiyaga harimo amafi menshi n'amoko menshi y'inyoni zo mu mazi. Harimo kandi ingona, inzoka n'izindi nyamaswa.\nAmafi y'ingenzi mu uburobyi ni \"Oreochromis niloticus\" na \"Oreochromis melanopleura\". Mu 1973, ku kiyaga hakoreraga abarobyi 325. Uwo mwaka, baroba toni 300 z'amafi. Ubu, ku nkengero z'ikiyaga, borora amafi mu bigega.\nUbwikorezi n'ubukerarugendo.\nMu 2023, hakozwe ubwato bunini buhuza Umurenge wa Mugesera n'Umurenge wa Karenge. Ubwo bwato bwatwaraga abantu, imodoka n'umusaruro w'ubuhinzi nk'inanasi. Mu 2025, ubwo bwato bwari bumaze umwaka urenga budakora.\nMu Murenge wa Zaza, ku nkengero z'ikiyaga, hubatswe hoteli yitwa Lakeside Recreation Resort.\nAmateka.\nMu kinyejana cya 15, akarere gakikije Ikiyaga cya Mugesera kari gatuwe n'umuryango w'Abahondogo. Abahondogo bari aborozi b'Abatutsi bari bafite igihugu cyigenga.\nUmurenge wa Rukumberi ukikijwe n'ibiyaga bitatu: Sake, Mugesera na Rweru. Muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, Abatutsi bo muri Rukumberi babuze aho bahungira. Abenshi bishwe. Abandi bajugunywe mu Kiyaga cya Mugesera.\nUrwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Rukumberi rushyinguyemo abazize Jenoside barenga 38 000. Buri mwaka muri Mata, abarokotse bashyira indabo kuri iki kiyaga. Ikiyaga gifatwa nk'urwibutso rwa Jenoside."}
{"id": "15620", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15620", "title": "Choupo moting", "text": "Eric Choupo Moting ni umugabo ukomoka muri cameroon \nakaba akina umupira w'amaguru nk'uwabigize umwuga \nakinira ikipe ya bayern munchen Moting akaba yaravutse\ntariki ya 23/3/1989 avukira mu gihugu cy'ubudage ahitwa\nAltona Hamburg, kurubu akaba afite imyaka 33 yamavuko.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nUbudage.\nChoupo-Moting afite pasiporo y\u2019Ubudage, ndetse yahagarariye icyo gihugu cy\u2019amavuko (ari nacyo gihugu cya nyina) mu mikino yo gushaka itike ya Shampiyona y\u2019Uburayi ya UEFA mu cyiciro cy\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 19 mu 2008, ndetse n\u2019icy\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 21 mu 2011."}
{"id": "15621", "revid": "10821", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15621", "title": "Karl Toko Ekambi", "text": "Karl Toko Ekambi yavutse tariki ya 14/10/1992.\nekambi n'umukinnyi wabigize umwuga wavukiye \nmu gihugu cy'ubufaransa mu murwa mukuru wa paris\nakaba akinira ikipe y'igihugu ya cameroon, akaba \nyarakiniye amakipe nka Rennes ndetse na Lyon. "}
{"id": "15622", "revid": "10821", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15622", "title": "Datro fofana", "text": "Datro fofana yavutse taliki ya 22/12/2002 \nkurubu akaba afite imyaka 20 y'amavuko\nfofana akaba yaravukiye muri cote d'ivory\nmuntara ya Oaragahio. fofana akaba akinira \nikipe ye y'igihugu y'amavuko hamwe n'ikipe \nya chelsea. yo mugihugu cy'ubwongereza."}
{"id": "15623", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15623", "title": "Ben Eliott", "text": "Ben Eliott yavutse kuw 5/11/2002 kurubu akaba afite \nimyaka 20 yamavuko Ben akaba ari umukinyi wabigize \numwuga. yavukiye mu gihugu cy'ubwongereza muntara\nya Kingston Upon Thames kurubu akaba yarahisemo\ngukinira ikipe y'igihugu ya cameroon akaba ari n'umukinyi\nwo hagati mu ikipe ya chelsea yo mu gihugu cy'ubwongereza."}
{"id": "15624", "revid": "10821", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15624", "title": "Mateo kovacic", "text": "Mateo kovacic yavutse yavutse kuwa 6 may 1994\nkurubu akaba afite imyaka 28 y'amavuko\nMateo akaba ari umukinnyi wabigize umwuga \nakaba yaravukiye mugihugu cya Austria muntara \nya Linz kovacic akaba kuruba akinira ikipe ya chelsea\nyo mu gihugu cy'ubwongereza "}
{"id": "15625", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15625", "title": "Romeo Lukaku", "text": "Romeo Lukaku yavutse kuwa 13 May 1993 avukira\nmu gihugu cy'ububirigi uyu mugabo kurubu akaba \nafite imyaka 28 y'amavuko muntara ya Antwerp.\nlukaku akaba kurubu yaranyuze mu makipe nka \neverton, man united, chelsea, na inter millan kurubu \nuyu mugabo akaba akinira ikipe y'igihugu cy'ububirigi. Ku ya 12 Kanama 2021, Lukaku yagarutse mu ikipe ye yahoze ari Chelsea ku mafaranga yatangajwe na \u00a3 miliyoni 97.5."}
{"id": "15626", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15626", "title": "Hakim ziyech", "text": "Hakim Ziyech yavutse muwa 19/3/1993 kurubu akaba \nafite imyaka 28 y'amavuko. uyu mugabo akaba yaravukiye\nmu gihugu cy'ubu holand mumujyi wa Dronten.\nuyu mugabo kandi yamenyekanya cyane azamukiye\nmw'ikipe ya ajax yo mu buhorandi aza kwerekeza \nmw'ikipe ya chelsea yo mu bwongereza akaba arinayo\nabarizwamo kugeza ubu. HaKIM ZIYECH kandi akaba \nakinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Marocce. "}
{"id": "15627", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15627", "title": "Denis zakaria", "text": "Denis Zakaria yavutse taliki ya 20/11/1996 kurubu\nakaba afite imyaka 26.\nuyu mugabo akaba ari umukinnyi w'umupira wabigize\numwuga akaba yaravukiye kugihugu cya Switzerland.\navukira ahitwa Geneva.akaba yaravutse kubabyeyi \nRina zakaria na Lako Lado zakaria. uyu mugabo akaba\nakinira chelsea yo mu bwongereza akaba anakinira \nikipe y'igihugu ya Switzerland."}
{"id": "15628", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15628", "title": "Mykhailo Mudryk", "text": "Mykhailo Mudryk yavutse taliki ya 5/1/2001.\nuyu mugabo yavukiye mugihugu cya Ukraine\nmumujyi wa Krasnohrad. Mudryk akaba yarakiniye \namakipe nka Fc Shakhtar Donetsk,Fc arsanal kyviv\nna Fc Desna Chernohiv kurubu akaba akinira ikipe\nya chelsea yo mu bwongereza, akaba akinira kandi \nikipe y'igihugu ya Ukraine "}
{"id": "15629", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15629", "title": "Christian pulisic", "text": "christian pulisic yavutse taliki 18/10/1998 \nkurubu akaba afite imyaka 24 y'amavuko.\npulisic akaba ari umukinyi wabigize umwuga\nakaba yaravukiye muri leta zunze ubumwe \nza amerika muri leta ya Hershey Pennsylvania,\nakaba yaramenyekanye mu makipe nka \nborusiya dorutimundi. kuruba akaba akinira \nikipe ya chelsea yo mu bwongereza. kurubu\nakaba akinira ikipe y'igihugu ya leta y'unze \nubumwe bwa Amerika."}
{"id": "15630", "revid": "10574", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15630", "title": "Ethan Ampadu", "text": "Ethan Ampadu yavutse taliki ya 15/12/2000 \nkurubu afite imyaka 23 y'amavuko.\nuyu mugabo akaba ri umukinnyi wabigize \numwuga akaba yaravukiye mu gihugu\ncy'ubwongereza mu mujyi wa exeter. \nEthan akaba yaramenyekanye mu ikipe ya \nchelsea yo mugihugu cy'ubwongereza, uyu mugabo w'umwongereza akaba\nyarahisemo gukinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Wales."}
{"id": "15631", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15631", "title": "Umusozi wa Nyiragongo", "text": "\u00a0Ibiwuranga\nUmusozi wa Nyiragongo (/\u02cc n \u026a\u0259r \u0259 \u02c8 \u0261 \u0252 \u014b \u0261 o\u028a, - \u02c8 \u0261 \u0254\u02d0 \u014b - / neer-\u0259-INDIRIMBO -go) ni stratovolcano ikora ifite uburebure bwa 3,470\u00a0m (11.385)\u00a0ft) mu misozi ya Virunga ifitanye isano na Albertine Rift. Iherereye muri parike y'igihugu ya Virunga, n Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, nko mu birometero 12,5 mu majyaruguru y\u2019umujyi wa Goma n\u2019ikiyaga cya Kivu no mu burengerazuba bw\u2019umupaka n\u2019u Rwanda. Ikibaya kinini gifite uburebure bwa kilometero ebyiri (1 mi) kandi ubusanzwe kirimo ikiyaga cya lava. Kugeza ubu icyo cyobo gifite intebe ebyiri zitandukanye zikonje za lava zikonje mu rukuta rw'ikiriba - imwe kuri metero 3,175 (10.417 ft) naho iyindi yo munsi ya metero 2975 (9,760 ft).\nIkiyaga cya lava cya Nyiragongo rimwe na rimwe cyabaye ikiyaga kinini kizwi cyane mu mateka ya vuba. Ubujyakuzimu bw'ikiyaga cya lava buratandukanye cyane. Uburebure ntarengwa bw'ikiyaga cya lava bwanditswe kuri metero 3,250 (metero 10,660) mbere yo guturika kwa Mutarama 1977 - ubujyakuzimu bw'ikiyaga gifite metero 600 (2000). Nyuma yo guturika muri Mutarama 2002, ikiyaga cya lava cyanditswe ku butumburuke bwa metero 2.600 (metero 8.500), cyangwa metero 900 munsi y\u2019umugezi. Urwego rwazamutse buhoro buhoro kuva icyo gihe. Nyiragongo hamwe na Nyamuragira hafi yabo ni bo nyirabayazana wa 40 ku ijana by'iruka ry\u2019ibirunga bya Afurika."}
{"id": "15632", "revid": "11484", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15632", "title": "Umusozi wa Everest", "text": "Ibiwuranga\u00a0\nUmusozi wa Everest (Nepali: \u0938\u0917\u0930\u092e\u093e\u0925\u093e, romanised: Sagarm\u0101th\u0101; Tibetan: Chomolungma \u0f47\u0f7c\u0f0b \u0f58\u0f7c\u0f0b \u0f42\u0fb3\u0f44\u0f0b \u0f58; Igishinwa: \u73e0\u7a46\u6717\u739b\u5cf0; pinyin: Zh\u016bm\u00f9l\u01cengm\u01ce F\u0113ng) ni umusozi muremure w'isi hejuru y\u2019inyanja, uherereye mu gace ka Mahalangur Himal. Himalaya. Umupaka w'Ubushinwa na Nepal unyura mu mpinga yawo. Uburebure bwacyo (uburebure bwa shelegi) bwa 8.848.86 m (29,031 ft 8 + 1\u20442 in) bwashizweho vuba aha mu 2020 n\u2019abayobozi b\u2019Ubushinwa na Nepali.\nUmusozi wa Everest ukurura abazamuka benshi, harimo nabanyamisozi bafite uburambe. Hariho inzira ebyiri nyamukuru zo kuzamuka, imwe yegera impinga kuva mu majyepfo yuburasirazuba bwa Nepal (izwi nka \"inzira isanzwe\") indi iva mumajyaruguru muri Tibet. Nubwo idafite ibibazo bikomeye byo kuzamuka mu buryo bwa tekiniki mu nzira isanzwe, Everest irerekana akaga nk'indwara zo mu butumburuke, ikirere, n'umuyaga, ndetse n'ingaruka ziterwa n'inkangu hamwe na Khumbu. Kugeza mu mwaka wa 2019, abantu barenga 300 bapfiriye kuri Everest, inyinshi mu mibiri yabo ikaguma ku musozi.\nImbaraga za mbere zanditse kugirango tugere mu nama ya Everest zakozwe n'abasozi b'Abongereza. Kubera ko icyo gihe Nepal itemereraga abanyamahanga kwinjira muri icyo gihugu, Abongereza bagerageje inshuro nyinshi ku nzira yo mu majyaruguru iva mu ruhande rwa Tibet. Nyuma y\u2019urugendo rwa mbere rw\u2019iperereza n\u2019abongereza mu 1921 rugeze kuri m 7000 (22,970 ft) kuri Col ya ruguru, urugendo rwo mu 1922 rwasunitse inzira y\u2019imisozi y\u2019amajyaruguru rugera kuri m 8.320 (27.300 ft), bikaba bibaye ubwa mbere umuntu azamuka hejuru ya m 8000 (26,247 ft). Urugendo rwo mu 1924 rwavuyemo rimwe mu mayobera akomeye kuri Everest kugeza na nubu: George Mallory na Andrew Irvine bagerageje inama ya nyuma ku ya 8 Kamena ariko ntibigera bagaruka, bituma havuka impaka zo kumenya niba ari bo ba mbere bageze ku isonga. Tenzing Norgay na Edmund Hillary bakoze inyandiko ya mbere ya Everest mu 1953, bakoresheje inzira yo mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba. Norgay yari imaze kugera kuri m 8,595 (28.199 ft) umwaka ushize nkumunyamuryango w\u2019urugendo rw\u2019Abasuwisi 1952. Itsinda ry\u2019abashinwa ry\u2019imisozi rya Wang Fuzhou, Gonpo, na Qu Yinhua bakoze raporo ya mbere yazamutse ku mpinga iva mu misozi y\u2019amajyaruguru ku ya 25 Gicurasi 1960.."}
{"id": "15634", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15634", "title": "Jamie Webber", "text": "Jamie Craig Webber (wavutse ku ya 21 Mutarama 1998) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira wamaguru ukomoka muri Afurika yepfo ukina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati mu kibuga, mu ikipe ya SuperSport United yo mu gihugu cya muri Afurika yepfo. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nAmaze gukinira Vasco da Gama na Stellenbosch mu cyiciro cya mbere cy\u2019igihugu, yinjiye muri SuperSport United muri Mutarama 2018. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri Kamena 2017, yahamagawe mu ikipe ya Afurika y'Epfo mu gikombe cya COSAFA, maze atangira gukinira Afurika y'Epfo muri iri rushanwa. \nYahagarariye kandi Afurika yepfo kurwego rw'abatarengeje imyaka 23. "}
{"id": "15635", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15635", "title": "Hillal Soudani", "text": "El Arabi Hilal Soudani (wavutse 25 Ugushyingo 1987) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Alijeriya ukina nk'umukinnyi ukina imbere mu ikipe ya Damake yo mu gihugu cya Arabiya Sawudite ndetse n\u2019ikipe y'igihugu ya Alijeriya.\nSoudani yagaragaye bwa mbere ku rwego mpuzamahanga mu mwaka wa 2010, agaragara mu marushanwa ya 2013, 2015 na 2017 mu gikombe cy\u2019Afurika cy\u2019ibihugu, ndetse no mu gikombe cy\u2019isi cya FIFA cy'abereye muri Burezili 2014. Kugeza mu Gushyingo 2019, yatsindiye imipira 54 mpuzamahanga ndetse atsinda ibitego 24, bituma aba umunyalijeriya w'atsinze ibitego bitandatu mu mateka.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nASO Chlef.\nSoudani wavukiye muri Chlefe, yatangiye umwuga we mu ntera ntoya y\u2019ikipe yavukiyemo Chlef. Muri Gicurasi 2006, afite imyaka 19, yatangiye gukinira ikipe ye ya mbere muri iyi kipe asimbuye USM Annaba mu cyiciro cya 28 cya shampiyona yo muri Alijeriya 2005 kugeza 06, yaje gukinira Samir Zaoui ku munota wa 72. \nMuri 2008, Soudani yatorewe kuba umukinnyi w\u2019umwaka wa 2008 nyuma yo gutsinda ibitego 11 mu mikino 24 muri shampiyona ya 2007\u201308. \nMuri Kamena 2011, Soudani yagiye mu igeragezwa n'ikipe y'Abafaransa shampiyona 2 muri Le Mans FC. \nVit\u00f3ria de Guimaraes.\nKu ya 8 Kanama 2011, Soudani yasinyanye amasezerano y\u2019imyaka itatu n\u2019ikipe ya Victoriya yo muri Porutugali. Amafaranga yo kwimura byavuzwe ko mu mayelo 800.000. Ku ya 25 Kanama 2011, Soudani yatangiye gukinira Vit\u00f3ria ku mugaragaro nk'umusimbura w\u2019iminota 66 mu mukino wo kwishyura wa shampiyona yiburayi 2011 muri 12 na Atletico Madrid. Ku ya 16 Ukwakira 2011, Soudani yafunguye konti ye muri iyi kipe akoresheje igitego mu cyiciro cya gatatu cya Taca yo muri Poritugale 2011 kugeza 12 na Moura Atl\u00e9tico Clube. Nyuma yo gutsinda igitego 1-0, Soudani yatsinze igitego cyo kunganya ku munota wa 89 wumukino wohereza umukino kumwanya winyongera, mbere yo gutsinda uwatsinze kumunota wa 117. Ku ya 1 Mata 2012, yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere muri Primeira Liga itsinze Pacos ya Ferreira ibitego 3-1. Ku ya 21 Mata, yatsinze igitego 3-2 yatsinze Uniayo ya Leiria. \nKu ya 26 Gicurasi 2013, Soudani yafashije Vit\u00f3ria gutsinda umukino wa mbere wa Ta\u00e7a de Portugal yatsinze Benfica ibitego 2\u20131 ku mukino wa nyuma, atsinda igitego cyo kunganya ku munota wa 79 mbere yuko Ricardo Pereira atsinda igitego nyuma yiminota ibiri. Bukeye, yagiye muri Korowasiya kugira ngo arangize ubuvuzi mbere yo kwimurirwa i Dinamo Zagreb. \nIcyubahiro.\nASO Chlef\nVit\u00f3ria Guimar\u00e3es\nAlijeriya\nUmuntu ku giti cye"}
{"id": "15636", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15636", "title": "Abdullahi Hamoud", "text": "Abdellah Haimoud (wavutse 21 Gicurasi 2001), ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru w'abigize umwuga ukomoka muri Marocke ukina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati wa mu ikipe ya Botola Wydad AC. \nAkazi ka ikipe.\nAmaze gutangira gukora akiri muto muri Mohammed VI Football Academy. Mu mwaka wa 2021, yabonye impinduka ikipe yo muri Wydad AC.\nKu ya 30 Gicurasi 2022, yaje ku munota wa 84 kuri Guy Mbenza na Al-Ahly SC ku mukino wa nyuma w'igikombe cya Afurika cya CAF maze atsinda umukino itsinze ibitego 2-0 kuri Stade Mohammed V. \nIbikorwa mpuzamahanga.\nKu ya 28 Nyakanga 2022, umutoza Hicham Dmii yamutumiye mu myitozo hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Maroc A, agaragara ku rutonde rw\u2019abakinnyi 23 bazitabira imikino y\u2019ubufatanye bwa kisilamu muri Kanama 2022. \nKu ya 15 Nzeri 2022, Hicham Dmii yamutumiye hamwe na Maroc mu mikino Olempike guhatana na Senegali mu rwego rwo kwitegura kwitabira imikino Olempike yo mu 2024."}
{"id": "15637", "revid": "12672", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15637", "title": "Maghreb de F\u00e8s", "text": "Maghreb de F\u00e8s ni ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga muri Maroke ifite icyicaro i Fez, ikora amarushanwa muri Botola, indege y'ambere y'umupira w'amaguru wa Maroke.\nIyikipe yashinzwe mu 1946. Iyi ikipe yari isanzwe yambara ibikoresho byo murugo kuva yatangira. Maghreb de F\u00e8s ni ikipe izwi cyane kubera gutsinda igice cyayo cyumupira wamaguru, izwi cyane mugihugu ndetse no hanze yacyo. Iyi kipe yakinnye imikino yayo iwayo muri 45,000 Stade Fez iri mumujyi wa Fez kuva 2007 \nMaghreb de F\u00e8s yigaragaje nk'imbaraga zikomeye mu mupira w'amaguru muri Maroc ndetse no muri Afurika mu kinyejana cya 20. Mu mupira wamaguru mu gihugu, iyi kipe yatwaye ibikombe 10; 4 Amazina ya Botola, 4 Igikombe cy'intebe ya Maroke na Botola 2 (icyiciro cya kabiri cya Maroke) kabiri. Mu marushanwa yo ku mugabane no ku isi, Maghreb Fez yatwaye ibikombe 2; igikombe kimwe cya CAF Confederatiyo Igikombe kimwe na CAF.\nAbaterankunga.\nItsinda rishyigikiye kumugaragaro rya MAS ni Ingwe Zica. Yashinzwe mu 2006. \n Abatsinze (5): 1965, 1979, 1983, 1985, 2026\n Kwiruka: 1961, 1969, 1973, 1975, 1978, 1989, 2011\n Abatsinze (4): 1980, 1988, 2011, 2016\n Kwiruka: 1966, 1971, 194, 1993, 2001, 2002, 2008, 2010\n Abatsinze (2): 1997, 2006\n Abatsinze (1): 2012"}
{"id": "15638", "revid": "10599", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15638", "title": "Igishanga cya Rugende", "text": "Igishanga cya Rugende nigishanga giherereye mukarere ka Gasabo mu Mujyi wa Kigali Kandi nigishanga gikora kuturere tubiri aritwo Gasabo na Rwamagana.\nIbihingwamo..\nIgishanga cya Rugende Gihingwamo Umuceri.\n\ufffcNyuma yaho Umujyi wa Kigali ufashe umwanzuro wo kubungabunga ibishanga nakubitunganya, Igishanga cya Rugende nacyo Kiri mubishanga byatunganyijwe bikorwa neza bihingwamo ibihingwa bihabereye.\nIgishanga cya Rugende kandi Kiri mibishanga 400 byatunganyijwe\nMubizahingwamo Umuceri ubutubuzi bw'Imbuto y'Ibigori n'ubwatsi bw'amatungu.\nIbirushijeho"}
{"id": "15639", "revid": "10599", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15639", "title": "Igishanga cya Gatsata", "text": "Igishanga cya Gatsata n'igishanga kinini Giherereye mu Mujyi wa Kigali Akarere ka Gasabo, Umurenge wa Gatsata.\n\ufffcNigishanga Gihingwamo Umuceri nibindi bitandukanye Harimo imboga zitandukanye nibindi nyinci.\nImboga zihingwa mugishanga cya Gatsata.\nimboga rwatsi Harimo:Amashu,dodo,Pavuro.\ufffc\nKubungabunga Igishanga cya Gatsata.\nMurwego rwo gufata neza Ibishanga by'ikigali urwego rw'umujyi wa Kigali.\ufffc\nUmuhuzabikorwa w'ibiro by'ubutaka n'ibikorwaremezo mu karere ka Gasabo bwahaye Igihe ntarengwa kubafite Ibikorwa byabo ndetse na magaraje mu gishanga cya Gatsata ko baba bamaze gukuramo ibikorwa byabo bitarenze Taliki 30 Ukwakira 2011 \nAkarere ka Gasabo kongereye Abafite amagaraje ko bongerewe igihe cyo kuba bakuyemo ibikorwa byabo Bidahutajwe Taliki 31 Ukuboza 2011.\nReba.\ufffc.\nhttps://mobile.igihe.com/ubukerarugendo/ahantu-nyaburanga/article/umujyi-wa-kigali-ugiye-gushaka-abazatunganya-ibindi-bishanga-mu-isura-ya\nhttps://www.kigalitoday.com/ibidukikije/ibungabunga/article/ibishanga-by-i-kigali-bikomeje-gutunganywa-bizashyirwamo-ibinyabuzima-nk-inyoni-n-ibinyugunyugu\nhttps://www.kigalitoday.com/ibidukikije/ibungabunga/Abafite-amagaraje-mu-gishanga-cya-Gatsata-bongerewe-amezi-abiri-mbere-yo"}
{"id": "15640", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15640", "title": "Igishanga cya Kibumba", "text": "\"Igishanga cya Kibumba giherereye mukarere ka Nyamagabe.\"\nIbyo Wamenya ku Igishanga cya Kibumba.\nIki gishanga, abahinzi bagihingamo bavuga ko imirima myinshi yatwawe n\u2019imyuzure hagasigara udushitu, gusa bakaba bafite ikibazo cyuko umugezi wa Rukarara wicamo ibice iyo wongeye kuzura ubundi ahasigaye uhatwara kuko wari ufite inzira imwe kuri ubu ukaba ufite izigera kuri esheshatu.Ubuyobozi bwa karere buvugako igikwiye ari kubanza gukorwa kuri iki kibazo ari ubukangurambaga ku gushinganisha ibihingwa mu baturage, kugira ngo nihaba ibiza bajye byibuza babasha kubona imbuto bashoye.Bakomeje bavuga bateganya kuhasura bakareba ikibazo uko giteye no gukorana n\u2019bahanga mu gutunganya ibishanga bakazemeza uburyo iki gishanga cyatunganywamo, n\u2019igitera kuta inzira kw\u2019amazi ya Rukarara atuma igishanga cyuzura.bagombaga kuzabanza kugere muri ako gace bakareba icyakorwa n\u2019ibyangiritse uko bingana. Abaturage na bo basabwaga kujya bahinga basiga inkombe z\u2019umugezi ntibasasereze imigezi, abahinga imusozi nabo bagasibura imirwanyasuri.gahunda yari kuzakorana n\u2019abahanga mu gutunganya ibishanga nibo bazemeza icyo cyiriya gishanga cyizakorerwa n\u2019amazi yataye inzira ya Rukarara.\nTumenye gahunda ya leta yo kubungabunga Ibishanga.\nIbishanga biri gutunganywa mu rwego rwo kurengera urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima biba mu bishanga.u Rwanda rurushaho gufata imyanzuro yo kugabanya ibikorwa bya muntu byangiza ibishanga kugira ngo hirindwe ingaruka zatezwa n\u2019iyangirika ryabyo.Mu mwaka 2020 u Rwanda rwavuguruye National determined contributions ni gahunda y'igihugu yo guhangana n'imyuka ihumanya ikirere harimo rero no kubungabunga ibishanga kuko bifite ubushobozi bwo kubika imyuka yangiza ikirere. Ibishanga bibungabunzwe bizagira akamaro ku baturage, Umujyi wa Kigali urakura kimwe n'indi iwegereye, abantu bakenera aho kuruhukira.Muri gahunda yo kwita no gutunganya ibishanga wiswe Kigali Wetland master plan, biteganijwe ko ibishanga 5 muri 36 biri mu Mujyi wa Kigali bigomba gutunganywa mu gihe kitari kirekire kugirango urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima birimo bizabashe gusubirana,Mu bishanga bizatunganywa mu minsi ya vuba n'ubwo hataratangazwa igihe ibikorwa bizatangirira, harimo igishanga cya Rwampara, icya Gikondo, icya Nyabugogo, Rugenge agazwi nko mu Rwintare na Kibumba. usibye kuba bizatanga imirimo ku baturage bazabitunganya, byitezweho ko bizanongera ibikorwa by'ishoramari.Ibikorwa byo gutunga ibi bishanga bizatanga imirimo ku baturage binongere ibikorwa by\u2019ishoramari nk\u2019ubukerarugendo."}
{"id": "15641", "revid": "10821", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15641", "title": "Gabriel slonina", "text": "Gabriel Slonina yavutse taliki ya 15/5/2004\navukira leta zunze ubumwe za amerika muri\nmugace kitwa Addison,llinios.\nSlonina akaba ari umukinyi w'umupira wa \namaguru wa bigize umwuga. akaba akinira \nikipe ya chelsea yo mu bwongereza mu kiciro\ncyambere akaba yarageze muriyi kipe \nmumwaka wa 2022.\nakaba akinira kandi ikiwe ye y'amavuko\nya leta zunze ubumwe za amerika."}
{"id": "15642", "revid": "10821", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15642", "title": "Benoit Badiashire", "text": "Benoit Badiashire ni yavutse taliki ya 26/3/2001\nkurubu akaba afite imyaka 21 y'amavuko.\nBenoit akaba yaravukiye kandi akurira mu\ngihugu cy'ubufaransa muri leta ya Lemoges,\nakaba ari umukinnyi wa bigize umwuga,akinira\nikipe ya chelsea yo mu kiciro cyambere yo mubwongereza.\nuyu musore akaba apima (1.94M na 74Kg) akaba \nyarerekeje muri chelsea muwi 2023 avuye muri AC Monacco."}
{"id": "15643", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15643", "title": "Trevoh Chalobah", "text": "Trevoh chalobah yavutse le 5/7/1999 kurubu \nakaba afite imyaka 23 y'amavuko. \nChalobah yavukiye mugihugu cya sierra Leone\nahitwa Freetown. uyu mugabo akaba akina \numupira w'amaguru nk'uwabigize umwuga akaba \nyarahisemo gukinira ikipe y'igiugu y'ubwongereza."}
{"id": "15644", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15644", "title": "Igishanga cya Rwangingo", "text": "Igishanga cya Rwangingo giherereye mukarere ka Gatsibo ndetse kikanakora kukarere ka Nyagatare.\nIbyo wamenya.\nUbuyobozi bw\u2019Akarere ka Gatsibo mu mwaka wa 2016 bwavuze ko iki gishanga cya Rwangingo kijya gutunganywa hari mu rwego rwo kugira ngo ubukungu burusheho kwiyongera kandi n\u2019imibereho y\u2019abatuye baka karere na yo itere imbere kurushaho.Mugutangira kgukoresha igishanga cya Rwangingo byari biteganyijwe ko iki gishanga kizahingwamo igihingwa cy\u2019umuceri, ariko ku ukubitiro abaturage bazagihingamo barashishikarizwa gutangirana n\u2019imbuto ya soya n\u2019ibigori, kugira ngo habanze hakorwe igeragezwa.Kuba ubuhinzi burimo gufata indi ntera mukarere ka Gatsibo,nibimwe mubimenyetse bivuze ko ubukungu bwako na bwo buri kugeda butera imbere mu buryo bushimishije, ibyo bigira uruhare mu kubyaza umusaruro iki gishanga nabwo burushaho kugenda neza.Igishanga cya Rwangingo gifite ubuso bungana na hegitari 900, Akarere ka Gatsibo kakaba kihariye ubuso buhingwamo bungana na hegitari 320.Umwe mu bahinzi batangiye guhinga muri iki gishanga, avuga ko igihingwa batangiriyeho guhinga cya soya bizeye kuzakuramo umusaruro ushimishije, kandi ngo isoko ryari rinahari kuko bari begerejwe uruganda ruyitunganya."}
{"id": "15645", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15645", "title": "Reece James", "text": "Reece James yavutse taliki ya 8/12/1999,\nkurubu akaba afite imyaka 23 y'amavuko.\nReece akaba yaravukiye mu gihugu cy'ubwongereza\nmumurwa mukuru waho ahitwa london.\nakaba akina mubinyuma kuruhande rw'ibumoso\nReece kurubu akaba akinira ikipe ya chelsea yo \nmu bwongereza hamwe n'ikipe y'igihugu y'abongereza.\nuyu mugabo apima (1.82M na 82kg)."}
{"id": "15647", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15647", "title": "Godfrey Chitalu", "text": "Godfrey Chitalu, uzwi ku izina rya Ucar (22 Ukwakira 1947 - 27 Mata 1993), yari umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Zambiya wakinnye mu bi'imbere. Azwi cyane nk'umukinnyi ukomeye wa Zambiya mu bihe byose kuko afite umuhigo wo gutsinda ibitego mu ikipe y'igihugu kandi yatorewe kuba umukinnyi w\u2019umupira w'amaguru muri Zambiya inshuro eshanu. Muri 2006, yatoranijwe na CAF nk'umwe mu bakinnyi 200 b'umupira w'amaguru muri Afurika mu myaka 50 ishize. \nIshyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru muri Zambiya ry'atangaje ko Chitalu yatsinze ibitego birenga 100 mu marushanwa yose yabaye mu 1972, akaba arenga Geradi Mulere yatsindiye mu mwaka umwe ndetse na Lioneli Mesi yose hamwe muri 2012, bombi bakaba bakunze kwita umunyamakuru amateka y'isi. Ubushakashatsi bwatanzwe mu mwaka wa 2012 nyuma yuko Liyoneli Mesi ahinduye amateka avugwa ku isi ya Geradi Mulere. Nubwo bimeze bityo ariko, umuvugizi wa FIFA yatangaje ko amateka ya FIFA ku isi atigeze abaho kuko batakurikiranye amarushanwa yo mu gihugu. \nNyuma y\u2019izabukuru, Chitalu yatangiye gutoza kandi yari ayoboye ikipe y\u2019igihugu ya Zambiya igihe ikipe yose yazize impanuka y\u2019indege y'abereye ku nkombe za Gaboni ku ya 27 Mata 1993.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nGodfrey Kangwa Chitalu yavukiye i Luanshya, mu Ntara ya Copperbelt, aho se Chitalu yakoraga akazi ko gucukura amabuye y'agaciro ndetse akanaba umucamanza w\u2019urukiko rw\u2019ibanze, mu gihe nyina Chitalu yari umugore wo mu rugo. Yakuriye mu gice cya 9 cy'umujyi wa Mine hamwe na barumuna be 9, Godefure ni uwa karindwi wavutse. Aha kandi niho yakinaga umupira wamaguru wurubyiruko utambaye ibirenge, mumihanda yumujyi kimwe nabantu benshi. Imikino yabera hagati yibice bitandukanye byumujyi wa kirombe. Utubuto twaba igihembo nyamukuru kubatsinze, ariko, mubihe bimwe na bimwe amafaranga yaba igiciro. Aha niho imikino imwe nimwe yarangirira mu kuboko, hagati y'amakipe ahanganye. Chitalu yakundaga gukina umupira, ariko imiterere y'imikino isobanura ko yagize imvune nyinshi. Bimwe muri ibyo bikomere byaba birimo ukuboko kuvunitse, kuzavunika inshuro nyinshi mugihe kizaza. Rimwe na rimwe, iyo yari mu bitaro, yarahunze akajya gukina umupira n'incuti ze. "}
{"id": "15648", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15648", "title": "Umugezi wa Luapula", "text": "Umugezi wa Luapula ni igice cy'umugezi wa kabiri muremure wa Afurika, Kongo. Ni uruzi rw'ambukiranya imipaka rugizwe hafi y'uburebure bw'umupaka uhuza Zambiya na Congo. Ihuza ikiyaga cya Bangweulu (muri Zambiya yose) kugera ku kiyaga cya Mweru (gisangiwe hagati y'ibihugu byombi) kandi giha izina Intara ya Luwapula ya Zambiya. "}
{"id": "15649", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15649", "title": "Umugezi wa Lubefu", "text": "Umugezi wa Lubefu ni uruzi rwu mugezi wa Sankuru, ukaba ari uruzi rw'umugezi wa Kasayi muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo."}
{"id": "15650", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15650", "title": "Umugezi wa Lubudi (uruzi rwa Lualaba)", "text": "Umugezi wa Lubudi ni uruzi rwu mugezi wa Luwalaba muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (DRC). Lubudi yazamutse hafi y'umupaka wa Zambiya mu majyepfo ashyira uburengerazuba bwa Kolwezi. Itemba mu majyaruguru no mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba kugira ngo ifatanye na Luwalaba uhereye ibumoso aho ikibaya cya Katanga cyo mu majyepfo kigwa mu bwonko bwa Upemba, hafi ya Bukama. [1]"}
{"id": "15651", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15651", "title": "Umugezi wa Lubudi (umugezi wa Sankuru)", "text": "Umugezi wa Lubudi (cyangwa Labodi) ni uruzi rwu mugezi wa Sankuru muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (DRC). Umunwa wu ruzi uri mu butware bwa Kuba bw'intara ya Mweka mu Ntara ya Kasayi."}
{"id": "15652", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15652", "title": "Umugezi wa Lubue", "text": "Uruzi rwa Lubue ruturuka mu majyepfo rugana mu majyaruguru runyura mu karere ka Idiofa, intara ya Kwilu, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Hafi y'aho rukomoka mu majyepfo, aho uruzi rwa Musanga rwinjirira uturutse ibumoso, ni uruzi ruto rugoramye, rufite ubugari bwa metero 12 (ubunini bwa 39 ft), rufite amabuye n'imigezi y'amazi yihuta (rapids) ruhagaze. Rutangira gukoreshwa n'amato ahitwa Mulasa, kandi nyuma y'aho, runyura mu kibaya kinini cyuzuye amashyamba.Rusohokera mu ruzi rwa Kasa\u00ef hafi y'umujyi Dibaya Lubue. "}
{"id": "15653", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15653", "title": "Umugezi wa Luele", "text": "Umugezi wa Luele (witwa Piyo cyangwa Liye umugezi wacyo wo hepfo) uva mu majyepfo ugana mu majyaruguru unyuze ku butaka bwa Idiyofa, intara ya Kwilu, muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Uruzi rutangira nku mugezi usobanutse mu kibaya gito hafi ya Idiofa. Ikura mu bunini byihuse kubera imigezi mito mito, muri yo hakaba harimo uruzi rwa Punkulu, hanyuma ikanyura mu kibaya kinini mbere yo kwinjira mu ruzi rwa Kasai umanuka uva Mangayi. "}
{"id": "15654", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15654", "title": "Umugezi wa Lufira", "text": "Umugezi wa Lufira ni uruzi rwu mugezi wa Luwalaba muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (DRC)."}
{"id": "15655", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15655", "title": "Umugezi wa Lufu", "text": "Umugezi wa Lufu cyangwa Luvo ni uruzi rwa Angola na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Ni umugezi w'ibumoso w'umugezi wa congo."}
{"id": "15656", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15656", "title": "Umugezi wa Lufuko", "text": "Umugezi wa Lufuko (cyangwa Lufuku) ni uruzi muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo ru sohoka mu kiyaga cya Tanganyika iruhande rwu mudugudu wa Mpala mu Ntara ya Tanganyika (ahahoze ari Intara ya Katanga).\nUbumenyi bw'isi.\nLufuko itwara igice cy'imisozi ya Marungu. Habayeho ibyifuzo byo kubungabunga amashyamba hejuru ya 1,500 uhana imbibi nu mugezi wa Mulobozi nu mugezi wa Lufuko mu turere tubungabunga ibidukikije. [1]"}
{"id": "15657", "revid": "11200", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15657", "title": "Umugezi wa Lukaya", "text": "Lukaya ni uruzi muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Inkomoko yacyo iherereye mu misozi ya Crystal, aho iva iburasirazuba ikanyura muri Basi ya Congo, hanyuma ikanyura mu nkombe z'umugezi wa Ndijili. Umuhanda wa gari ya moshi uva Matadi ugana Kinshasa unyura mu kibaya cyu mugezi igihe runaka, unyura mu majyepfo hanyuma ugana iburasirazuba bwa Kinshasa. Igihe kimwe uruzi rwitirirwa akarere muri leta y'ubuntu ya congo."}
{"id": "15658", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15658", "title": "Umugezi wa Zigi", "text": "Umugezi wa Zigi uzwi kandi ku izina rya Sigi mu giswahiri, ni uruzi ruherereye mu burasirazuba bwa Tanga mu gihugu cyaTanzaniya.\nUruzi ruzamuka mu gasozi ka Amani mu burasirazuba bwi misozi ya Usambara mu Karere ka Muheza, mu misozi ya Handei, ku butumburuke bwa metero 1130 kandi butemba kuri kilometero 100 mu masumo maremare hamwe n'impinduka nyinshi zicyerekezo kumunwa wa kilometero 40 mu majyaruguru y'umujyi wa Tanga mu nyanja yu Buhinde. Inzuzi zayo ni Kihuhui (kuva mu majyepfo) na Musi (kuva mu majyaruguru)."}
{"id": "15659", "revid": "10890", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15659", "title": "Umugezi wa Wembere", "text": "Umugezi wa Wembere ni uruzi ruherereye mu majyaruguru yu burengerazuba bwa Singida, muri Tanzaniya. Uruzi ni igice cy'ikibaya cy'amazi cy'ikiyaga cya Eyasi.\nMunsi yumwuzure uruzi ruhinduka amajyaruguru yuburasirazuba rugasuka mu majyepfo yikiyaga cya Kitangiri. Ikiyaga cya Kitangiri gisohoka mu kiyaga cya Eyasi kinyuze mu ruzi rwa Sibiti. "}
{"id": "15660", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15660", "title": "Umugezi wa Wami", "text": "Umugezi wa Wami ni uruzi ruherereye mu karere ka Puwanimuri Tanzaniya. ni amazi y\u2019a masoko ya Wami ni nzuzi zayo akomoka mu misozi yi burasirazuba bwa Arike yo mu karere ka Morogoro. Uruzi rutemba rugana mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba unyuze mu karere ka Pwani kugira ngo rwinjire mu nyanja y'Abahinde mu burengerazuba bw'ikirwa cya Zanzibari."}
{"id": "15661", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15661", "title": "Umugezi Umba (Tanzaniya)", "text": "Umugezi wa Umba uherereye mu majyaruguru yu burasirazuba bwa Tanzaniya mu karere ka Tanga. Irazamuka mu ishyamba rya Shagayu mu misozi ya Usambara yi burengerazuba ku butumburuke bwa metero 2000 kandi itemba mu majyaruguru y\u2019umusozi ugana iburasirazuba. I Lelwa isiba uruzi rwa Mbalamu, ruva mu majyaruguru akabije y'imisozi ya Usambara, n'umugezi wa Mglumi ukinjira muri Umba. Mbere yuko Umba yinjira mu nyanja y'Ubuhinde, yambuka umupaka yerekeza muri Kenya. Umunwa ubwawo uranga ahantu h'iburasirazuba cyane ku mupaka uhuza Tanzaniya na Kenya, wakozwe ahanini mu murongo ugororotse ugana mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba ugana ku kiyaga cya Victoria mu kinyejana cya 19. Mu masoko yo hejuru y\u2019uruzi rwagati mu myaka ya za 1960 rwagati, havumbuwe amabuye y'agaciro menshi, harimo safiro na spessartine. Ku ruzi kandi ni Umba River Game Reserve, ikigega cy\u2019inyamanswa kirimo hamwe na Mkomazi Game, hafi kilometero kare 2.600."}
{"id": "15662", "revid": "10890", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15662", "title": "Umugezi wa Tarangire", "text": "Umugezi wa Tarangire ni uruzi ubundi ruherereye mu karere ka Manyara rwa gati mu ishami ryi burasirazuba ryi kibaya cya rifuti cyo muburasirazuba, mu majyaruguru ya Tanzaniya.\nAmasomo.\nAmazi y\u2019umugezi wa Tarangire ari mu misozi miremire no mu nkengero z\u2019akarere ka Babati mu karere ka Manyara n\u2019akarere ka Kondoa mu karere ka Dodoma, cyane cyane imisozi ya Irangi mu Karere ka Kondoa. Uruzi ruzamuka mu misozi ya Wasi, rugwa mu burasirazuba bwa Kondoa Escarpment. Itemba iburasirazuba igana Chubi aho ihindukirira amajyaruguru ikanyura muri parike y'igihugu ya Tarangire.\nHanyuma ihindukirira iburengerazuba hanyuma ikerekeza mu majyepfo, mbere yo kurangirira ku ruzi rwayo ku kiyaga cya Burunge. \nUmugezi wa Tarangire nisoko yambere y\u2019amazi meza y\u2019inyamaswa zimuka n\u2019ibindi binyabuzima byo mu bidukikije bya Tarangire mu gihe cyizuba cyumwaka. "}
{"id": "15663", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15663", "title": "Umugezi wa Songwe", "text": "Umugezi wa Songwe ni uruzi rugize imbibi mpu zamahanga hagati ya Malawi na karere ka Songwe muri Tanzaniya. Agace ka songwe muri Tanzaniya yitiriwe uruzi.\nAmazi meza ya Songwe niho imipaka ya Malawi, Tanzaniya, na Zambiya ihurira. Itemba mu majyepfo yuburasirazuba kugirango yubake mu kiyaga cya Nyasa. Amasomo yo hagati atandukanya imisozi ya Misuku ya Malawi n'umusozi wa Umalila mu karere ka Songwe muri Tanzaniya. Inzira yo hepfo inyura mu kibaya cya Kyela, ikibaya kirumbuka giherereye mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bw'ikiyaga cya Malawi ikibaya cya Rifuti yo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. Ikibaya cya Kyela gihingwa n'umuceri n'ibindi bihingwa. "}
{"id": "15664", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15664", "title": "Umugezi wa Sibiti", "text": "Uruzi rwa Sibiti ni umugezi w\u2019amazi menshi ufite uburebure bwa kilometero mirongo irindwi n\u2019eshanu uhuza ikiyaga cya Eyasi n\u2019ikiyaga cya Kitangiri, ukagira umupaka karemano hagati y\u2019akarere ka Singida n\u2019akarere ka Simiyu mu majyaruguru yo hagati mu gihugu cya Tanzaniya.\nUruzi rwa Sibiti rufite undi mugezi umwe urushamikiyeho ariwo uruzi rwa Semu. Uruzi rwa Sibiti ni uruzi rw'ikibaya cyuzuyemo imigezi myinshi yinjira mu kiyaga cya Kitangiri, harimo:"}
{"id": "15665", "revid": "10890", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15665", "title": "Umugezi wa Semu", "text": "Umugezi wa Semu ni uruzi rwo mu majyaruguru ya Tanzaniya, uruzi rwa S'ibiti, mu kiyaga cya Eyasi ni ikiyaga cya Kitangiri."}
{"id": "15666", "revid": "10890", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15666", "title": "Umugezi wa Ruvuma", "text": "Umugezi wa Ruvuma hitwa kandi uruzi rwa Rovuma, ni uruzi ruri mu karere k'ibiyaga bigari bya Afurika. M'ugice kinini cy'amasomo yacyo, ikora umupaka uhuza Tanzaniya na Mozambike (muri Mozambike uzwi nka Rio Rovuma). Uruzi rufite kilometero 800, hamwe n'ikibaya cy'amazi gifite kilometero 155,500 mu bunini. Ikigereranyo cyo gusohora buri mwaka ni metero 475 ku munwa wacyo. \nReba.\n\u00a0This article\u00a0incorporates text from a publication now in the public domain:\u00a0.mw-parser-output cite.citation{font-style:inherit;word-wrap:break-word}.mw-parser-output.citation q{quotes:\"\\\"\"\\\"\"'\"\"'\"}.mw-parser-output.citation:target{background-color:rgba(0,127,255,0.133)}.mw-parser-output.id-lock-free a.mw-parser-output.citation.cs1-lock-free a{background:url(\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/65/Lock-green.svg\")right 0.1em center/9px no-repeat}.mw-parser-output.id-lock-limited a.mw-parser-output.id-lock-registration a.mw-parser-output.citation.cs1-lock-limited a.mw-parser-output.citation.cs1-lock-registration a{background:url(\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d6/Lock-gray-alt-2.svg\")right 0.1em center/9px no-repeat}.mw-parser-output.id-lock-subscription a.mw-parser-output.citation.cs1-lock-subscription a{background:url(\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/aa/Lock-red-alt-2.svg\")right 0.1em center/9px no-repeat}.mw-parser-output.cs1-ws-icon a{background:url(\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4c/Wikisource-logo.svg\")right 0.1em center/12px no-repeat}.mw-parser-output.cs1-code{color:inherit;background:inherit;border:none;padding:inherit}.mw-parser-output.cs1-hidden-error{display:none;color:#d33}.mw-parser-output.cs1-visible-error{color:#d33}.mw-parser-output.cs1-maint{display:none;color:#3a3;margin-left:0.3em}.mw-parser-output.cs1-format{font-size:95%}.mw-parser-output.cs1-kern-left{padding-left:0.2em}.m