{"id": "15677", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15677", "title": "Nyumba ya Mungu Urugomero", "text": "Urugomero rwa Nyumba ya Mungu ni urugomero ruri muri Tanzaniya, urugomero rwa mashanyarazi ruherereye rukorera mu Karere ka Mwanga, mu Karere ka Kilimanjaro. Yubatswe mu mpera z'imyaka ya za 1960 ni amazi manini yo mu karere ka Kilimanjaro. Nyumba ya Mungu Ikigega. Ikigega gisangiwe n'akarere ka Moshi mu karere ka Kilimanjaro n'akarere ka Simanjiro mu karere ka Manyara. Nyumba ya Mungu bisobanura 'Inzu y'Imana'. Ubushobozi bwayo bw'ashyizweho ni 8. "}
{"id": "15678", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15678", "title": "Gusubiranywa kwa Ashyamba mu myaka 10", "text": "Leta y\u2019u Rwanda yashyize imbaraga mu gutera amashyamba no gusubiranya aho yahoze, gahunda yatangiwe mu mwaka wa 2009.\nIbyo Wamenya ku Gusubiranywa kwa Amashyamba.\nMu mwaka wa 2011 ni bwo u Rwanda rwiyemeje kuba rwasubiranyije hegitari miliyoni ebyiri zahozeho amashyamba kandi mu mwaka 2020 byagombaga kuba byaragezweho.U Rwanda ni kimwe mu bihugu bya mbere byashyize mu bikorwa gahunda yari igamije gusubiranya hegitari miliyoni 150 zahozeho amashyamba akaza kwangizwa ku Isi, zigasubiranywa bitarenze mu mwaka wa 2020.Iyo gahunda yagiye itanga umukoro wo gusubiranya hegitari miliyoni 350 z\u2019amashyamba aho yahoze kugeza mu gihe cyo mu mwaka wa 2030.Ibice biteweho amashyamba mu Rwanda bigira uruhare rukomeye mu gufasha igihugu guhangana n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere, kurwanya imirire mibi n\u2019ibindi.U Rwanda ruri muri gahunda y'icyerecyezo cy\u2019imyaka 30 kizageza mu mwaka 2050. Muri iki gihe u Rwanda rufite gahunda yo kuzaba ruri mu bihugu bikize ku Isi ariko kikagumana umwimerere wacyo wo kubungabunga ibidukikije, mu kwirinda ingaruka z\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe.Kimwe mu bizafasha muri iyo gahunda, harimo gukomeza gutera amashyamba no gusazura amashyamba ashaje, ari nako habaho kurengera ibidukikije bishyira mu igenamigambi ry\u2019imijyi n\u2019ahandi hantu hahurira abantu benshi mu Rwanda.Mu kwirinda ko haterwa ibiti bibonetse byose, hashyizweho ibigo bituburirwamo imbuto z\u2019ibiti,Mu gishushanyombonera cy\u2019imikoreshereze y\u2019ubutaka,gitegeka imijyi yose y\u2019u Rwanda n\u2019udusantere guteganya ahantu hahariwe guterwa ibiti n\u2019ibikorwa bitangiza ibidukikije.\nIbindi wamenya.\nLeta y\u2019u Rwanda Nubwo intego yo gutera amashyamba n\u2019ibiti byinshi ari ukubungabunga ibidukikije hari nagahunda yogushaka ko binabyazwa umusaruro, bikungukira ababikora.Guverinoma yashyizeho uburyo bwihariye bw\u2019imicungire y\u2019amashyamba, hifashishijwe abikorera.Mu mwaka wa 2019, Minisiteri y\u2019Ibidukikije yatangije uburyo bwiswe (Private Forest Management Units). Kuri ubu hegitari 23.456,15 zingana na 38.4 % by\u2019amashyamba ya Leta acungwa n\u2019abikorera.Ubukerarugendo gakondo bw\u2019u Rwanda ni za pariki kandi umutungo wazo wa mbere ni inyamaswa n\u2019amashyamba. Ibyo byatumye higwa uburyo bwihariye bwo gukomeza kubungabunga izo pariki igihugu gifite ari nako aho bishoboka zongerwa.u Rwanda rwatangiye gahunda yo kwagura Pariki y\u2019Ibirunga mu rwego rwo kubungabunga urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima rubamo nk\u2019ingagi zo mu misozi."}
{"id": "15679", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15679", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Jipe", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Jipe ni ikiyaga kiri ku mupaka wa Kenya na Tanzaniya. Kiri hafi y'Umusozi wa Kilimanjaro.\nIkiyaga cya Jipe kizwiho amoko y'amafi ataboneka ahandi ku isi. Kizwiho kandi inyoni zo mu mazi n'ibishanga bigikikije.\nImiterere.\nKu ruhande rwa Kenya, ikiyaga kiri mu majyepfo y'umudugudu wa Ngohonji. Ku ruhande rwa Tanzaniya, kiri mu Karere ka Mwanga, mu Ntara ya Kilimanjaro. Ikiyaga gihabwa amazi ahanini n'umugezi wa Lumi. Uwo mugezi umanuka ku Musozi wa Kilimanjaro. Gihabwa kandi amazi n'imigezi iva mu misozi ya Pare. Amazi asohoka mu kiyaga anyura mu mugezi wa Ruvu.\nKu ruhande rwa Kenya, Pariki y'Igihugu ya Tsavo y'Iburengerazuba irinda igice cy'ikiyaga. Ku ruhande rwa Tanzaniya, hafi y'ikiyaga hari ahantu harinzwe ha Mkomazi.\nIbinyabuzima.\nIkiyaga cya Jipe kizwiho amoko y'amafi ataboneka ahandi. Kibamo kandi inyoni zo mu mazi n'inyamaswa z'inyamabere. Ibishanga byo ku nkombe zacyo bishobora kugera kuri km 2 uvuye ku kiyaga."}
{"id": "15680", "revid": "10890", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15680", "title": "Umugezi wa Lumi (Afurika y'Iburasirazuba)", "text": "Umugezi wa Lumi uherereye mu Karere ka Rombo, muri Kilimanjaro mu majyaruguru y'u burasirazuba bwa Tanzaniya ndetse na gace gato mu majyepfo ya Kenya mu Ntara ya Cowasite. Ikomoka mu burasirazuba bwa mpinga ya Mawenzi ku ruhande rw'iburasirazuba bwa (Umusozi Kilimanjaro), kandi itemba cyane hafi y'Uruzi Rombo ku buryo hafi yo gukora ikibanza. Lumi, ariko, ikomeza icyerekezo cyayo cyo mu majyepfo, bityo rero twavuga ko igereranya inzira yo hejuru ya Ruvu, imwe mu masoko abiri nyamukuru y\u2019umugezi wa Pangani. Itemba ikiyaga cya Chala n'umujyi wa Taveta mu burengerazuba hanyuma ugasuka mu kiyaga cya Jipe. Ubwoko bw'amafi Barubusi. 'Pangani' yabonetse gusa mu ruzi rwa N'joro, ruherereye mu kibaya cyo hejuru cy'uruzi rwa Pangani."}
{"id": "15681", "revid": "10890", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15681", "title": "Umugezi wa Msangazi", "text": "Umugezi wa Msangazi ni uruzi rubarizwa muri Tanzaniya. Ni igice cy'ikibaya cy'umugezi wa Pangani. "}
{"id": "15682", "revid": "10890", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15682", "title": "Umugezi wa Ngerengere", "text": "Umugezi wa Ngerengere ni uruzi rwo mu karere ka Morogoro muri Tanzaniya. Irazamuka mu misozi ya Uluguru, ikanyura iburasirazuba kugira ngo ifatanye n'u mugezi wa Ruvu hafi. Umujyi wa Morogoro uri ku ruzi rwa Ngerengere."}
{"id": "15683", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15683", "title": "Umugezi munini wa Ruaha", "text": "Umugezi munini wa Ruaha ni uruzi rwo mu majyepfo ya Tanzaniya rw'agati runyura mu bishanga bya Usangu na Parike yi gihugu ya Ruwaha, mu burasirazuba kugera mu ruzi rwa Rufiji. Iranyura kandi iranga imipaka iri hagati y'akarere ka Iringa, akarere ka Dodoma na karere ka Morogoro. Umugezi munini wa Ruaha ufite ubuso bungana na kilometero 83,970. Abaturage bo mu kibaya batunzwe ahanini no kuhira no kubaho mu mazi nko kuroba no korora amatungo."}
{"id": "15684", "revid": "10890", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15684", "title": "Umugezi wa Ulanga", "text": "Umugezi wa Ulanga, uzwi ku izina rya Kilombero, uzamuka mu misozi miremire yo mu majyepfo ashyira uburengerazuba bw'akarere ka Morogoro, muri Tanzaniya, mu burasirazuba bwa Rifiti yo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba. Uruzi rutemba rugana mu buraruko bushira ubuseruko bushira ubuseruko bw'akarere ka Lindi mbere yuko rwinjira mu ruzi rwa Rufiji. Amaherezo Rufiji yinjira mu nyanja y'U buhinde ku nkombe y'a majyepfo y'akarere ka Pawani."}
{"id": "15685", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15685", "title": "Umugezi wa Lukenie", "text": "Umugezi wa Lukenie ni uruzi ruri mu kibaya cyo hagati cya Kongo hagati muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (DRC).\nInzuzi ziva i Kinshasa zerekeza muri Congo (Kasayi), na uruzi rwa Fimi kugera i Lukeniye kugeza aho zimukiye i Kole, urugendo rw'i byumweru 6 kugeza 12. Ibi ntibikorwa mugihe cyamazi make (Kamena - Kanama), ariko, kubera gutinya guhagarara igihe kirekire. Lukenie ntabwo ishobora kugendagenda hejuru ya Kole.\nMu bihe bya mbere y\u2019abakoloni b\u2019Ababiligi, uruzi rimwe na rimwe rwakoreshwaga mu gutwara reberi ku biro nka Kole na Lodja ikamanuka ku kiyaga cya Leopold II. Nyamara, ibikoresho byinshi byazanwe ku butaka bwa Bene Dibele, mu majyepfo ku nkombe y\u2019iburyo y\u2019umugezi wa Sankuru munsi gato y\u2019aho bihurira n\u2019umugezi wa Lubefu, inzira yizewe. \nBimwe mu bice nyamukuru by\u2019ibiti bya Sodefor biri ku mpande zombi z'umugezi wa Lukenie, bishingiye kuri Oshwe. Muri Nzeri 2010, abantu babarirwa mu magana bo muri Oshwe, umuryango wo mu Ntara ya Mai-Ndombe, bigaragambije barwanya SODEFOR. Basabye ko ihagarikwa ry\u2019ibiti by\u2019inganda muri kariya karere, byangiza amashyamba y\u2019imvura abaturage bashingiyeho nta nyungu ku baturage bakennye. "}
{"id": "15686", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15686", "title": "Umugezi wa Lukuga", "text": "Umugezi wa Lukuga ni uruzi rwu mugezi wa Lualaba muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (DRC) rutwara ikiyaga cya Tanganyika. Ntibisanzwe kubera ko imigezi yayo itandukana ibihe gusa ariko nanone bitewe n'ihindagurika ry'igihe kirekire."}
{"id": "15687", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15687", "title": "Umugezi wa Lukunga", "text": "Umugezi wa Lukunga ni uruzi runyura mu murwa mukuru wa Kinshasa muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, ni uruzi rw'umugezi wa Kongo. Kinshasa aryamye mu kibaya k'izengurutswe n'imisozi, gitwarwa n'i nzuzi nyinshi. Muri ibyo, Lukunga ni imwe mu zikomeye, kandi kubera iyo mpamvu iha izina Akarere ka Lukunga ku mujyi. [1]"}
{"id": "15688", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15688", "title": "Umugezi wa Lukushi", "text": "Umugezi wa Lukushi ni uruzi rw'u mugezi wa Luvua. Iva mu majyepfo igana mu majyaruguru unyura mu Ntara ya Malemba Nkulu yo mu Ntara ya Hoti Lomami no mu Ntara ya Manono yo mu Ntara ya Tanganyika, ikanyura mu mijyi icukurwamo amabati ya Kitotolo na Manono mbere gato yo kwinjira muri Luvua. [1]\nMu ntangiriro ya 1800, Umwami Kumwimbe w\u2019Ubwami bwa Luba yashyizeho igihugu cy\u2019abakiriya gihuza imidugudu ya Hemba yo mu kibaya cy\u2019umugezi wa Lukushi, kandi cyagize uruhare runini mu kurinda Luba kuganza ibindi bihugu bito byo mu karere. [2]"}
{"id": "15689", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15689", "title": "Umugezi wa Lulonga", "text": "Lulonga ni uruzi ruturuka mu ntara ya eqateri ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Ni kolomeortero 200 ndende kuva yatangira mu mujyi wa Basankusu. Lopori na Maringa bifatanya gushinga Lulonga hariya. Umugezi wa Lulonga utemba mu ruzi rwa Congo ku mudugudu wa Lulonga. "}
{"id": "15690", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15690", "title": "Umugezi wa Lulua", "text": "Umugezi wa Lulua ni uruzi ruri mu kibaya cya Kongo muri Afurika giherereye muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. N'umugezi w'iburyo w'umugezi wa Kasayi."}
{"id": "15691", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15691", "title": "Umugezi wa Lungezi", "text": "Uruzi rwa River ni uruzi ruri mubigize umupaka uhuza Angola na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Ni uruzi rw'uruzi rwa Lufu\nCourse.\nUmugezi wa Lungezi uzamuka mu ntara yo hagati ya Kongo mu burasirazuba bwa Songololo, utemba ugana mu majyepfo ashyira uburengerazuba kugera ku mupaka na Angola aho uhurira n'umugezi wa Lavemba, hanyuma ugatemba ugana iburengerazuba ugana ku mupaka kugeza aho uhurira n'umugezi wa Lufu, unyura mu majyaruguru unyuze muri Angola ugakomeza. iburengerazuba ku rubibe. [1] Imiterere y\u2019ikirere ya K\u00f6ppen ni Aw: Ubushyuhe bwo mu turere dushyuha, butose. [2]"}
{"id": "15692", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15692", "title": "Umugezi wa Luvua", "text": "Umugezi wa Luvua (cyangwa \"uruzi rwa Lowa\") (Swahili) ni uruzi ruri mu Ntara ya Katanga muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (RDC). Rutemba ruturutse ku mpera y'amajyaruguru y'ikiyaga cya Mweru ku mupaka wa Zambiya na Kongo mu cyerekezo cy'amajyaruguru y'uburengerazuba ku kugera aho ihurira n'uruzi rwa Lualaba ruteganye n'umujyi wa Ankoro. Lualaba ihinduka uruzi rwa Kongo ruri munsi y'amasumo ya Boyoma.\nIkiyaga cya Mweru, kiri ku burebure bwa, ni ikiyaga cyuzuye amazi cyakozwe n'isuri aho umuyaga watwaye alluvium. [1] Uruzi rwa Luvua ruva mu majyaruguru y'ikiyaga i Pweto muri RDC. [2] Uruzi rutemba mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba ugana Ankoro, aho uhurira na Lualaba. [3] Umurongo wo hagati w'uruzi ubangamiwe n'imigezi myinshi, imigezi n'amasumo mu gihe umanuka uva ku kibaya ugana mu kibaya cya Kongo. [4] I Piana Mwanga amasumo akoreshwa mu gutanga amashanyarazi yo mu birombe bya Manono na Kitotolo. Uruzi rushobora kugendwa mu bwato buto buto mu yo hasi munsi ya Kiambi. [3] Luvua ifite amazi menshi cyane hagati ya Werurwe na Gicurasi, aho amazi menshi cyane hagati ya Nzeri na Ugushyingo. [5]\nIkibaya cy'Uruzi rwa Kongo gifite ishusho y'isahani nini kandi idakomeye. Luvua inyura mu nkengero z'amajyepfo y'uburasirazuba bw'iyi sahani, ikazana amazi ava mu kibaya cya Mweru-Bangweulu. [6] Luvua itwara amazi ku buso bwa, igice kinini cyabyo cyahoze ari igice cy'amazi ya Zambezi. [7] Hari ibimenyetso bikomeye by'inyamaswa bigaragaza ko ikibaya cya Luvua cyahoze ari igice cy'uburyo bwa Zambezi, aho amoko menshi y'amafi asanzwe muri ubwo buryo bwa Zambezi nayo aboneka muri Luvua. [8] Inyamaswa zo muri Kongo zinjiye muri Luvua zinjira mu kiyaga cya Mweru, ariko zafunzwe n'amasumo ya Mambatuta kugira ngo zigere mu kiyaga cya Bangweulu. Impinduka yabaye mu ntangiriro za Tertiary. [9]\nBamwe mu bahanga mu by\u2019ubutaka babona ko Luvua ari igice cy\u2019uruzi rwa Kongo. Bashyira inkomoko ya Kongo mu misozi miremire iri hagati ya Tanzaniya na Zambiya, aho uruzi rwa Chambeshi ruturuka, rutemba mu majyepfo y\u2019uburengerazuba rugana ku kiyaga cya Bangweulu. Uruzi rwa Luapula ruvamo rukamanuka rugana mu majyaruguru rurenga kugera ku kiyaga cya Mweru. Uruzi rwa Luvua rusohoka mu kiyaga cya Mweru rugatemba mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba rugana ku ruzi rwa Lualaba, ruhinduka uruzi rwa Kongo rumanuka. [10] Bamwe bavuga ko Kongo itangirira aho Lualaba na Luvua bihurira. [11] Impamvu yo gufata Lualaba nk'amazi y'ingenzi, nubwo ari magufi cyane, ni uko rufite amazi akubye kabiri aho ruhurira na Luvua. [10]\nIkibaya cyo hejuru cy'uruzi rwa Luvua cyahoze gituwe n'abantu b'umuryango wa Bwile. Hashize igihe nyuma ya 1810, Kumwimbe Ngombe, umutegetsi w'Ubwami bwa Luba, yigaruriye akarere. Umumisiyonari n'umushakashatsi w'Umunyaburayi David Livingstone \"yavumbuye\" Ikiyaga cya Mweru mu 1867, kandi yibwiraga ko uruzi rwa Luvua rutemba rugana ku Nili y'Hejuru. Ariko nyuma y'urupfu rwa Livingstone, ni bwo Henry Morton Stanley, mu rugendo rwe rwo gushakisha rwo mu 1874-1877, yagaragaje ko mu by'ukuri uru ruzi ari umugezi w'uruzi rwa Kongo. Guhera mu 1891, Umuswahili witwa Shimba yatangiye ibitero by'inyuma byinshi byo kunyaga abantu bakabagurisha nk'abacakara, ibyo bigatuma igice kinini cy'inkombe y'iburengerazuba y'Ikiyaga cya Mweru kiba nta bantu. Shimba yifatanyije n'undi Muswahili witwa Kafindo wari ari mu gace ko hejuru y'uruzi rwa Luvua, maze batera umutegetsi w'aho w'umuryango wa Yeke. Ibyo bitero byakomeje kugeza igihe Umubiligi Braseur agezeyo, atangira \"kuhanagura intambara\" muri ako karere, akarere ibihangange by'Uburayi byari byumvikanyeho ko ari ak'ubutegetsi runaka.. [14]\nMu 2000, mu Ntambara ya Kabiri ya Kongo, ingabo za leta zatsinzwe bikomeye n'ingabo z'u Rwanda i Pweto, aho uruzi rwatangiriye. Ingabo za Kongo zari zazanye inyinshi mu modoka zazo zitwaje intwaro zambukijwe uruzi. Hari ubwato bumwe, kandi ntibari bafite umwanya uhagije wo kuvana izo modoka mbere yuko Abanyarwanda bahagera. Abasirikare bashyizemo tanki ya T-62 mu buryo buteye ubwoba, maze ubwato buragwa burohama. Abanyarwanda babonye ibifaru 33, hamwe n'izindi modoka, ingabo za Kongo zari zagerageje gutwika. [15]"}
{"id": "15693", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15693", "title": "Umugezi wa M'pozo", "text": "M'pozo ni uruzi mu ntara ya Basi Congo muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Inkomoko yarwo iherereye muri Angola igize igice cya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. ni uruzi rurangirira ku nkombe y'ibumoso yu mugezi wa Congo, mu birometero bike ugana Matadi. \nUruzi ruzwi cyane cyane mu gice cyo hepfo y\u2019urugendo rwarwo no kuri kanyoni, rukoreshwa na gari ya moshi ya Matadi - Kinshasa, kandi rukaba rwaragize ikibazo gikomeye mu gihe cyo kubaka uyu murongo wa gari ya moshi mu mpera z'ikinyejana cya 19. "}
{"id": "15694", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15694", "title": "Umugezi wa Makongo", "text": "Umugezi wa Makongo ni uruzi rwa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Ni umugezi w'ibumoso w'umugezi wa Bomokandi, nawo ukaba uruzi rukomokwaho uruzi rwa Uele."}
{"id": "15695", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15695", "title": "Mampeza", "text": "Mampeza ni umugezi uri muri Kinshasa, mu gihugu cya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. "}
{"id": "15696", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15696", "title": "Umugezi wa Maringa", "text": "Umugezi wa Maringa ni uruzi ruri muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Umugezi wa Maringa ndetse nu mugezi wa Lopori uherereye mu majyaruguru, bifatanya hafi na Basankusu bigakora uruzi rwa Lulonga, uruzi rw'u mugezi wa Kongo. Ikibaya cya Maringana Lopori gifite ubuso bungana Maringa-Lopori-Wamba, ifite akamaro gakomeye ku bidukikije. Abaturage ba Ngando batuye mu gace ka Maringa mu majyaruguru ya Ikela. "}
{"id": "15697", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15697", "title": "Jean-Claude Raphael", "text": "Jean-Claude Raphael (wavutse 5 Werurwe 1973) ni umukinnyi wa jido ukomoka muri Morise.\nRaphael yaserukiye Morise mu mikino y'olempike ya Atlanta mu 1996 agera ku mwanya wa 9 mu mikino olempike ya Sydney mu 2000. abona umudari wa zahabu mu bihugu bivuga icyo ngereza, we gukanye umudari wa zahabu mu mikino yo mu nyanja y\u2019Ubuhinde, watsindiye umudari wa Zahabu muri Afurika ya Jido, amaze imyaka myinshi yitabira amahanga mbere yo gusezera mu marushanwa ya bigize umwuga nyuma y\u2019imikino Olempike ya Sydney. "}
{"id": "15698", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15698", "title": "Roilya Ranaivosoa", "text": "Marie Hanitra Roilya Ranaivosoa akunze kwitwa Roilya Ranaivosoa (yavutse ku ya 14 Ugushyingo 1990) ni umunyamoritaniya uterura ibiremereye muri Morise ukomoka muri Malagasi, uhatanira mubafite ibiro 48, yahatanye mu cyiciro anahagararira Morise mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga.\nYitabiriye amarushanwa menshi ya Shampiyona y'isi yo guterura ibiremereye. Yitabiriye imikino ya bavuga icyongereza muri 2014 mu birori bya bapima ibiro 58. \nYahagarariye Morise mu mikino y'olempike ya 2020 yabereye i Tokiyo, mu Buyapani. Yarangije ku mwanya wa 11 mu bagore mu bapima ibiro 49. \nYatsindiye umudari wa feza mu bagore bapima ibiro 49 mu mikino ya bavuga icyongereza yabereye i Birmingham mu Bwongereza. Mu kuboza 2022, yatorewe kuba umwe mu bagize komisiyo y'abakinnyi ba IWF. "}
{"id": "15700", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15700", "title": "Souleymane Anne", "text": "Souleymane Anne (wavutse ku ya 5 Ukuboza 1997) ni umukinnyi wu mupira w'amaguru ukina nk'umukinnyi ukinira ikipe ya Virton yo mu Bubiligi ndetse ni kipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Moritaniya.\nAnne yatangiye umwuga wu mupira w'amaguru mu cyiciro cyo hasi cyu bufaransani umukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi muri SMOC, Saran, Angoul\u00eame, hanyuma Aurillac Arpajon. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nAnne yavukiye mu Bufaransa, akomoka muri Moritaniya. Anne yatangiye gukina mu ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Moritaniya mu mukino wa gicuti yatsinzwe na Gana ibitego 3 kuri 1 ku ya 26 Werurwe 2019. \nYakiniye ikipe y'igihugu mu gikombe cya Afurika cy\u2019ibihugu muri 2019, irushanwa mpuzamahanga rya mbere ryiyi kipe "}
{"id": "15701", "revid": "12301", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15701", "title": "Jidou El Moctar", "text": "Jidou Ould Khaye El Moctar (yavutse ku ya 8 Nyakanga 1985) ni umukinnyi wiruka ukomoka muri Moritaniya w'itabiriye imikino olempike yo mu mpeshyi muri 2012 mu birometero 200. Yabaye icyitegererezo muri Moritaniya mu birori byo gutangiza irushanwa. El Moctar yavanywe mu cyiciro cya mbere ariko arangiza n'ibihe byiza afite amasegonda 22.94.\nYitabiriye isiganwa rya metero 100 mu mikino olempike ya 2016 yabereye i Rio Janeiro. Yarangije ku mwanya wa 6 mu cyiciro kibanza kandi ntiyujuje ibyiciro bya mbere byanyuma. Yabaye ibendera rya Moritaniya m'ugihe cya kwiyerekana cy'amahanga. "}
{"id": "15702", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15702", "title": "Aminata Kamissoko", "text": "Aminata Kamissoko (wavutse ku ya 9 Nyakanga 1985) ni umukinnyi usiganwa ku maguru ukomoka muri Moritaniya.\nMu 2003, Kamissoko yitabiriye amarushanwa y'isi muri 2003 yaberaga mu mikino ngororamubiri yabereye mu Bufaransa, yiruka muri metero 100 aho yirutse mu gihe cya masegonda 13.70 akaza ku mwanya wa 7 ku buryo atujuje ibisabwa mu cy'iciro gikurikira, amezi 12 nyuma yaje kuba uwa kabiri mu bahatana, mu gitsina gore bahagarariye igihugu cye mu mikino olempike yo mu mpeshyi, ubwo yitabiriye imikino olempike yo mu 2004 muri metero 100, yiruka akoresha ibihe bya masegonda 13.49 akaza ku mwanya wa 8, bityo ntibujuje ibisabwa mukuhya mu cyiciro gikurikira. "}
{"id": "15704", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15704", "title": "Youba Hmeida", "text": "Youba Mohamed Ould H'me\u00efde akitwa Youba Hmeida (wavutse ku ya 1 Mutarama 1976) ni umukinnyi wo kwirukanka n'amaguru uri mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru ukomoka i Nouakchott muri Moritaniya, wazobereye mukwiruka metero 400. Yaserukiye Moritaniya mu mikino olempike yo mu 2004, anashyiraho agahigo mu gihugu ndetse n\u2019umuntu ku giti cye akoresha amasegonda 47.87 ku mukino wa mbere wa siporo yakinnye mu marushanwa y\u2019isi ya IAAF 2001 yabereye i Edmonton mu karere ka Alberta, muri Kanada. \nHmeida yujuje ibihe bisabwa mu ikipe ya Moritaniya muri metero 400 mu bagabo mu mikino olempike yo mu 2004 yabereye muri Atenayi ahabwa ikarita yinjira mu gusozi IAAF. Hmeida yiruka na bandi bakinnyi barindwi aza muri butatu, Hmeida yarenze umurongo wa nyuma ku mwanya wa nyuma na masegonda arenga atatu inyuma y'umuyobozi Anton Galkin wu burusiya akoresheje amasegonda 49.18. Hmeida yananiwe kujya muri kimwe cya kabiri kuko yashyize kure avuye mu bice bibiri byikora mu cyiciro gikurikiraho hanyuma akaza ku mwanya wa. 58 muri rusange muri prelime. Hmeida yagizwe umuyobozi utwara ibendera rya Moritaniya na Komite y\u2019igihugu olempike mu muhango wo gutangiza. "}
