{"id": "15706", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15706", "title": "Houl\u00e8ye Ba", "text": "Houleye Ba (yavutse ku ya 17 Nyakanga 1992) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Moritaniya wiruka n'amaguru hagati.\nYitabiriye imikino olempike yo mu 2016 mu kwiruka muri metero 800 mu cyiciro cya bagore aza ku mwanya wa 2 akoresha amasegonda 43.52, gusa ntabwo yujuje ibihe bisabwa mu gukomeza muri kimwe cya kabiri. Mu mikino yo mu mpeshyi ya 2020 yirutse muri metero 100 kandi yiruka amasegonda 15.26 byari ibihe byiza ku giti. "}
{"id": "15707", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15707", "title": "Ch\u00e9rif Baba Aidara", "text": "Ch\u00e9rif Baba Aidara (wavutse ku ya 22 Ugushyingo 1967) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Moritaniya wiruka n'amaguru hagati.\nAidara yitabiriye imikino olempike ibiri yo mu mpeshyi, mu mikino olempike yo mu 1992 yinjiye muri metero 800 arangiza ari uwa 6 ku umunani bitabiriye, yiruka mu bikomeye, gusa ntabyo yujuje ibisabwa mu cyiciro gikurikira, ntabwo yongeye kwitwara neza muri metero 800 kuri imikino olempike yo mu 1996 aho iki gihe yarangije ku mwanya wa 7 mu bubasha bwe, gusai ntiyongeye kwitabira icyiciro gikurikira. Yagiye kandi mu marushanwa y\u2019isi yo mu 1997 yaberaga mu kwiruka muri metero 800 aho yaje ku mwanya wa nyuma mu bushyuhe bwe ntiyakomeza mu cyiciro gikurikira. "}
{"id": "15708", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15708", "title": "Abidine Abidine", "text": "Abidine Abidine (wavutse 31 Werurwe 1993) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Moritaniya, akaba yiruka intera ndende ya Marato. Yitabiriye amarushanwa muri metero 5000 mu mikino olempike yo muri 2020. \nUmwuga.\nMuri Kanama 2019 mu mikino nya furika yo muri 2019, Abidine yaserukiye Moritaniya muri metero 5000 arangiza ku mwanya wa 27 agangiza afite ibihe bingana n'amasaha 15: 52.09. \nAbidine yari afite ibendera rya Moritaniya mu gihe cy'imikino olempike yo mu mpeshyi yo muri 2020. "}
{"id": "15709", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15709", "title": "Gino Soupprayen", "text": "Gino Frederic Soupprayen Padiatty (wavutse 3 mutarama 1973) ni umukinnyi wu munya Moritaniya uterura ibiro biremereye, uhatanira mubatarengeje ibiro 56 wahagarariye igihugu cy cya Motitaniya m'umarushanwa mpuzamahanga. Yitabiriye imikino olempike yo muri 1996 ndetse no mu mikino olempike yo mu 2000 mu birometero 56. "}
{"id": "15710", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15710", "title": "Selma Rosun", "text": "Jessika Selma Rosun (wavutse ku ya 26 Mata 1991) ni umukinnyi umutera umuhunda ukomoka muri wa Morise.\nYatsindiye umudari wafeza muri Shampiyona ya furika ya batarengeje imyaka 2009, yegukana umwanya wa cumi muri shampiyona ny'afurika yo muri 2010, aba uwa gatanu mu mikino y'abereye muri afurika muri 2011, aba uwa gatandatu muri shampiyona ny'afurika muri 2012, yegukana umudari wa feza mumikino yo muri 2013 yo mubufaransa, yegukanye umwanya wa cumi na kabiri mu mikino ya yabavuga icyongereza muri 2014, yegukana umudari wa feza muri shampiyona ny'afurika yo muri 2014, y'egukana umwanya wa gatandatu mu mikino ny'afurika yo muri 2015, iya karindwi muri Shampiyona ny'afurika 2016, aba uwa kane muri 2017mu mikono yo mubufaransa, aba uwa karindwi mu mikino ybavuga icyongereza muri 2018, uwa gatanu muri shampiyona ny'afurika yo muri 2018 nuwa gatanu mu mikino ny'afurika yo muri 2019. \nUmuntu we yitwaye neza ni metero 53,98, yagezweho muri Gicurasi 2019 i Savona. "}
{"id": "15711", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15711", "title": "Bernadette Ravina", "text": "Bernadette Perrine-Ravina (wavutse ku ya 18 Gashyantare 1975) ni umukinnyi uri mukiruhuko cy'izabukuru utera umuhunda ukomoka muri Morise.\nYatsindiye umudari wa feza mu mikino yo muri afurika yo muri 1995, umudari wa feza muri mikino yo mubufaransa muri 1997, umudari wa feza muri shampiyona ny'afurika yo muri 1998, aba uwa gatandatu muri yo mubufaransa muri 2001, yegukanye umudari wa feza muri shampiyona ny'afurika 2002, yegukana umwanya wa munani mu mikino ya bavuga icyongereza muri 2002, uwa gatandatu muri shampiyona ny'afurika 2006, uwa karindwi muri shampiyona ny'afurika ya 2010, uwa kane mu mikino ya Afurika yose muri 2011 na karindwi muri shampiyona ny'afurika 2012. \nYatsinze kandi imikino yo mu kirwa cyo mu nyanja ya bahinde muri 1998 na 2003. Nkumukinnyi ufite amashoti yarangije umwanya wa gatanu muri shampiyona ny'afurika yo muri 1998. \nUmuntu ku giti cye yataye ni metero 54.56, yagezeho muri Kamena 2002 muri R\u00e9duit. Iyi ni inyandiko ya Morise. "}
{"id": "15712", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15712", "title": "Gavin Kaplan", "text": "Gavin Kaplan (wavutse 7 Gashyantare 1998) ni umukinnyi wa ruhago mu mupira w'amaguru, ukomoka muri afurika yepfo. Yatangiye icyiciro cye cya mbere ku ya 18 Ugushyingo 2021, mu Ntara y'Iburengerazuba muri 2021 kugeza 22 CSA nyuma yi minsi 4. Yatangiriye bwa mbere muri Twenty20 ku ya 7 Gashyantare 2022, mu ntara yI burengerazuba muri 2021 kugeza 22 CSA T 20 mu marushanwa yaho. Yatangiye Urutonde rwe rwa mbere ku ya 16 Werurwe 2022, mu Ntara yI burengerazuba mu gikombe cyu munsi umwe 2021-22 CSA. "}
{"id": "15713", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15713", "title": "Gregory Mahlokwana", "text": "Gregory Nkale Mahlokwana (yavutse ku ya 14 Ukuboza 1994) ni umukinnyi wa ruhago mu mupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yabonye Urutonde rwe mbere mu majyaruguru ya CSA yo mu Ntara ya 2016 kugeza 17 ku ya 12 Gashyantare 2017. Yatangiye gukinira muri Twenty20 mu majyaruguru mu gikombe cya Afurika T20 cyo muri 2017 ku ya 1 Nzeri 2017. Yatangiye gukina mu cyiciro cya mbere mu majyaruguru mu gikombe cy\u2019iminsi 3 cya Sunfoil 2017\u201318 ku ya 14 Ukuboza 2017. \nMuri Nzeri 2018, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya majyaruguru mu gikombe cya Afurika T20 muri 2018. Muri Nzeri 2018, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Titans mu gikombe cya Abu Dhabi T20 muri 2018. Yabaye umukinnyi wa mbere watsindiye amajyaruguru muri 2018\u201319 Intara ya CSA Intara yumunsi umwe, aho yirukanye 18 mu mikino umunani. \nMuri Nzeri 2019, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Cape Town Blitz mu marushanwa ya Mzansi muri 2019. Muri Mata 2021, Mahlokwana yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Afurika y'Epfo mu ikipe idasazwe ya bagabo, aho imikino yabo itandatu yakiniwe muri Namibiya. Nyuma yaho muri uko kwezi, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Free State, mbere yi gihembwe cya 2021-22 muri Afurika yepfo. "}
{"id": "15714", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15714", "title": "Takudzwanashe Kaitano", "text": "Takudzwanashe Kaitano (yavutse 15 kamena 1993) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Zimbabwe. Yatangiye gukinira mu mikino mpuzamahanga mu ikipe ya Cricket ya Zimbabwe muri Nyakanga 2021. \nUmwuga.\nKaitano yerekeje mu cyiciro cya mbere muri Mid West Rhinos mu gikombe cya Logan muri 2016\u201317 ku ya 21 Gashyantare 2017. Yagaragaye ku rutonde rwe rwa mbere muri Mid West Rhinos muri shampiyona yo muri 2017\u201318 ya Pro50, ku ya 23 Gicurasi 2018. Ukuboza 2020, yatoranijwe gukinira muri Rhinos mu gikombe cya Logan 2020\u201321. \nYatangiye bwa mbere muri Twenty20 ku ya 13 Mata 2021, akinira Rhinos, mu marushanwa yo mu gihugu cya Zimbabwe 2020\u201321. Nyuma yaho muri uko kwezi, yatowe nk'umukinnyi uhagaze neza mu mikino y'ibizamini bya Zimbabwe na Pakisitani. \nMuri Nyakanga 2021, Kaitano yashyizwe mu itsinda ry\u2019ibizamini bya Zimbabwe kubera umukino umwe bakinnye na Bangladesh. Yatangiye Ikizamini ku ya 7 Nyakanga 2021, muri Zimbabwe na Bangaladeshi. Mu mukino ubanza, yatsinze ibitego 87, amanota menshi n\u2019umufungura wa Zimbabwe ku ncuro ya mbere. \nMuri Mutarama 2022, Kaitano yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Zimbabwe umunsi umwe mpuzamahanga kubera imikino yakinnye na Sri Lanka. Yatangiye gukinira ODI ku ya 16 Mutarama 2022, muri Zimbabwe na Siri Lanka. "}
{"id": "15715", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15715", "title": "Bryce Parsons", "text": "Bryce Parsons (yavutse ku ya 13 Gashyantare 2001) ni umukinnyi umukino wa criketi ukomoka muri afurika y'Epfo. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye gukinira Twenty20 muri Gauteng mu gikombe cya T20 CSA Provincial cy'Intara muri 2019\u201320 ku ya 14 Nzeri 2019. Ukuboza 2019, yagizwe kapiteni w'ikipe ya Afurika y'Epfo mu gikombe cy'isi cya Cricket cy'abatarengeje imyaka 19. Yabaye umukinnyi w'ambere watsinze ibitego byinshi muri Afrika yepfo muri iri rushanwa, yatsinze 265 mu mikino itandatu. \nYatangiye icyiciro cye cya mbere ku ya 13 Gashyantare 2020, akinira Gauteng mu gikombe cy\u2019Intara cy\u2019iminsi 3 - 2019. Yakoze Urutonde rwe rwa mbere ku ya 16 Gashyantare 2020, kuri Gauteng muri 2019\u201320 Intara ya CSA Intara Umunsi umwe. \nMuri Mata 2021, Parsons yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Afurika y'Epfo ikipe ya bagabo, kubera imikino yabo itandatu yakinnye muri Namibiya. Nyuma yaho muri uko kwezi, yahamagawe mu ikipe ya KwaZulu-Natal, mbere y\u2019igihembwe cya 2021-22 muri Afurika yepfo. "}
{"id": "15716", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15716", "title": "JJ Smit", "text": "Johannes Jonathan Smit (wavutse ku ya 10 Ugushyingo 1995) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa Cricket ukomoka muri Namibiya wakinnye bwa mbere mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Namibiya muri Gashyantare 2012, afite imyaka 16.\nUmwuga wo hambere.\nni umukinnyi w\u2019ibumoso wihuta ukomoka muri Keetmanshoop. Smit yatangiye gukinira ikipe ya Namibiya y'abatarengeje imyaka 19 muri shampiyona yo muri 2011\u201312. Yakinnye imikino itanu muri icyo cyumweru cya Khaya Majola, cyabaye mu Kuboza 2011, Namibiya ihura n\u2019a makipe y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 19 y\u2019a makipe yo muri Afurika yepfo. Igihe shampiyona irangiye, muri Gashyantare 2012, Smit yatoranijwe kugirango atangire gukinira icyiciro cya mbere mu ikipe nkuru ya Namibiya. Yatsinze igitego kimwe ku ncuro ye ya mbere yakinnye n'Intara y'Iburengerazuba mu marushanwa yo mu Ntara y'iminsi itatu, yo muri Afurika y'Epfo, aya Mujahid Behardien. Smit yakinnye undi mukino wo mu cyiciro cya mbere gihembwe gikurikira, yongera gukina ni ntara y'uburengerazuba. Yongeye kugaragara mu batarengeje imyaka 19 mu cyumweru cya Khaya Majola, maze atwara ibitego birindwi, inyuma ya Bredell Wessels gusa muri Namibiya. Abakinnyi cumi na babiri bakinanye nawe muri iri rushanwa yatsinzwe n\u2019abakinnyi babiri gusa - Kyle Simmonds wa KwaZulu -Natal (17) na Vincent Moore (14). \nMuri Shampiyona y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 19 ya ICC muri Afurika, yabereye muri Uganda muri Gicurasi 2013, Smit yatsinze ibitego cumi na bibiri, inyuma ya Paramveer Singh wo muri Kenya. Yagizwe kandi umukinnyi wa Final, nyuma yo gufata 4/17 mu minota umunani, harimo na ni bitego bitatu yitsindiye, kugira ngo afashe Namibiya gutsinda Kenya ku manota 52, bityo yemererwe kujya mu gikombe cy\u2019isi cy\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 19 muri 2014. Smit yatangiye gukinira abatarengeje imyaka 19 Umunsi mpuzamahanga (ODI) mu gikombe cyisi, yakinnye muri leta z'unze ubumwe zabarabu muri Gashyantare 2014. Yagaragaye mu mikino itandatu yose ya Namibiya muri iri rushanwa, aho yatsindiye umunani inyuma ya Bredell Wessells (14) gusa muri Namibiya. Muri rusange gufungura umupira hamwe na Marius Delport cyangwa Kobus Brand, imibare ye myiza, 3/55, yaje guhangana na Ositaraliya. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nHanze y'abakinnyi batarengeje imyaka 19, Smit yabaye akamenyero ku ikipe nkuru ya Namibiya mu marushanwa yo mu gihugu cya Afurika y'Epfo ndetse no mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga, agaragara mu gikombe cya cya mpuzamigabane muri 2013 na Shampiyona ya WCL, mu majonjora y'isi ya 2013, ndetse nA majonjora y'Igikombe cy'isi cyo muri 2014. guhangana na Kenya mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cy'isi 2014 muri Nuvele Zelande, yakuye 3/23 avuye mu minota icumi yafunguye hamwe na Louis Klazinga, bituma Kenya igera kuri 186/8 kuri 50. Yatsinze icyenda mu mikino ya Namibiya, yaje kuri wiketi n'amanota 144/7, nyuma yo kwirukanwa kwa Sarel Burger, hanyuma atsinda 33 ntabwo yavuye mu mukino 25. Namibiya yatsinze ibitego bibiri (hasigaye imipira irindwi), naho Smit agirwa umukinnyi w'umukino. "}
{"id": "15717", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15717", "title": "Tasmeen Granger", "text": "Tasmeen Granger (yavutse 12 Kanama 1994) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Zimbabwe ukina imikino ya cricket. Yaserukiye igihugu cye cya Zimbabwe mu majonjora yo guhatanira itike yo kuzakina imikino ya 20 mu bagore ku isi muri 2013 na 2015. \nMuri Nyakanga 2019, yari umwe mu bakinnyi bane b\u2019abakinnyi b\u2019abakobwa ba Zimbabwe babujijwe ni nama mpuzamahanga yu mukino wa Cricket (ICC) gukina mu ikipe y\u2019iterambere ry\u2019isi yose, kubera gukina na makipe ya Cricket nkuru y'abagore, nyuma yuko ICC ihagaritse Cricket ya Zimbabwe mu ntangiriro z'ukwezi.. Muri Gashyantare 2021, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Zimbabwe kubera imikino yakinnye na Pakisitani. \nMu Kwakira 2021, Granger yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Zimbabwe, muri umunsi umwe mpuzamahanga w'abagore (WODI) kubera imikino ine yakinnye na Irilande. Imikino yari umukino wa mbere WODI nyuma yuko Zimbabwe ibonye WODI muri ICC muri Mata 2021. Yatangiye bwa mbere WODI ku ya 9 Ukwakira 2021, muri Zimbabwe na Irilande. "}
{"id": "15718", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15718", "title": "Brian Chari", "text": "Brian Bara Chari (wavutse 14 Gashyantare 1992) ni umukinnyi wa Zimbabwe ukina umukino wa cricket. Yatangiye gukinira imikino mpuzamahanga mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Zimbabwe mu Gushyingo 2014.\nUmwuga wo murugo.\nNi umukinnyi wo mu rwego rwo hejuru kandi rimwe na rimwe akina nku mu binyuma yugara, Chari yakiniye mu gihugu imbere muri Matabeleland Tuskers kuva mu 2011. Niwe watsinze ibitego byinshi mu irushanwa rya Matabeleland Tuskers no mu marushanwa ya Shampiyona ya 2017\u201318 muri Pro50, yatsinze 316 mu mikino umunani. Yabaye kandi umukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi muri Matabeleland Tuskers mu gikombe cya Logan 2018\u201319, yatsinze 356 mu mikino itandatu. \nUkuboza 2020, yagizwe kapiteni wa Tuskers mu gikombe cya Logan 2020\u201321. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nChari yerekeje bwa mbere muri Zimbabwe mu Gushyingo 2014, akina muri bibiri mu bizamini bitatu by'ikipe mu ruzinduko rwabo muri Bangaladeshi. Yatangiye gukinira umunsi mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga ya (ODI) muri Zimbabwe na Pakisitani ku ya 1 Ukwakira 2015. \nMuri kamena 2018, yashyizwe mu bakinnyi 22 babanje mu cyiciro cya mbere cya T2020 mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga (T20I) mu marushanwa ya Tri-Nation ya Zimbabwe 2018. Ukwezi kwakurikiyeho, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Zimbabwe umunsi umwe mpuzamahanga (ODI) kubera imikino yakinnye na Pakisitani. \nMuri Nzeri 2018, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Zimbabwe mu marushanwa yo guhatanira igikombe cya Afurika T20 2018. Muri Nzeri 2019, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Twenty20 ya mpuzamahanga muri (T20I) ya Zimbabwe mu marushanwa ya Tri-Nation ya Singapore ya 2019\u201320. Yatangiye gukinira T20I muri Zimbabwe, na Nepale, muri Singapore Tri-Nation ya Singapore ku ya 27 Nzeri 2019. "}
{"id": "15719", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15719", "title": "Richard Ngarava", "text": "Richard Ngarava (wavutse 28 Ukuboza 1997) ni umukinnyi wa Zimbabwe ukina umukino wa cricket. Yatangiye gukinira Twenty 20 yo muri Zimbabwe na free state yo muri afurika yepfo mu gikombe cya Afurika cya T20 muri 2016 ku ya 9 Nzeri 2016. Mbere y\u2019umukino wa mbere wa Twenty 20, yari mu ikipe ya Zimbabwe mu gikombe cy\u2019isi cya Cricket cy\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 19. \nUmwuga.\nYaje kurutonde bwa mbere muri Zimbabwe ya A na Afuganisitani A mu ruzinduko rwa Afuganisitani muri Zimbabwe ku ya 3 Gashyantare 2017. Nyuma y'imikino no kuza ku rutonde A, Ngarava yongerewe mu ikipe ya Zimbabwe umunsi umwe mu mikino mpuzamahanga (ODI) mu mikino itanu yakinnye na Afuganisitani. Yatangiye gukinira ODI muri Zimbabwe na Afuganisitani muri Harare Sports Club ku ya 16 Gashyantare muri 2017. Muri Gashyantare 2017, yashyizwe mu itsinda ry\u2019ishuri na Zimbabwe Cricket kuzenguruka u Bwongereza nyuma yuwo mwaka. \nYatangiye bwa mbere mu cyiciro cya mbere muri Rising Stars mu gikombe cya Logan 2017\u201318 ku ya 4 Ukwakira 2017. Muri kamena 2018, yashyizwe mu itsinda rya Board XI kubera imikino yo gususurutsa mbere y\u2019imikino ya Tri-Nation Zimbabwe 2018. \nMuri Nzeri 2018, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Zimbabwe mu marushanwa yo guhatanira igikombe cya Afurika T20 2018. Nyuma yaho muri uko kwezi, yashyizwe mu itsinda ry\u2019ibizamini bya Zimbabwe mu rukurikirane rwakinnye na Bangladesh. Ariko, nyuma yaje kwirukanwa mu bigeragezo kubera imvune. \nMuri Nzeri 2019, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Twenty 20 International (T20I) ya Zimbabwe mu marushanwa ya Tri-Nation ya Singapore muri 2019\u201320. Yatangiye gukinira T20I muri Zimbabwe, na Singapore, muri Singapore muri Tri-Nation Series yo ku ya 27 Nzeri 2019. Muri Gashyantare 2021, Ngarava yashyizwe mu itsinda ry\u2019ibizamini bya Zimbabwe kubera imikino yakinnye na Afuganisitani. Muri Mata 2021, yashyizwe mu itsinda ry\u2019ibizamini bya Zimbabwe, kubera imikino yakinnye na Pakisitani. Yatangiye ikizamini cya mbere muri Zimbabwe, na Pakisitani, ku ya 29 Mata 2021. "}
{"id": "15720", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15720", "title": "Yvan Pierrot", "text": "Yvan Hilary Pierrot (23 Gicurasi 1996 - 31 Ukuboza 2015) yari umukinnyi uterura ibiremereye ukomoka muri Morise. Yarushanwe mu bagabo bapima ibiro biri hejuru 105 mu muhango wi birori mu mikino ny'afurika ya 2015 \nUmwuga wa siporo.\nPierrot yatangiye guterura muri 2010 afite imyaka 14. Yabonye umudari we wa mbere wa zahabu mu 2013 muri Shampiyona y\u2019urubyiruko muri bihugu bivuga icyongereza. Muri 2013 yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi witwaye neza muri Morise. Muri 2015 yatsindiye umudari wa feza muri Shampiyona yi bihugu bivuga icyongereza, anegukana umudari wa zahabu mu cyiciro cy'abato. Mu mikino nyafurika yatsindiye umudari wafeza ibiri (isuku &amp; umuhunda) mu icyicirokuri cya bapima ibiro birenga 105.\nUrupfu.\nKu gicamunsi cy'umwaka mushya, 2015, yari atwaye imodoka wenyine, maze agira impanuka y'imodoka yahitanye Midlands. "}
{"id": "15721", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15721", "title": "Jonathan Permal", "text": "Jonathan Olivier Permal (yavutse ku ya 15 Mutarama 1994) ni umukinnyi wo gusiganwa ku maguru uvuka mu Karere ka Flacq wo muri Morise wiruka muri metero 100 na metero 200. Muri mikino ya bafaransa muri 2013, yegukanye umudari wa feza muri 200. Yageze no muri kimwe cya kabiri cyaba metero 100 na metero 200 mu marushanwa y\u2019imikino ngororamubiri muri Afurika 2014 yabereye i Marrakech, muri Maroke. \nPermal kuri ubu ni iya gatatu yihuta cyane muri Maurice muri metero 200 hamwe n'ibihe cya masegonda 20,85 nyuma ya 20.06 ya Stephan Buckland na 20.66 ya Eric Milazar. Kugeza ubu niwe mugabo wihuta cyane uhatanira Morise. "}
{"id": "15722", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15722", "title": "Odirile Modimokoane", "text": "Odirile Modimokoane (yavutse ku ya 10 Nyakanga 2001) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa cricket wo muri Afurika yepfo. Yatangiye bwa mbere muri Twenty 20 ku ya 10 Ukwakira 2021, muri Dolphins mu marushanwa yo kuwa 2021-22 mu Intara ya CSA ya T20 Knock-Out. Mbere y\u2019umukino wa mbere wa Twenty 20, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Afurika yepfo mu gikombe cy\u2019isi cya Cricket cy\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 19. Yatangiye icyiciro cya mbere ku ya 18 Ugushyingo 2021, muri Dolphins muri 2021-22 CSA y'iminsi 4. Yaje mubakinnyi bwa mbere ku ya 27 Werurwe 2022, muri Dolphins mu gikombe cy'umunsi umwe 2021-22 cya CSA. "}
{"id": "15723", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15723", "title": "Alfred Mothoa", "text": "Alfred Mothoa (wavutse ku ya 16 Ukuboza 1989) ni umukinnyi wa cricket ukomoka muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Cricket ya majyaruguru mu gikombe cya furika ya T20 muri 2015. Muri Kamena 2018, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Titans muri shampiyona ya 2018\u201319. \nMuri Nzeri 2018, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Titans mu gikombe cy'abu Dhabi ya T20 muri 2018. Ukwezi kwakurikiyeho, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Jozi Stars ku nshuro ya mbere y'irushanwa rya Mzansi muri T20. Yabaye umwe mu bayobozi bayoboye Titans muri 2018\u201319 CSA y'iminsi 4 ya Franchise, aho muri 21 mu mikino umunani. \nMuri Nzeri 2019, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Limpopo yari mu gikombe cya T20 cy'Intara muri 2019\u201320. Muri Mata 2021, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Free State, mbere y\u2019igihembwe cya 2021-22 muri Afurika yepfo. "}
{"id": "15724", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15724", "title": "Janneman Malan", "text": "Janneman Nieuwoudt Malan (wavutse ku ya 18 Mata 1996) ni umukinnyi ukina umukino wa Cricket ukomoka muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yatangiye gukinira imikino mpuzamahanga ya Cricket muri Afurika yepfo muri Gashyantare 2019. \nUmwuga wo murugo na T20.\nMalan yashyizwe mu ikipe y\u2019amajyaruguru y\u2019iburengerazuba mu gikombe cya Afurika cya T20 muri 2016. Muri Kanama 2017, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Bloem City Blazers mu gihembwe cya mbere cya shampiyona ihuruweho cya T20. Ariko, mu Kwakira 2017, Cricket yo muri afurika y'Epfo yabanje gusubika amarushanwa kugeza mu Gushyingo 2018, ubwo ihagarikwa rikuweho. \nMalan niwe watsinze ibitego byinshi mu marushanwa ya CSA yo mu Ntara ya 2017\u201318, mu munsi umwe, yatsinze ibitego 500 mu mikino icumi. Yabaye kandi umukinnyi watsinze ibitego byinshi mu marushanwa y\u2019igikombe cy\u2019iminsi 3 ya Sunfoil muri 2017\u201318, yatsinze 1.046 mu mikino icumi. \nMuri Kamena 2018, Malan yashyizwe mu ikipe mu ikipe ya Cape Cobras muri shampiyona yo muri 2018\u201319. Muri Nzeri 2018, yashyizwe mu ikipe y\u2019Intara y\u2019Iburengerazuba mu gikombe cya Afurika cya T20 muri 2018. Niwe watsinze ibitego byinshi mu Ntara y'Iburengerazuba muri iri rushanwa, yatsinze imikino 178 mu mikino ine. \nMu Kwakira 2018, Malan yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Cape Town Blitz mu marushanwa ya mbere ya shampiyona ya mbere ya Mzansi muri T20. Muri Nzeri 2019, yashyizwe mu ikipe mu ikipe ya Cape Town Blitz mu marushanwa ya Mzansi shampiyona ya mbere muri 2019. Muri Mata 2021, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Boland, mbere y\u2019igihembwe cya 2021-22 muri Afurika yepfo. "}
{"id": "15725", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15725", "title": "Beyatt Lekweiry", "text": "Beyatt Lekweiry (wavutse ku ya 11 Mata 2005) ni umukinnyi wu mupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Moritaniya ukina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati mu kibuga mu ikipe ya AS Douanes ku nguzanyo ya FC Nouadhibou, ndetse ni kipe yi gihugu ya Moritaniya.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nNku musore, Lekweiry yakiniye ikipe yiwabo avukamo ya FC Nouadhibou yo muri cyiciro cya mbere muri Morise. Muri 2021 yinjiye muri AS Douanes ku nguzanyo y'umwaka umwe. Icyo gihe yatekerezaga ko ibitangazamakuru byo muri Moritaniya ari kimwe mu byifuzo byu mupira wa maguru mu gihugu. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nLekweiry yari umukinnyi ukomeye muri Mauritania mu gikombe cy'Abarabu U-20 2020 afite imyaka 15. Umwaka ukurikira yatorewe guhagararira Mauritania mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu 2021 cya Afurika U-20 ariko ntiyitabira irushanwa kubera imvune. \nMuri Mutarama 2022, Lekweiry yari mu ikipe nkuru y\u2019igihugu cye mu gikombe cy\u2019Afurika muri 2021 kubera guhamagarwa kwe bwa mbere. Ku myaka 16, yariwe mukinnyi muto muri iri rushanwa. Yakomeje gukinira umukino we wa mbere mu mukino wa nyuma w'ikipe mu mikino itangira, yaje kuza asimbuye Mali ku ya 20 Mutarama 2022. "}
{"id": "15726", "revid": "15693", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15726", "title": "Yoann Langlet", "text": "Yoann-Jean-No\u00ebl Langlet (yavutse 25 Ukuboza 1982) ni umukinnyi wu mupira w'amaguru ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati mu kibiga. Yavukiye i R\u00e9union,Iri ni ishami ryo mu mahanga hamwe na karere k'Ubufaransa kari mu nyanja y'Abahinde, ahagarariye ikipe yi gihugu ya Moritaniya ku rwego mpuzamahanga.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nLanglet yakiniye amakipe yo mu Bufaransa, Ubusuwisi, Libiya n'Ubugereki.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMu 2003, Langlet yemeye kuba umunyagihugu ndetse nu muturage wa Moritaniya, nyuma yu butumire bwa mugenzi we wu mufaransa Noel Tosi, wahoze ari mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Moritaniya kandi yamwifuza muri iyi kipe.\n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo urutonde rwa intego ya Mauritania mbere.\" \nReba.\nhttp://www.football.ch/sfl/de/start.aspx?vNews=1&amp;newsID=4"}
{"id": "15727", "revid": "16886", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15727", "title": "Adaklu Waya", "text": "Adaklu Waya ni umurwa mukuru w'akarere ka Adaklu. Ni kamwe mu turere two mu karere ka Voluta, muri Gana adaklu district yashyizweho ku itariki ya 28 kamena 2012 kandi yari ikubiyemo mbere mu gice kinini cyari kitwa adaklu anyigbe district mbere yo gutandukana. \nAho biherereye.\nAdaklu Waya iherereye mu karere ka Volta kandi ni akarere gakomeye kugera mu mijyi ya Adaklu."}
{"id": "15728", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15728", "title": "Akarere ka Achiase", "text": "Akarere ka Achiase ni kamwe mu turere mirongo itatu na dutatu two mu karere k'iburasirazuba, muri Gana. Mu ntangiriro y'ahoze mu gice kinini kandi cya mbere cy'a karere ka Birim y'Amajyepfo mu 1988, yashinzwe kuva mu cyahoze ari Njyanama y'akarere ka Birim, kugeza igice cy'iburengerazuba cy'akarere cyacitsemo ibice kugira ngo habeho a akarere gashya ka Birim y'Amajyepfo ku ya 29 Gashyantare 2008; bityo igice gisigaye cyiswe izina rya Central District ya Birim, hamwe na Akim Oda nk'u murwa mukuru. Icyakora ku ya 15 Werurwe 2018, igice cy'iburasirazuba bw'akarere cyacitsemo ibice kugira ngo hashyizweho Akarere ka Achiase, bityo igice gisigaye cyagumishijwe nkakarere ka Birim yepfo. Inteko y'akarere iherereye mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bw'akarere k'iburasirazuba kandi ifite Achiase nk'umurwa mukuru."}
{"id": "15729", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15729", "title": "Bertrand Ketchanke", "text": "Bertrand Ketchanke (wavutse ku ya 14 Kamena 1980) yahoze ari umukinnyi w'umupira wa bigize umwuga ukina nka myugariro. Yavukiye muri Kameruni, akaba yari umusore ukina nka mpuzamahanga mu Bufaransa kandi yakinnye inshuro imwe mu ikipe nkuru ya Moritaniya. \nUmwuga.\nKetchanke yatangiye umwuga we muri Rennes yo mu Bufaransa mu cyiciro cya mbere cyitwa lige ya 1. Mu 1999, yoherejwe ku nguzanyo muri Reims mu cyiciro cya gatatu cy'Ubufaransa. Mu 2004, Ketchanke yasinyiye mu cyiciro cya gatanu mubwo ngereza muri Scarborough. Mu 2005, yasinyiye ikigo muri Irilande y'Amajyaruguru ariko avayo kubera iterabwoba. Mu 2010, yasinyiye ikipe ya Borgo yo mu Bufaransa. \nMbere yi gice cya kabiri cy'umwaka wa 2011\u201312, Ketchanke yasinyiye BX Bruxelles mu cyiciro cya gatatu mu bubiligi. Muri 2013, yasinyiye ikipe ya Luxembourgish yo mu cyiciro cya gatatu US Esch. Muri 2014, yasinyiye CS P\u00e9tange mu cyiciro cya kabiri cya Luxemburuge. Muri 2015, Ketchanke yasinyiye ikipe yo mu Bubiligi ya FC Arlon\u00a0[fr]. "}
{"id": "15730", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15730", "title": "Dominique Da Sylva", "text": "Dominique Da Sylva (wavutse ku ya 16 Kanama 1989) ni umukinnyi wu mupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri wa Moritaniya ukina nku mukinnyi ukina imbere mu ikipe yu mujyi wa Kuala Lumpur ndetse n\u2019ikipe y'igihugu ya Moritaniya. Yamaze igihe mu ikipe ya Acad\u00e9mie de Football Nouakchott mbere yo kwinjira mu ikipe ya CS Sfaxien yo muri Tuniziya muri 2007. Nyuma y'imyaka ine, yimuriwe mu ikipe ya Al-Ahly yo mu Misiri. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nDa Silva yavukiye i Nouakchott mu gihugu cya Moritaniya ku babyeyi ba Gineya-Bissawu. akaba ari uwo mu idini rya bagatolika. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nYari muri shampiyona ya 2006\u201307 muri Acad\u00e9mie de Football yo muri uyu mujyi mbere yo kwinjira mu ikipe ya CS Sfaxien yo muri Tuniziya mu 2007. Muri shampiyona ye ya kabiri hamwe na Sfaxien, yatsinze ibitego bine mu mikino icumi yakinnye mu cyiciro cya mbere cya Tuniziya, shampiyona ya babigize umwuga ya 1. Yatsinze ibitego bitatumuri bya shampiyona muri 2009-10 ndetse n'ibindi bibiri muri shampiyona yakurikiyeho mbere yuko yinjira mu ikipe ya Al-Ahly yo mu Misiri ku madolari 600.000 muri Mutarama 2011. Da Silva yatsinze ibindi bitego bitatu mugihe cyo kwigaragaza muri 2010\u201311 kandi afasha Al-Ahly gutwara shampiyona yi cyiciro cya mbere cya Misiri muri shampiyona ya karindwi yikurikiranye. Ku ya 9 Nzeri 2012, yaje asimbuye atinze mu gutsinda Al-Ahly yatsinze ENPPI ibitego 2-1 mu gikombe cya Misiri. Muri Mutarama 2014, Da Silva yimukiye muri Zamalek SC. Yahise atangaza ako kanya, atsinda igitego muri buri mukino wa mbere. \nMuri Kamena 2017, yinjiye mu ikipe ya Viyetiname yo muri Vietnam H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh City FC, atsinda ibitego bibiri ku busa. Mu mpera za 2019, Da Sylva yavuye muri Viyetiname yerekeza muri Maleziya, asinyana na Terengganu FC \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYatangiye gukinira ikipe yi gihugu ya Moritaniya mu 2007 atsinda ibitego 45. Yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere igihugu cye na Maroke mu 2008. "}
{"id": "15731", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15731", "title": "Boubacar Bagili", "text": "Boubacar Salam Bagili (wavutse ku ya 7 Ukuboza 1994) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Moritaniya ukinira Nouadhibou ndetse ni kipe y'igihugu ya Myritaniya.\n \"Nkumukino wakinnye 16 Nyakanga 2017.\" \"Amanota ya Mauritania yanditse mbere, amanota yinkingi yerekana amanota nyuma ya buri gitego cya Bagili.\" "}
{"id": "15732", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15732", "title": "Jacob Ba", "text": "Jacob Ba (wavutse 20 Mutarama 1984) yari umukinnyi wu mupira w'amaguru wabigize umwuga ukomoka muri Moritaniya. \nUmwuga.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nBa yavukiye i Saint-Louis, muri Senegalie, yakinnye umupira w'amaguru muri Senegale, Ubufaransa, Espagne, Maroke n'Ububiligi muri Lingu\u00e8re, Martigues, Gaz\u00e9lec Ajaccio, Dijon, Tours, Gueugnon, Terrassa, Kenitra, Ubumwe Royale Namur, Aurillac FCA, Angoul\u00eame CFC, Limoges FC na Cholet. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nBa yari umukinnyi wabigize umwuga wakomokaga muri moritaniya mu 2008, akaba yarahamagawe mu ikipe yigihugu inshuro "}
{"id": "15733", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15733", "title": "El Hadji Ba", "text": "El Hadji Ba (yavutse ku ya 5 Werurwe 1993) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati mu kibuga ikina mu ikipe ya Sipiriyani Apollon Limassol. Yavukiye mu Bufaransa, akinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Moritaniya.\nUmwuga.\nBa yatangiye gukina kuwabigize umwuga we ku ya 24 Gashyantare 2012 mu mukino wa shampiyona hamwe na Guingamp muri uwo mukino yaje kugaragaramo nku wasimbuye. Mbere yo gukinira bwa mbere muri Le Havre, yari afitanye isano no kwerekeza mu ikipe ya Tottenham Hotspur yo mu Bwongereza aho bivugwa ko yari yemeye kwinjira muri iyi kipe. \nYatangiye gukinira Sunderland na Carlisle United mu gikombe cya FA ku ya 5 Mutarama 2014, akomeza gutsinda igitego aho muri uwo mukino yatsinze igitego cya gatatu atsinda 3\u20131. \nKu ya 29 Kamena 2015, Ba yinjiye muri Charlton Athletic mu masezerano y\u2019imyaka itatu, bityo arangiza imyaka ibiri yakoranye na Sunderland. Amasezerano yagiranye niyi kipe yahagaze ku ya 1 Gashyantare 2017. \nKu ya 6 Werurwe 2017, Ba yinjiye mu ikipe ya Noruveje Stab\u00e6k. \nKu ya 23 Kamena 2022, Ba yemeye gukinira mu ikipe ya Apollon Limassol muri shipure. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nBavukiye mu Bufaransa, ababyeyi ba Ba bakomoka muri Senegali na Moritaniya. Yari umufaransa akaba urubyiruko wari mpuzamahanga, akaba yarahagarariye igihugu cye kurwego rwabatarengeje imyaka 18. \nMu 2022, yakiriye ubutumire bwe bwa mbere bwo guhagararira Moritaniya. Yatangiye gukinara Moritaniya mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo guhatanira kuzakina igikombe cya Afurika 3\u20130 muri 2023 aho batsinze Sudani ku ya 4 Kamena 2022. "}
{"id": "15734", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15734", "title": "Tanaka Chivanga", "text": "Tanaka Chivanga (yavutse 24 Nyakanga 1993) ni umukinnyi ukomoka muri Zimbabwe ukina umukino wa cricket. Yatangiye gukinira imikino mpuzamahanga mu ikipe ya Cricket ya Zimbabwe muri Gicurasi 2022. \nUmwuga.\nUkuboza 2020, yatoranijwe gukinira ikipe ya Eagles mu gikombe cya Logan muri 2020\u201321. Yatangiye icyiciro cye cya mbere ku ya 9 Ukuboza 2020, muri Eagles, mu marushanwa yi gikombe cya Logan 2020\u201321. \nYatangiye bwa mbere muri Twenty 20 ku ya 10 Mata 2021, no muri Eagles, mu marushanwa yo mu gihugu cya Zimbabwe muri 2020\u201321. Ku ya 14 Mata 2021, umukino wahuje Eagles na Rock wagiye muri shampiyona y'icyiciro cya mbere, Chivanga yita umuntu w\u2019umukino kubera gukina kwe umukino urangiye. Nyuma y'iminsi itatu, Chivanga yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Zimbabwe kubera imikino yabo yari mpuzamahanga muri Twenty 20 muri T20I yakinnye na Pakisitani. Mbere yo gutorwa mu ikipe y'igihugu, Chivanga yari yanakina n'i ikipe ya Cricket ya Zimbabwe A. Ku ya 26 Mata 2021, Chivanga yashyizwe mu itsinda rigerageza rya Zimbabwe, no mu rukurikirane rwakinnye na Pakisitani. \nMuri Gicurasi 2021, yashyizwe mu ikipe ya Zimbabwe A mu rukurikirane rwabo na Afurika y'Epfo A. Yagiye ku rutonde rwe rwa mbere ku ya 29 Gicurasi 2021, muri Zimbabwe A na Afurika yepfo A. Muri 2021, Chivanga yashyizwe mu itsinda rya Zimbabwe kubera umukino umwe bakinnye na Bangaladeshi. \nMuri Gicurasi 2022, Chivanga yashyizwe mu ikipe ya T20I ya Zimbabwe kubera imikino 5 yakinnye iwayo na Namibiya. Yatangiye umukino wa mbere wa T20I ku ya 17 Gicurasi 2022, muri Zimbabwe na Namibiya. Ukwezi kwakurikiyeho, yahamagawe mu ikipe ya Zimbabwe umunsi umwe mpuzamahanga (ODI) kubera imikino yakinnye na Afuganisitani. Yatangiye gukinira ODI ku ya 4 Kamena 2022, muri Zimbabwe na Afuganisitani. \nKu ya 12 Gashyantare 2023, Chivanga yatangiye gukinira mu igeragezwa muri West Indies. "}
{"id": "15735", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15735", "title": "Gufata neza Ibishanga", "text": "Ifatwa neza Ry'ubutaka Bukikije Ibishanga leta y'urwanda Yafashe iyambere mukurinda isuri nitwarwa Ry'ubutaka bafata ingamba zo gutera imigano kunkengero zibishanga bitandukanye mu gihugu \nAkamaro kimigano\nLeta y'urwanda Yafashe ingamba zo gutera imigano kunkengero z'ibishanga bitandukanye Mumujyii cyangwa Munkengero zu Mujyi Murwego rwo gufata ubutaka no gushaka umusoruro uva mu biti byi imigano.\nReba Ibirushijeho.\ufffc.\nhttps://www.environment.gov.rw/news-detail/minisiteri-yibidukikije-yiyemeje-kongera-ubuso-buteyeho-imigano-mu-rwego-rwo-kurwanya-isuri-no-guteza-imbere-ibikorerwa-mu-rwanda\nhttps://mobile.igihe.com/ibidukikije/article/hatangijwe-umushinga-wo-gutera-imigano-izajya-itunganywa-ikabyazwamo-ibindi\nhttps://www.kigalitoday.com/ibidukikije/ibungabunga/article/menya-byinshi-ku-kamaro-k-imigano-inaribwa"}
{"id": "15736", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15736", "title": "Abdallah Utumatwishima", "text": "Dr. Utumatwishima Jean Nepo ABDALLAH \nMinisitiri w'Urubyiruko n'Ubuhanzi, Repubulika y'u Rwanda\nDr. Utumatwishima Abdallah ni Minisitiri w'Urubyiruko n'Ubuhanzi mu Rwanda. Yahoze akora nk'umushakashatsi mu by'indwara z'ibyorezo mu Kigo cy'Igihugu cy'Ubuzima cya Amerika, aho yakoraga ubushakashatsi ku bintu bishobora gutera indwara z'umutima n'imitsi ku bimukira b'Abanyafurika mu gace ka Washington D.C.. Kuva akigera mu cyiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza, Utumatwishima yagize uruhare runini muri gahunda zo guteza imbere urubyiruko mu Nama y'Igihugu y'Urubyiruko mu Rwanda kandi aracyabikora kugeza ubu.\nReba..\n1.https://www.theafricaceoforum.com/forum-2024/en/intervenant/dr-utumatwishima-jean-nepo-abdallah/\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20230325081238/https://umuseke.rw/2023/03/dr-utumatwishima-yagizwe-minisitiri-wurubyiruko/\nhttps://mobile.igihe.com/amakuru/u-rwanda/article/dr-utumatwishima-yagizwe-minisitiri-w-urubyiruko-menya-abandi-bahawe-inshingano"}
{"id": "15737", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15737", "title": "Gufata neza Amashyamba", "text": "U Rwanda rugizwe n'imisozi ubundi yari iriho amashyamba ariko hari aho usanga imisozi ihanamye. Nta gushidikanya kandi ko u Rwanda ruri mu bihugu bituwe cyane ku isi kandi kikaba ari gito.\nIbyo wamenya ku Gufata neza Amashyamba.\nKurwanya ibikorwa byangiza amashyamba ibituma amashyamba akomeje gusagarirwa n\u2019ibikorwa bya muntu,urugero nko mu mujyi wa Kigali, aho byibura mu Cyumweru kimwe hinjira amakara imifuka irenga ibihumbi 61, ku buryo Umujyi wa Kigali wonyine mu cyumweru wangiza amashyamba ahinze kuri hegitari zirenga 300.Umujyi wa Kigali utiza umurindi itemwa ry\u2019amashyamba, bavuga ko biteye impungenge mu gihe amashyamba yakomeza gutemwa mu gihugu kuko mu bice by\u2019icyaro nabo benshi bicanira inkwi.\"Mu bushakashatsi bwakoze mu mwaka wa 2020 bwagaragaje ko mu Cyumweru kimwe gusa mu Mujyi wa Kigali hinjira imbaho ibihumbi 53,193, imifuka y\u2019amakara ibihumbi 61,241, amasiteri y\u2019inkwi metero cube 321m3, inkingi z\u2019amashanyarazi ibihumbi 20 naho ibiti byo kubakisha ibihumbi birenga bitatu bihinjira mu cyumweru kimwe.Urebye mu mibare ihujwe ubona ko hegitari 485.2 zaba zagiye mu Cyumweru zijyanywe n\u2019amakara n\u2019inkwi n\u2019ibindi bituma ibiti bitemwa.Usesenguye ziriya mbaho zavuye kuri hegitari imwe, amakara ava kuri hegitari 398, inkwi ziva kuri hegitari 4.2, ibiti biva kuri hegitari 3, byose ni mu cyumweru kimwe gusa.\"\nTumenye Ubuso bw'Amashyamba.\nUbuso bw\u2019u Rwanda 30.4% bungana na kilometero kare 8,006% buriho amashyamba, 68% aya mashyamba n\u2019ay\u2019abaturage naho 32% akaba aya leta agizwe n\u2019amashyamaba y\u2019amaterano, imigano n\u2019amashyamba kimeza.I\"mibare ya hegitari 485 zijyenda mu cyumweru kimwe mu makara n\u2019inkwi ukubye Ukwezi, Umwaka, ukabihuza na toni miliyoni 2.7 z\u2019amakara n\u2019inkwi bikoreshwa ku mwaka, ubihuje n\u2019uburyo Abanyarwanda twiyongera ndetse dukoresha amakara n\u2019inkwi bihita bitanga umukoro wo gufata ingamba zo kongera amashyamba no kureba ubundi buryo bwo gukoresha izindi ngufu mu gucana n\u2019imbabura zirondereza ibicanwa. Inganda zikora ibyayi, amashuri, amagereza n\u2019abandi bakoresha inkwi n\u2019amakara mu guteka nabo bakareba uko bareka gutema ibiti.\"\"Ibidukikije iyo bivuyeho natwe ntitwashobora kubaho, turebe amashyamba nk\u2019ikidukikije aho kuyabonamo inyungu mu kuyacana gusa,\u00a0 twongere ibiti n\u2019amashyamba. Fata iwawe uhatere igiti kiribwa imbuto n\u2019ibivangwa n\u2019imyaka. Tubungabunge amashyamba niyo yaba aya leta ntukabone uwangiza amashyamba ngo uceceke, igiti kimwe gifitiye akamaro abantu benshi. Abantu bumve ko tubayeho kubera ibidukikije, urahinga ukeza kubera imvura, uwejeje aratugaburira tukarya kandi tukagira ubuzima bwiza tubona umwuka mwiza duhumeka.\"\nAmashyamba arinda kwangirika kw'ikirere akanakurura imvura \namashyamba atuma imisozi itambara umusa ngo itwarwe n'isuri kandi akanakurura umwuka mwiza duhumeka."}
{"id": "15738", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15738", "title": "Guterwa Ibiti mu bigo by\u2019amashuri", "text": "U Rwanda muri gahunda yo gutera ibiti nibura bisaga miliyoni 36 umwaka washize muri 2022 mu rwego rwo kurushaho kubungabunga ibidukikije, kubera iyo mpamvu Minisiteri y\u2019Ibidukikije yatangije gahunda yo gutera ibiti mu mashuri byiganjemo iby\u2019imbuto ziribwa.\nIbyo wamenya.\nMinisitiri w\u2019Ibidukikije, yavuze ko gahunda yo gutera ibiti u Rwanda rwiyemeje ko igomba gukorwa ahantu hatandukanye harimo no mu mashuri mu rwego rwo gukundisha abakiri bato ibyiza byo kubungabunga ibidukikije.Yavuze ko muri Kigali hagiye guterwa ibiti bisaga ibihumbi 400 kandi no mu mashuri ubukangurambaga burakomeje mu rwego rwo gutera ibiti byiganjemo imbuto ziribwa zizanifashishwa mu kurwanya imirire mibi mu mashuri.Kuri ubu mu Karere ka Nyarugenge hateganyijwe guterwa ibiti 9685, Gasabo bazatera ibiti 7020 mu gihe Kicukiro yitegura gutera ibiti ibihumbi birenga ibihumbi bine.Hatangiye gahunda yo gutera ibiti, hashize iminsi haterwa ibiti mu Mujyi wa Kigali kandi iyogahunda bayigira buri mwaka.Basanze ari ngombwa ko guhera no mu mashuri abana bato bagakura bazi kubungabunga ibidukikije icyo ari cyo, bazi kubitera n\u2019akamaro kabyo.Tariki ya 22 Ugushyingo mu mwaka 2022, iyi gahunda yatangirijwe mu ishuri rya Ecole Belge de Kigali, aho umujyi wa Kigali watangaje ko muri uwo mwaka hagiye guterwa ibisaga ibihumbi 21 mu bigo by\u2019amashuri nk\u2019uko Meya w\u2019Umujyi wa Kigali,yabivuze.\nMubindi wamenya kuri gahunda yogutera Ibiti.\nIbyo biti bifitwe muri gahunda harimo n\u2019ibyo ibigo by\u2019amashuri bizatera. Buriya iyo uhaye umwana ubutumwa abugeza ku wo umutumyeho, aba rero ni intumwa za Leta ku babyeyi babo. Buriya umwana muto uteye igiti uba umuhaye ejo heza hazaza. Igiti ni ubuzima kandi ni ejo hazaza h\u2019u Rwanda biba byiza n\u2019abana bagize uruhare mu kugira Isi nziza.\u201dNubwo Minisiteri y\u2019Ibidukikije yihaye gutera ibiti miliyoni 36 ariko ngo ibimaze kuboneka bigaragaza ko bashobora no gutera miliyoni 40 bigizwemo uruhare na buri munyarwanda.Minisitiri yasabye Abanyarwanda muri rusange kugira uruhare mu gutera ibiti bahereye mu ngo zabo, ku mihanda banyuramo, ku nsengero, mu mirima n\u2019ahandi hatandukanye ndetse n\u2019urubyiruko arwibutsa kugira uruhare mu gutegura ejo hazaza heza.Iyo haterwa ibiti mu mashuri bibafasha kurushaho gutekereza ku kamaro k\u2019ibiti kandi bibafasha no kugira ikirere n\u2019umwuka mwiza uborohereza kwiga neza.Umukozi muri Ambasade y\u2019Ububiligi yavuze ko gahunda yo gutera ibiti u Rwanda rwihaye izafasha mu kurushaho guhangana no kubungabunga ibidikikije kandi ko kubitera mu bigo by\u2019ishuri ari ingirakamaro."}
