{"id": "15740", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15740", "title": "Umugezi wa Mbomou", "text": "Umugezi wa Mbomou cyangwa Bomu (nanone witwa M'bomou mu gifaransa) ni umugezi ugize umupaka uhuza ibihugu cya Repubulika ya Centrafrique (CAR) ndetse na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (DRC). \nMbomou ihuza uruzi rwa Uele kugira ngo ikore uruzi Ubangi. Ubangi, uruzi rwa Kongo, narwo rukora nku mupaka uhuza CAR na DRC."}
{"id": "15741", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15741", "title": "Umugezi wa Mbuji-Mayi", "text": "ni umugei wabona kuri aya merekezo: 6\u00b002\u203200\u2033S 23\u00b046\u203200\u2033E\ufeff / \ufeff6.03333\u00b0S 23.76667\u00b0E\ufeff / -6.03333; 23.76667,Umugezi wa Mbuji-Mayi, cyangwa bawita \"Bushmaie\", \"Bushimaie\", \"Bushimay\" or \"Mbushimaie\", ni umugezi wa muri Repubulika iharanaira Demoarasi ya Congo, ukaba ari umugezi wa Sankuru, uri mu ntara ya lualaba nanone mu ntara ya kapanga bigana muntara ya Kasayi hari n'umugezi wa Mbuji Mayi. is a river in the.\nKuva mu kinyejana cya 17 kugeza ku cya 19, ni uruzi rwari rugizwe nurubibi z'Ubwami bwa Lunda. "}
{"id": "15742", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15742", "title": "Umugezi wa Momboyo", "text": "Umugezi wa Momboyo (mu gifaransa ni umugezi wa Momboyo) ni uruzi ruri muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Ihurira nu mugezi wa Busira ikora uruzi rwa Ruki, uruzi rw'umugezi wa Congo. Momboya nu mugezi wacyo mukuru Luilaka irashobora kugenda kuri kilometero 545 kuva ku isoko yawo.\nKubaho kwabantu.\nImidugudu iherereye ku ruzi itanga umuriro muri Mbandaka n'i biribwa bihari bitandukanye, icy'ingenzi bihari ni myumbati, ibigori n'amavuta y'imikindo. [5] Amazi y'inzuzi yandujwe no gusohoka mu masoko rusange k'uruhande rw'inzuzi. Ibi bivamo indwara ziterwa n'amazi nka diyare mu baturage bahaturinye. [6] Mu 2008 hagaragaye ibibazo by\u2019inguge muri Ingende munsi y\u2019umugezi no muri Boteka, kuri Momboya. Iyi ndwara iterwa ahanini no kurya inyama z'inguge. [7]"}
{"id": "15743", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15743", "title": "Umugezi wa Mongala", "text": "Umugezi wa Mongala ni umugezi uri mu majyaruguru ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo ni uruzi rujya mu mugezi wa Kongo."}
{"id": "15744", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15744", "title": "Umugezi wa Mulobozi", "text": "Umugezi wa Mulobozi ni uruzi ruri mu Ntara ya Tanganyika (ahari Intara ya Katanga) wo mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nItemba iva iburengerazuba, ikanyura mu misozi ya Marungu, mu kiyaga cya Tanganyika mu majyaruguru y'icyambu cya Moba. Amashyamba n'inzira y'inzuzi zayo ziri mu kaga gakomeye ko kurimbuka gaterwa n\u2019isuri ku nkombe. Mollusk Tomichia guillemei ituye muri Mulobozi kandi atuye ku ruzi rw'uzuye ibyondo mu kiyaga cya Tanganyika. "}
{"id": "15745", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15745", "title": "Umugezi wa Ndjili", "text": "Umugezi wa Ndjili ni uruzi rutemba ruva mu majyepfo runyura mu murwa mukuru wa Kinshasa muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, aho ruhurira n'umugezi wa Kongo. Itandukanya uturere twa Tashangu na n'umusizo w'amba. [1] Uruzi ruha izina rya komini Ndjili no ku Kibuga cy\u2019indege mpuzamahanga cya Ndjili. [2]"}
{"id": "15746", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15746", "title": "Umugezi wa Nepoko", "text": "Umugezi wa Nepoko ni uruzi muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. aho Ihuza uruzi rwa Ituri mu mujyi wa Bomili rugakora uruzi rwa Aruwimi."}
{"id": "15747", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15747", "title": "Umugezi wa Ngiri", "text": "Umugezi wa Ngiri (cyangwa uruzi rwa giri) ni uruzi rwu umugezi wa Ubangi rutemba rugana mu majyepfo unyuze mu Karere kaUbangi ya majyepfo ko mu ntara ya eqateri, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo."}
{"id": "15748", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15748", "title": "Umugezi wa Ngwane", "text": "Umugezi wa Ngwane ni uruzi ruri mu majyaruguru ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Itembera igana mu Ntara ya Bondo mu Karere ka Basi Uwele. "}
{"id": "15749", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15749", "title": "Umugezi wa Nzoro", "text": "Umugezi wa Nzoro (cyangwa Nzaro, Obi, Zoro) ni uruzi ruri muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Ni umugezi w'iburyo w'umugezi wa Kibali. Ikoreshwa mu gutanga amashanyarazi kuri Mine ya Kibali.\nAmasomo.\nUmugezi wa Nzoro ukomoka mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bw'igihugu, hafi y\u2019umupaka na Sudani y'Amajyepfo uhuza umupaka na Uganda. Bikurikira inzira yo kugendagenda mubyerekezo rusange byiburengerazuba kugera aho bihurira na Kibali kumanuka uva Durba. [1] Imiterere y\u2019ikirere ya K\u00f6ppen ni karere ka kimberabyombi ka savanna aho itose. [2]"}
{"id": "15750", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15750", "title": "Umugezi wa Rubi", "text": "Umugezi wa Rubi (mu gifaransa ni umugezi wa Rubi) ni uruzi ruri ibumoso rw'umugezi wa Itimbiri, rukora aho Rubi ihurira n'umugezi wa Likati."}
{"id": "15751", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15751", "title": "Uruzi rwa Ruki", "text": "Ruki ni uruzi ruri muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Ni umugezi uri ibumoso w'umugezi wa congo. ushobora kuwubonwa nkaho itemba igana hepfo y'umugezi wa Busira, nawo ushobora kugaragara nkaho igana hepfo y'umugezi wa Tshuapa."}
{"id": "15752", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15752", "title": "Uruzi rwa Rutshuru", "text": "Umugezi wa Rutshuru ni uruzi ruri mu burasirazuba bwa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo ruvoma amazi yarwo mu kiyaga cya Mutanda mu misozi ya Virunga muri Uganda, rutemba rugana mu majyaruguru mu kiyaga cya Rutanzige (ahari ikiyaga cya Edward). Mu burebure bwayo bwose inyura mu ntara ya Rutshuru mu ntara ya Kivu y'Amajyaruguru. [1]\nInkomoko.\ni"}
{"id": "15754", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15754", "title": "Umugezi wa Salonga", "text": "Umugezi wa Salonga ni uruzi ruri muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Ni umugezi ukomokaho uruzi wa Busira.\nAmasomo.\nIzina ryuyu mugezi ryaturutse ku kuvuga nabi nsao'loonga, izina ry'inyoni. Umugezi wa Salonga ugenda werekeza mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba unyuze muri parike y'igihugu ya Salongo [1] no kugera aho uhurira n'umugezi wa Busira. [2] parike yi gihugu ya Salonga ni parike nini y\u2019amashyamba manini muri afurika, ifite ubuso bwa kilometero 33,350. [1] rwinjira muri Busira kilometero 2 hejuru yi mbere ya Lotoko. urashobora kugenda umwaka wose hamwe na toni 50 kugeza Watsi Kengo. [3]"}
{"id": "15755", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15755", "title": "Umugezi wa Sankuru", "text": "Umugezi wa Sankuru ni uruzi runini ruri muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Uburebure bwacyo bugera ku kilometero 1.200 ikora uruzi rurerure rw'umugezi wa Kasai.\nHejuru y\u2019isangano n\u2019umugezi wa Mbuji-Mayi uzwi nka Lubilash. Itemba yerekeza mu majyaruguru, hanyuma iburengerazuba ikanyura mu mijyi mike, nka Lusambo. Hanyuma yinjira mu ruzi rwa Kasai hafi ya Bena-Bendi ku bipimo."}
{"id": "15756", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15756", "title": "Umugezi wa Tinda", "text": "Umugezi wa Tinda ni uruzi ruri mu majyaruguru ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Itembera mu Ntara ya Aketi mu Karere ka Bas Uwele. "}
{"id": "15757", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15757", "title": "Umugezi wa Tshilongo", "text": "Umugezi wa Tshilongo (mu gifaransa umugezi wa Tshilongo) ni uruzi ruri mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nAmateka.\nMuri buvumbuzi bwa Grandslam, aho ingabo z\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye zishinzwe kubungabunga amahoro zagabye igitero muri Leta ya Katanga bitandukanye, ku ya 17 Mutarama 1963, abayoboke ba Burigade ya 99 bageze ku ruzi rwa Tshilongo aho byabasabye guhagarara. Nyuma ya saa sita, Mo\u00efse Tshombe yishyize mu maboko yabo. [6]"}
{"id": "15758", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15758", "title": "Tshimbi River", "text": "Umugezi wa Tshimbi ni uruzi ruherereye mu majyaruguru ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Itembera igana mu Ntara ya Aketi mu Karere ka Bas-Uwele. "}
{"id": "15759", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15759", "title": "Uruzi rwa Tshimbi", "text": "Umugezi wa Tshimbi ni uruzi ruherereye mu majyaruguru y'igihugu cya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Itembera igana mu Ntara ya Aketi mu Karere ka Bas-Uwele. "}
{"id": "15760", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15760", "title": "Umugezi wa Tshuapa", "text": "Umugezi wa Tshuapa cyangwa umugezi Tshwapa ni uruzi riri muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo, akaba uruzi runini ku mugezi wa Busira.\nAmasomo.\nni uruzi ruzamuka mu majyepfo y\u2019icyanya gikomye cya Sankuru, ruzenguruka mu majyaruguru y\u2019iburengerazuba kugera Elinga-Mpango no kugera i Bondo, aho ruva mu burengerazuba y'amajyaruguru rugana Bowende, hejuru y\u2019isangano ryarwo n\u2019umugezi wa Lomela rugakora uruzi rwa Busira. [1] ku kilometero 408, kuva aha kugera k'umugezi wa congo. [2] wa Bowende ni kilometero 29 kuva ihuriro hamwe na kilometero 444 kuva Mbandaka. ku ruzi rwa Kongo. [3]"}
{"id": "15761", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15761", "title": "Ubangi River", "text": "Umugezi wa Ubangi, witwa Oubangui, ni uruzi runini rw'umugezi rwa Kongo mu karere ka afurika yo hagati. Itangirira ku masangano ya Mbomou (bivuze rusohora buri mwaka metero cube 1,350) ni uruzi rwa Uele (bivuze ko isohoka buri mwaka metero 1,550) ikanyura iburengerazuba, igakora umupaka uhuza ibihugu bya Repubulika ya Centrafrique (CAR) na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Repubulika Kongo. Ubangi ugana mu majyepfo ashyira uburengerazuba ikanyura i Bangui, umurwa mukuru wa CAR, nyuma ikanyura mu majyepfo\u00a0ugakora umupaka uhuza Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo na Repubulika ya Kongo. Ubangi yinjira mu ruzi rwa congo i Liranga."}
{"id": "15762", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15762", "title": "Umugezi wa Ubangi", "text": "Umugezi wa Ubangi, witwa Oubangui, ni uruzi runini rw'umugezi rwa Kongo mu karere ka afurika yo hagati. Itangirira ku masangano ya Mbomou (bivuze rusohora buri mwaka metero cube 1,350) ni uruzi rwa Uele (bivuze ko isohoka buri mwaka metero 1,550) ikanyura iburengerazuba, igakora umupaka uhuza ibihugu bya Repubulika ya Centrafrique (CAR) na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Repubulika Kongo. Ubangi ugana mu majyepfo ashyira uburengerazuba ikanyura i Bangui, umurwa mukuru wa CAR, nyuma ikanyura mu majyepfo\u00a0ugakora umupaka uhuza Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo na Repubulika ya Kongo. Ubangi yinjira mu ruzi rwa congo i Liranga."}
{"id": "15763", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15763", "title": "Umugezi wa Uele", "text": "Uele izwi kandi ku mvugo ya U\u00e9l\u00e9, Ou\u00e9l\u00e9, cyangwa uruzi rwa Wele, ni uruzi ruri muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo.\nAmasomo.\nUele ituruka ahitwa Dungu, ikaba ihuriro ry\u2019inzuzi za Dungu na Kibali, zombi zikomoka mu misozi yegereye ikiyaga cya Albert. Uhujije iyi migezi itemba iburengerazuba nko muri kilometero 1,210, kugeza igihe Uele ihurira n'umugezi wa Mbomou i Yakoma. Inzuzi nini ku ruzi rwa Uele ni uruzi rwa Bomokandi (ibumoso) n'umugezi wa Uere (uruhande rw'iburyo)."}
{"id": "15764", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15764", "title": "Umugezi wa Uere", "text": "Umugezi wa Uere, nanone witwa umugezi wa Were, ni uruzi ruri muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Ikomoka hafi y'umupaka na Sudani igatemba iburengerazuba igirango y'injire mu ruzi rwa Uele."}
{"id": "15765", "revid": "12135", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15765", "title": "Umugezi wa Ulindi", "text": "Umugezi wa Ulindi ni uruzi rw'umugezi wa Lualaba muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (DRC). hakaba hariho icyifuzo cyo k'ubaka urugomero rw'amashanyarazi kuri uri ruzi kugira batangize umushinga wo gucukura zahabu."}
{"id": "15766", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15766", "title": "Umugezi wa Wamba", "text": "Umugezi wa Wamba ni uruzi ruri muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (DRC) na Angola. Ikomoka ku butumburuke bwa metero 3,250, ari nk'isangano ry'imigezi mito nko mu Ntara ya Lunda y'amajyaruguru ya Angola, akarere k'imisozi mito n'imigezi idakabije. Muri Angola izwi ku izina rya Uamba.\nItemba yerekeza mu majyaruguru, aho igizwe n'igice cy'umupaka wa Angola / DRC, hanyuma mu burebure bwacyo ikanyura mu Ntara ya Bandundu kugera aho ihurira n'umugezi wa Kwango ku butumburuke bwa metero 1,023. "}
{"id": "15767", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15767", "title": "Umugezi wa Yekokora", "text": "Umugezi wa Yekokora ni uruzi ruri mu ntara ya eqateri, Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Yekokora ni uruzi rw'umugezi wa Lopori. Umugezi wa Lopori ufatanya n'umugezi wa Maringa mu majyepfo, ugakora uruzi rwa Lulonga, uruzi rw'umugezi wa Kongo. Yekokora itembera mu kibaya cya Lopori muri Maringa, uzwi ku izina rya Maringa-Lopori-Wamba, ahantu h\u2019icyanya gikomye bifite akamaro kanini mu bidukikije. "}
{"id": "15768", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15768", "title": "Yoko River", "text": "Umugezi wa Yoko ni uruzi ruri mu majyaruguru ya Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. ikaba Itemba mu Ntara ya Aketi mu Karere ka Basi Uwele. "}
{"id": "15769", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15769", "title": "Urutonde rw'inzuzi za Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo", "text": "Uru ni urutonde rw'inzuzi ziri muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Uru rutonde ni ikibaya cy\u2019amazi, n\u2019imigezi ijyanye na buri zina rinini."}
