{"id": "15775", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15775", "title": "Imigezi Ni Bishanga", "text": "Iyangirika ry'imigezi ni bishanga bitera igabanuka ryamazi Mugihugu. Ubushakashatsi byagarajeko hatigize igikorwa Bimwe mubinyabuzima byacyika burundu mu Rwanda.\nIkibitera..\nIyangirika ry'imigezi ni bishanga Bigaragarako hamwe mubishanga kimwe cya kabiri hahinduwe ahacukurwa gasegereti,guhingwa,Kuvumba nibindi byangiza Ibishanga.\nIbikoze Igishanga..\nUbundi Igishanga kiba kigizwe nurufunzo ugasanga Ari ubuturo bwi Nyamanswa.\nubundi mubusanzwe urufunzo rufasha gufata amazi yavuye imusozi no guhumanura ikirere,bitewe ni myotsi iba iri mukirere.\nIndiri tu Nyamanswa zo mu mazi ni ziguruka ziri mubwoko bw'inyoni. Harimo imisambi.\nHakorwa iki..\nKwirinda gukorera ibikorwa bitajyanye nibikorerwa mubishanga Nko kubaka mubishanga.\nKubaka cyangwa gutura mubishanga.\nIbirushijeho..\nhttps://mobile.igihe.com/ibidukikije/article/imf-yanyuzwe-na-politiki-y-u-rwanda-yo-kurengera-ibidukikije\nhttps://www.rba.co.rw/post/Minisitiri-Mujawamariya-arasaba-abakorera-mu-bishanga-kubibungabunga\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20230326074120/https://umusanzunews.com/iyangirika-ryibishanga-byimigezi-ya-nyababarongo-na-akanyaru-iyangirika-ryibinyabuzima-ni-ibidukikije-mu-rwanda/"}
{"id": "15777", "revid": "11826", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15777", "title": "Ibishanga ni binyabuzima", "text": "Ibishanga by'ikigali Birigutunganywa ngo bishyirwemo ibinyabuzima bitandukanye byiganjemo ibiguruka byari bitangiye kuzimira.\nAkamaro k'ibinyabuzima..\nBuri mwaka kwi Taliki 05 Kanama isi yizihiza umunsi mpuzamahanga wahariwe urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima.\nIbinyabuzima biba mubishanga nsetse nahandi handi bifasha mugutuma ikirere gisa neza nsetse nugufasha isi ikomeza kuba nziza.\nIbinyabuzima biba mubishanga..\nUrusobe rw'ibinyabuzima biba mubishanga Harimo imisambi.\nIbicyeri,Imitubu inyoni zitandukanye.\nhttps://www.kigalitoday.com/ibidukikije/ibungabunga/article/urusobe-rw-ibinyabuzima-rutabungabunzwe-uko-bikwiye-abantu-bashiraho-burundu-impuguke.\nhttps://www.environment.gov.rw/news-detail/abanyarwanda-barakangurirwa-kubungabunga-urusobe-rw-ibinyabuzima"}
{"id": "15778", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15778", "title": "Gutunganya Ibishanga by\u2019Umujyi wa Kigali", "text": "Ubushakashatsi bwakozwe n\u2019umuryango mpuzamahanga urengera ibidukikije, ARCOS, bwerekanye ko ubudahangarwa bw\u2019ibishanga cyane cyane ibyo muri Kigali bwangiritse ku gipimo cya 65%.\nIbyo wamenya ku Ibishanga by'Umujyi wa Kigali.\nIgishushanyombonera cy\u2019imitunganyirize y\u2019ibi bishanga kigaragaza ko Umujyi wa Kigali ufite ubuso bungana na kilometero kare 15.76 (20%) bugizwe n\u2019ibishanga hamwe n\u2019imibande.Ibishanga byo hepfo y\u2019i Gikondo nka Rwandex na Rwampara kugera Nyabugogo, ndetse na Gacuriro, Mulindi na Masaka, bigomba gutunganywa mu gihe cy\u2019imyaka itanu guhereye muri Nyakanga mu mwaka 2021.Ibishanga byitaweho cyane ku ikubitiro ni icya Rwandex, Rwampara, icya Masaka, mubindi bikorwa bizahakorerwa birenze kuhatera ibiti ni uko hazashyiirwa ibiyaga, hazashyirwa serivisi zifasha abantu gukora siporo, abakoze ubukwe baze kuhifotoreza. Hazaterwa indabo hazanwe ibinyabuzima birimo inyoni zari zaracitse i Kigali, ibinyugugu,\u2026mbese nk\u2019uko ubibona uko Nyandungu yakozwe.Byari biteganyijwe ko amafaranga azajya aboneka ibishanga nk\u2019icya UTEXRWA na Nyabugogo na byo bizatunganywa, ariko icy\u2019ingenzi ari ukubanza gukuramo ibikorwa byose birimo, kugira ngo ibyo bishanga bibashe kwakira no kubika amazi yose ava muri Kigali.Inkunga yatanzwe na Banki y\u2019Isi kugira ngo ivugurure Kigali n\u2019imijyi itandatu iwunganira, yaje ari icyiciro cya kabiri cy\u2019umushinga wiswe \u2018Rwanda Urban Development (RUDP)\u2019 uzamara imyaka itanu kuva mu mwaka 2021 kugeza mu mwaka wa 2025.\nUko Umushinga waruhagaze.\nMININFRA mu mwaka wa 2021 Kamena, yatangaje ko Banki y\u2019Isi n\u2019Ikigega cy\u2019Isi gitera inkunga ibidukikije (GEF), ndetse n\u2019ikigega cyitwa Nordic Development Fund (NDF), byatanze inguzanyo y\u2019Amadolari ya Amerika ya miliyoni 170 (ahwanye n\u2019Amafaranga y\u2019u Rwanda miliyari 170).Muri ayo mafaranga hakaba haragombaga kuvamo amadolari ya Amerika miliyoni 50 (ni miliyari 50 z\u2019Amanyarwanda) yagenewe kubaka ibikorwaremezo, gutera ibimera bibungabunga ibishanga by\u2019i Kigali no kuzanamo ibisimba bimwe byahacitse kugeza ubu bikiboneka muri Pariki ya Nyungwe.Uyu mushinga watangiraga mu mwaka wa 2021 muri Nyakanga, MININFRA yavugaga ko miliyoni zigera ku 120 z\u2019Amadolari ya Amerika yasigaye nyuma yo gukuramo 50 yo gutunganya ibishanga by\u2019i Kigali, azakoreshwa mu guteza imbere imijyi ya Huye, Muhanga, Rusizi, Rubavu, Nyagatare na Musanze.Icyiciro cya mbere cya RUDP, Banki y\u2019Isi yari yagihaye amadolari ya Amerika agera kuri miliyoni 100, aho kuva mu mwaka wa 2016 kugera mu mwaka wa 2021 Kigali yubatswemo imihanda yo mu makaritiye ireshya na kilomero 54."}
{"id": "15779", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15779", "title": "Igishanga cy\u2019Akagera", "text": "Igishanga cy\u2019Akagera kiri mu Burasirazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda.\nTumenye Igishanga cy'Akagera.\nIgishanga cy\u2019Akagera kiri mu Burasirazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda. Kigizwe n\u2019urufunzo rwinshi n\u2019ibindi bimera, usanga kibamo amoko menshi y\u2019inyoni atemberamo akanagera muri Pariki y\u2019Akagera aho asurwa n\u2019abakerarugendo. Iki gishanga gifite amazi yisuka mu Kagera akanatanga urugomero rwa Rusumo n\u2019ibindi.\"Mu Rwanda hari amoko atatu y\u2019ibishanga: ibishanga bikomye, ibishanga bikoreshwa habanje gufata imigambi yo kubirengera, n\u2019ibishanga byakoreshwa nta kibazo. Muri byo harimo Kamiranzovu, Rugezi n\u2019Akagera ntibyemerewe guhingwamo.\"\"Ni Ibishanga bitagira ibikorerwamo na mba bikomye aribyo bitatu igishanga cya Rugezi, icya Kamiranzovu n\u2019icy\u2019Akagera,Bavugako atari byo byonyine ariko ibi by\u2019umwihariko ngo bigomba kuyungurura umwuka, amazi n\u2019ingomero bikanatanga urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima bitandukanye biba bikenewe mu buzima bwa buri munsi bw\u2019umuntu.\""}
{"id": "15780", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15780", "title": "Kubungabunga Imigezi,n'Ibishanga", "text": "Urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima runyuranye ruri mu byanya bikomye za pariki, n\u2019ibishanga, rusurwa na ba Mukerarugendo aho bigira uruhare runini mu iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019igihugu.\nIbyo Wamenya.\nUrusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima runyuranye ruri mu byanya bikomye (za pariki, n\u2019ibishanga), ko rusurwa na ba Mukerarugendo aho bigira uruhare runini mu iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019igihugu.Abanyarwanda bashishikarizwa gufatanyiriza hamwe mu kwiteza imbere no gufata neza umutungo kamere w\u2019urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima.U Rwanda rwihaye Icyerekezo cyo mu mwaka 2050, cyo kuba mu bihugu biteye imbere binyuze mu iterambere ritabangamira ibidukikije.Gahunda y\u2019igihugu y\u2019imyaka irindwi yo kwihutisha iterambere. Bityo iyangirika ry\u2019umutungo kamere n\u2019urusobe ry\u2019ibinyabuzima, bigira ingaruka zikomeye kandi zidindiza kugera ku ntego z\u2019iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu igihugu cyiyemeje.Inzira iracyari ndende, igisabwa nuguhindura imyumvire ku ikoreshwa ry\u2019urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima, aho kera byafatwaga nk\u2019ahantu ho kujugunya imyanda.\nKuvugurura Imigezi n'Ibishanga byari byaratereranywe.\nBivuzeko inzira iracyari ndende, igisabwa nuguhindure imyumvire mu buryo hakoreshwa indiri z\u2019urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima, cyane cyane ibishanga, imigezi n\u2019ibiyaga, kera byafatwaga nk\u2019aho kujugunya imyanda.Umuturarwanda agomba kuzirikana isano kamere afitanye n\u2019ibidukikije, bityo akarushaho kubungabunga urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima bibumbatiye amoko atandukanye y\u2019inyamaswa n\u2019ibimera dukesha ibidutunga, imiti twivuza n\u2019umwuka mwiza duhumeka aho bavuze ko uwo mwuka udashobora kubonerwa ikiguzi gikwiye.tariki 05 Kamena buri mwaka, kuri iyi tariki isi yose yizihiza umunsi mpuzamahanga w\u2019ibidukikije,buri wese asabwa gukomeza guhindura imyumvire y\u2019uburyo hakoreshwa neza urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima."}
{"id": "15782", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15782", "title": "Muvumba River", "text": "Muvumba ni uruzi ruherereye mu majyaruguru.y'uburasirazuba bw'u Rwanda no mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bwa Uganda. Ibice byo hejuru byamazi ya Nili. Kuri Birometero 170 z'uburebure, ni rumwe mu nzuzi runini 'mu Rwanda haba mu bunini no mu bukungu. Amzi yuru Ruzi Yifashishwa mu guhinga icyayi mu butumburuke bwo mu majyaruguru yu Rwanda no mu majyepfo y\u2019iburengerazuba bwa Uganda. Inzira yacyo yo hasi itanga amazi kubice byumye bya Nyagatare, byorohereza kuhira imirima yumuceri nibindi bihingwa kimwe no gutanga amazi y'inka muri kano gace kugirango borore inka.\nAmasomo.\nUruzi rufata isoko i Rukomo mu karere ka Gicumbi hafi y'umujyi wa Byumba mu misozi miremire yo mu majyaruguru y'u Rwanda. Mwisoko, yitwa uruzi rwa Mulindi. Uyu mugezi ni ingenzi cyane mubukungu kuko ikibaya cyacyo n\u2019ibibaya by\u2019inzuzi zacyo birumbuka kandi birimo ibihingwa by\u2019icyayi. Rumwe mu ruganda runini rw'icyayi mu Rwanda, Uruganda rwa Mulindi Factory tea ruherereye ku uru ruzi. Mulindi itemba mu majyaruguru kuri 28 km hanyuma yinjira muri Uganda.\nrumaze kwinjira muri Uganda, ruhindura izina ruva mu ruzi rwa Mulindi ruhinduka uruzi rwa Rwabakazi. Rwabakazi ikomeza mu majyaruguru, hanyuma imaze kugera mu mujyi wa Kabale, uruzi ruhindura inzira kandi rutemba mu cyerekezo rusange cyo mu majyepfo y'iburasirazuba yerekeza mu Rwanda. Iki gice cyumugezi wa Muvumba muri Uganda (Umugezi wa Rwabakazi) gifite uburebure bwa km 55. Uruzi rusubira mu Rwanda mu Karere ka Nyagatare rugafata izina Umugezi wa Muvumba. Ihita itemba yerekeza mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bwa kilometero 87 ikisuka mu ruzi rwa Akagera ahitwa Kagitumba, inyabutatu ihuza u Rwanda, Uganda na Tanzaniya. Kuri kilometero 30 yanyuma yinzira zayo, uruzi rugize umupaka uhuza u Rwanda na Uganda.\nUbukungu.\nMuvumba river ifite ikibaya gihingwa cyane. Inzira yo hejuru yinzuzi mu misozi yintara yamajyaruguru mu Rwanda no mu Karere ka Kabale muri Uganda ifite ibibaya bigufi bikoreshwa cyane nko guhinga icyayi. Uruzi rutanga amazi kumigezi itabarika ifasha kuvomera imirima. Kubera iyo mpamvu, uruzi rwangiritse igice kinini ahantu henshi kugirango igenzure amazi kandi irebe ko haboneka amazi no mugihe cyizuba. Mu bice bidahingwa byicyayi, ikibaya gikoreshwa mubuhinzi butunze Benci.\nIyo uruzi rwongeye kwinjira mu Rwanda, rutemba mu turere tw\u2019imisozi ahantu hahanamye kandi hahanamye cyane. Inzira zose z'ikibaya cy'umugezi wa Muvumba zikunda kwibasirwa n'umwuzure kubera imvura nyinshi igwa mu misozi yo mu majyaruguru yayo. Ibi bizwiho kuzana imyuzure ikabije ndetse no mu bice byo hepfo yuruzi ubusanzwe bitagira imvura nyinshi. Iyi myuzure ishobora guhagarika inzira yo hepfo yuruzi, igafunga imihanda nikiraro mugihe nayo yangiza cyane ibihingwa.\nIbinyabuzima ni Bimera.\nHanze y'ubuhinzi bunini, imigezi yo hepfo ishyigikira ishyamba rinini. Iri shyamba rifunganye rirashobora kuba ryinshi kandi ntirishobora kwambuka, kandi rikubiyemo ubwoko bwinshi bwibiti bya savanna. Ubwoko bwinshi bwinyoni buboneka muri kariya gace, ubwinshi muri bwo ni heron na egrets. Amatungo magufi y\u2019inyamaswa n\u2019ibikururukanda Inyamaswa nini zo mu mazi nka Invubu, ningona za Nili zishobora kandi kuboneka mubice byegeranye n\u2019isangano ry'umugezi munini wa Akagera. Izi nyamaswa zizwiho kugenda zerekeza hejuru cyane cyane mugihe cyumwuzure utera guhitana abaturage baho batabizi batamenyereye aya matungo kuba kure cyane.\nReba.\nInkomoko\nhttp://en.igihe.com/IMG/pdf/Hydrological_Bulletin_No_06.pdf"}
{"id": "15783", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15783", "title": "Pariki ya Rusizi", "text": "Pariki y'igihugu Ya Rusizi ni pariki y'igihugu cyu Burundi, iruhande rw'umugezi wa Rusizi. Ni 15\u00a0km mu majyaruguru yu mujyi wa Bujumbura Umugezi ubamo Invubu na sitatungas. Gustave, ingona ya Nili, bivugwa ko yahitanye abantu 300."}
{"id": "15784", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15784", "title": "Inyanja itukura", "text": "Muri Bibiliya havugwa inkoni Mose yakubise mu Nyanja Itukura igatandukana Abisiraheli bakayambuka.\nImiterere.\nBisaba amasaha atandatu n\u2019iminota 20 kuva i Kigali kugera mu murwa mukuru wa Misiri ari wo Cairo. Iyo ugeze muri uyu mujyi ufata indege ikugeza mu Mujyi wa Sharm El Sheikh ari na ho haherereye Inyanja Itukura.\nUmuntu umenyereye ubuzima bwa Kigali abanza kugorwa n\u2019ubushyuhe bwo muri aka gace cyane ko bigoye kubona umuntu wambaye yifubitse.\nIkintu cya mbere gitangaje ubona ukigera muri uyu murwa ni ibiti bitoshye ariko bavuga ko bisaba kubyitaho cyane ukabivomerera kuko utabikoze gutyo bitaramba."}
{"id": "15785", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15785", "title": "Norv\u00e8ge ya Kigali", "text": "Norv\u00e8ge iherereye mu Mudugudu wa Karama, Akagari ka Nyabugogo, Umurenge wa Kigali Akarere ka Nyarugenge. Aka gace kiswe Norv\u00e8ge kubera ukuntu kubatswemo inzu zigendanye n\u2019igihe n\u2019uburyo gakomeje kugezwamo ibikorwa bitandukanye by\u2019iterambere.\nUbusanzwe Norv\u00e8ge ni igihugu kiri ku Mugabane w\u2019u Burayi mu Majyaruguru y\u2019Isi, kizwiho kuba abaturage bacyo ari bamwe mu babayeho neza.\nImiterere.\nIyo utembereye muri aka gace kari mu Mudugudu wa Gakoni mu Kagari ka Nyabugogo mu Murenge wa Kigali uhana imbibi n\u2019uwa Kimisagara n\u2019uwa Mageragere kabatijwe akabyiniro ka Norv\u00e8ge, utungurwa n\u2019ibikorwa remezo bimaze kukagezwamo.\nHari irerero rifasha mu burezi bw\u2019abana bafite guhera ku myaka itatu kugeza kuri itanu. Hubatswe inzu zigezweho ziherutse gutahwa n\u2019Umukuru w\u2019Igihugu ziri mu byiciro bitandukanye ku buryo umuturage ashobora kugura ku giciro kimunogeye.\nAbantu benshi bahazi neza bahamya ko ikibanza cyaho gisaba uwifite kuko gihenze. Ni mu gihe ibiciro fatizo by\u2019ubutaka mu Rwanda 2021, byateguwe n\u2019Urugaga rw\u2019Abagenagaciro ku mutungo utimukanwa mu Rwanda rugena ibiciro by\u2019ibibanza hagendewe ku bintu bitandukanye.\nRuvuga ko ikibanza cyo guturaho amafaranga make ashoboka ari 3,849 kuri metero kare mu Mudugudu wa Karama ho mu Kagari ka Nyabugogo, Umurenge wa Kigali."}
{"id": "15786", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15786", "title": "Udusozi twa nyarubuye", "text": "Ubuyobozi bw\u2019Akarere ka Kirehe butangaza ko udusozi twa Nyarubuye dutatwse namabuye manini turi guteganyirizwa gushyirwa mu bice nyaburanga bizajya bisurwa na ba mukerarugendo.\nAkarere ka Kirehe gafite umwihariko w\u2019ubwiza butatse imisozi iriho amabuye manini y\u2019ibitaro, igaragara cyane mu bice by\u2019Imirenge ya Kigina, mpanga, Nyarabuye na Nasho. akarere ka kirehe gahana imbibi nigihugu cya tanzania kakaba gatatswe nibyiza byishi "}
{"id": "15787", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15787", "title": "Ibigabiro by\u2019umwami", "text": "Ahirengeye mu Murenge wa Gatsibo, aho bita Gatsibo k\u2019imitoma, hari ahahoze ibivumu byari bigize urugo umwami yabagamo. Uhasanga kandi inzu ishaje imeze nk\u2019iyubatswe mu gihe cy\u2019ubukoloni. Iyo uhahagaze kandi ubasha kubona ibice byinshi by\u2019imisozi. Iyo uhageze ubona ko koko hari amateka."}
{"id": "15788", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15788", "title": "Ibisigisigi by\u2019ishyamba i Ndego", "text": "Ndego ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Kayonza, mu Ntara y\u2019Iburasirazuba.\nImiterere.\nAka gace kahoze ari amashyamba, kadatuwe, ndetse mbere ya 1994, hahoze ari Parike y\u2019Akagera.\nHari ibiyaga bine, ari byo: Nasho, Rwakibare, Ihema na Kagese. N\u2019ubundi hegereye Parike y\u2019Akagera, ndetse hagahana imbibi n\u2019Akarere ka Kirehe, hari n\u2019agace k\u2019Ikiyaga cya Rwakibare kegereye Umugezi w\u2019Akagera, n\u2019igihugu cya Tanzania. Ibi bituma abatuye Ndego bagirana ubuhahirane n\u2019Abanyambo bo muri iki gihugu gituranyi cya Tanzania.\nUmurenge wa Ndego utuwe n\u2019abaturage basaga ibihumbi 20, abenshi batunzwe n\u2019ubuhinzi. Usibye ahubatse amazu n\u2019ibindi bikorwa remezo, ahari ibiyaga na hake hari imisozi ihanamye, ubuyobozi buvuga ko ahasigaye hakorerwa ubuhinzi n\u2019ubworozi.\nGusa n\u2019ubwo ibiti bya kimeza cyangwa by\u2019ishyamba byatemwe bigacanwa uko abaturage bagiye biyongera, byinshi bigatwikwamo amakara, uhageze ntuhabura ibimenyetso by\u2019uko aha hantu hahoze ari Parike y\u2019Akagera."}
{"id": "15789", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15789", "title": "Gutera ibiti", "text": "Igiti ni ijambo risanzwe rivuga, nta bisobanuro byemewe bizwi ku isi hose byerekana icyo igiti aricyo, haba mu bimera cyangwa mu rurimi rusanzwe., igiti ni igihingwa icyo aricyo cyose gifite uburyo rusange bwurwego rurerure, cyangwa igiti, gifasha amababi ya fotosintetike cyangwa amashami intera iri hejuru yubutaka. Ibiti na byo bisobanurwa n'uburebure, hamwe n'ibiti bito kuva kuri 0,5 kugeza kuri 10 (1,6 kugeza 32.8 ft) byitwa ibihuru, bityo uburebure buke bw'igiti busobanurwa neza. Ibimera binini nka papayi n'ibitoki ni ibiti muri ubu buryo bwagutse.\nIncamake.\nIngeso yo gukura kw'ibiti ni ihindagurika ry'ihindagurikire riboneka mu matsinda atandukanye y'ibimera: mu gukura mu buremure, ibiti bishobora guhangana neza n'izuba. Ibiti bikunda kuba birebire kandi biramba, bimwe bigera ku myaka ibihumbi. Ibiti byinshi biri mu binyabuzima bya kera cyane ubu. Ibiti byahindura imiterere nkibiti binini bigizwe ningirabuzimafatizo zihariye zongerera imbaraga imiterere nigihe kirekire, bigatuma zishobora gukura muremure kuruta ibindi bimera byinshi no gukwirakwiza amababi yabyo. Bitandukanye ni ibihuru, bifite imiterere isa yo gukura, mubisanzwe bikura binini kandi bifite igiti kimwe nyamukuru; irashobora kugabanuka mubunini mugihe gikabije cyibidukikije nko kumusozi nuduce twa subarctique. Imiterere yibiti yagiye ihindagurika mu byiciro bidafitanye isano n\u2019ibimera hasubijwe ibibazo bisa n\u2019ibidukikije, bituma iba urugero rwiza rw\u2019ubwihindurize. Hafi yubwoko 60.000-100.000, umubare wibiti kwisi yose ushobora kuba makumyabiri na gatanu kwijana ryibinyabuzima byose bizima.Umubare munini muribi ukura mu turere dushyuha; henshi muri utwo turere tutarasuzumwa neza n\u2019ibimera, bigatuma ibiti bitandukanye kandi bitamenyekana neza.\nAkamaro k'igiti.\nIbiti bigira akamaro kenshi: hari ibyera imbuto: nk\u2019amacunga, amapapayi, indimu, amatunda, marakuja, za avoka, imyembe n\u2019ibindi byinshi. Hari n\u2019ibyubakishwa amazu n'amateme hakaba n\u2019ibisaturwamo imbaho, zikabazwamo ibikoresho by\u2019amoko menshi, hakaba n\u2019ibicanwa. Hari n'ibiti bitanga igicucu kuburyo abagenzi bashobora kwikinga izuba baruhuka bamara gutora akabaraga bagakomeza urugendo.\nMu Rwanda.\nLeta y'u Rwanda isaba abaturage abatuye mu mijyi kwitabira gahunda yo gutera ibiti by\u2019imbuto mu rwego rwo kongera imirire myiza yo mu ngo. kandi ikogera gushishikariza abaturage Gahunda igira iti\"Ntutema kimwe uge Utera bibiri\"."}
{"id": "15790", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15790", "title": "Imiterere y\u2019urwego rw\u2019ibidukikije", "text": "Mu Rwanda, kimwe n\u2019ahandi hose ibidukikije bigizwe n\u2019ibice bibiri, ibidukikije kamere n\u2019ibidukikije biva ku bikorwa bya muntu kandi bigengwa na politike, inzego z\u2019ubuyobozi n\u2019amategeko mu mikorere, mu kurindwa no mu micungire yabyo. Ibidukikije kamere bigizwe n\u2019ubutaka n\u2019ikuzimu, umutungo w\u2019amazi, umwuka, urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima, ubwiza nyaburanga, ahantu nyaburanga n\u2019inyubako. Ibidukikije biva ku bikorwa bya muntu birebana n\u2019imitunganyirize y\u2019imijyi n\u2019icyaro n\u2019imibereho y\u2019abantu.\nIbidukikije kamere.\nIbidukikije karemano by\u2019u Rwanda birangwa n\u2019aho u Rwanda ruherereye mu burasira zuba bw\u2019Afurika yo hagati ya 1\u00b0 04\u2019 na 2\u00b0 51\u2019 (mu majyepfo ya koma y\u2019isi) na 28\u00b0 45\u2019 na 31\u00b0 15\u2019 (Uburasirazuba). Ibintu by\u2019ingenzi bigize ibidukikije keremano by\u2019u Rwanda biri ku buso bungana na km\u00b2 26338 kandi birangwa ahanini n\u2019ubutumburuke bw\u2019imisozi, ubutaka, imiterere y\u2019ikirere, ibimera n\u2019amazi."}
{"id": "15791", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15791", "title": "Imiterere y\u2019imisozi", "text": "Imiterere y\u2019imisozi yo mu Rwanda iranyuraranye. Uvuye i burasirazuba ugana iburengerazuba ubutumburuke buri hagati ya m 1000 na 4500. Iburasirazuba burangwa n\u2019imisozi migufi, mu gihugu hagati n\u2019imisozi iringaniye n\u2019aho mu burengerazuba n\u2019imisozi miremire.\nIsunzu rya Kongo Nili.\nNi uruhererekane rw\u2019imisozi ifite ubutumburuke buri hagati ya m 2500 na 3000. Iryo sunzu ricuramiye ikiyaga cya Kivu, rigabanya amazi y\u2019u Rwanda mu bice bibiri: amazi yisuka mu kibaya cy\u2019uruzi rwa Kongo mu burengerazuba n\u2019amazi yisuka mu kibaya cya Nili mu burasirazuba. Isunzu rya Kongo Nili, mu majyaruguru hashyira i burengerazuba, higanje uruhererekane rw\u2019imisozi y\u2019ibirunga bitanu harimo ikirunga kibisumba byose aricyo Karisimbi gifite ubutumburuke bungana na m 4507."}
{"id": "15792", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15792", "title": "Imiterere y\u2019ibihe n\u2019ikirere", "text": "U Rwanda rurangwa n\u2019ibihe by\u2019igihugu biri munsi ya koma y\u2019isi bidakora ku nyanja ariko imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe byo mu Rwanda bigengwa n\u2019ubutuburuke bw\u2019imisozi. Ubushyuhe ntabwo buhindagurika cyane. Mu mwaka, ubushyuhe buba buri hagati ya 16\u00b0C na 17\u00b0C mu bice by\u2019imisozi miremire, hagati ya 18\u00b0C na 21\u00b0 C mu bitwa byo mu gihugu hagati na 20\u00b0C kugeza kuri 24\u00b0C mu bice by\u2019imisozi migufi y\u2019iburasirazuba n\u2019iy\u2019iburengerazuba. Imvura igwa mu mwaka iri hagati ya mm 700 na mm 1400 mu duce tw\u2019imisozi migufi yo mu burasirazuba n\u2019iburengerazuba, no hagati ya mm 1200 na mm 1400 mu duce tw\u2019ibitwa byo mu gihugu hagati no hagati ya mm 1400 na mm 2000 mu duce tw\u2019imisozi miremire. Imvura igwa igira uruhare runini ku mazi yo mu migezi, ibiyaga n\u2019ibishanga. Imyuzure mu gihe cy\u2019itumba riba mu kwezi kwa Werurwe rikagera muri Gicurasi naho ikamuka rikaba mu gihe cy\u2019impeshyi iba kuva mu kwezi kwa Kamena kugera muri Nzeri. U Rwanda rugenda ruhura n\u2019amapfa maremare kandi agenda agaruka mu duce tw\u2019iburasirazuba n\u2019amajyepfo y\u2019iburasirazuba. Iyo mihindagurikire ifitanye isano n\u2019iyo dusanga mu rwego mpuzamahanga itewe n\u2019ishyuha rusange ry\u2019umubumbe w\u2019isi.\nImihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere ni iki?\nImihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere irebana n\u2019impinduka muri rusange y\u2019ibigize ikirere n\u2019ibihe. Irangwa n\u2019impinduka y\u2019ibigize ikirere kimenyerewe mu buryo n\u2019inshuro bidasanzwe biba mu gihe kirekire, akenshi hagati y\u2019imyaka 30 na 35. Ibigize ikirere bihinduka bikubiyemo uko imvura igwa, ubushyuhe, imiyaga, ububobere, urubura n\u2019ibihe by\u2019ihinga. Mu magambo yoroshye, imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere isobanura uguhinduka kw\u2019igihe kirekire kw\u2019imiterere y\u2019ibihe n\u2019ikirere."}
{"id": "15793", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15793", "title": "Imigezi y\u2019u Rwanda", "text": "U Rwanda rufite imigezi myishi igabanyijemo ibice bibiri. Hari imigezi yisuka mu kibaya cy\u2019uruzi rwa Congo n\u2019indi yisuka mu kibaya cy\u2019uruzi rwa Nili. Imigezi yo mu kibaya cy\u2019uruzi rwa Congo ni migufi irimo amazi make kandi yisuka mu kiyaga cya Kivu. Amazi y\u2019umugezi wa Rusizi aturuka mu Kiyaga cya Kivu. Amazi menshi ajya mu kiyaga cya Kivu aturuka mu mugezi wa Ruhwa ugize umupaka w\u2019u Rwanda n\u2019u Burundi mu gice cy\u2019iburengerazuba naho mu gice cy\u2019amajyaruguru amazi ajya mu kiyaga cya Kivu ava mu mugezi wa Sebeya mu Ntara ya Gisenyi. Ikibaya cy\u2019uruzi rwa Nili nicyo gifite igice kinini cy\u2019amazi yo mu Rwanda. Imigezi minini yo mu Rwanda ariyo Nyabarongo n\u2019Akanyaru ndetse n\u2019indi myinshi iyisukamo niyo igize uruzi rw\u2019Akagera iturutse mu kiyaga cya Rweru. Iyo migezi ihererekanya amazi hagati yayo n\u2019ibishanga binini n\u2019ibiyaga bitari birebire ujya ikuzimu.\n mu Rwanda\u00a0 N\u00b048/2018 ryo ku wa 13/08/2018 rivuga ko mu bikorwa bibujijwe harimo kumena imyanda yanduza n'itanduza, itemba cyangwa gazi ihumanya mu mugezi, mu ruzi, mu gishanga, mu kidendezi, mu kiyaga no mu nkengero zabyo; kwangiza ubwiza bw\u2019amazi yaba ay\u2019imusozi cyangwa ay\u2019ikuzimu. Ubu bugenzuzi bukaba bwatangiriye mu Turere dukora ku kiyaga cya Kivu aritwo Rubavu,Rusizi,Nyamasheke,Karongi na Rutsiro. Mu rwego rwo ku kirengera birinda icyatuma cyangirika nuko hari metero."}
{"id": "15794", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15794", "title": "Amashyamba", "text": "U Rwanda rufite indiri y\u2019urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima zinyuranye: indiri z\u2019urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima kamere zigizwe n\u2019amashyamba y\u2019inzitane yo mu misozi miremire, amashyamba mato yo mu duhanga tw\u2019imisozi,umukenke, ahantu hahehereye n\u2019amashyamaba y\u2019matereno. Ahantu hakomye ho mu Rwanda hagizwe n\u2019Ishyamaba rya Cyimeza rya Nyungwe, Pariki Nasiyonali y\u2019Akagera, Pariki Nasiyonali y\u2019Ibirunga na Pariki Nasiyonali y\u2019Akagera n\u2019aho hantu harinzwe ho mu Rwanda hagizwe n\u2019ishyamba rya cyimeza rya Mukura, n\u2019amashyamba ya Cyamudongo, Busaga, Umukenke wo mu burasirazuba. Ishyamba rya cyimeza rya Gishwati ryo riri hafi kuzimangatana.\nAmashyamba ni kimwe mu mutungo kamere u Rwanda rufite, ariko by\u2019umwihariko kuba rugifite amashyamba ya kimeza bikaba akarusho kuko bifasha mu kubungabunga urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima. Amashyamba ya kimeza ari mu igihugu cy'u Rwanda harimo: Nyungwe, Kibirizi, Gishwati, Mukura ndi menshi kuko amashyamba ya kimeza agera 107 hose mu gihugu. "}
{"id": "15795", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15795", "title": "Parki Nationali ya Nyungwe.", "text": "Parki nkuru ya Nyungwe ni ishyamba cyimeza riri mu majyepfo y\u2019iburasirazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda kandi riri hejuru y\u2019inkombe z\u2019ikiyaga cya Kivu. Iryo shyamba rifatanye na Pariki Nasiyonali ya Kibira yo mu gihugu cy\u2019u Burundi kandi rishobora kuba ari ryo shyamba ry\u2019inzitane ryo mu misozi minini kandi miremire muri Afurika yose; ryari rifite ubuso bwa km\u00b2 924 mu mwaka w\u2019i 2000. Iryo shyamba riri mu misozi ifite m 1600 na m 2950 kandi ririmo amoko menshi y\u2019ibimera abana n\u2019amoko anyuranye y\u2019inyamaswa; agizwe ahanini n\u2019inyoni n\u2019ingunge. Ishyamba cyimeza rya Nyungwe ni kimwe mu bigega by\u2019amazi y\u2019u Rwanda: ritanga hafi 60% by\u2019amazi y\u2019u Rwanda. Ikindi kandi isoko ry\u2019uruzi rwa Nili iri muri iryo shyamba."}
{"id": "15796", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15796", "title": "Amashyamba y\u2019amatereno.", "text": "Amashyamba y\u2019amaterano yatewe hagati ya 1920 na 1948 kandi agizwe ahanini n\u2019intusi ariko hari ubundi bwoko bw\u2019ibiti nka Gereveriya, Cedrella, Callianda bugenda bukwirakwizwa. ubuzima bwo kuri iyi si\u00a0 dutuyeho, ribonekamo ibimera bitandukanye, Ubuso bw\u2019u Rwanda 30.4% bungana na kilometero kare 8,006% buriho amashyamba, 68% by\u2019aya mashyamba n\u2019ay\u2019abaturage naho 32% akaba aya leta agizwe n\u2019amashyamaba y\u2019amaterano, imigano n\u2019amashyamba kimeza. Ikigo cy\u2019Igihugu gishinzwe amashyamba (RFA), gitangaza ko mu mwaka wa 2022/2023 bateganya gutera ubuso burenga hegitari 50,000, buriho ibiti bivangwa n\u2019imyaka."}
{"id": "15797", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15797", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Nyirakigugu", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Nyirakigugu ni ikiyaga gito cyo mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba y'u Rwanda. Kiri mu Murenge wa Jenda, mu Akarere ka Nyabihu. Kiri hafi y'umuhanda wa kaburimbo uva i Musanze ujya i Rubavu.\nAmazi y'iki kiyaga yagiye yiyongera. Yageze mu nzu z'abaturage bamwe. Abo baturage basabye kwimurwa.\nAmateka.\nAbaturiye ikiyaga bavuga ko cyavutse mu mwaka wa 1963. Cyatangiye ari amazi make. Abantu bamwe bagifataga nk'ahantu nyaburanga.\nMbere, amazi y'iki kiyaga yajyaga mu kiyaga cya Karago. Ahagana mu mwaka wa 2010, inzira y'amazi yanyuraga munsi y'umuhanda yarafunzwe. Kuva icyo gihe, amazi yatangiye kwiyongera.\nIngaruka ku baturage.\nMu mwaka wa 2013, amazi yari amaze kugera ku nzu zimwe. Abaturage batinyaga ko yangiza inzu n'umuhanda. Umuyobozi w'Akarere ka Nyabihu, Twahirwa Abdoulatif, yavuze ko aho hantu hadakwiye guturwa. Yasabye abaturage kwimuka.\nMu mwaka wa 2022, amazi yinjiraga mu nzu z'abaturage. Inzu zimwe zatangiye gusenyuka. Abaturage basabye Leta kubimura. Umuyobozi w'Akarere, Mukandayisenga Antoinette, yavuze ko ubuyobozi bushaka inzira yo gusohora amazi buhoro buhoro. Yasabye abaturage gutekereza ku kwimuka."}
{"id": "15798", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15798", "title": "Ikiyaga cya Bisoke", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Bisoke ni ikiyaga kiri ku gasongero k'Ikirunga cya Bisoke, mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda. Ni ikiyaga kiri mu mwobo w'ikirunga (\"crater lake\").\nIkiyaga cya Bisoke ni hamwe mu hantu nyaburanga mu Rwanda. Ba mukerarugendo benshi barakizamuka kugira ngo bakirebe.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga cya Bisoke kiri ku gasongero k'Ikirunga cya Bisoke. Kiri ku butumburuke bwa m 3 711.\nIkirere cyo kuri iki kirunga gihinduka vuba. Rimwe haba ibihu, ubundi hakaba harakeye. Imvura na yo ishobora kugwa umwanya uwo ari wo wose.\nUbukerarugendo.\nBa mukerarugendo benshi basura ikiyaga kubera ubwiza bwacyo. Urugendo rutangirira i Kinigi, ku biro bya RDB. Abazamuka bagomba kwambara imyenda irinda imbeho n'inkweto zitanyerera. Abatazifite bashobora kuzikodesha i Kinigi."}
{"id": "15799", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15799", "title": "Inyoni ya Kiwi", "text": "Kiwi ni inyoni abantu benshi bazi kuko bayibona ku mufuniko w\u2019 umuti w\u2019 umukara usigwa ku nkweto (siraje). Iyi nyoni ikunda kuboneka mu gihugu cya Nouvelle Zelande ku mugabane wa Oseyaniya.\nimiterere.\nNi ubwoko bw\u2019 inyoni idakunze kuboneka ahantu henshi ku Isi. Iyi nyoni yakoreshejwe mu kirago cy\u2019 igihugu cya Novelle Zelande mu kinyejana cya 19, ni inyamabere ikaba n\u2019 imyamahoro.\nUbu bwitonzi bw\u2019 iyi nyoni no kuba idakunda imirwano bituma inyamaswa z\u2019 indyanyama ziyisagarira cyane zikayikoramo amafunguro.\nKiwi 27 zipfa buri cyumweru zishwe n\u2019 inyamaswa z\u2019 indyanyama. Izi nyoni ziri mu nyamaswa zigeraniwe cyane ku Isi kuko ubusanzwe zikunda kuba mu mashyamba none amashyaka abaka agenda akendera kubera ibikorwa bya muntu.\nIbindi.\nIkindi inyoni zigira amababa maremare ayifasha kuguruka, mu gihe Kiwi ifite amababa ajya kumbera nk\u2019 ubwoya.\nKiwi kimwe n\u2019 izindi nyamaswa z\u2019 inyamaberere mu imbere mu magufa yazo habamo ibindi bintu biremera bityo bigatuma Kiwi igira ibiro byinshi kuburyo itabasha kwiterura."}
{"id": "15800", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15800", "title": "Ikoranabuhanga rya Biomass", "text": "Nyuma yamababi yaguye, amashami yapfuye, amashami yibiti hamwe nibyatsi byajanjaguwe na straw pulverizer, bishyirwa mumashini ya pellet pellet, ishobora guhinduka lisansi nziza mugihe kitarenze umunota umwe.\nImiterere.\nIgice c'ibyatsi byo mu murima gishobora gusubizwa mu murima nyuma yo guhonyorwa, ariko imyanda myinshi y\u2019ubuhinzi n\u2019amashyamba ijugunywa mu mwobo no mu nzuzi.Kandi iyi myanda irashobora guhinduka ubutunzi binyuze muburyo bwo kuvura, kumenya umutungo wongeye gukoreshwa.\nMuri biomass ya Kingoro yashinze ingufu za peteroli, imashini ebyiri mumahugurwa zikora ku muvuduko mwinshi.Ibiti by'ibiti bitwarwa n'ikamyo bishyirwa mu mashini ya pellet pellet, ihinduka amavuta menshi cyane mu gihe kitarenze umunota.Amavuta akomeye ya biomass afite ibiranga ingano nto, ubwinshi bwinshi nagaciro keza cyane.Uhereye ku ngaruka zo gutwika, toni 1,4 ya lisansi ikomeye ya biomass ihwanye na toni 1 yamakara asanzwe.\nIbikomoka kuri biyomasi birashobora gukoreshwa mu gutwika karubone nkeya na sulferi nkeya mu gutwika inganda n\u2019abaturage.Ikoreshwa cyane cyane muri pariki y'imboga, amazu y'ingurube n'amasoko y'inkoko, ibihumyo bikura ibihumyo, uturere tw\u2019inganda, n'imidugudu n'imigi yo gushyushya.Irashobora kuzigama ingufu no kugabanya ibyuka bihumanya kandi ibiciro ni bike.Umusaruro wacyo Igiciro ni 60% gusa ya gaze gasanzwe, kandi imyuka ya gaze karuboni na dioxyde de sulfure nyuma yo gutwikwa yegereye zeru."}
{"id": "15801", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15801", "title": "Ubusitani bwa Primature", "text": "Ubusitani bwa Primature buherereye mu Murenge wa Kimihurura, hagati ya Rwanda Revenue Authority, MINAFFET, Primature na MINADEF. Ni ahantu hagari hajya habera ibirori bitandukanye nk\u2019ibitaramo, ubukwe n\u2019ibindi."}
{"id": "15802", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15802", "title": "Umusozi wa Gisenyi", "text": "Umujyi wa Gisenyi, uri mu Karere ka Rubavu iri mu mijyi itandatu yatoranyijwe izunganira Kigali. izwiho kuba umujyi wo kwidagaduriramo, ndetse ukanashyuha. Uretse kuba umujyi w\u2019ubucuruzi, ufite n\u2019ibice nyaburanga bifasha abantu kwishimisha no kuruhuka. Umusozi wa Rubavu(Gisenyi) ni umusozi w\u2019amateka uhagararaho ukareba umujyi wa Rubavu na Goma nk\u2019uyicayemo.\nImiterere.\nUmusozi wa Gisenyi, ubu umaze kugirwa umusozi w\u2019ubukerarugendo ku bufatanye na Koperative Inshongore y\u2019Inkeragutabara hamwe n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019igihugu gishinzwe kubungabunga ibidukikije (REMA) n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019igihugu cyimakaza iterambere (RDB).\nUmusozi wa Gisenyi ubumbatiye amateka menshi, arimo ashingiye ku buvumo (abacunga uyu musozi bavuga ko batarahashyira umuhanda ku buryo abantu bahagera) ngo bwifashishijwe n\u2019Umujenerali w\u2019Umudage, ubwo barwana n\u2019Ababiligi bari muri DR Congo mu ntambara ya mbere y\u2019Isi, ndetse hagwa abasirikare benshi cyane.\nAha ngo Abadage barahakunda kuko hafite aho hahuriye n\u2019amateka yabo nk\u2019uko tubikesha Ndagijimana Innocent, umwe mu bagize Koperative Inshongore.\nUyu musozi kandi wakunze kujya wifashishwa n\u2019ingabo z\u2019u Rwanda.\nUyu musozi uzengurutswe n\u2019agahanda k\u2019ibilometero 11 ushobora kugendamo n\u2019amaguru gusa, ukora Siporo cyangwa uri gutembera.\nIyo uri hejuru uba ushobora kureba neza Umujyi wa Gisenyi, ikiyaga cya Kivu n\u2019Umujyi wa Goma muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Congo munsi yawe."}
{"id": "15816", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15816", "title": "Vanessa Lau", "text": "Vanessa Lau (wavutse 29/04/1994) ni rwiyemezamirimo, online marketing strategist, content marketing expert, digital content creator, blogger, numu social media influencer, uzwiho cyane cyane kuri chaine ye ya YouTube. Azwiho kwigisha aba creators, abayobozi,hamwe naba rwiyemezamirimo bakorera online uburyo bakwagura presence yabo ku imbuga nkoranyambaga bikabafasha kongera umusaruro.\nAmashuri yize n\u2019ubuzima bwamuranze.\nLau yavukiye i Vancouver mu ntara ya British Columbia mu gihugu cya Canada. Akaba afite inkomoko muri Asia. Yize amashuri yisumbuye mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya McRoberts, aho yize ibijyanye n\u2019indimi akaba yararangije amashuri mu 2012. Lau went on to study Marketing and Brand Management at the Sauder School of Business at the University of British Columbia.Yatorewe kuba Perezida wa Sosiyete y'Ubucuruzi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu 2015 kandi yegukana igihembo cy\u2019indashyikirwa cy\u2019abagore barangije mu 2016."}
{"id": "15817", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15817", "title": "Lumala Abdu", "text": "Lumala Abdu (wavutse ku ya 21 Nyakanga 1997) ni umukinnyi wumupira wamaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nk'umukinnyi usatira izamu mu ikipe ya Pyramids yo mu Misiri ndetse n\u2019ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nImyaka yo hambere.\nAbdu yakuriye hamwe na nyirakuru mu mudugudu wa Kataba kuva nyina yapfa afite amezi make gusa ise ntazwi. Afite imyaka 10 yahawe Henrik Larsson, ishati nk'umunsi w'amavuko ye, yahawe na nyirasenge. Yizeraga kuzabona ubuzima bwiza, ubwo nyirakuru yamwohereje mu murwa mukuru Kampala afite imyaka 16. Abdu yakoze akazi kenshi, nko koza imodoka, mbere yuko ahura n'abanyaburayi b'abazungu babashije kumujyana mu ndege yerekeza ku kibuga cy'indege cya Sturup.\nSuwede.\nYasigaye wenyine mu mihanda ya Malm\u00f6 niho yavuganye na Migrationsverket. Bashoboye kubona icumbi rya Abdu mu mujyi muto wa Brom\u00f6lla. Agezeyo, yatangiye imyitozo hamwe n'ikipe yaho If\u00f6 / Brom\u00f6lla akina mu cyiciro cya 5 cya Suwede, ariko nyuma yo kutabasha kubona inkweto z'umupira w'amaguru we n'inshuti bimukiye mu cyiciro cya 9 Gual\u00f6vs GoIF. Yahise agirwa kapiteni hanyuma amaze gutsinda ibitego 20 m'umikino 10 ikipe nini ya Mj\u00e4llby AIF yamusinyiye mu mpeshyi ya 2014. Yakinnye umwaka usigaye hamwe na bafite munsi y'imwaka 17 na 19. Mbere y'igihembwe gitaha Abdu yazamuwe muri ikipe nkuru A ikina mu cyiciro cya kabiri cya Suwede Superettan. Yarishimwe, maze atsinda ibitego 3 mu mikino 24 ari 17 gusa igihe shampiyona yatangiraga. Ibihuha by'impano ye by'akwirakwirijwe n'amakipe nka Malm\u00f6 FF na Olympiacos bashaka kumusinyisha..\nKalmar FF.\nAbdu impano ye yaje kurangirira muri Suwede yo mu ndege muri Kalmar FF. Muri shampiyona ya mbere, yakinnye imikino 10 ya shampiyona.\nInguzanyo.\nMbere y'igihembwe cya 2017 Abdu yahawe inguzanyo muri ikipe ya Superettan Varbergs BoIS. Nyuma y'igice cya shampiyona hamwe niyi kipe, yagarutse muri Kalmar FF kugirango yongere gutizwa, kuriyi nshuro ikigirwamana cye cya nyina Henrik Larsson Helsingborgs NIBA. Yatangiye umukino wa mbere mu mukino yakinnye na GAIS. nyuma yishati ya Abdu ivuga Lumalinho. \nPyramids FC.\nMuri Nyakanga 2019, Abdu yinjiye mu ikipe ya Pyramids FC yo mu Misiri yo mu Misiri aho yahuye n'uwahoze ari umutoza wa Uganda, S\u00e9bastien Desabre. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYatangiye gukinira ikipe y\u2019umupira wamaguru y\u2019igihugu cya Uganda ku ya 9 Kamena 2019 mu mukino wa gicuti na Turukimenisitani, atangira mu kibuga. "}
{"id": "15818", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15818", "title": "George Abege", "text": "George Abege Opio (yavutse ku ya 5 Werurwe 1993) ni rutahizamu ukomoka muri Uganda kuri ubu ukinira Sri Lanka's Up Country Lions SC. Yaje gukina muri shampiyona yo muri Kenya mu ikipe ya Nairobi City Stars, anakina muri Bandari FC (Kenya) hamwe na Kariobangi Sharks, ndetse na Asante Kotoko SC yo muri Gana mu cyiciro cya mbere\nUmwuga.\nGeorge yatangiriye muri FC Luzira ya Maroon, Luweroo United yo muri Uganda mbere yo kwinjira muri kaminuza ya SC Victoria muri 2013. Nyuma yaje muri Kenya aho yamaze igihembwe cya 2014 muri Nairobi City Stars.\nMuri 2015 yerekeje ku nkombe za Bandari FC muri Kenya kugeza mu mpera za shampiyona ya 2016 hanyuma yerekeza mu Burengerazuba yinjira muri SoNy Sugar FC muri shampiyona ya 2017 na 2018.\nYagarutse i Nairobi mu gice cya kabiri cya shampiyona ya 2018 nyuma yo kwinjira muri FC Kariobangi Sharks. Mu ntangiriro z'uwo mwaka, yari afite kwerekeza mu yindi kipe muri Kenya Posta Rangers FC ariko kubera impamvu zitazwi, yagumye i SoNy.\nIgihembwe cya 2018/19 kirangiye, George yerekeje muri shampiyona yo muri Gana yinjira muri Asante Kotoko SC ku masezerano yimyaka itatu. Ariko, nyuma y'amezi make, yavuye muri iyo kipe hanyuma ahuzwa yerekeza mu ikipe ya Uganda yitwa URA FC. Muri Mata 2021 yimukiye muri Sri Lanka's Up Country Lions SC. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nKu ya 10 Nyakanga 2012, George yabereye ku kibuga cya Stade Juba, mu mukino wa gicuti na Sudani y'Amajyepfo. Muri 2015 yatangaje yeruye icyifuzo cye cyo kurushaho kwitabwaho mu ikipe yigihugu. "}
{"id": "15819", "revid": "13539", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15819", "title": "Leo Adraa", "text": "Leo Adraa ni umutoza w'umupira w'amaguru kandi wahoze akina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka mugihugu cya Uganda.\nSudani y'Amajyepfo.\nYatsindira shampiyona y'imbere muri Sudani yepfo ari hamwe na Atlabara FC, Adraa yayobora iyi kipe muri marushanwa ya CAF muri 2014, ni ubwa mbere ikipe ya Sudani yepfo yitabiriye ayo amarushanwa. \nYashyizweho nk'umutoza w'agateganyo w'ikipe y'igihugu ya Sudani y'Amajyepfo mu 2016, aho yagombaga kuyobora iyi kipe mu majonjora yo gushaka itike yo kuzakina igikombe cya Afurika cyo muri 2017 ; ariko, yeguye kuri uyu mwanya nyuma y'umukino umwe kuri uwo mwaka kubera uburangare bw\u2019ishyirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru ku mushahara we, avuga umushahara atishyuwe. Adraa yatangaje ko atazongera gusubira muri Sudani y'Amajyepfo. "}
{"id": "15820", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15820", "title": "Brian Aheebwa", "text": "Brian Aheebwa (wavutse 1 Nyakanga 1998) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira ya KCCA FC yo muri shampiyona ya Uganda hamwe nikipe yigihugu ya Uganda (Imisambi) nka rutahizamu. \nUmwuga w'urubyiruko.\nAkiri muto, yari umunyamuryango w\u2019ishuri rya Seminari ya Mutagatifu Yohani Bosco maze mu 2014 yinjira mu ishuri ry\u2019imikino rya Mbarara kugeza 2016. \nUmwuga.\nMbarara FC (2016-2020).\nAheebwa yinjiye muri Mbarara City FC mu 2016 arangiza muri Mbarara. Yasinyanye amasezerano y'imyaka 4 amaze kwinjira muri Mbarara City FC, Mu 2016, niwe watsinze ibitego byinshi muri shampiyona y'akarere yatsinze ibitego umunani. Yatangiye gukinira irushanwa rikuru muri 2017 muri Mbarara City FC na Kireka Yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere yatsinze Masavu FC muri Werurwe 2017. Ku ya 9 Mata 2017 yatsinze ibitego bine muri Mbarara City FC na Nyamityobora FC. Yatsinze ibitego 39 mugihe cy'imyaka ine yamaze muri Mbarara City FC. \nKCCA FC.\nMuri Kamena 2020 yinjiye muri KCCA FC asinya amasezerano yimyaka 3. Ku ya 3 Ukuboza 2020, yatangiye gukinira KCCA FC na Bright Stars FC. Yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere kuri KCCA FC muri uwo mukino, KCCA FC yatsinze ibitego 2 kuri 1. \nUbuzima bwite.\nAheebwa yavutse ku ya 1 Nyakanga 1998 mu Karere ka Kibale. Yize amashuri abanza ya Kahunde, Ishuri ry'isumbuye rya Mutagatifu Yohani Bosco muri Hoyima mbere yo kwinjira mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Mutagatifu Kirigwajjo aho yakiriye UCE. Hagati ya 2014 na 2015, Aheebwa yinjiye mu kigo cy\u2019ubuvuzi cy\u2019Urwibutso rwa Mayanja aho yarangirije impamyabumenyi muri Nursing bityo akaba ari umuyobozi w\u2019ubuvuzi wemewe. "}
{"id": "15821", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15821", "title": "Sadat Anaku", "text": "Sadat Byishimo Anaku Ana (wavutse 9 Ukuboza 2000) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira ikipe ya Dundee yo muri Ekose, nk'umukinnyi ukina imbere asatira izamu. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nAnaku yakinnye i gihugu cye cya Uganda mu mujyi ya KCC, aho yatsinze ibitego 22 mu mikino 67 yakiniye iyi kipe mbere yo gusinyira imyaka ibiri mu ikipe ya Scottish Dundee muri Kanama 2022, nyuma yo kurangiza ingeragezwa akaritsinda. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri Nzeri 2021, yari ahagarariye itsinda ryatoranijwe rya Uganda mu akarere, naho muri Gashyantare 2022 ahagarariye itsinda ryatoranijwe rya Uganda mu murikagurisha ryabereye muri Esipanye. \nAnaku yahamagawe n'ikipe nkuru y'igihugu ya Uganda, ariko guhera muri Kanama 2022 yari atarakina. "}
{"id": "15822", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15822", "title": "Bruk Anukani", "text": "Bright Anukani (yavutse 26 kamena 2000) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nk'umukinnyi wo hagati mu kibuga mu ikipe ya KCCA ndetse nikipe yumupira wamaguru ya Uganda. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nYinjiye muri KCCA mu mpeshyi 2020. "}
{"id": "15823", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15823", "title": "Khalid Aucho", "text": "Khalid Aucho (wavutse 8 Kanama 1993) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira ikipe ya Young Africans yo muri Tanzaniya ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda nku mukinnyi ukina hagati mu kibuga. \nAucho yakinnye umupira w'amaguru mu makipe atandukanye, nka Jinja Municipal Council FC kuva 2009 kugeza 2010, Water FC yo muri Uganda kuva 2010 kugeza 2012, Simba FC yo muri Uganda, Tusker ikomoka muri Kenya, Gor Mahia ikomoka muri Kenya, na Baroka ikomoka muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yari mu ikipe ya Uganda yujuje ibisabwa mu gikombe cya Afurika ku nshuro ya mbere mu myaka 38.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nAucho yavukiye i Jinja, muri Uganda. Yize amashuri abanza ya Namagabimuri Kayunga, St Thudus mu cyiciro rusange, akomereza mu Ishuri rivanze rya Iganga mu mashuri yisumbuye. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nGor Mahia FC.\nMuri Nyakanga 2016, Aucho yagiye mu igeragezwa mu ikipe ya Aberdeen yo muri Skotishi mu cyiciro cya mbere. Kwimukira muri Aberdeen byaragiye, ariko, nyuma yo kwishyura amafaranga yo kwimura amakipe. Nyuma y\u2019igeragezwa ritangenze neza muri otcosse, Aucho yasinye muri Baroka FC ikomoka muri Afurika yepfo ku giciro cyavuzwe ko ari Rande 200.000. \nBaroka FC.\nKu ya 24 Kanama 2016, Aucho yasinyiye ikipe ya Baroka FC Yatangiye umukino we wa mbere ku ya 15 Ukwakira 2016 mu mukino w\u2019umupira w'amaguru wa shampiyona wabereye kuri Stade ya Cape Town ku munota wa 50 asimbuye Chauke Mfundhisii. \nUrubyiruko rwo muri Afurika SC.\nAucho yimukiye muri ikipe yo muri Tanzaniya ya Young Africans SC muri Kanama 2021. "}
{"id": "15824", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15824", "title": "Timothy Awany", "text": "Timothy Dennis Awany (wavutse 6 Kanama 1996) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira FC Ashdod ndetse nikipe yigihugu ya Uganda nka myugariro.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nAwany yakiniye mu ikipe ya KCCA yi Kampala. \nMuri Nyakanga 2019, yinjiye muri shampiyona ya Isiraheli yinjira mu ikipe FC Ashdod. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nAwany yagaragaye bwa mbere mu ikipe mpuzamahanga y'igihugu cya Uganda mu 2016, kandi yashyizwe mu ikipe izakina mu gikombe cy'Afurika cyo muri 2017. "}
{"id": "15825", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15825", "title": "Ibiyaga n'Ibishanga", "text": "Ikiremwamuntu gikwiye guhindure imyumvire mu buryo bwogukoresha indiri z\u2019urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima, cyane cyane ibishanga, imigezi n\u2019ibiyaga, kera byafatwaga nka ahantu ho kujugunya imyanda.\nKubungabunga Ibiyaga n'Ibishanga.\nKurengera ibidukikije mu rugamba rw\u2019iterambere rirambye, inzira ni ndende,abantu basabwa guhindura imyumvire ku ikoreshwa ry\u2019urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima, aho kera byafatwaga nk\u2019ahantu ho kujugunya imyanda.Umuturarwanda agomba kuzirikana isano kamere afitanye n\u2019ibidukikije, bityo akarushaho kubungabunga urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima bibumbatiye amoko atandukanye y\u2019inyamaswa n\u2019ibimera dukesha ibidutunga, imiti twivuza n\u2019umwuka mwiza duhumeka uwo mwuka udashobora kubonerwa ikiguzi gikwiye.Abanyarwanda bashishikarizwa gufatanyiriza hamwe mu kwiteza imbere no gufata neza umutungo kamere w\u2019urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima.Urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima runyuranye ruri mu byanya bikomye za pariki, n\u2019ibishanga, bifashako igihugu ko gisurwa na ba Mukerarugendo aho bigira uruhare runini mu iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019igihugu.Twite ku rusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima, iyo ni insanganyamatsiko ijyanye n\u2019icyerekezo cyo mu mwaka 2050 u Rwanda rwihaye, cyo kuba mu bihugu biteye imbere binyuze mu iterambere ritabangamira ibidukikije.\nIbindi Wamenya.\nMu Rwanda, insanganyamatsiko ivuga iti Igihe kirageze twite ku rusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima, ijyanye n\u2019icyerekezo cyo mu mwaka 2050 u Rwanda rwihaye, cyo kuba mu bihugu biteye imbere, binyuze mu iterambere ritabangamiye ibidukikije kandi rifite ubudahangarwa ku ngaruka z\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe.Iyo nsanganyamatsiko, ijyanye n\u2019intego z\u2019iterambere rirambye, na gahunda y\u2019igihugu y\u2019imyaka irindwi yo kwihutisha iterambere. Bityo nukuvugango iyangirika ry\u2019umutungo kamere n\u2019urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima, bigira ingaruka zikomeye kandi zitubuza kugera ku ntego z\u2019iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu bw'igihugu cyiyemeje.Bavuga ko ibyo bigaragaza ko kubungabunga urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima, byuzuzanya no guteza imbere ubukungu n\u2019imibereho myiza y\u2019abaturage.kurengera ibidukikije ni rugamba rw\u2019iterambere rirambye."}
{"id": "15826", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15826", "title": "Micheal Azira", "text": "Micheal Azira (yavutse 22 Kanama 1987) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda.\nUmwuga wabigize umwuga.\nAzira yasinyanye na Batteri ya Charleston ya USL Pro muri 2012. \u00a0 Yatsindiye Charleston igitego y'atsinze Wilmington Hammerheads mu mikino ya Shampiyona ya USL Pro muri 2012. Azira yatsinze ibindi bitego bitandatu muri Battery muri 2013.Ku ya 6 Werurwe 2014, Azira yimuriwe muri Seattle Sounders FC muri Shampiyona nkuru y\u2019umupira w'amaguru. Yatangiye bwa mbere muri MLS asimbuye Montr\u00e9al ku ya 23 Werurwe. \nSeattle ntabwo yongeye amasezerano ya Azira nyuma y'igihembwe cyo muri 2015. Azira yinjiye mu mushinga wa MLS Waiver mu Kuboza 2015 kandi yatoranijwe ni kipe ya Colorado Rapids. Azira yagurishijwe na Rapids ku ya 8 Kanama 2018 yerekeza i Montreal Impinduka zo mu cyiciro cya kane cyatoranijwe muri MLS SuperDraft muri 2020. Azira yongeye kugurishwa muri Kanama 2019, kuri iyi nshuro kuri Chicago. Amasezerano yagiranye niyi kipe yarangiye mu mpera za shampiyona ya 2020. \nKu ya 1 Gashyantare 2021, Azira yasinyanye na USL Champiyona ya Mexico. "}
{"id": "15827", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15827", "title": "Assani Bajope", "text": "Assani Bajope (yavutse ku ya 14 Mata 1982) numupira wamaguruukomoka muri Uganda.\nUtuntu n'utundi.\nBajope akina nk'umukinnyi ukina hagati mu kibuga, Bajope yakiniye umujyi wa Kampala, mu ikkipe ya City Council FC mbere yo kwerekeza mu ikipe ya Saint-George SA yo muri Etiyopiya muri Nyakanga 2006.\nMpuzamahanga.\nYabaye kandi umwe mu bagize ikipe y\u2019umupira wamaguru y\u2019igihugu cya Uganda akaba yarahamagawe mu ikipe y'igihugu inshuro zirenga 20, kuva 2003 \u2013 2008. \n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo byerekana igitego cya Uganda mbere.\" "}
{"id": "15828", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15828", "title": "Timothy Batabaire", "text": "Timothy Batabaire (yavutse ku ya 25 Kanama 1981) ni myugariro mu mupira wamaguru ukomoka i Iganga muri uganda.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nBatabaire yari yatangiye gukina mu 1999 na SC Villa aho yagumye kugeza shampiyona irangiye 2003. Nyuma yimukiye i Burayi gukina umwaka umwe muri Shampiyona ya kabiri ya Seribiya na Montenegoro, hamwe n\u2019ikipe ya Seribiya OFK Ni\u0161, hagati y\u2019ibiruhuko byo mu itumba ryo mu 2003\u201304 na 2004\u201305. Kuva mu 2005, yakinnye muri Afurika y'Epfo na Bloemfontein Celtic aho yakinnyeimikino itanu ikomeye mbere yo kwimuka, mu mpeshyi 2009, yerekeza mu yindi kipe yo muri Afurika y'Epfo, Bidvest Wits. Ku ya 19 Kanama 2014, yimukiye mu ikipe ya Garankuwa FC yo mu cyiciro cya mbere cy\u2019igihugu cya Afurika yepfo \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nBatabaire yabayeumukinnyi w'ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda kuva mu 2000. "}
{"id": "15829", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15829", "title": "Shafik Batambuze", "text": "Shafik Bhuchu Batambuze (wavutse 14 Kamena 1994) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru aka ari mpuzamahangaukomoka muri Uganda ukinira Gor Mahia yo muri Kenya nku mukinnyi wo hagati mu kibibuga. \nUmwuga.\nBatambuze yakiniye amakipe atandukanye nka Simba, Urubyiruko rwa Muhoroni, SC Villa, Western Stima, Sofapaka, Tusker na Singida United. \nYatangiye gukinira amarushanwa mpuzamahanga muri 2016, kandi yashyizwe mu ikipe yitabiriye imikino yi gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu cya Afurika muri 2017. "}
{"id": "15830", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15830", "title": "Fahad Bayo", "text": "Bayo Aziz Fahad ni umukinnyi wu mupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira MFK Vy\u0161kov muri shampiyona yi gihugu cya Ceki. Bayo yakinnye ku rwego mpuzamahanga akomoka muri Uganda. \nUmwuga w'urubyiruko.\nBayo niwe watsinze ibitego byinshi mu marushanwa ya bibigo bya mashuri y'isumbuye muri Uganda mu marushanwa ya Copa Coca Cola muri 2014. Yatsinze ibitego 11.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nProline FC.\nYinjiye muri Proline FC mu 2014 afite imyaka 16. Yakinnye imikino 25 atsinda ibitego 16 muri shampiyona yo muri 2015\u201316 ya shampiyona ya kabiri ikomeye muri Uganda. \nImikinireye ye yagize uruhare mu kuzamura Proline FC muri shampiyona ya Uganda. \nMuri shampiyona ya 2016\u201317, yatsindiye Proline ibitego bitandatu. Yakinnye imikino 18.\nBayo yakinnye kimwe cya kabiri cya shampiyona yo muri Uganda muri 2017-18. Yatsinze ibitego bitandatu mu mikino 14 ya shampiyona. yahise ajya mu ikipe yo muri Zambiya ya Buildcon FC mu gusoza shampiyona. \nKubaka FC.\nKu myaka 18, Bayo yinjiye muri ikipe ya Zambiya Buildcon FC muri Mutarama 2018. Yatsinze ibitego icyenda kandi atanga imipira yavuyemo esheshatu mu mikino 16.\nFC Ashdod.\nKu ya 27 Nyakanga 2020 yasinywe mu ikipe yo muri Isiraheli yitwa FC Ashdod. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nMuri Werurwe 2018, Bayo yakiriye guhamagarwa mu ikipe nkuru y'igihugu ya Uganda n'umutoza Sebastien Desabre mu kiruhuko mpuzamahanga. Bayo yakinnye mumikino yombi ya gicuti na Sao Tome na Malawi. \n \"Amanota n'ibisubizo byerekana igitego cya Uganda mbere.\" "}
{"id": "15832", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15832", "title": "Alexis Bbakka", "text": "Alexis David Bbakka (yavutse ku ya 13 Nzeri 1995) ni umukinnyi w umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga ukina nk'umukinnyi ukina imbere asatira izamu mu ikipe ya Ettan Fotboll mu kipe ya Ume\u00e5 ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda. Yavukiye muri Suwede, akinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nBbakka yerekeje bwa mbere muri Uganda mu mukino wa gicuti 0-0 na Turukimenisitani ku ya 9 Kamena 2019. Umukino we wa mbere wamarushawa ni 0-0 na Burkina Faso mu majonjora yo guhatanira igikombe cya Afurika ku ya 13 Ugushyingo 2019. \nUbuzima bwite.\nBbakka yavukiye muri Suwede ariko ahagarariye Uganda ku rwego mpuzamahanga, afite ubwenegihugu ku bihugu byombi. "}
{"id": "15833", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15833", "title": "Giosue Bellagambi", "text": "Giosue Ebong Bellagambi (yavutse ku ya 8 Ugushyingo 2001) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru w'abigize umwuga ukina nk'umuzamu w'ikipe ya Huddersfield Town yo mu Bwongereza, ariko atizwa mu ikipe yu mujyi wa Salford. Yavukiye mu Bwongereza, akinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nBellagambi ni gicuruzwa cy'urubyiruko rwa Lambeth Tigers FC na Whyteleafe, y'imukira mu ishuri ry\u2019urubyiruko rwa Huddersfield Town muri 2018. Ku ya 6 Kanama 2020, yasinye amasezerano ye ya mbere y'umwuga na Huddersfield Town. Yatangiye umwuga we ari mu ntizanyo ya Ramsbottom United mu Gushyingo 2020, aho yakinnye imikino 4. bamutiza bwa kabiri yari kumwe na Ebbsfleet United, yarangiye muri Werurwe 2021. Yarasigarany ukwezi kumwe kwa masezerano na Stalybridge Celtic muri Kanama 2021 nyuma yo gukira imvune y'urutoki. Ku ya 27 Ukuboza 2021, yinjiye mu mujyi wa Brighouse ku ntizanyo y'iminsi 28. Mushiki we nawe ni Viola Bellaganbi\nKu ya 26 Mutarama 2022, yongereye amasezerano mu mujyi wa Huddersfield kugeza mu 2024. Ku ya 8 Kanama 2022, yimukiye muri Hyde United ku ntizanyo y'amezi atatu. Ku ya 6 Ukwakira 2022, intizanyo ye yagabanijwe na Huddersfield. Bukeye, yasinyiye intizanyo muri shampiyona y'Amajyaruguru ya Spennymoor Town ku ntizanyo yo kugeza ku ya 2 Mutarama 2023. \nSIBLINGS Giosue Bellagambi afite na mushiki we witwa Viola bellagambi nawe ari mu myitozo yo kuba umukinnyi wu mupira w'amaguru nkuko murumuna we sutton yunze ubumwe kuva 2017 kandi n'ubu aracyabikora\nInguzanyo yo mu mujyi wa Salford.\nKu ya 31 Mutarama 2023, Bellagambi yinjiye muri EFL League Ikipe ya Salford City ku nguzanyo kugeza shampiyona irangiye 2022-23. "}
{"id": "15835", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15835", "title": "Stephen Bengo", "text": "Stephen Bengo nI umukinnyi mpuzamahanga ukina umupira w'amaguru ukommoka muri Uganda. "}
{"id": "15836", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15836", "title": "Arbade Bironze", "text": "Arbade Bironze ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru w'abigize umwuga ukomoka muri Uganda. Kuri ubu akinira Nakhon Pathom muri Shampiyona yo muri Tayilande. "}
{"id": "15837", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15837", "title": "Herbert Bockhorn", "text": "Herbert Bockhorn (wavutse 31 Mutarama 1995) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina iburyo kuruhande kuri 2. Bundesliga ikipe ya 1. FC Magdeburg.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nUmwuga w'urubyiruko.\nBockhorn yatangiye gukina umupira w'amaguru muri TSV Melsdorf na FC Kilia Kiel mbere yo kwinjira mu rubyiruko rwa Werder Bremen aho yakiniye amakipe ari munsi yimwaka 17 na 19. \nWerder Bremen III, II na SC Wiedenbr\u00fcck 2000.\nBockhorn yinjiye mu ikipe ya Werder Bremen ya kabiri mu ikipe ya bari munsi ya 19. Yatangiye umukino we wa mbere ku ya 27 Kanama 2014 na SG Aumund-Vegesack. Ku ya 21 Nzeri 2014, Bockhorn yakinnye umukino we wa mbere na Werder Bremen bahanganye na TSV Havelse. Bockhorn yinjiye muri SC Wiedenbr\u00fcck 2000 kuva Werder Bremen II. Yatangiye gukina bwa mbere ku ya 1 Kanama 2015 yakinnye na Rot-Weiss Essen.\nBorussia Dortmund II.\nBockhorn yinjiye muri Borussia Dortmund II mu 2016. Yatangiye gukina bwa mbere ku ya 12 Kanama 2016 na Rot-Wei\u00df Oberhausen. Yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere ku ya 27 Kanama 2017 na Borussia M\u00f6nchengladbach II. Bockhorn yakiniye ikipe nkuru ya Borussia Dortmund inshuro ebyiri: ku ya 22 Nyakanga 2018 kuri Stade ya Banki ya Amerika. Yakinnye na Liverpool mugihe cy'igikombe mpuzamahanga. \nUmujyi wa Huddersfield.\nMuri Nyakanga 2019, Bockhorn yimukiye mu ikipe ya Huddersfield Town yo mu Bwongereza, ahura n'umutoza Jan Siewert, wari watoje Bockhorn mu gihe cye na Borussia Dortmund. Ku ya 13 Kanama 2019, Bockhorn yerekeje bwa mbere mu mujyi wa Huddersfield, mu cyiciro cya mbere cy'igikombe cya EFL yakinnye na Lincoln City. Icyakora, ku ya 16 Kanama, Siewert yarirukanwe; Serivisi za Bockhorn ntizakunzwe n\u2019umuyobozi mushya Danny Cowley, maze ava muri iyo kipe shampiyona irangiye, atagaragara muri shampiyona.\nVfL Bochum.\nMuri Nyakanga 2020 Bockhorn yasinyanye amasezerano yumwaka na VfL Bochum. "}
{"id": "15838", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15838", "title": "Tenywa Bonseu", "text": "Tenywa \"T-Bone\" Bonseu (yavutse ku ya 28 Ukwakira 1976) ni umupira w'amaguru mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru, ukomoka i Kampala muri uganda, w'akinnye imyaka icyenda y'umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga muri Amerika.\nUmwuga.\nabatabigize umwuga na kaminuza.\nBonseu yatangiye umwuga we akinira Horizon FC mu gihugu cye cya Uganda, mbere yo kuza muri Amerika mu 1997 kwitabira no gukina umupira w'amaguru muri kaminuza ya Martin Methodiste College yo mu cyaro cya Tennessee nyuma yo gukora igeragezwa n'ikipe yo mu Buyapani muri shampiyona ya J. \nAbabigize umwuga.\nBonseu yinjiye muri Pittsburgh Riverhounds ya muri shampiyona ya A mu 1999 akinayo ibihe bibiri, mbere yo gusinyana na Shampiyona nkuru y'umupira w'amaguru wa Chicago Fire. Bonseu yagiye kumara ibihe byinshi muri MLS, akina na Columbus Crew mu 2001, Dallas Burn mu 2002 na 2003, na MetroStars yaguze Tenywa muri Dallas kwa Steve Jolley mbere ya shampiyona yo muri 2004. Mu bihe bitanu muri MLS, Bonseu yakinnye muri shampiyona isanzwe 87 n'imikino 11 yo gukina (gutangira byose uretse bitatu).\nNyuma yo kurekurwa na MetroStars, Bonseu yakinnye ibihe bine na Rochester Rhinos mu cyiciro cya mbere cya USL kuva 2005 kugeza 2008, mbere yo gusinyira Pittsburgh Riverhounds mu 2009.\nMpuzamahanga.\nBonseu yari umwe mu bakinnyi bato batoranijwe kugaragara mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda. Afite imikino 21 muri Uganda."}
{"id": "15839", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15839", "title": "Ivan Bukenya", "text": "Ivan Bukenya (wavutse 1 Ugushyingo 1991) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda. Bukenya yahoze akinira FC Linkoping City, na Erbil FC muri Iraki, Abayobozi ba Kaizer muri Afurika y'Epfo na Bengal y'Iburasirazuba FC yo mu Buhinde.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nBukenya yatangiye urugendo rwe rw'umupira w'amaguru muri Nyakanga 2007 ubwo yasuraga Rio Ferdinand. Yakiniraga ikipe ya Coca-Cola y'ahisemo urubyiruko rwatojwe na Mike Mutebi hamwe na Ibrahim Juma, Andrew Buteera na Dennis Guma aho bakinanye n'abasore ba Proline FC. Kuba ku ruhande rwa Coca-Cola byari ukwemeza inyenyeri igenda ikura ari Bukenya kandi yaje gusinyira ikipe yo muri shampiyona ya Uganda. Ferdinand yashimishijwe cyane n'impano zerekanwa kugirango akore muri Proline y'abato, Bukenya yari mu rwego rwo kujya mu Bwongereza no gukina imikino n\u2019impande z\u2019ishuri rya Manchester na West Ham mu Kwakira uwo mwaka. Yatsinze ibitego burigihe muri shampiyona ya Uganda kandi yagaragajwe nk\u2019iterabwoba mu kirere mu gihe cyo gutera imigeri no ku busa kuri Proline FC. Umukino wa Bukenya gusoma hamwe n'ubushobozi bwo kwimurira umupira hejuru cyane twavuga ko ari imwe mu mbaraga zikomeye mu ikipe ya Mujib Kasule, aho yaciye. "}
{"id": "15840", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15840", "title": "Ikiyaga cya cyabayaga", "text": "Ikiyaga cya Cyabayaga ni ikiyaga gihangano cyo mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba y'u Rwanda. Kiri mu Akarere ka Nyagatare. Cyashyizweho mu mwaka wa 2004.\nAmazi y'Ikiyaga cya Cyabayaga yuhira umuceri. Ikiyaga kirororerwamo amafi. Kibangamiwe n'amarebe n'isuri.\nAmateka.\nIkiyaga cya Cyabayaga kiri mu kagari ka Cyabayaga. Cyashyizweho mu mwaka wa 2004. Kibika amazi y'imirima y'umuceri. Iyo Umuvumba wuzuye, ikiyaga kigabanya amazi ajya mu mirima.\nMu mwaka wa 2010, hashinzwe koperative y'abarobyi. Iyo koperative ishinzwe kurinda ikiyaga no kukororeramo amafi. Mu mwaka wa 2014, yari ifite abanyamuryango 72.\nImiterere.\nIkiyaga cya Cyabayaga gifite ubuso bwa hegitari zigera kuri 40. Ubwo buso bugabanuka iyo amazi ari make.\nAkamaro n'ibibazo.\nAmazi y'ikiyaga yuhira umuceri w'amakoperative atatu y'abahinzi. Uwo muceri uhingwa ku buso bwa hegitari 600.\nMbere y'umwaka wa 2014, koperative y'abarobyi yasaruraga ibiro 400 by'amafi ku kwezi. Muri Mata 2014, amarebe aturuka mu Muvumba yakwiriye hafi ikiyaga cyose. Kuva icyo gihe, umusaruro w'amafi warahagaze.\nMuri Mata 2018, isuri yasibye ikiyaga. Ikiyaga nticyari kigishobora kubika amazi. Mu mwaka wa 2019, RAB yatanze imashini zo gukuramo itaka.\nMu mwaka wa 2025, ikiyaga cyari hafi gukama. Imyuzure yari yangije imiyoboro izana amazi y'Umuvumba."}
{"id": "15841", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15841", "title": "Keita Buwanika", "text": "Keita Buwanika (yavutse kuya 16 ukuboza 2002) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru mu buyapani, ukina kuruhande mu ikipe ya JEF Chiba. yavukiye i Tokiyo ise akomoka muri uganda nyina akaba umu yapanikazi."}
{"id": "15842", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15842", "title": "Elvis Bwomono", "text": "Elvis Okello Bwomono (yavutse 29 Ugushyingo 1998) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nk'umukinnyi w'inyuma wa \u00cdBV.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nUrubyiruko na Southend.\nBwomono yavukiye muri Uganda kugeza afite imyaka itatu. Bwomomo yaje kwimukira i Londres aho yize kuri Hatch End High School. Yatangiye umwuga we nk'umukinnyi ukiri muto muri Queens Park Rangers, nyuma aza kwinjira muri Southend afite imyaka 14. \nAtangiye gukinira Southend batsinze Gillingham ibitego 2\u20131 mu gikombe cya EFL yo mu majyepfo ya 2017 B ku ya 29 Kanama 2017. Mu Kwakira 2017, yasinye amasezerano ye yambere y'umwuga niyi kipe. \nNyuma yo gusezererwa, Bwomono yanze amasezerano mashya yanga gukinira iyi kipe, nubwo yagize uruhare rwe mu gusezerera iyi kipe. Nyuma yaje kuva muri Southend. \n\u00cdbv.\nMuri Gicurasi 2022, Bwomono yinjiye muri Besta-deild karla sideBV. \nBwomono yerekanwe bwa mbere muri Uganda mu Gushyingo 2020 aho bakinaga na Sudani y'Amajyepfo. "}
{"id": "15843", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15843", "title": "Bobosi Byaruhanga", "text": "Bobosi Byaruhanga (wavutse ku ya 3 Ukuboza 2001) ni umukinnyi w\u2019umupira w'amaguru uvuka muri Uganda usanzwe ukina nku mukinnyi wo hagati mu ikipe ya Austin FC II yo muri Amerika, ku nguzanyo ya Vy\u0161kov.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nByaruhanga yatangiye umwuga we muri Vipers, agenda atera imbere muri iryo shuri, aza gutwara ibikombe bibiri bya shampiyona ndetse n\u2019umukinnyi w\u2019umwaka wa 2021 Airtel FUFA. Muri Kamena 2022, yari afite kuva muri iyo kipe, maze muri Kanama 2022, yimukira muri Repubulika ya Ceki, yinjira mu ikipe ya Vy\u0161kov yo mu gihugu cya Ceki. \nMuri Mutarama 2023, yimukiye mu ikipe ya Amerika Austin FC II ku ntizanyo yi gihembwe, aho ashobora no kugurwa. \nIcyubahiro.\nInzoka\nUganda yabatarengeje 20"}
{"id": "15844", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15844", "title": "Peter Byaruhanga", "text": "Peter Byaruhanga (yavutse 18 Kanama 1979) ni Uganda wahoze akina umupira w'amaguru wa babigize umwuga, ukora muri Amerika, wakinnye nka rutahizamu.\nUbuzima bwite.\nByaruhanga yavukiye i Kampala, muri Uganda kandi afite ubwenegihugu bubiri bw'Abanyamerika na Uganda.\nUmwuga.\nUmwuga wa kaminuza.\nByaruhanga yakiniye UAB Blazers muri shampiyona ya 1998 na 1999. \nAbigize umwuga.\nMuri Gashyantare 2000, ikipe ya Kansas City bahisemo Byaruhanga mu cyiciro cya kabiri cya 2000 MLS SuperDraft. Yigaragaje inshuro esheshatu mu bihembwe bibiri. Muri Gicurasi 2000, Kansas bohereje Byaruhanga ku ntizanyo muri Raleigh Express mu mikino itanu. Mu 2001, yagiye mu ntizanyo muri Atlanta Silverbacks. Ku ya 18 Kamena 2001, Kansas baretse Byaruhanga. Ku ya 6 Nyakanga 2001, yasinyanye na Richmond Kickers. Mu 2002, yakiniye Cincinnati Riverhawks ndetse na Carolina Dynamo yo muri USL D3-Pro muri shampiyona.\u00a0 Muri 2009, yakiniye Rocket City."}
{"id": "15845", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15845", "title": "Igishanga cya Cyabayaga", "text": "Igishanga cya Cyabayaga cyashyizweho mu mwaka wa 2004, gifasha mu gukamura amazi ari mu muceri no kuyagabanya mu mirima.\nIbyo wamenya kugishanga cya Cyabayaga.\nIgishanga cya Cyabayaga gifite ubuso bwa hegitari zigera kuri 40 ariko zikaba zigabanuka bitewe n\u2019amazi iyo yabaye make. Uretse amarebe ashobora gutuma kigira ikibazo ngo n\u2019abahinga mu nkengero zacyo nabo bahinga bashyiramo ibitaka kimwe n\u2019amatungo acyuhirwaho.Mu mwaka 2014 batewe n\u2019amarebe aturuka mu mugezi w\u2019umuvumba hamwe n\u2019umucanga muri icyoguhe nta musaruro w\u2019amafi bakibonaga kandi imbaraga zabo zari zimaze gukendera.Bavugaga ko bakeneye guterwa inkunga yo gukuramo ayo marebe bakareba ko bakongera kurya ku ifi no kwinjiza amafaranga ayikomokaho.Ubuyobozi bw\u2019akagari ka Cyabayaga bwavugaga ko iki kibazo bwakimenye kandi bwiteguraga kugira icyo bwafasha mu kugikemura.Bavugaga ko bagiye kwifashisha umuganda w\u2019abaturage bagakuramo aya marebe, ariko na none bakanahuza koperative y\u2019abahinzi b\u2019umuceri icunga amazi ajya muri iki kiyaga ndetse na koperative Cyabayaga Fishing y\u2019aborozi b\u2019amafi.Cooperative yakoreragamo ubworozi bw\u2019amafi yari igizwe n\u2019abanyamuryango 72. Mbere ngo amarebe ataraza muri icyo kiyaga bari bageze ku musaruro w\u2019ibiro 400 by\u2019amafi ku kwezi aho ikiro cy\u2019ifi cyagurwaga amafaranga y\u2019u Rwanda hagati Igihumbi magana atanu (1500) n'Iguhumbi magana abiri (1200)."}
{"id": "15846", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15846", "title": "Elio Capradossi", "text": "Elio Capradossi (wavutse ku ya 11 Werurwe 1996) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga ukina nku mukinnyi ukina hagati muri ikipe ya Cagliari muri shampiyona ya seri B Yavukiye muri Uganda, ni umukinnyi mpuzamahanga mu Butaliyani.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nCapradossi ni umwe mubazamukiye mu ishuri ryurubyiruko rya roma. Yatsindiye muri Shampiyona y'Ubutaliyani yabatarengeje imyaka 19 muri 2015\u20132016 hamwe n'ikipe ya batarengeje imyaka 19 ya Roma nka kapiteni w'ikipe.\nMu mpeshyi 2016 yagurijwe muri Bari muri Seri B. Yatangiye shampiyona ku ya 24 Nzeri 2016 akina nk'umukinnyi wa tangiye umukino na Benevento kuri Stadio San Nicola. Muri Mutarama 2018, nyuma y'igihembwe ni gice yamaze i Bari, asubira i Roma. \nKu ya 6 Gicurasi 2018, yakinnye bwa mbere na Roma mu mukino yatsinze Cagliari 1-0 hanze aho yakinnye mu 11 bantangiye mu kibuga. \nKu ya 20 Nyakanga 2018, Capradossi yasinyiye ikipe ya Spezia yo muri Seri B ku nguzanyo kugeza ku ya 30 Kamena 2019. \nKu ya 1 Kanama 2019, Capradossi yasinyanye na Seri B ikipe ya Spezia ku masezerano y'imyaka ine. \nMuri Kanama 2019, Capradossi yaguzwe na Spezia Calcio naho muri Nyakanga 2020 agira imvune ikomeye y\u2019imitsi yimbere yabujije ibikorwa bye byo gukina mugi cya mezi icumi yakurikiye. Ku ya 23 Gicurasi 2021, umukino wa Speziana Roma kugaruka muri Seri A nyuma y'imyaka itatu. \nKu ya 1 Nzeri 2022, Capradossi yasinyanye amasezerano y'imyaka ibiri na Cagliari. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nHamwe n\u2019Ubutaliyani yabatarengeje imyaka 17 yitabiriye Shampiyona y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 17 ya UEFA ndetse no mu gikombe cyisi cya FIFA yabatarengeje 17 muri 2013."}
{"id": "15847", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15847", "title": "Abel Dhaira", "text": "Abel Dhaira (9 Nzeri 1987 - 27 Werurwe 2016) yari umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru, akaba yari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri Uganda wakinnye nk'umuzamu. akaba yarakinnye inshuro 13 mu ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nDhaira yakinnye umupira w'amaguru muri Uganda, Congo na Isilande muri Express, URA, AS Vita (ubwo yinjiye mu Kuboza kwa 2009 ku madolari ya Amerika 22.000) na \u00cdBV. Yarekuwe n'ikipe ya Simba SC yo muri Tanzaniya mu Kuboza 2013. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nDhaira yakinnye bwa mbere muri Uganda mu 2009. Yatwaye ibikombe bitatu bya CECAFA muri 2009, 2011 na 2012. Mu gikombe cya CECAFA muri 2012 yajyanywe mu bitaro nyuma yo kugongana n'umukinnyi bari bahanganye. \nUrupfu.\nMu 2015, Dhaira bamusanganye kanseri yo mu nda hanyuma abagwa muri Uganda mu Kuboza uwo mwaka. Yasubiye muri Isilande muri Mutarama 2016 aho yongeye kwivuriza. Icyakora, kanseri yari yarakwirakwiriye mu mubiri we maze ku ya 27 Werurwe 2016, apfa azize indwara mu bitaro bya kaminuza nkuru ya Isilande, afite imyaka 28. \nIcyubahiro.\nUganda"}
{"id": "15848", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15848", "title": "Patrick Edema", "text": "Patrick Lechi Edema (wavutse 27 Kanama 1992) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira wamaguru ukomokamuri Uganda ukinira ikipe ya El\u00e9ctrico. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nYatangiye umwuga wogukina muri Segunda Liga muri Beira-Mar ku ya 31 Kanama 2014 mu mukino yakinnye na Sporting B. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYaserukiye Uganda yabatarengeje imyaka 20 muri Shampiyona ya CECAFA yabatarengeje imyaka 20 muri 2010. "}
{"id": "15849", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15849", "title": "Gift Fred", "text": "Impano Fred (yavutse ku ya 21 Nyakanga 1998) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira wamaguru ukomoka i Masindi muri Uganda ukinira ikipe ya SC Villa yo muri shampiyona ya Uganda ndetse n'ikipe yigihugu ya Uganda. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nMuri Kanama 2021, gift yasinyanye amasezerano y'imyaka itatu na ikipe yo muri shampiyona ya Uganda yitwa SC Villa. Mbere yo gusinyira Villa, yakinnye mu cyiciro cya gatatu cya Booma FC. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nUkuboza 2022, umutoza Milutin Sedrojevic yamutumije kwinjira mu ikipe nkuru y\u2019umupira wamaguru y\u2019igihugu cya Uganda mu marushanwa y'ibihugu yo muri2022 yabeye muri Alijeriya. Yatangiye umukino wa mbere mu mukino wa gicuti wahuje Uganda na Mali birangira banganyije 0-0 muri Tunusiya. Yatangiye gukinira ku mugaragaro mu marushanwa ya Shampiyona y\u2019Afurika muri 2022 ubwo Uganda yanganyaga na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo ku ya 14 Mutarama 2023 kuri Stade Annaba muri Alijeriya. "}
{"id": "15850", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15850", "title": "Paul Hasule", "text": "Paul Edwin Hasule (20 Ugushyingo 1959 - 26 Mata 2004) yahoze ari umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru muri Uganda. Yabaye kapiteni n'umutoza w'ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda (uzwi ku izina rya \"The Cranes\"). Yari amaze imyaka 25 yitabira ikipe yi gihugu nk'umukinnyi n'umutoza. Paul Edwin Hasule yavutse 1959 kuri John Haumba Kango na Petwa wa Murandu Mbale. Yashimishijwe cyane no kuba rutahizamu igihe yari muri kaminuza ya Tororo na nyuma ya kaminuza ya Makerere, umwuga we muto muri Mbale Intwari niwo w'amugize umutungo ukomeye mu mupira w'amaguru wa Uganda.\nKwinjira muri Villa.\nByahindutse ubwo yinjiraga muri SC Villa mu Gushyingo 1981. Ibyo byaje nyuma yo gusezera kw'intwari, kandi yatangiye gukinira ikipe ya Villa na Nile FC mu gikombe cya Jesse Owens cyabereye kuri Stade ya Nakivubo muri 1981.\nUyu musore w'imyaka 22 yageze muri parike ya Villa ari kumwe na basirikare bakuru nka Jimmy Kirunda, umutoza wa Cranes, Dan Lutalo, Godfrey Kisitu na Fred Serwadda. Ku ikubitiro, umutoza wa Villa, George Mukasa, yahaye Hasule gukina iburyo ariko ntiyabyemera kandi yitwaye nabi igihe yahindurwaga ku mwanya wo hagati.\nUmurage wa ikipe na Cranes wari wararenganye.\nAfite imyaka 44, yapfiriye mu bitaro bya Mulago muri 2004, urupfu rwateye amarira menshi akarere, abayoboke be bamuhaye icyubahiro cya nyuma mu buryo bwo gushyingura mu buryo bukwiye, binjira mu kwishyura amafaranga yo gushyingura harimo no kugura isanduku yashyinguwemo mu ibendera ry'igihugu mu cyubahiro cye akwiye."}
{"id": "15851", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15851", "title": "Igishanga cya bugarama", "text": "Ikibaya cya Bugarama gifite ubuso busaga hegitari 1500 buhingwamo umuceri.\nIbindi.\nIgishanga cya Bugarama ni kimwe mu binini biri mu Rwanda bikorerwaho ubuhinzi, aho kingana na hegitari 1 500. Umusaruro w\u2019abahinzi bo muri iki gishanga ugurwa n\u2019inganda enye zitonora umuceri\nMu kibaya cya Bugarama ni hamwe mu hakunze gukorerwa imirimo y\u2019ubucuruzi bunyuranye kandi bukitabirwa n\u2019abanyamahanga barimo n\u2019abo mu gihugu cy\u2019u Burundi na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Congo. "}
{"id": "15852", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15852", "title": "Denis Iguma", "text": "Denis Iguma ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muriUganda usanzwe ukina nka myugariro wa KCCA FC hamwe n'ikipe y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda ku ya 29 Werurwe 2012 ubwo bakinaga n'ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Misiri. Muri Mutarama 2014, umutoza Milutin Sedrojevic, yamutumiriye kuba mu ikipe y\u2019umupira wamaguru y\u2019igihugu cya Uganda muri Shampiyona y\u2019ibihugu bya Afurika muri 2014. Iyi kipe yegukanye umwanya wa gatatu mu marushanwa nyuma yo gutsinda Burkina Faso, inganya na Zimbabwe itsindwa na Maroke. Muri 2017, yashyizwe mu bakinnyi 23 bari kujya mu gikombe cy\u2019ibihugu cya Afurika muri 2017. "}
{"id": "15853", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15853", "title": "Daniel Isiagi Opolot", "text": "Daniel Isiagi Opolot (wavutse ku ya 19 Ukuboza 1995) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira Jomo Cosmos FC muri Afurika y'Epfo ndetse n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda (\"Cranes\") nka rutahizamu. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nDaniel yakinnye umupira wamaguru muri kaminuza ya SC Victoria, no muri Kampala city Council, Proline FC, Al Nasr kuri ubuari Jomo Cosmos FC muri Afrika yepfo. \nProline FC.\nYinjiye muri Proline FC mu 2016 avuye mu \nAl Nasr.\nMuri Nyakanga 2018 Dan yinjiye muri Al nasr.\nURA FC.\nMuri Nzeri 2019, Daniel yinjiye muri URA FC. \nIkipe y'igihugu.\nDaniel yatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda na Sudani y'Amajyepfo ku ya 8 Ukuboza 2017. \nImibereho.\nDaniel ni umuhungu wa Isiagi Patrick Opolot na Josephine Pedune. \nIcyubahiro n'ibimaze kugerwaho.\nKaminuza ya Victoriya"}
{"id": "15854", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15854", "title": "Isaac Isinde", "text": "Isaac Isinde (wavutse ku ya 16 Mata 1991) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri wa Uganda kuri ubu ukinira Hadiya Hossana nk'umukinnyi ukina hagati. Yatangiye gukina umupira w'amaguru mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Jinja, igihangange cya siporo mu burasirazuba bwa Uganda; aho yari asanzwe akora. Yatsindiye ibikombe 4 muri shampiyona, muri Etiyopiya ndetse n\u2019ibikombe 2 bya FA bya Etiyopiya mu myaka 5 yakoranye na Saint George. \nAmateka yumwuga.\nIsaac yakinnye umupira w'amaguru mu Nama Iganga Town Council, Simba, Victors yo muri Uganda, Saint George muri Etiyopiya, Buildcon FC muri Zambiya, na TRAU FC mu Buhinde. \nKubaka FC.\nIsaac yerekeje muri Buildcon FC nyuma yo kurangiza amasezerano yagiranye na St. George yo muri Etiyopiya, iminsi mike kugeza ku mukino w'anyuma w'igikombe cya Afurika cy\u2019ibihugu aho yari muri Uganda, Isaac yatangiye gukinira Buildcon FC na TP Mazembe. Sitade Mwanawasa, Ndola, Isinde igaragara inyuma iburyo. Yatangiye bwa mbere muri shampiyona ya Zambiya ku ya 8 Mata 2017 na Real Nakonde FC maze umukino urangira banganyije 0-0.\u00a0\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nIsinde yakinnye umukino we wa mbere mpuzamahanga n'ikipe nkuru y'igihugu ku ya 3 Werurwe 2010 muri Tanzaniya (2\u20133), aho yakinnye umukino wose. Ubu asanzwe mu ikipe y'igihugu yashyizweho kuva mu 2013 kandi ku myaka 25 y'amavuko yahamagawe mu ikipe y'igihugu inshuro 55. "}
{"id": "15855", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15855", "title": "Katende Joram", "text": "Katende Jerome Raymond (yavutse 29 Nzeri 1987) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muriUganda wahoze akinira ikipe ya Universiti Sains Maleziya yo muri Maleziya. Nubwo ahanini akina nk'umukinnyi w'ibumoso, ashobora gukina nka rutahizamu, umuvuduko ukaba ikimuranga nyamukuru. \nYatangiye umwuga we wo gukina n\u2019ikipe ya SC Villa yo muri Uganda mu 2003, arangije amashuri yisumbuye, maze agaragara muri iyi kipe 45, mbere yo kwerekeza mu ikipe ya bapolisi bo muri Uganda mu 2006. Nyuma yo kwigaragaza 27 hamwe na Polisi yatsinze ibitego 18, ikipe ya Uganda Revenue Authority SC yo muri Uganda yaramushimye maze yinjiramo muri 2007. Mu myaka 2 yakoranye na URA yakinnye imikino 25 muri iyi kipe, mbere yo kwerekeza mu ikipe ya Omani yo muri shampiyona ikipeya Al Nasrin 2009. Nyuma y'umwaka mwiza muri Omani, yinjiye muri shampiyona yo muri Maleziya ya Universiti Sains Malaysia Staff FC aho akina ubu."}
{"id": "15856", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15856", "title": "Ibrahim Juma (umupira w'amaguru)", "text": "Ibrahim Sadam Juma (wavutse 1 Ukwakira 1993) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wabigize umwuga ukomoka muri Uganda uherutse gukinira hagati mu kibuga muri sahmpiyona ya Uganda mu ikipe ya KCCA FC. Azwiho guhanga, intera yo gutambutsa no kurangiza umukira mu izamu, ni n'inzobere mu kwirukana ubusa. Juma yafashwe na Uganda ku rwego mpuzamahanga.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nImyaka yo hambere.\nMu busore bwe, Juma yakinnye muri Kampala Kids. Yabaye umukinnyi w'ingenzi mu ikipe yatwaye igikombe cya gikombe cya Tivoli na Gothia mu 2003 yatsinze ibitego 25 mu mikino 13 mu marushanwa aheruka - ndetse na Tivoli Cup umwaka wakurikiyeho. Yafashije iyi kipe kongera gutwara igikombe cya Tivoli - igikombe cya karindwi muri rusange - mu 2008 ubwo yatsindaga ikipe ya Danemarike Hillerod 6\u20130 ku mukino wa nyuma. \nCray Wanderers.\nJuma yatangiye umwuga we mukuru mu ikipe ya Isthmian League Cray Wanderers. Nyuma yimyitwarire ishimishije kubakinnyi Juma yahamagawe mu makipe y'ambere arangije atangira gukinira muri Corinthian Casuals. Umusanzu ukomeye wa Juma muri Cray Wanderers ni ugutsinda igitego kubusa cyatsinzwe na Simon Osborn bigatuma Cray Wanderers atsindara imikino ya nyuma bityo akazamurwa mu cyiciro gikurikiyeho. Juma yagiye gukina inshuro 4 gusa kuri Cray Wanderers. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYakuriye i Luzira, mu nkengero za Kampala."}
{"id": "15857", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15857", "title": "Murushid Juuko", "text": "Murushid Juuko (wavutse 14 Mata 1994) ni ukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina mu kibuga hagati muri Express FC. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nJuuko yavukiye Entebbe, mu Karere ka Wakiso. Yakinnye umupira w'amaguru mu makipe yo muri Uganda Bunamwaya na SC Victoria University mbere yo kwerekeza muri Tanzaniya gukinira Simba.\nJuuko yinjiye muri Express FC muri 2020 ku masezerano y'umwaka umwe. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nKu ya 11 Nyakanga 2014, Juuko yatangiye gukinira ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda (\"Cranes\") bakina n'ikipe y'igihugu ya Seychelles. aho Ikipe y'igihugu ya Uganda yatsinze igitego 1-0. \nAFCON 2017.\nJuuko yayoboye Cranes k'umukino y'ambere yokujya mu gikombe cya Afrika kuva 1978. Yari mu ikipe yatsinze Comoros 1-0 kugirango ijye mu mukino wanyuma wa 2017 muri Gaboni. Amaze kubura umukino ubanza na Gana kubera guhagarikwa mugihe cya majonjora yakinnye iminota 180 yakinnye na Misiri na Mali. \nAFCON 2019.\nMu gikombe cy\u2019Afurika cya 2019 Juuko yakinnye imikino ibiri, iyambere yakinnye na Congo indi ikina na Senegali nyuma yo gukomereka. Uganda \"Cranes\" yagarukiye mu cyiciro cya 16. "}
{"id": "15858", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15858", "title": "Joseph Kabagambe", "text": "Joseph Kabagambe (wavutse ku ya 3 Nzeri 1984) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru akaba ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira ikipe ya Al-Nil Al-Hasahesa yo muri Sudani, nka rutahizamu. \nUmwuga.\nYavukiye mu gace ka Mubare, mu Karere ka Kabale, Kabagambe yatangiye gukina umupira w'amaguru ku mpande zaho, mbere yo kwinjira muri Horizon FC muri 2000. Kabagambe yakinnye umupira wamaguru mu Rwanda na Sudani. "}
{"id": "15859", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15859", "title": "Savio Kabugo", "text": "Savio Kabugo (wavutse 20 Mutarama 1995) ni ukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda kuri ubu ukinira jwaneng galaxy fc yo muri botswana.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nSavio yakinnye umupira we mu makipe atandukanye nka Victoria University SC, KCCA FC, URA FC kuri ubu akina muri Proline FC.\nKaminuza ya Victoriya.\nNyuma yo kwitwara neza muri shampiyona ya Fufa, mu Igikombe cya Uganda ndetse no muri Uganda, Savio yahaye amahirwe yo kugerageza muri Bidvest Wits muri Kamena 2013. Muri Nzeri 2014 ubwo yari mu ikipe y'igihugu Savio Kabugo yagize imvune mu mukino wa nyuma w'amakipe mu 2014 wari mu Kuboza na Bright Stars, yashoboye gukina nyuma yo gufata ibituma ububabare bugabanuka. \nKCCA FC.\nMuri Mutarama 2015, Savio yinjiye mu Kampala City Council Savio Kabugo yari mu bakinnyi ba KCCA FC bagize impanuka ubwo yerekezaga i Ntungamo mbere y\u2019igikombe cya nyuma cya Ugandamuri 2015 na SC Villa. \nURA FC.\nKu ya 4 Ukuboza 2015, Savio Kabugo yasinyiye URA FC ku masezerano y'umwaka umwe. Kabugo yakinnye imikino itandatu, URA yatsinzwe na Express FC ibitego 2-1 muri Werurwe 2016 niwo mukino we wa nyuma muri URA FC. \nProline FC.\nMuri Kanama 2016, Savio Kabugo yinjiye mu ikipe y\u2019umupira wamaguru ya Proline Ku ya 18 Ukwakira 2016, Savio Kabugo yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere mu ikipe y\u2019umupira wamaguru ya Proline bakina na Sadolin FC kuri Stade Kyabazinga i Bugembe. \nikipe ya AS Vita.\nUkuboza 2018, Savio yinjiye mu ikipe ya AS Vita avuye muri SC Villa ku masezerano y'imyaka itatu. \nUmujyi wa Sebeta.\nKu ya 31 Ukwakira 2019, Savio yimukiye mu ikipe ya Etiyopiya Sebeta City. \nUbuzima bwite.\nSavio Kabugo yabuze ababyeyi be bombi akiri muto. Ni mubyara wa Ivan Bukenya, wakinnye umupira wamaguru muri Uganda wahoze akinira Kaizer Chiefs muri Shampiyona y'umupira w'amaguru muri Afrika yepfo."}
{"id": "15860", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15860", "title": "Patrick Kaddu", "text": "Patrick Henry Kaddu (wavutse ku ya 9 Ukwakira 1995) ni umukinnyi w'umupira w'amaguru ukomoka muri Uganda ukina nk'umukinnyi ukina mu b'imbere muri RS Berkane muri shampiyona ya Botola Maroke Telecom muri Maroke, ndetse no mu ikipe y'igihugu y'umupira w'amaguru ya Uganda \"Cranes\". \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nRS Berkane.\nMuri Kanama 2019, Kaddu yinjiye muri RS Berkane ku masezerano yimyaka 4. \nYoussoufia Berrechid.\nKu ya 5 Ukuboza 2020, Kaddu yimukiye mu ikipe ya Botola Youssoufia Berrechid ku masezerano mu gihe gisigaye. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nKu ya 17 Ugushyingo 2018, Kaddu yatsinze igitego cye cya mbere mpuzamahanga ku ntsinzi batsinze Cape Veride igitego 1-0 mu gikombe cy\u2019Afurika cy\u2019igikombe cy\u2019ibihugu cya muri 2019, k'ikaba cyarashyize ahagaragara icyemezo cya Uganda mu gikombe cy\u2019Afurika cyo muri 2019. \nKu ya 12 Kamena 2019, Kaddu yashyizwe mu bakinnyi 23 ba Uganda mu gikombe cy\u2019Afurika cya 2019 mu Misiri. Ku ya 22 Kamena 2019, yatsinze ibitego 2-0 itsinze umukino wa mbere yatsinze Congo. \nIcyubahiro.\nClub.\nKCCA"}
{"id": "15861", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15861", "title": "Alimansi Kadogo", "text": "Alimansi Kadogo (wavutse ku ya 5 Gashyantare 1982) ni umukinnyi w\u2019umupira w'amaguru ukina hagati mu kibuga, ukomoka mu gihugu cya Uganda, wakinnye muri ATRACO FC ndetse n\u2019ikipe y\u2019umupira wamaguru ya Uganda. \nKadogo yakiniye Polisi FC yo mu Rwanda, afasha iyi kipe kugera ku mwanya wa kabiri muri Shampiyona y\u2019umupira wamaguru mu Rwanda muri 2011\u201312 ndetse no gushaka itike yo kujya mu gikombe cya CAF muri 2013. "}
{"id": "15862", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15862", "title": "Shafik Kuchi Kagimu", "text": "Shafik Kuchi Kagimu (wavutse ku ya 28 Ugushyingo 1998) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru akaba ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira ikigo cya Revenue Authority, nk'umukinnyi wo hagati.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nYavukiye i Nsambya, yakinnye umupira wamaguru mu rubyiruko muri Zebra FC, Kampala Junior Team na Water FC. Yatangiye umwuga we mu ikipe nkuru muri Uganda Revenue Authority muri 2015. Mu mpera za shampiyona ya 2016\u201317 yatorewe igihembo cya 'Best Midfielder' igihembo muri UPL Awards. Muri Mata 2019 yavuze ko akina ashaka gusatira isamu bituma aboan ibitego byinshi. \nIgihembwe cya 2018\u201319.\nYatsinze ibitego birindwi muri shampiyona mu mikino 28, hamwe na kimwe mu gikombe cya Uganda aho URA FC yaviriyemo mu cyiciro cya 16 kuri Bright Stars FC. Kagimu yashyizeho agahigo ko gutanga imipira ivamo ibitegomuri bihe bitandatu. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYatangiye gukinira mu marushanwa mpuzamahanga muri Uganda muri 2017. \nUbuzima bwite.\nafite impamyabumenyi mu micungire y\u2019amasoko n\u2019ibikoresho muri kaminuza ya Kampala. "}
