{"id": "15864", "revid": "11200", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15864", "title": "Shafiq Kagimu", "text": "Shafiq Kagimu (wavutse 28 Gicurasi 1998) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru akaba ari mpuzamahanga ukomoka muri Uganda ukinira ikipe y'ikigo cya Revenue Authority nku mukinnyi wo hagati.\nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nYavukiye i Nsambya, yakinnye umupira w'amaguru mu rubyiruko muri Zebra FC, Kampala Junior Team na Water FC. Yatangiye umwuga mu ikipe nkuru muri Uganda Revenue Authority muri 2015. Mu mpera za shampiyona ya 2016\u201317 yatorewe igihembo cya 'Best Midfielder' igihembo muri UPL Awards. Muri Mata 2019 yavuze ko akinishwa mu myanya nyinshi mu kibuga, bikavamo imiterere myiza n'ibitego byinshi. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nKagimu yakiniye Uganda yabatarengeje imyaka 20 mu marushanwa ya COSAFA yabatarengeje imyaka 20 yabereye muri Zambiya muri 2017. Yatangiye bwa mbere ku ya 6 Ukuboza 2017 na Zambiya yabatarengeje imyaka 20 kuri Sitade ya Arthur Davies, Kitwe. \nKagimu yakiniye Uganda mu majonjora yabatarengeje imyaka 23 muri TOTAL AFCON yabatarengeje imyaka 23. Yatangiye bwa mbere ku ya 14 Ugushyingo 2018 na Sudani y'Amajyepfo yabatarengeje imyaka 23 kuri Sitade ya Times ya Sitade Lugogo, Uganda yabatarengeje imyaka 23 yatsinze umukino 1-0. \nYatangiye gukinira muri mpuzamahanga muri Uganda muri 2017. \nUbuzima bwite.\nbamuhimbaga \"Kuchi\". yize afite impamyabushobozi mugucunga imishinga yakuye muri kaminuza ya Kampala."}
{"id": "15865", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=15865", "title": "Robert Kakeeto", "text": "Robert Kakeeto (wavutse ku ya 19 Gicurasi 1995) ni umukinnyi ukina umupira w'amaguru wa bigize umwuga ukomoka mu gihugu cya Uganda ukinira ikipe ya Middelfart yo muri Danemarike, ku ntizanyo ya AaB, nk'umukinnyi wo hagati. \nUmwuga wa ikipe.\nKakeeto yavuye muri Uganda yerekeza muri Danimarike mu 2013 gukinira Nordjyllands Idr\u00e6tsh\u00f8jskole. Muri Nzeri muri 2015 yasinyanye amasezerano kugeza muri Kamena 2018 na AaB. \nKakeeto yagurijwe ku ya 31 Kanama 2018 na Jammerbugt FC mu cyiciro cya 2 cya Danemarike mu gihe cyari gisigaye. \nKu ya 13 Kanama 2019, Kakeeto gutizwa mu ikipe ya HIFK yo muri Finilande kugeza mu mpera z'Ugushyingo. Ku ya 31 Kanama 2021, yongeye gutizwa, kuri iyi nshuro mu ikipe ya Danemarike yo mu cyiciro cya 2 mu ikipe yaSkive mu gihe cyari gisigaye cya 2021-22. Ku ya 27 Nyakanga 2022, yongeye gutizwa, muri Middelfart Boldklub muri shampiyona yakurikiyeho. \nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nYatangiye gukinira imikino mpuzamahanga muri Uganda ku ya 2 Kamena 2017, mu mukino wa gicuti na Etiyopiya. "}
